["[�Iu:OrderedHashBz[[�"Breaking News!"lI'm live here at <imp>Tri Island</imp>, a mysterious island discovered recently off the coast of Makya."�Trainers from all over the world are making their way over as there have been sightings of extremely rare Pokemon and resources."�With no region claiming major jurisdiction over the island, there have been reports of multiple factions creating base camps in the area."}The only thing that's certain here is the battling as Trainers duke it out over territory and access to these new wild areas."NBut for now, we'll be providing live coverage of the event. Over and out."1Uh -- yes? Did you want to ask me something?"LWell then don't -- can you not -- I'm not a big fan of being stared at."�I just like... I’m a wanderer. Or, rather, not a wanderer -- but I don't have a home -- or, well -- excuse me. I spend most of my time in caves."�I don't know? I mean -- no, I know, but rather I'm not sure why -- I mean, what kind of question is that? I'm a Pokémon trainer."AOr I was. And I’m... rather good at it. And not much else."bA friend's. Just a friend's. I'm good at -- they entrust me with the training. I get results."aI mean, that sounds -- that's not what I really meant. I'm -- I'm -- I was -- let's move on."(Heyo, \PN. Hear you’ve been busy."YYou’re just racking up badges like they’re nothing, huh? Mavis must be so proud."5It’s not a compliment. Just stating the facts."~And the fact is that you’re not getting anywhere now unless you come meet me, for reasons that make me too angry to explain."*I’ve got a <imp>gift</imp> for you."�I’m literally friends with two - I mean ONE - of those gym leaders, and I was the commanding officer for half the people keeping track of Rafael."Word gets around."kI also know that you’re gonna have some issues getting <imp>across that river</imp> without my help."Yikes."Yeah, Mavis is… Mavis."CYou know, you… ah, nevermind. Eye on the prize and all that."JSpeaking of which, you need to