st team you’ve got. It’s gonna get ugly."?Hey, just checking in. What’s going on? Making progress?"SOh, wow. Really trying your li’l heart out, aren’t you? More than one gym!",Ah, don’t get all broken up about it."[You could be in the big city with six badges under your belt and it wouldn’t matter."Why, I never."6Haven’t you heard blood’s thicker than water?""Practically a type advantage.")Well, whatever -- keep your secrets."8As for me, I’m taking a break before facing Noel."nYou don’t know him -- and, let’s be honest, you probably never will -- but he’s kind of a big deal."bSo while you’re scuttling to and fro like a Falinks without an officer, I’ll be relaxing."Wish you were here!"He hung up…"(Wow, that was… a complete breeze."A joke, honestly."&That’s my sixth badge now. You?"Wow. I remember that."1Wait, how did you even schedule a challenge?"4I made an appointment before I got on the ship."2You... you're serious about this, aren't you?"That can’t be right."You’re better than that."UNot by much, but if you’re lying, then… you’re taking this seriously. Huh."Hah! That never gets old."LYou remind me of… I guess a Zangoose, right? So angry, but so normal.",But you are really angry, aren’t you?"\Well, you’ve certainly made good time, but this is where things start getting harder."1You’ve still got a lot of ground to cover."!See you at the championship!"4I’ll make sure to look in the stands for you."He hung up… again."/Hey, \PN. Things going well on your front?"0Good. You’ve got eight badges now, right?"xThat’s... it’s something. You’ll excuse me if I’m not too preoccupied with the whole gym challenge shebang."That makes one of us."KBetween the avatars and... recent developments... I’ve been swamped."XYeah, frickin’ tell me about it. I know exactly what you’re talking about, too."ZListen: I know the stress is probably getting to you, but we’re in the endgame now."_Be a hero, become Champion, go home to Mavis. Everyone’s happy, right? Smiles all round."(So, y