 the teleporters."_See those blue pads? The ones the trainers are protecting will teleport you past the maze."IIf you don't unlock them, you'll find yourself walking a harsh path!"'Grats on beating the gym!"+You pushed through the pain just fine."@Sorry for blocking the way, but I'm desperately dehydrated.">You have a <imp>Fresh Water</imp>! I'll be taking that..."/The man takes a Fresh Water from your bag."(Ahhhh.... that helps a lot. Thanks." Consider the lockdown over."�The scientists keep offering me liquids in beakers, but I've had too many close calls with caustic chemicals to just trust 'em on the contents."MI can't leave my post, so blocking the gym entrance is my only leverage."_I'm plopping down here until a challenger like yourself grabs me a <imp>Fresh Water</imp>."SThere are <imp>vending machines</imp> in all PokéCenters and Ranger Stations."`I hope you won't find this cruel. The suffering I'm about to inflict is strictly necessary."...Noted. Please avail yourself of this teleporter. Taking the long way may subject any afflicted Pokemon to undue injury."lThank you for your participation. Step carefully, now! Wouldn't want any lingering side effects... heh."JA 3-D model displays the the chemical makeup of Makyan Tangela venom.")Our glorious Champion! Good evening!"cOr morning! I’m not in the business of keeping count of the hours. That’s for the interns!"QNow, why are you here? Hoping for a rematch? Looking to learn more about me?"~Sorry! I’m busy! Drastically, obscenely busy! There is much work to be done, and I absolutely cannot spoil what it might be!"7Goodbye, \PN. We’ve already had our last battle."Not yet."Of course.000Iu;␀�[["7Wow! Well done! That must have been nervewracking."AI wonder why those two Pokemon came here in the first place."9Aren't Absol drawn to areas with upcoming disasters?"(Yikes. I hope they predicted wrong."&Anyways, thanks for all the help."KI'm gonna get out of this place, it's got to be packed with bad vibes."Oh