fect mind."hIf you ever get tired of battling and want a change of pace, we're always looking for new recruits."dWe're doing operations all over the region, so you'll get to see everything Makya has to offer."II help coordinate rescue operations with some of the Makyan rangers."�We used to just work around the Ice Cave area, but now we've been funded by LuxTech to start holding operations for the entire region."It's been tough."8Strange Pokemon have been appearing out of nowhere."AA lot of Mayka's caverns have been deemed unsafe for travel."WWe manage, but if people would stop being so reckless, that would also help a ton."&The mountains here are dangerous."dWinding tunnels, dead ends, and circular paths make it a labyrinth even for experienced hikers."^Now all of a sudden with avatar Pokemon on the loose, it's made the situation even worse."rPeople are getting attacked left and right, and the number of Trainers capable of killing one are pretty low."JHopefully we can train some more capable battlers in the near future."XThe computer glows faintly. A list of documents are organized into various folders."9The documents seem to be related to various avatars."UGym Leader Lambert reported an avatar he spotted in a grotto by Bluepoint Beach."HAccording to his follow-up, a Trainer managed to defeat the avatar."KRangers who investigated the scene confirmed that the avatar was gone."This place sucks."God, this place sucks."BI swear every fifteen seconds a new avatar is reported there."VThose kids living there are so lucky that, like, two capable Trainers live there."JI don't know what's with that spot. It has to be cursed or something."_Daily patrols are required. Nothing too bad has happened yet, but it could get much worse."tI swear I've been there like four times in three days. I don't even have the patience to write a proper report."5Well, peace or something. Dunno how to end this."7Multiple avatars have been reported in the sewers."While in other situations we might send some Rangers in, it's actually much easier to simply leave them to their business."vThere are only a few exits, which are staffed by sewer treatment personnel. Each of them are registered trainers."\The walls down there are hard to dig through, and Trainers rarely travel through there."^It's more efficient to leave the avatars down there until we have more Rangers available."cWitnesses observed multiple avatars destroy the bridge that connects Prizca to southern Makya."FThis has caused a large disturbance for intra- regional shipping."oThe situation isn't dire, but shipping to Novo Town and the LuxTech Campus has been limited to air travel."OThe avatar of Terrakion remains on the Prizca side of the bridge crossing."<Gigalith's Guts has been a hot spot of avatar activity."VParticularly strong avatars have been spotted both on the mountain and within it."[Rangers approaching the situation are advised to be in parties of no smaller than two.">Inexperienced Trainers are recommended to avoid the area."sTrainers looking to acquire the Patience and Perseverance Badges are recommended to travel via Grouz or Svait."WVelenz has been rendered unsafe for long term habitation due to the avatar crisis."zOperating Rangers have been able to keep the area at acceptable levels, enough for Rafael's Gym services to continue."9Non-Trainers are advised to avoid the area entirely."nPersonal Note: The situation is such a mess. We really need more staff on hand. Or funding. Or free food."GCan we get something other than camping rations over here? Please?"9Van has been complaining non-stop since we got here."- Connor"`Rangers patrolling Grouz have observed strange sightings of a potential four-legged avatar."~While previous patrols have confirmed the existence of avatar activity in the area, this particular sighting is rather unique."�Every avatar sighted in the area has been confirmed as Steel-type, and all known four-legged Steel-type Pokemon are too slow to match observed movement."`A local living in the area has reported multiple strange sightings in the surrounding area."�The proximity of his home to Gigalith's Guts makes his case plausible, but his reports don't seem to match the avatars known to be in the area."�Notably, he has also reported sighting two different Pokemon. The sighting locations and timings from other reports corroborate his story."^The destruction left at the sites of each sighting suggest an incredibly powerful avatar."bRangers looking to confirm these reports are advised to be in parties of no smaller than two."Closed Incidents"Known Incidents"Undefined Incidents"Log Off"Bluepoint Grotto"Németh Apartments"Sewers"Go Back"Eleig Bridge"Gigalith's Guts"Velenz"Grouz Sightings"County Park Sightings[N"M為了抵禦惡劣的天氣，你得讓精靈時刻處於最佳狀態。"M在外面，無論是身體，還是心靈都會受到挑戰和壓力。"J一旦出現了一個問題，那麼其他問題也會接踵而至。"拿上它吧。"_或許你能用得上，但最重要的是，要靠健康的思想保護我們的身體。"_如果你厭倦了戰鬥，想換一種生活節奏，那我們隨時歡迎你的加入。"_我們在這個地區四處執行任務，所以能見識到馬凱亞每一處的風光。"S我和馬凱亞的護林員一起工作，負責組織和協調救援任務。"�我們以前只活躍在冰之洞窟附近，但自從得到光華的資助，我們的業務便逐步擴展到了整個地區。"太難了！"5最近突然冒出來了好多奇怪的精靈。"G現在馬凱亞的很多洞穴都不再適合旅行和探險了。"w目前我們還能勉強應付，但如果人們不再那麼冒失行事，我們的工作壓力就會小很多。"#這邊的山裡非常危險。"�淨是些蜿蜒曲折的隧道、和走到盡頭才能發現的死衚衕，就算是經驗豐富的徒步旅行者，也是十分棘手的挑戰。"D現在突然出現的化身精靈，更是讓其難度倍增。"S人們四處遭遇襲擊，而有實力除掉化身的訓練師寥寥無幾。"D希望在不久的將來能培養出更多更強的訓練師。"Y電腦散發出微弱的光芒，一各種文件被分類後放在了文件夾裡。"/這些文件似乎與各種化身有關。"\道館館主蘭伯特報告稱，他在藍瑩海灘的洞穴中發現了一個化身。"J根據對他的後續訪談，最後是一位訓練師擊敗了它。"J調查現場的護林員成員證實，那隻化身已經不見了。"這地方爛透了。"這是什麼破地方！">我感覺每過十五秒都會出現一隻新的化身。"P住在那裡的孩子們運氣真好，身邊有兩位強大的訓練師。"M真搞不懂那個地方到底咋回事，是被詛咒了還是什麼？"}我們每天每時每刻都得巡邏，雖然目前還沒發生什麼嚴重的事情，但情況可能會變得更糟。"P我這三天已經去巡邏了四次，連正式報告都沒心情寫了。")好吧，只能祝願和平啥的...")下水道里出現了多個化身。"}在正常情況下，我們或許會派護林員過去處理，但現在最好的辦法是讓它們彼此互相解決。"t畢竟下水道只有幾個出口，都由汙水處理人員看守，而且每個工作人員都是訓練師。"M地下的牆壁很難挖掘，再者說能力足夠的訓練師太少。"S目前護林員仍然人手短缺，所以打算等有空了再一併處理。"V有目擊者看到幾個化身破壞了連接宏禮市和南馬凱亞的橋樑。"8這對那片區域的通行造成了很大影響。"e雖然情況還不算很糟，但運往望新鎮和光華市的貨物只能靠航空運輸了。"A代拉基翁的化身還留在宏禮市方向的橋頭上。"5怪巖腸道一直是化身活躍的重災區。"P無論是在山上還是洞裡，都出現了一些實力強大的傢伙。"M當地的護林員至少得保證兩人一組，絕不能單獨行動。"8經驗不足的訓練師最好遠離那片區域。"n想要獲得“耐心徽章”和“毅力徽章”的訓練師們，建議改走古治鎮或霜皚鎮。"D由於化身的影響，夜幽市已經不在適宜居住了。"V目前護林員暫時接管此處，確保拉斐爾的道館得以繼續運作。"2建議非訓練師徹底遠離這個區域。"n個人備註：現在情況爛到極限了。我們需要更多的人手、鈔票或者免費的補給。"h除了那種硬邦邦乾糧以外，咱們能不能弄點靠譜的玩意兒來？擬人一點吧！";從來到這裡之後，阿凡的抱怨就沒停過。"- 康納"M在古治鎮巡邏的護林員發現了一個四條腿的奇怪化身。"e的確當地的確早就有其他化身活動的痕跡，但這次發現的化身格外不同。"z此次出現的化身不僅速度極快，與之前的其他四足化身不同，也並非當地常見的鋼屬性。"J當地的居民報告稱，曾多次在周圍看到奇怪的景象。"z目擊位置與怪巖腸道很近，使得此次報告的可信度增加，但他對化身的描述卻並不尋常。"T根據 現場的破壞跡象，可以推出是由一隻強大的化身所為。"G但目擊者卻聲稱看到了兩隻種類完全不同的精靈。"D建議前去調查的護林員，務必保證成編制出動！"已解決事件"已探明事件"未確定事件"關閉"藍瑩洞穴"望新公寓"下水道"返回"埃利格大橋"怪巖腸道"夜幽市"古治鎮目擊事件"國立公園目擊事件;[N"[In order to fight the climate, you have to keep you and your Pokemon in tip-top shape."WBoth physically and mentally. Out there, your body and your mind are under attack."CHaving one crack will lead to the other cracking just as fast."Take this."aUse it if it helps, but the most important part is that a perfect body needs a perfect mind."hIf you ever get tired of battling and want a change of pace, we're always looking for new recruits."dWe're doing operations all over the region, so you'll get to see everything Makya has to offer."II help coordinate rescue operations with some of the Makyan rangers."�We used to just work around the Ice Cave area, but now we've been funded by LuxTech to start holding operations for the entire region."It's been tough."8Strange Pokemon have been appearing out of nowhere."AA lot of Mayka's caverns have been deemed unsafe for travel."WWe manage, but if people would stop being so reckless, that would also help a ton."&The mountains here are dangerous."dWinding tunnels, dead ends, and circular paths make it a labyrinth even for experienced hikers."^Now all of a sudden with avatar Pokemon on the loose, it's made the situation even worse."rPeople are getting attacked left and right, and the number of Trainers capable of killing one are pretty low."JHopefully we can train some more capable battlers in the near future."XThe computer glows faintly. A list of documents are organized into various folders."9The documents seem to be related to various avatars."UGym Leader Lambert reported an avatar he spotted in a gro