[[#"+I am going to be very honest with you."KThe whole searching for the gym leader ordeal has been the last straw."eI don't want to compete in Makya anymore. I want to go somewhere that has a sane Pokemon League."/Like Unova. Or Sinnoh. Sinnoh sounds nice."<I caught this Magby for one reason -- to beat this gym."GSince I'm no longer trying, I want to trade it for something else."XI want a Shinx. I love how they look and I want something that's popular in Sinnoh."Sure, whatever."&Come back if you do find a Shinx.";Nice, maybe this'll motivate me once I land in Sinnoh."-Finally, now I can get out of this dump."6The caves under this town are rather dangerous..."cNot only are there tons of avatars, all the Trainers down there are looking to battle as well."KDespite not being plugged in, the vending machine is still functional.">The only option to select is Tea. Tea from the Tea Store."$It costs $2000! What a rip off!"IYou decide against giving the suspicious vending machine your money."&You purchase the Tea Store's Tea."$\PN put $2000 into the machine."!Whoa! A Pokemon dropped out!")You can't afford the suspicious tea."(The haunted tea machine hums along."GYou decide against giving any more money to this accursed machine.""Another Sinistea dropped out!"#You can't afford any more tea."7Gross, the goods inside the cooler are rotten now."No"Yes"Do Not Buy Tea"Buy Tea[#"我受不了了！"D我真的受夠了，我不想再四處尋找道館館主了！"w我不想再參加馬凱亞競技大會了，我要去一些正常點的地區，繼續我的精靈聯盟旅程。">比如說合眾或者神奧...神奧感覺挺不錯的。"D之前我抓這隻鴨寶寶...就是為了擊敗這個道館。"G現在我用不著它了，我打算用它交換其他的精靈。"~我想要一隻小貓怪，它們非常和我的喜好，而且在神奧地區也很流行（可在箱子裡選擇精靈）。"行吧，隨便你。"2你要是真找到了小貓怪再過來吧。"M很好，等我到了神奧地區，這或許能成為我前進的動力"2現在我終於可以離開這破地方了。"/這個城市地下的洞裡相當危險..."G不僅有大量的化身，而且那裡的訓練師都很好鬥。"D儘管沒有插上電源，自動販賣機仍然可以使用。">只不過能選的飲料只有...來自茶葉店的茶。"3它居然賣2000金錢！怎麼不去去搶！"5你決定不管這臺可疑的自動售貨機。" 你購買了茶店的茶。"'\PN將2000金錢塞進了機器。"&哇！一隻精靈掉了出來！"&你買不起這種可疑的茶。"2這臺鬧鬼的自動販茶機嗡嗡作響。"2你決定不再給這臺破機器投錢了。"#又掉出了一隻來悲茶！" 你再也買不起茶了。"/糟了，冰櫃裡的食物都腐爛了。"不換"換"不買"買茶;[#"+I am going to be very honest with you."KThe whole searching for the gym leader ordeal has been the last straw."eI don't want to compete in Makya anymore. I want to go somewhere that has a sane Pokemon League."/Like Unova. Or Sinnoh. Sinnoh sounds nice."<I caught this Magby for one reason -- to beat this gym."GSince I'm no longer trying, I want to trade it for something else."XI want a Shinx. I love how they look and I want something that's popular in Sinnoh."Sure, whatever."&Come back if you do find a Shinx.";Nice, maybe this'll motivate me once I land in Sinnoh."-Finally, now I can get out of this dump."6The caves under this town are rather dangerous..."cNot only are there tons of avatars, all the Trainers down there are looking to battle as well."KDespite not being plugged in, the vending machine is still functional.">The only option to select is Tea. Tea from the Tea Store."$It costs $2000! What a rip off!"IYou decide against giving the suspicious vending machine your money."&You purchase the Tea Store's Tea."$\PN put $2000 into the machine."!Whoa! A Pokemon dropped out!")You can't afford the suspicious tea."(The haunted tea machine hums along."GYou decide against giving any more money to this accursed machine.""Another Sinistea dropped out!"#You can't afford any more tea."7Gross, the goods inside the cooler are rotten now."No"Yes"Do Not Buy Tea"Buy TeaIu;␀�[[-"CAndris gave each of us -- us gym leaders -- one of these keys.".They’re for these doors, these prisons."{Behind all that bluster about Champions and badges and all that, this is our real purpose. At least, it’s supposed to be."9Seems like I’m the only one taking this seriously."PSo, please, take this key, go through that door, and get rid of that thing."WYou gonna go after the avatar? Until it’s gone, I can’t leave... just in case."Just. In. Case.":You’re back? Really? I mean, fine, but please stop."bAnother challenger? How inhospitable does this place have to get before you lunatics give up?"ODo I look like I have the time to duel you? That isn’t my job, you know."cMy job is to guard this door until I can find someone strong enough to defeat what’s inside."jAnd for some insane reason they thought sending a parade of children at me was a good way to do that."But fine. We’ll fight."9I run doubles, and doubles only. You ready for that?"4Great. Maybe I can get some soil samples today."*I used to be a scientist, you know..."9You’ve got the aura of someone with real audacity."}The only reason I’m here is to find a true Pokémon master, and you’ve at least got the ferocity fighting your way to me."5Fine. You’re here for more than an easy badge."Show me what you got."mSure thing. The sooner I lose to you, the sooner you get out of here and back somewhere safe, I suppose."Do it."HFinally. How many years and I finally – it’s done! It’s done!"AYou. Take the Reverence Badge. You’ve more than earned it.",Now, this door. My true responsibility."&This damn burden... let’s talk."%Yep. You’re still pretty good."&I can’t give you another badge."Please leave me alone."I hope you’re happy."_Suicidal dive into dangerous territory, hunt me down, force me to waste time fighting you.""And for what, a big old game?"Take your badge."vAnd, yeah, I’m not angry with you, got it? I’m angry with Helena and Andris and everyone for setting this up." Now get outta here, ‘kay?")Please, let's not do this right now."wWhen the tournament is on, it's the only time of the year I can take a break from handling crazy trainers all day."2I'm gonna make the most of it, by relaxing..."Give me a sec."Of course.[-"2安德里斯給了館主們各一把鑰匙。"/都是這些門...這些監獄的鑰匙。"w在接受挑戰、頒發徽章等表象背後，但這才是我們真正的使命。也是事情本來的樣貌。"/看起來只有我是最認真的那個。"P所以請拿著這把鑰匙，通過那扇門，把那個東西消滅掉。"D你要去找化身嗎？只有它消失了，我才能離開..."務必小心。"\真的假的？你回來了？我的意思是，隨便了，但還是就此打住吧。"b又來個挑戰者？這個地方究竟要變成什麼樣，你們這些瘋子才會放棄？"V我看起來像有時間和你戰鬥嗎？你也知道，這不是我的職責。"b我的職責就是守護這扇門，直至尋到足夠強大的人來擊敗裡面的東西。"\但是我不知道他們是怎麼想的，竟然覺得派來一群孩子就能搞定。")行行行，那我們就打一場。"D我這邊是雙打比賽，而且只有雙打，準備好了？">行吧。也許我今天可以採集一些土壤樣本。"2你知道嗎，我以前是一名科學家..."/你身上有一種敢作敢為的氣質。"�我來這裡的唯一原因是找到一位真正的精靈大師，而你在與我對戰的過程中所展現出的激烈攻勢，也算符合了我的要求。"J很好，我明白了。你來這裡可不僅僅是為了枚徽章。"&讓我看看你有什麼本事。"A當然，你輸的越快，就可以越早地離開這裡。"來吧。"A終於，多少年了！我終於...等到了！等到了！">你，收下這枚崇敬徽章吧。這是你應得的。">現在，這道門背後，是我真正應負的責任。"8也是該死的負擔...讓我們好好談談吧。"#沒錯，你還是很厲害。")但我沒法再給你一枚徽章。"請別煩我了。"&我希望你會為此而高興。"S冒著生命危險到這種地方來找我，逼我浪費時間和你戰鬥。"A這一切都是為了什麼，一場老掉牙的遊戲嗎？"拿走你的徽章吧。"b我沒有生你的氣。我是在生海倫娜、安德里斯，以及所有決策層的氣。"現在可以走了嗎？"拜託，別再來了。"V聯盟大賽舉辦期間，那是我一年中唯一能夠好好休息的日子。",我要好好利用，放鬆一下......"稍等"來吧;[-"CAndris gave each of us -- us gym leaders -- one of these keys.".They’re for these doors, these prisons."{Behind all that bluster about Champions and badges and all that, this is our real purpose. At least, it’s supposed to be."9Seems like I’m the only one taking this seriously."PSo, please, take this key, go through that door, and get rid of that thing."WYou gonna go after the avatar? Until it’s gone, I can’t leave... just in case."Just. In. Case.":You’re back? Really? I mean, fine, but please stop."bAnother challenger? How inhospitable does this place have to get before you lunatics give up?"ODo I look like I have the time to duel you? That isn’t my job, you know."cMy job is to guard this door until I can find someone strong enough to defeat what’s inside."jAnd for some insane reason they thought sending a parade of children at me was a good way to do that."But fine. We’ll fight."9I run doubles, and doubles only. You ready for that?"4Great. Maybe I can get some soil samples today."*I used to be a scientist, you know..."9You’ve got the aura of someone with real audacity."}The only reason I’m here is to find a true Pokémon master, and you’ve at least got the ferocity fighting your way to me."5Fine. You’re here for more than an easy badge."Show me what you got."mSure thing. The sooner I lose to you, the sooner you get out of here and back somewhere safe, I suppose."Do it."HFinally. How many years and I finally – it’s done! It’s done!"AYou. Take the Reverence Badge. You’ve more than earned it.",Now, this door. My true responsibility."&This damn burden... let’s talk."%Yep. You’re still pretty good."&