know when you’re 'bout ready, and we’ll do this. Ain’t no two ways about it."YTake your time and make it good. I wanna be facin’ the whole nine yards, y’hear?";Ah, good. Prove me right. Show me I ain’t nothin’."{But, uh, I ain’t ‘bout to go down easy. \PN, meet the team I’ve been honing since the good ol’ days. Meet Drag-Mag."...'Bout figures."nWell, I ain’t gonna sugarcoat it: it’s your job now. Always was, lookin’ at it a certain kinda way."_Go down there. Talk some sense into her. Y’know how. Ain’t much else to say, is there?"NYou know whatcha gotta do. Don’t need me holdin’ your hand. Good kid."^Oh, don’tcha go thankin’ me yet. I ain’t done nothin’ for ya. Nothin’ material."I was plannin’ to."�I ain’t ‘bout to go down there myself with ya – it’s a private affair. Can’t ruin my reputation by barging on in and making a muck of things."`Hah. Don’t embarrass me. Maybe after all’s said and done, we can grab a drink together."@You, me, Yez... or just you and me, if that’s your drift."QJust don’tcha go being one of those folks asking me to step on ‘em. Hah!"BYou’re gonna need a li’l help to get to tomorrow, though."�Take my Heatran. I don’t see myself fightin’ too many wars in my near future, and for anythin’ less my regulars will do well enough."7You, though? You oughta take anything you can get."ATake good care of that damn thing, y’hear? We go way back."rAnd, besides, it’s a damn juggernaut that can wreak more carnage than a babyface like you can even imagine."wHah! I ain’t never been able to tell if you’re brave or stupid. In my experience, they ain’t much different."ZAs you say, though. Ain’t gonna complain 'bout keepin’ an extra ace up my sleeve."�Well, I s’pose we oughta keep it brief, all things considered. You gotta go hunt that girl down, and I gotta go prep for either which way it ends."I’ll be seein’ her soon, one way or another. Probably won’t be too keen on seein’ me, but that’s friends for ya."SHey, \PN, I figure this comes as an awful surprise to you, but I got a secret."�Up until now, I’ve been workin’ with Yez, clandestine-like. Masked, causin’ havoc, fightin’ you. I ain’t proud of it, but it ain’t far from my usual."xI’m a black ops gal born and raised, though I’m a mite more on the side of cut-and-burn than cloak-and- dagger."rI ain’t 'bout to apologize. But, uh, Yez’d have me stoppin’ you, and I ain’t 'bout to play that game."IShe got other lackeys, good on her, but I ain't gonna be one of 'em."1Go ruin her day, kid. I’ll see you around."fHey, next time I see ya, drinks are on me. Call it my way of making up to you. Heh. So long, kid."X\PN, go ruin her day. I wish I was good enough to do it myself, but I just ain’t."RYou understand her well enough. She’ll listen to you, one way or the other."~And, uh, sorry. For makin’ this all ‘bout her. If things were any different, I’d love to chat ‘bout other things."<Maybe some day, yeah? I’ll see you around, I promise."nYou come back and there’s still bars left in the world, drinks are on me, y’hear? See ya around, kid."3A booklet emblazoned with the Team Chasm logo."...Your phone is ringing."2It’s... your mother. It’s Mavis. Pick up?"8Hey, \PN? I’ve been trying to call you for hours!"�Congratulations! You decimated Zain in the tournament, and my boots on the ground are telling me that you’ve done some extracurriculars."[Saved the region, I hear? Very impressive, \PN. You shattered my wildest expectations."�Now, I haven’t been able to get in contact with Zain, but to be honest, after that showing...? I’m not sure we have much to talk about right now."sIgnore him, though. He’s just moping because he couldn’t beat you. To be honest, I never thought he could."�Today’s about you. Aww, honey, you did so well! I can get a private flight scheduled to get you back home ASAP. I’ve got big plans for you."�You are my number one asset right now, and I want to show you the vacation you deserve. Business can wait – but there will be business."qWith your skills and my influence, I’ll secure you an exceedingly comfortable position within the company.".So, what date works for you to come home?"bTomorrow morning? Or do you want to sleep in? We’ll make it tomorrow evening, just in case."YYou – you what? Excuse me? Is there some kind of arrangement I don’t know about?"_Are you – are you eloping? Have you been offered a job there? You do understand what –"FOh, good. I’ll start making plans for our vacation immediately."#You’ve worked so hard and..."AMavis continues on for a few minutes before she lets you go."JShe says she loves you, and goodbye, and she’ll see you again soon."MYou’ll tell her that a certain someone said hi when you meet her next.":You’ll be her second-in-command and second-to-last."0...You thought it’d make you feel warmer."9You’ve never not picked up for your mother before."&It’s Mavis. You have to answer."...No, you don’t.",Thanks for completing Pokemon Tectonic!"UPlease consider filling out the Playtest Survey that is linked on the main menu."?Your feedback helps a lot to continue to improve the game."2You? I... I remember... outside of Novo Town.">You aren’t – I mean, you are – it doesn’t matter."OYou’re here. I’m here. I have more Pokémon to train. A duel? Doubles.":W-well, I could ask you the same thing. Can we start?"?Then go! Don’t bother me and then not even – whatever."5But you’re not getting past me without a duel."-Good. OK. No more talking. Just... this."9That was -- you’re... yeah, you are, aren’t you?"fIf you’re looking deeper in the caves, then I -- I mean, if you don’t mind, may I come along?"�I have healing items for the both of us. It’s dangerous and we -- I’d like to talk. And that’s... that’s not very common for me."ASo? I’m not moving until I get a double battle out of you.",I need to... oh, just fight me already!":That was – you’re... yeah, you are, aren’t you?"gIf you’re looking deeper in the caves, then I – I mean, if you don’t mind, may I come along?";Ah, you’re back. I, uh, don’t have much to do yet.".And we still haven’t finished our talk."2Some loose paper displaying the LuxTech logo."LLeaving through -- oh. You -- you’re looking for something down here."2Come back and, uh, I’ll still be... around." So you lead with \pfp, hmm?".Tell me – would you tell me about them?"-Good, good. You seem to be good friends."hMy Togekiss, Artemisia, has been mine since I was – oh, sorry. I shouldn’t... let’s continue.".Oh, is that so? Well, maybe it’ll grow."bMy Togekiss, Artemisia, used to be a liability, but she became my most trusted – excuse me.":I’m – why am I – whatever. Let’s keep moving."%I’m glad you found them, then."bThe only reason I have Artemisia, my Togekiss, is a story about a Togekiss from my childhood."MI’ve loved – sorry. I’m getting carried away – let’s continue."*Hah, well, I know what that’s like."QI rarely get to use my true team – my, uh, friends give me teams to train."mMy Togekiss, Artemisia, gets used more for flying than – oh, I’m – excuse me. Let’s keep moving."RAnother avatar... so strange. They aren’t spirits – not like Ghost-types."cI’ve never found an avatar of a man-made Pokémon, but there are avatars of fossil Pokémon."Almost as if... hmm." What do you think they are?"AOh – uh, I’m sorry, I’m not used to getting responses."I mostly talk to Pokémon."GPlease excuse my rambling, I – but you’re right. Nobody knows."COh – I suppose – sorry, I’m used to talking to Pokémon."AI’m not used to my rambling being – I mean, I’m sorry."/You said illusions? And yet they... hmm..."VOh – you – I’m sorry, excuse my ramblings. I usually talk to, um, Pokémon."/And they don’t – I mean – ignore me.">But you have a good hypothesis, I think. Except... hmm..."mOh – I didn’t – sorry. Excuse me, I forgot that you – I mean, I’m used to talking to Pokémon."EI’m – I’m not used to… whatever. Forget I said anything.":Were you down here for this – whatever all this is?"'That Linoone dragged it down here."8Even if you weren’t… it’s valuable. Trust me."3Barter and blackmail are Makya’s currencies."SAnd this <imp>Chasm keycard</imp> – I haven’t – it’s been a long time."<Take it. I don’t need it, and Helena won’t miss it.";It’ll get you into some <imp>dangerous places</imp>."I used to – oh."XOh. Oh, I just – I – I’m sorry. I shouldn’t be imposing upon you like this."KI’ve been stalking you – I just – my name’s <imp>Yezera</imp>."Yours?"0Well, \PN, you... you’re easy to talk to."VAlmost like a Pokémon, and I just – I’ve never found someone… I’m sorry.";I just keep talking and – I should go. I need to go."eOh – I mean, yes, that’s... I’m sorry. I’m a stranger, I shouldn’t’ve – I’ll go."But thank you."�I – I haven’t talked to someone in... a little while, and you’re… I don’t know why but you’re easy to – I’m sorry."I should go."Stay out."Enter."I know."So now what?"You like me?"
Fine."My pleasure."It should be you."Just a moment."Let's go."
Nope."Thanks."Help me."I like you too."Take Heatran."Refuse Heatran forever."Pick up."Don't pick up."I'm not coming home."That sounds nice."What are you doing here?"Not now."OK."It's reliable."It's lackluster."It's my favorite."I'm just training it."I don't know."Illusions."Myths made real."I don't care."Tell her."Don't tell her.Iu;␀OU[[�"bYou might be able to tell, but a certain Nurse aid in training is feeling a bit wild today..."^This Happiny has been a troublemaker since day one, always trying to battle the patients."SI got an idea. If you can beat it in a battle, it'll demand to join your team."2It'll thrive with a trainer. What do you say?"CI just want to get it off the cliff so we can get out of here."Place feels dangerous."!Wonderful. Give me a second.".HEY! YOU GOT SOMEONE WHO WANTS TO BATTLE!"GET DOWN HERE!"Thanks for that."<As expected, it's practically dying to join your party."DWell, I suppose that's three months of training down the drain."Peace."wMy mom told me not to come up here, but I really wanted to see what it was like to pee off the side of a mountain.";I uh... don't need to pee anymore. For no real reason."{I felt like peeing off Makya's highest point would be great, but I'm not feeling as liberated as I thought I would be."WI'm scared of heights, but I'm more scared of growing old without making memories."4That's why I choose where I pee very carefully."^\PN! My beloved! The mountains frame your beauty in a way I can only describe as sublime."TYou look as if you could tear them down around you and build yourself a throne."-You don’t need to. All you need is me."oOf course. I always have time to talk with you. Listening to your dulcet voice makes my worries dissipate."1We can talk about anything. Anything at all."GWhy would you come here if not for me? You could’ve stayed away."sWhat draws you to me? You know what it is, I think. We both know. I’d love to show you what you really feel."oYou’re perfect. I see all my love reflected in your eyes. It’s beautiful. I want to hold you so badly."1Oh, you’re adorable. Such a pure creature."zYes, my love. Always gifts. I’ll get you anything you desire, always. You’re worth more than any material object."!...But that must come later."P\PN. I had planned to propose to you here. But then I was gifted a miracle."pMy undying, fervent wish was made real before my eyes. Our love was consecrated in the eyes of the heavens."{I knew this gift to us was to be used only one way. You are like Yezera: there’s one language you speak above all others."xI’ve been so selfish, using my words to express how wonderful you are. I should’ve been speaking your language."�Let me show you my love. Let me show you the sign I have received. Let our love be made immortal by this glorious omen, shining in the passions of combat."-Of course, my love. Make yourself ready."4I love you. Allow me to show you just how much."8...I won’t let you slip away. You’re mine, \PN."|You don’t understand what I mean yet. Let me show it to you. Let me open your eyes to the love you’ve been missing."BThis is meant to be. Witness the message the heavens gave me."�You’re making me wait. My heart is pounding. I can’t wait any longer. Will you now bear witness to this sign of our eternal love?"�Do you see it? The wish-bringer, come to grant me my wish! The light of our love shining through it! And you, like a star, like an avatar!"mI wanted Yezera, and I sought the avatars, all to lead me here. To woo a god, and make you mine forever."1Can’t you see? I will do anything for you."�I will move heaven and earth. I will love you eternally. I will smother you in compassion and affection. I will fill your life with comfort and pleasure."~I will steal for you. Kill for you. End this world for you, or remake it to be more pleasant for you. So long as you are mine."]So long as I can hold you, and love you, and know that you are mine and no one else’s."1I need help? That’s all you can say to me?"zI love you more than anyone has loved anything! Do you expect me to keep it inside, wear masks, be... civil about it?"It drives me to madness and back not embracing you here and now! As it should! Everyone else is blind not seeing your radiance!"pYou are gorgeous and brilliant and divine. What higher accomplishment could there be than to make you mine?">No one could aspire to anything better, except to be you."2I would for you. Don’t you understand that?"=Why would you reject me? I could make your life perfect!"�I would do anything for you, and you want to throw that away? Simply because I ask for your love in return? Am I not worthy of that, after everything?"RI am kind, and loving, and caring, and humble, and I can see your real worth!"VShouldn’t I be more worthy of love than anyone else? Do you think I’m insane?"You’re the mad one here if you think you’ll be better off without me. A beautiful mad god that refuses to be helped..."QNo! I will have you alone. I couldn’t stand to share you with anyone else!"cPlease, you won’t even notice. I will fill your days with joy. You won’t need anyone else."�If they ask for you, if they want you, I’ll take care of them. They can serve you – us – or they can leave. Our perfect days need no one else."~After all, I’m the only one that feels this raging love. I’m the only one that knows what you really are. Radiant. Divine."8Yes. Of course. Hah! Everything is as it should be."LThe entire world is falling into place, my love. You are mine. Forever."�Love, I’ve been working with Yezera to reset the world. I planned to rule with her, and then later I planned to make it a paradise for us two."�But now? You’re fighting Yezera, and I’ll gladly choose you over her. She’s nothing to me now. You’re the only one that matters."zHow about this? You go take care of her and make sure she never bothers us. Meanwhile, I’ll be making preparations."�I’ll make your life a dream. A beautiful, idyllic, paradisiacal dream from which you’ll never wake up. Go do what you do best."Oh, the plans I have. My love, just you wait. Please. Don’t hurry yourself. Although... you must have work to attend to."VOh, please, continue then. I wouldn’t dare take you away from what you do best."{I need time to prepare, and you need to wrap up these loose ends. Cut these threads away. You don’t need anyone else now."Y\PN, I’m going to make your life a dream. You’re a god... and now you’re mine."VWe’ll be together forever. Forever’s just beginning, and I’m a patient man."fSo go ahead. Get rid of Yezera. Get rid of everyone! And then come back to me, so I can hold you."QHere. Take Jirachi with you. A sign of my undying love, and our divine bond."OI love you, \PN. My gift to you is a god, because what else could suffice?"CTake it, and know you’re loved. Loved more than anyone else."7No? Oh, \PN, you don’t have to leave it with me."�If it isn’t good enough for you, I’ll make it up to you. Anything you desire, you’ll have. Just let me work out the details, alright?"SYou’re gorgeous. You’re perfect beyond words. And you’re mine. All mine."mSo go on. We can be apart for a little while more. I’ll be thinking of you every second you’re away."`I’ve got preparations to make. Time to set aside, items to procure, people to... obviate."[We’ll meet again. And then we’ll never meet again, because we’ll never be apart.">Goodbye, \PN. I love you more than anything in the world."The stone hums with power."TEtched into its side are two images, a pair of glowing spheres in red and blue.".You present the Red Orb and the Blue Orb."'The stone activates at your touch."You’re leaving me? Why?"EI was going to create a perfect world for you. Do you know that?"�Yezera wants a new world. I don’t care why. It gave me the perfect canvas. An ancient, divine land. A golden age! And this time it’d never end!" I would have her... or you."�I served her whims here, helping her, fighting you, stealing the titans. And I would serve her in the reborn world, love her forever."�But now that you have shone upon me, I couldn’t ever go back to her. She pales in comparison. So now no one will receive this endless love."]I will never build a new world for my beloved. And I will never have a god to call mine."2...Fine. You’ll regret this. They all will."JThey’ll all die cold and alone, withering unloved and unremembered."dYou could’ve been happy. And now the fire smolders to embers and ash. I hope you choke on it."You – no!"QWhy would you give me hope just to rip it away? Why would you do this to me?"EI have worshiped you! I have loved you! I have always loved you!"iGods come to earth, turning their backs on me! Do I deserve this? Have I failed you in a single way?"0No! I am pure, and holy! My love is divine!"~Fine then! If you want to cast me into darkness, do so. If my love burns too brightly even for the heavens, cast me down."fYou can’t stop me. You can’t snuff me out. You’ll be mine eventually. One of the gods will."pAll I need is one to love forever. One to be mine, and mine alone. I won’t stop until I have one to keep."OI love you. I love you more than anything. And I’ll never see you again."�Maybe we’ll meet in another eternity, when I have a god of my own to love and care for. And then we’ll see if you regret this."OJirachi seems perturbed. It seems to have gravely misjudged the situation."WIt also seems apologetic. Perhaps it wants to make it up to you, or keep you safe."BMaybe it’s even attracted by your adamant hopes and wishes."7In any case, it seems willing to be caught by you."QHow Skyler was blessed by a mythical granter of wishes, you’ll never know."�Jirachi seems highly embarrassed and gladly lets itself be caught. Honestly, it seems like it just wants to forget this ever happened."nJirachi seems disappointed. You suspect it wanted to be caught and battle some more as a palate cleanser."ZAs an immortal being, though, it’s got plenty of time to forget this ever happened."\It leaves with the mountain wind. Perhaps you’ll see it again on these snowy peaks..."9Are you also here to dance at the top of a mountain?"1I regret coming up here dressed like this..."0I wish Lainie were here to dance with me..."HYou won't dance with me? Well, I'm sure you're very fun at parties."=Go on, back to your climbing or whatever you like to do."Do you even have hobbies?"Down: Gigalith's Guts"JThe true power of the Dragon-type is only unlocked during an Eclipse!"?The only problem here is my own. I have failed my Pokemon."FI shall return to my thoughts, and I will come back more focused."BDragon-type Pokemon often roost on the peak of this mountain."JHearing the songs of Hymnus is a true once-in-a- lifetime experience."No"Yes"I want to talk."Not why I'm here."All I need is you."More gifts?"Let me prepare."Very well."...No?"You need help."Go to hell."Last bit's a dealbreaker."Yes. Let me be yours."Take Jirachi."Refuse Jirachi forever."Catch Jirachi."Release Jirachi forever.[�"G你可能能看得出來，我這個護士今天心情不太好..."J這個小福蛋一直在製造麻煩，總是跟病人產生衝突。"G我有個注意，如果你能打敗它，那就把它帶走吧！"8有個訓練師的話，它就能茁壯成長了。">我真想給它丟下懸崖，這樣我就能回家了。"當然只是說氣話。"&太好了，給我一點時間。"*嘿！有 人 要 跟 你 戰 鬥 ！"下 來 吧 ！"謝謝你。"/果然，只有這樣它才願意加入。"/雖然這三個月的訓練都白費了..."謝天謝地。"k我媽媽不讓我來這裡，但我真想體驗一下站在懸崖邊，往下撒尿是什麼感覺。";我...再也不尿尿了...我是說在這種地方。"t我覺得從馬凱亞的最高峰往下尿尿的體驗一定很棒，但並沒有那種想象中的解放感。"J我有點恐高，但我更怕老去後沒有值得回憶的東西。"8因此，我會非常謹慎地選擇撒尿地點。"b\PN！我的愛人！這山脈將你的美麗框在了一種我無法形容的崇高之中。"A彷彿它要將自己拆解掉，形成屬於你的王座。"5當然你不需要這樣它，你只需要我。"k當然可以，我有很多可以和你閒聊的時間，你悅耳的聲音能讓我的煩惱消散。">你想談論些什麼都可以，任何事情都可以。"P如果不是為了我，你為什麼會來這裡？你本可以遠離我。"{是什麼吸引你來找我的？我想你知道這個原因，我們都很清楚，向你自己展示真正的感受吧。"}你是那麼的完美，我看到你的愛意從眼神中毫無保留的映射出來，太美了，我多想抱著你！"D啊！你真是太可愛了！竟然有如此純潔的生命。"�放心吧，我的愛人，我永遠都有東西給你，無論你想要什麼，我都會給你，這就是我對你愛的重量。"&...不過那必須稍後再說。"Y\PN，我本想在這裡向你求婚，但一個奇蹟打破了我原本的計劃。"t我那不朽與熱烈的願望，就這樣在眼前變成了現實，是我們的愛得到了天堂的祝福。"z不過這份禮物的包裝，只有一種拆解方式，那就是你和葉澤拉一樣，最擅長的那種語言。"}我一直都那麼自私，自顧自地用乾癟的語言表達你的美好，我應該換一種你能聽懂的方式。"�讓我展示我的愛吧，讓我展示我所接收到的徵兆，讓我們的愛因這個光榮的徵兆而不朽，在戰鬥的激情中閃耀。"A當然，我的愛人，我也不希望你是倉促應戰。";我愛你。讓我向你展示這份愛的濃郁吧。"8...我不會讓你溜走的，你是我的，\PN。"}你還不明白我的意思嗎？讓我毫不保留地展示給你看吧，讓我揭開你一直缺失的愛的眼簾。"D這是命中註定的，是所見證的上天給我的信息。"}在等待的過程中，我的心一直怦怦跳動，我再也等不了了，來見證我們永恆愛情的徵召吧！"�你看到了嗎？願望的化身來實現我的期盼了！我們的愛之光因為它閃耀！而你，像一顆星星，一個化身般閃耀！"�無論是葉澤拉，還是化身，我追求他們，都是為了今天，讓命運把我帶到這裡的一刻。追尋神的步伐，讓你永遠屬於我。"A你應該能看得出來吧？我會為你做任何事情。"�我會永遠愛你，我會為你移山填海，披荊斬棘，我會用關懷和愛意淹沒你，讓你的生活只剩舒適和愉悅。"�我會為了你成為竊賊，為你殺戮，為你毀滅世界，又或者重塑世界，使其更美好，只要你能屬於我..."Y只要我能擁抱你，愛你，並確保你是我的，不是其他什麼人的...";我需要治療？這就是你要對我說的全部？"}我愛你勝過任何人，勝過任何事物！你希望我把它藏在心裡，戴上面具，表現得...文明些？"w無法現在擁抱你會讓我瘋掉！這才是最該有的結果！其他人都瞎了，看不到你的光輝！"b你那麼美麗、聰明、神聖，讓你成為我的，就是此世間最珍貴的成就！"A除了成為你之外，沒有人能找到更好的追求。"A為了你，我願意下地獄，你難道還不明白嗎？"G你為什麼要拒絕我？我可以讓你的生活變得完美！"�我願意為你做任何事情，而你卻想要拋棄我？僅僅因為我要求你回報我的愛？在經歷了這一切之後，我難道不值得被愛嗎？"_我善良、謙虛、有愛心，也懂得關懷別人，還能看到你真正的價值！"M難道我不比任何人都更值得被愛嗎？你認為我瘋了嗎？"}你認為沒有我會更好？哈哈，原來是你瘋了，一個美麗的瘋狂之神，拒絕接受信徒的幫助..."M不！你只能有我一個人，我無法忍受與其他人分享你！"n求求你，你可能沒注意到，我會讓你的生活充滿快樂，你不再需要其他任何人。"�如果他們需要你，如果他們想要你，我會代你照顧他們。他們可以為你，為我們...服務，或者離開，我們完美的生活不再需要任何人。"t畢竟，只有我能感受到這股熾烈的愛，只有我知曉你真正的本質，那份光輝與神聖！"D沒錯，就是這樣，哈哈！一切就應該這樣發展！"P整個世界都在我手手中了，我的愛人，你是我的，永遠！"�親愛的，我之前一直在和葉澤拉一起重置世界，我原本計劃和她一起統治，再為我們兩個打造一個天堂的。"�但現在，你是她的對立面，我也很樂意選擇你而不是她，她對我來說已經毫無意義了，你是唯一重要的人。"n怎麼樣？你去解決掉她，確保她不會再來打擾我們吧，同時，我也會做好準備。"�我會讓你擁有夢境般的生活，一個美麗、閒適的夢境，你永遠都不需要醒來的夢境。而現在，繼續去做你擅長的事吧。"w我有數不清的計劃，我的愛人，在等等吧，請不要著急，而且...你還有些事情要處理。"2請繼續吧，我不會讓你停下那些。"�我需要時間來準備未來，而你需要結束這一些的源頭，當變故被全部切斷之後，你就不再需要任何人了。"k\PN，我會讓你的生活變成一場美好的夢境，現在...你就是獨屬於我的神明瞭。"\我們將永遠在一起，不...永遠也只是開始，我是一個有耐心的人。"k所以繼續吧，擺脫葉澤拉，擺脫其他所有人！然後回到我身邊，讓我擁抱你。"\不如，帶上基拉祈，這是我永恆的愛和我們之間神聖連結的象徵。"_我愛你，\PN，送給你一份傳說中的禮物，沒有什麼是比這更好的了。"n拿上它吧，你將時刻感知到，你被愛著，比以往任何時刻都更多，更充盈的愛。"A你不打算帶走它？\PN，你沒必要把它留給我。"�如果你覺得這份禮物還不夠，我將來會再補償你的，無論你想要什麼我都會給你，讓我來處理這些，好嗎？"J你的美，無與倫比，而且你是我的，全部都是我的。"e現在繼續你的旅程吧，我們可以再分開一段時間，我每一秒都會想念你。"Y接下來我要做好一切的準備，安排時間、採購物品、處理麻煩..."\等我們再次相遇，就永遠不會再分開，因為...這就是我永恆的愛！"2再見，\PN，我愛你勝過世間一切。"/這塊石頭散發出了強大的能量。"S它的側面刻有兩個圖像，一個紅色和一個藍色的發光球體。"5你拿出了硃紅色寶珠和靛藍色寶珠。")石頭在你觸摸時被激活了。"#你要離開我？為什麼？"J你知道嗎？我本來要創造一個屬於我們的完美世界！"�葉澤拉想要一個新的世界，我不在乎她的目的，但這給了我一塊完美的畫布，給了我古老而神聖的土地！我可以讓黃金時代永不終結！"#我會擁有她...或者你。"�我本在那裡為她服務，幫助她與你戰鬥，偷走巨人...在重生的世界裡，我也會繼續為她服務，永遠愛她。"�但現在你照亮了我，我再也無法回到她身邊，她現在已經顯得沒那麼美好了...所以現在沒有人能得到我這份無盡的愛。"n我永遠都無法為我所愛的人創造全新的世界了，我永遠都無法擁有自己的神了。">呵...你會後悔的...你們所有人都會後悔的！"D你們都會孤獨地死去，沒有人愛，沒有人記得。"e你本可以很幸福，現在火焰只剩灰燼和餘溫，我只希望它能把你們嗆住！"你...不！"Y為什麼你要給我希望，然後又將它撕碎？為什麼你要這樣對我？"G我那麼崇敬你，那麼愛你！一直、一直都是這樣！"_神明降臨人間，卻背棄了我！難道我不配嗎？我到底是哪裡做錯了？"A不！我是純潔而神聖的！我的愛是最神聖的！"~既然...連你都想將我扔進黑暗，那就這樣吧...如果連天堂都無法容納我的愛，那就將我驅逐吧..."�但你無法阻止我，無法扼殺我的！你，或者是其他神明中的一個，總有一個，總有一天會是我的！"z我只需要一個永遠愛我的人，一個屬於我...只屬於我的人！我會不停地追求，直到擁有..."G我愛你，我比誰都更愛你，但我再也見不到你了。"�也許我們會在另一個永恆中相遇，當我擁有自己的神明去愛和照顧時，到時再看看你是否會後悔吧。"G基拉祈似乎感到不安，它似乎嚴重地誤判了情況。"k它也似乎感到很抱歉，也許它也想彌補你受到的傷害，或者保護你免受傷害。"G也許它被你堅定的希望和絕不妥協的願望所吸引。")總之，它看起來想跟你走。"b你無論如何都想不明白，為什麼斯凱勒會被傳說中的願望的象徵祝福。"q基拉祈似乎非常尷尬，但也很高興自己能彌補，其實，它更想就此忘記這件事情。"k基拉祈似乎很失望，你懷疑它到底為什麼會祝福斯凱勒，總有種莫名的不安。"V不過，作為一個不朽的存在，它有足夠的時間忘記這件事情。"M它隨著山風離開了，也許你會在這雪山上再次見到它...")你也是來在山頂跳舞的嗎？")我後悔穿成這樣來這裡了...",真希望蘭妮能和我一起跳舞..."J你不想和我跳舞嗎？好吧，或許你對派對更感興趣。")繼續去做你喜歡的事情吧。"你有什麼愛好嗎？"下: 怪巖腸道"D只有日食的時候，才能解放龍屬性真正的力量！";唯一的問題在於我，我辜負了我的精靈。")我將更加專注地捋清思緒。"8龍屬性精靈經常棲息在這座山的山頂。">聽到讚美詩的歌聲是真正一生難得的經歷。"拒絕"可以"要談談？"還有別的事？"我只需要你。"有禮物？"準備一下。"好的。"...不需要吧..."你需要治療。"下地獄吧。" 最後一條不能接受。"讓我成為你的吧。"帶走基拉祈。"永遠拒絕基拉祈。"帶走基拉祈。"永遠拒絕基拉祈。;[�"bYou might be able to tell, but a certain Nurse aid in training is feeling a bit wild today..."^This Happiny has been a troublemaker since day one, always trying to battle the patients."SI got an idea. If you can beat it in a battle, it'll demand to join your team."2It'll thrive with a trainer. What do you say?"CI just want to get it off the cliff so we can get out of here."Place feels dangerous."!Wonderful. Give me a second.".HEY! YOU GOT SOMEONE WHO WANTS TO BATTLE!"GET DOWN HERE!"Thanks for that."<As expected, it's practically dying to join your party."DWell, I suppose that's three months of training down the drain."Peace."wMy mom told me not to come up here, but I really wanted to see what it was like to pee off the side of a mountain.";I uh... don't need to pee anymore. For no real reason."{I felt like peeing off Makya's highest point would be great, but I'm not feeling as liberated as I thought I would be."WI'm scared of heights, but I'm more scared of growing old without making memories."4That's why I choose where I pee very carefully."^\PN! My beloved! The mountains frame your beauty in a way I can only describe as sublime."TYou look as if you could tear them down around you and build yourself a throne."-You don’t need to. All you need is me."oOf course. I always have time to talk with you. Listening to your dulcet voice makes my worries dissipate."1We can talk about anything. Anything at all."GWhy would you come here if not for me? You could’ve stayed away."sWhat draws you to me? You know what it is, I think. We both know. I’d love to show you what you really feel."oYou’re perfect. I see all my love reflected in your eyes. It’s beautiful. I want to hold you so badly."1Oh, you’re adorable. Such a pure creature."zYes, my love. Always gifts. I’ll get you anything you desire, always. You’re worth more than any material object."!...But that must come later."P\PN. I had planned to propose to you here. But then I was gifted a miracle."pMy undying, fervent wish was made real before my eyes. Our love was consecrated in the eyes of the heavens."{I knew this gift to us was to be used only one way. You are like Yezera: there’s one language you speak above all others."xI’ve been so selfish, using my words to express how wonderful you are. I should’ve been speaking your language."�Let me show you my love. Let me show you the sign I have received. Let our love be made immortal by this glorious omen, shining in the passions of combat."-Of course, my love. Make yourself ready."4I love you. Allow me to show you just how much."8...I won’t let you slip away. You’re mine, \PN."|You don’t understand what I mean yet. Let me show it to you. Let me open your eyes to the love you’ve been missing."BThis is meant to be. Witness the message the heavens gave me."�You’re making me wait. My heart is pounding. I can’t wait any longer. Will you now bear witness to this sign of our eternal love?"�Do you see it? The wish-bringer, come to grant me my wish! The light of our love shining through it! And you, like a star, like an avatar!"mI wanted Yezera, and I sought the avatars, all to lead me here. To woo a god, and make you mine forever."1Can’t you see? I will do anything for you."�I will move heaven and earth. I will love you eternally. I will smother you in compassion and affection. I will fill your life with comfort and pleasure."~I will steal for you. Kill for you. End this world for you, or remake it to be more pleasant for you. So long as you are mine."]So long as I can hold you, and love you, and know that you are mine and no one else’s."1I need help? That’s all you can say to me?"zI love you more than anyone has loved anything! Do you expect me to keep it inside, wear masks, be... civil about it?"It drives me to madness and back not embracing you here and now! As it should! Everyone else is blind not seeing your radiance!"pYou are gorgeous and brilliant and divine. What higher accomplishment could there be than to make you mine?">No one could aspire to anything better, except to be you."2I would for you. Don’t you understand that?"=Why would you reject me? I could make your life perfect!"�I would do anything for you, and you want to throw that away? Simply because I ask for your love in return? Am I not worthy of that, after everything?"RI am kind, and loving, and caring, and humble, and I can see your real worth!"VShouldn’t I be more worthy of love than anyone else? Do you think I’m insane?"You’re the mad one here if you think you’ll be better off without me. A beautiful mad god that refuses to be helped..."QNo! I will have you alone. I couldn’t stand to share you with anyone else!"cPlease, you won’t even notice. I will fill your days with joy. You won’t need anyone else."�If they ask for you, if they want you, I’ll take care of them. They can serve you – us – or they can leave. Our perfect days need no one else."~After all, I’m the only one that feels this raging love. I’m the only one that knows what you really are. Radiant. Divine."8Yes. Of course. Hah! Everything is as it should be."LThe entire world is falling into place, my love. You are mine. Forever."�Love, I’ve been working with Yezera to reset the world. I planned to rule with her, and then later I planned to make it a paradise for us two."�But now? You’re fighting Yezera, and I’ll gladly choose you over her. She’s nothing to me now. You’re the only one that matters."zHow about this? You go take care of her and make sure she never bothers us. Meanwhile, I’ll be making preparations."�I’ll make your life a dream. A beautiful, idyllic, paradisiacal dream from which you’ll never wake up. Go do what you do best."Oh, the plans I have. My love, just you wait. Please. Don’t hurry yourself. Although... you must have work to attend to."VOh, please, continue then. I wouldn’t dare take you away from what you do best."{I need time to prepare, and you need to wrap up these loose ends. Cut these threads away. You don’t need anyone else now."Y\PN, I’m going to make your life a dream. You’re a god... and now you’re mine."VWe’ll be together forever. Forever’s just beginning, and I’m a patient man."fSo go ahead. Get rid of Yezera. Get rid of everyone! And then come back to me, so I can hold you."QHere. Take Jirachi with you. A sign of my undying love, and our divine bond."OI love you, \PN. My gift to you is a god, because what else could suffice?"CTake it, and know you’re loved. Loved more than anyone else."7No? Oh, \PN, you don’t have to leave it with me."�If it isn’t good enough for you, I’ll make it up to you. Anything you desire, you’ll have. Just let me work out the details, alright?"SYou’re gorgeous. You’re perfect beyond words. And you’re mine. All mine."mSo go on. We can be apart for a little while more. I’ll be thinking of you every second you’re away."`I’ve got preparations to make. Time to set aside, items to procure, people to... obviate."[We’ll meet again. And then we’ll never meet again, because we’ll never be apart.">Goodbye, \PN. I love you more than anything in the world."The stone hums with power."TEtched into its side are two images, a pair of glowing spheres in red and blue.".You present the Red Orb and the Blue Orb."'The stone activates at your touch."You’re leaving me? Why?"EI was going to create a perfect world for you. Do you know that?"�Yezera wants a new world. I don’t care why. It gave me the perfect canvas. An ancient, divine land. A golden age! And this time it’d never end!" I would have her... or you."�I served her whims here, helping her, fighting you, stealing the titans. And I would serve her in the reborn world, love her forever."�But now that you have shone upon me, I couldn’t ever go back to her. She pales in comparison. So now no one will receive this endless love."]I will never build a new world for my beloved. And I will never have a god to call mine."2...Fine. You’ll regret this. They all will."JThey’ll all die cold and alone, withering unloved and unremembered."dYou could’ve been happy. And now the fire smolders to embers and ash. I hope you choke on it."You – no!"QWhy would you give me hope just to rip it away? Why would you do this to me?"EI have worshiped you! I have loved you! I have always loved you!"iGods come to earth, turning their backs on me! Do I deserve this? Have I failed you in a single way?"0No! I am pure, and holy! My love is divine!"~Fine then! If you want to cast me into darkness, do so. If my love burns too brightly even for the heavens, cast me down."fYou can’t stop me. You can’t snuff me out. You’ll be mine eventually. One of the gods will."pAll I need is one to love forever. One to be mine, and mine alone. I won’t stop until I have one to keep."OI love you. I love you more than anything. And I’ll never see you again."�Maybe we’ll meet in another eternity, when I have a god of my own to love and care for. And then we’ll see if you regret this."OJirachi seems perturbed. It seems to have gravely misjudged the situation."WIt also seems apologetic. Perhaps it wants to make it up to you, or keep you safe."BMaybe it’s even attracted by your adamant hopes and wishes."7In any case, it seems willing to be caught by you."QHow Skyler was blessed by a mythical granter of wishes, you’ll never know."�Jirachi seems highly embarrassed and gladly lets itself be caught. Honestly, it seems like it just wants to forget this ever happened."nJirachi seems disappointed. You suspect it wanted to be caught and battle some more as a palate cleanser."ZAs an immortal being, though, it’s got plenty of time to forget this ever happened."\It leaves with the mountain wind. Perhaps you’ll see it again on these snowy peaks..."9Are you also here to dance at the top of a mountain?"1I regret coming up here dressed like this..."0I wish Lainie were here to dance with me..."HYou won't dance with me? Well, I'm sure you're very fun at parties."=Go on, back to your climbing or whatever you like to do."Do you even have hobbies?"Down: Gigalith's Guts"JThe true power of the Dragon-type is only unlocked during an Eclipse!"?The only problem here is my own. I have failed my Pokemon."FI shall return to my thoughts, and I will come back more focused."BDragon-type Pokemon often roost on the peak of this mountain."JHearing the songs of Hymnus is a true once-in-a- lifetime experience."No"Yes"I want to talk."Not why I'm here."All I need is you."More gifts?"Let me prepare."Very well."...No?"You need help."Go to hell."Last bit's a dealbreaker."Yes. Let me be yours."Take Jirachi."Refuse Jirachi forever."Catch Jirachi."Release Jirachi forever.Iu;␀I[[O"North: Sewer Junction"8North-East: Exit to Eleig Stretch Sewer Maintenance"&South: Exit to LuxTech Rec Center"5How d’ya do? Can’t beat the stench out here."USinuses ain’t stung this bad since that shot of Reuniclus liquid came back up."XAh, I don’t get paid to complain, though. This Trubbish is bein’ real stubborn."5Mind lendin’ a hand? The way folks like us do?"=I’m a trainer. Real trainer, too – I train, y’see."]Train people’s Pokémon for money. We had a scuffle back in Novo Town… which ya won."RIf ya wanna know more than that, shame. We got a business relationship, yeah?"Now give me that rematch."Tch. Cold."iWelp, I’ll just park my ass here till this sack o’ trash works up the nerve to get its feet wet."'Get that toxin pumpin’, ya know?"AYou’re one of them reliable sorts, ain’tcha? Disgusting."KAh, I kid, I kid! Nice to see a little innocence ‘round these parts.",Now c’mon, show me your vicious side."<Got a bin liner to train and nobody to keep me company."Mind lendin’ a hand?"IAh, I kid, I kid! Nice to see a little innocence 'round these parts."-Ya see that? I knew you had a mean side."XDownright sadistic. Always good to have a bit o’ your inner psychopath available."EReal ace up your sleeve kinda deal, y’see what I’m sayin’?"@Babyface like you got plenty of room to blindside somebody."<Love to see it happen, love to see ya take it to heart."'You’re a hero. Look at yourself."GBut don’t get pinned down by the role – have some fun with it."+Play the rival a bit, yeah? Be a heel."VAh, nevermind me. Maybe you’re better at playing the hero, through and through."@Me? I’m a rival. I ain’t your rival, but I was a rival."YI wasn’t ever meant for big things, ya know? But I help keep heroes on their toes."MAnd, hell, maybe I have some fun along the way. Make some friends, yeah?"BThose days are behind me, but ya can’t teach me new tricks."9Fightin’ you feels like old times. I 'preciate it."/The name’s <imp>Alessa</imp>, by the by."I'Fraid I can’t chat any longer, though. I’m off to the big city."ASome bigshot CEO’s kid needs his reserves trained up ASAP."5So, see ya 'round. Don’tcha keep me waitin’."MIt would be foolish of me to talk about reciprocity and not reciprocate!"5Here, Trainer. It is not much, but it is a gift."KEnjoy the world, Trainer. It is there for us, and we are there for it."@These Pokemon are happy as a direct result of your actions."BNot every Pokemon will have a grand adventure with a Trainer."IIt is important to remember that those Pokemon matter just the same."CIt is always important to give back from where you have taken!"uMy friend and I have been feeding the Munchlax down here as thanks for providing us with important battle items."jWe've done our part, but perhaps you would like to join us? The Pokemon down here love Big Malasadas."dIf you could get a batch of ten from the LuxTech food vendor, we could do a little bit of good."DThat is alright Trainer, my friend and I have more than enough."LBut consider my offer! It is not about wealth, it is about reciprocity."?Fantastic! The Pokemon here will appreciate your kindness!"GI don't see enough for a batch, Trainer. Perhaps you are mistaken."`Big Malasadas are sold at the LuxTech Campus. You should be able to purchase a batch there."aYou know, I feel a little bad about stealing all those Nuggets from the Pokemon down here...",You're a LuxTech employee, aren't you?!"I'm gonna steal your TMs!".Silver Ninjask isn't going to be happy...";Now this job's gone completely sideways. Thanks a lot."Dialogue here."KIt reeks down here, but the Pokemon in this place are pretty friendly."VThey're more used to human contact than most, given how these are sewers and all.",I don't think I'm at the right river..."AI guess I'm gonna go for a swim... Please close your eyes..."3This place doesn't look fun to swim through..."!Can I borrow your surfboard?"No? Ok..."Who are you?"	Nah."
