[[",Grouz Station Captain, at your service."lDon't know why nobody stopped you at the cave mouth, but I guess that's all you can expect from grunts."FUnless you got a proper ID card, we're not gonna let you through."YToo many would-be heroes have gotten themselves hurt fighting the Avatar in there..."1How'd you get your hands on a Chasm ID Card?"DDon't tell me you stole that thing just to fight these Avatars."-Not sure if that's brave or just stupid."]Due to policy, I've got to let you through regardless of how I feel. Ridiculous, I know."\Hah! If a single Ranger here had half of your grit I'd never have worry about anything."]Since we let you through to fight the Avatar, how about you keep quiet about beating it?"/They won't notice for a few days at least."3Allow me and my team a well deserved vacation."This assignment sucks..."sYou get yourself a few badges as a hobby and all of a sudden they say you're getting drafted into this mess..."9I could see all those flashy moves from back here..." Almost caught a stray shot!"!A right proper mess this is."_None of us are getting paid enough for throwing our Pokemon at this Suicune over and over."MCan't even remember the last time I got more than five hours of sleep..."-Need me a right proper bonus after this.".Mans needs a full night of sleep as well.["&你好，我是古治站站長。"S雖然不知道為什麼沒人攔住你，但我也並不因此感到奇怪。"G除非你有正式的身份卡，否則我們不會讓你通過。"S我們見過太多自稱為英雄的人，在裡面被化身打成重傷了...",你怎麼會有裂隙隊的身份卡？"G別告訴我你是為了跟化身戰鬥，才去偷身份卡的。"/真不知道該說你勇敢還是愚蠢。"S呵，出於政策，無論我怎麼想，都得讓你通過，真是荒謬。"n哈哈！如果這裡的護林員有你一半的勇氣和實力，我就不需要再操這麼多心了。"w出於我們讓你通過的交換，請你暫時不要告訴外界，這裡的化身已經被打敗了，好嗎？",這樣，應該能拖幾天的時間。")足夠讓士兵們休息休息了。"這任務糟透了..."e我本來只是處於愛好去挑戰了幾個道館，然後就突然被徵召進護林員了..."5從這裡我都能看到那些花哨的招數..." 還差點被流彈擊中！"真是糟了個大糕！"b我們拿到的那一點工資，根本抵不上在這裡跟水君玩命對戰的工作量。"G上一次一覺超過五小時已經是多久之前的事情了..."2我需要一筆豐厚的獎金作為報酬！"#我還需要睡一個好覺！;[",Grouz Station Captain, at your service."lDon't know why nobody stopped you at the cave mouth, but I guess that's all you can expect from grunts."FUnless you got a proper ID card, we're not gonna let you through