[["[Whoa, careful kid. Ain't no adventure for you past here 'less you know what'cha doin'.">Can't let'cha through 'less you got the proper clearance."AThat gate ain't opening for any ol' Trainer that wanders in."FI ain't gon' stop you since you got yerself the proper clearance."NAin't gon' like it, since you're just gonna get your behind handed to ya.",We'll I'll be darned! You took it down!"VYer good in my books kid. Ain't seen battlin' like that since my days as a grunt."YThe Svait Rescue Op owes ya one. I'm glad this crisis is a bit closer to bein' over."+Alright y'all, time to get outta here!"7You think you can best that monster? Best of luck."3Takes 3 of us to just keep it from escaping..."WWhen you challenged that Avatar, I thought you just had as much pride as a Pyroar."2But wow, you've got the skills to justify it."aIf everyone in Makya was as good as you, the Avatar Crisis would be an Avatar Inconvenience."9All I wanted was to attend the Makyan championships!"FHow'd I even get involved with the Avatar of Entei of all things?"QI go to boarding school in Paldea and Team Star ropes me into their plans...";I go to Galar and end up on a Team Yell cheer squad..."NI got to Alola and I'm working for every famous evil dude under the sun?!"5And now this?! I need to rethink how I travel...["G哇，注意安全，孩子！你知道這裡是什麼地方嗎？"/除非你有許可，否則不能通過。"G我們不會允許冒然闖進來的訓練師通過那扇門的。">既然你有通行證，那我就可以讓你過去了。"D雖說我自己不願這麼做，畢竟你也只會被打敗。" 我驚了！你打贏了！"Y你乾得很漂亮，孩子！自我從軍以來，就沒見過這樣的戰鬥了！"P霜皚救援隊欠你一個人情，離結束這場危機更近一步了！"&好了各位，可以回家了！"A你覺得你能打敗那個怪物？那就祝你好運吧。"G每次阻止它跑出去，都需要我們三個人合力才行..."b之前你要挑戰這個化身時，我以為你只是個跟火炎獅一樣自大的傢伙。"/但是你證明了的確有這份實力。"e如果馬凱亞能多一些像你這樣優秀的人，化身帶來的危機就是小問題了。"2我只是來馬凱亞參加競技大會的！"A為什麼會被捲入炎帝化身的防務工作當中啊？"M我一開始在帕底亞上學，然後莫名其妙加入了天星隊...">後來去了伽勒爾，又在旅店被吶喊隊選中..."Y在之後去了阿羅拉，又無意之中幫某個邪惡老大幹了不少髒活..."V為什麼現在又是這種感覺？我是不是該改改自己的旅行習慣...;["[Whoa, careful kid. Ain't no adventure for you past here 'less you know what'cha doin'.">Can't let'cha through 'less you got the proper clearance."AThat gate ain't opening for any ol' Trainer that wanders in