e what remains of a MasterBall, crushed completely flat."-I'd rather you not interrupt my lecture."5This information about avatars could save lives.">I tried to face an Ursaring avatar up in the Split Peaks."aI thought I'd be clever and use my Sinistea and my Duskull to completely negate its attacks."eI learned the hard way that avatars can ignore immunities. With their Empowered moves, at least."mThe damage was enough to send me packing. Later that day I heard that Victoire was able to take it down."+I bet that battle was a real carnival!"VIf an avatar takes enough damage, it might retaliate with a special kind of move."ONot only is the move powerful, it changes the typing of the avatar itself!"MMake sure your team isn't caught off guard by a sudden matchup reversal."EMost Pokemon are only able to have one status problem at a time."7Avatars, on the other hand, have no such defenses."DYou can have an avatar that's burned and numbed simultaneously!"]It's strange to consider what biological differences might have caused this discrepancy."TA ranger buddy of mine told me about the Avatars of Entei, Raikou, and Suicune."<He fought them, but won't tell me where at, the coward."9Though, maybe he's right to not get others involved."CHe's got three badges, and even then he failed to make a dent."hDuring my field studies, I noticed that the avatars rarely attacked the same Pokemon over and over."^They seemed to have a regular rhythm of switching who they were being aggressive against."?Holding back to avoid being too lethal? Or something else?"SThe board is scribbled with field research notes about an Avatar of Vileplume."PApparently a lot of stinky flowers bloomed nearby after it appeared. Gross!["S減小能力的技能對化身也有用，但效果不如一般精靈明顯。"V也許這種變化類技能對他們來說，只不過是平常的開胃小菜？">垃圾桶裡，有一個被壓成球片兒的大師球..." 請不要打擾我講課。"J這些關於化身的知識點，或許就能挽救某人的生命。"2我曾在嵌口峰面對過圈圈熊化身。"P我當時耍了點小聰明，試圖用來悲茶和夜巡靈免疫攻擊。"k然後我就學到了化身無視免疫這個重要知識點，起碼它們強化後的技能如此。"h然後我就灰溜溜地逃走了，直到晚些時候，聽說最後是薇克特爾擊敗了它。"5那一定是一場令人熱血沸騰的激戰！"\當一個化身受到足夠多的傷害後，就會使用一種極其特殊的技能。"q這種技能擁有強大的威力，能夠幫助它們恢復傷勢，還可以改變它們自身的屬性！"e挑戰化身時一定要考慮好，自己的精靈是否有完全處理不了的屬性變化。";大多數精靈同時只會陷入一種異常狀態。"&但是，化身並不在此列。"8你可以讓一個化身同時被麻痺和燒傷。"G想想是什麼生物差異導致了這種差異，真是奇怪。"\我有個護林員朋友跟我說，他曾面對過炎帝、雷皇和水君的化身。"P但是他沒告訴我這些化身在哪兒，誰知道是不是在吹牛。"_不過話說回來，如果是真的，為了不牽扯進他人而保密也可以理解。"S但我還是覺得他在吹牛，他也不過只拿到了三枚徽章而已。"S通過對數據的研究，我發現化身很少連續攻擊同一只精靈。"P它們似乎在按照一種固定的節奏，切換它們攻擊的對象。">難不成是良心發現不想下死手？誰知道呢！">黑板上詳細地寫著霸王花化身的詳細資料。"G在它出現之後，附近開出了很多散發著臭味的花！;["iStat changes affect Avatars, sure, but they have the ability to remove the negative changes somehow."IPerhaps stat-changing moves are more common wherever they come from."VAmong the garbage, you see what remains of a MasterBall, crushed completely flat."-I'd rather you not interrupt my lecture."5This information about avatars could save lives.">I tried to face an Ursaring avatar up in the Split Peaks."aI thought I'd be clever and use my Sinistea and my Duskull to completely negate its attacks."eI learned the hard way that avatars can ignore immunities. With their Empowered moves, at least."mThe damage was enough to send me packing. Later that day I heard that Victoire was able to take it down."+I bet that battle was a real carnival!"VIf an avatar takes enough damage, it might retaliate with a special kind of move."ONot only is the move powerful, it changes the typing of the avatar itself!"MMake sure your team isn't caught off guard by a sudden matchup reversal."EMost Pokemon are only able to have one status problem at a time."7Avatars, on the other hand, have no such defenses."DYou can have an avatar that's burned and numbed simultaneously!"]It's strange to consider what biological differences might have caused this discrepancy."TA ranger buddy of mine told me about the Avatars of Entei, Raikou, and Suicune."<He fought them, but won't tell me where at, the coward."9Though, maybe he's right to not get others involved."CHe's got three badges, and even then he failed to make a dent."hDuring my field studies, I noticed that the avatars rarely attacked the same Pokemon over and over."^They seemed to have a regular rhythm of switching who they were being aggressive against."?Holding back to avoid being too lethal? Or something else?"SThe board is scribbled with field research notes about an Avatar of Vileplume."PApparently a lot of stinky flowers bloomed nearby after it appeared. Gross!Iu;␀[[7"/Accessorize! Every Pokémon NEEDS an item!"dIf you can’t decide, give them Leftovers or a shiny new Gem and watch them strut their stuff."tThere are dozens and dozens of items to pick from, so I’m sure you can find something to match your Pokémon!"dSetting up with something like Dragon Dance can turn a Pokémon into an unstoppable juggernaut."3But be patient. Pick the right time and place."|Wait for something you can set up on without being humbled, and make sure there’s no nasty surprises waiting in the wings.".Remember to check the Info tab in battle."QThat’ll give you the nitty-gritty on your opponent’s stats – or yours."VYou can also check the MasterDex to see what kinds of moves your opponent learns."JOtherwise you might find out something learns Ice Shard the hard way."eAnd, hey, you can use it after the fight to find potential team members. Just filter and search."Hello again, champion."Don't pay me any mind."OI'm just here to discuss some possible changes to the monument with Jovan."You've met, I believe?"/I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."<First, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."We hope you excel!"-Offensive Pokémon need offensive moves."9Most of the time you’ve got more moves than types."lThat means you’re going to want some attacking moves that complement the moves that match your types."%Think long and hard about those."4A Normal-type might want a Dark or Ground move."cIf your team’s weak to Ice, maybe here’s where you slip in a Mach Punch or a Flamethrower."Think about it."NHeyo, \PN. Want some guaranteed one-hundred- percent success rate advice?"NNever be afraid to bring, like, five Pokémon that all do the same 