oal: to understand the circuitry and machinery housed in the lower layers."rAs it turns out, being the only engineer in a throng of useless academics makes it hard to get anything done."~Who cares about “cultural significance” or “hydrological processes" when we don’t even know what the thing does?!"*…but that’s all in the past, now."AI brought you here because of a different group of ex-Chasm."The Drillers.""What a lovely bunch they are."hThey’re basically a gang wearing ranger uniforms— and this corner of Makya is their “turf”."dUsually we’re keen to avoid the Regi Tombs, but recent events have… got some of us nervous."`That’s what the Drillers are saying, anyways… that they’re here to protect the place."Keep the prisons secure.",I think that’s a load of Tauros dung."FAnd even if it’s not, I don’t trust them around the machines."~So, my request: Figure out what The Drillers are doing. And stop them, if my instincts about their mission prove correct."#Finish the job that I can’t."!I’ll stand watch out here.";Need a refresher? I know, it’s a lot of information."0The Drillers have invaded the Oasis System."?They’re a bunch of brutes, and probably up to something."HEven if they’re not, I don’t want them anywhere near the place."}I’ll never figure out why the ancients built this System if The Drillers find a way to “accidentally” destroy it first."BIn short: find The Drillers and—if neccessary—evict them.[$"	\PN.",謝謝你聽我說，並來到這裡。"	\PN!")你確定你不是超能屬性嗎？"S我花了整整一天考慮是否要給你打電話，而你卻自己來了。"G...我很高興見到你，儘管我內心的一部分並不是..."#讓我們直接進入正題。"A您可能已經弄清楚了，但是我是前裂隙隊的。"M幾年前，我加入了馬凱亞政府組織的電路洞窟探險隊。">我們的目標：瞭解下層的電路和機械裝置。"k事實證明，作為一個工程師，周圍卻是一群無用的學者，很難做成任何事情。"{當我們甚至都不知道這個東西是做什麼的時候，誰會在乎“文化意義”或“水文過程”呢？！"&...但那都是過去的事了。"A我把你帶到這兒是因為另一群前裂隙隊成員。"鑽工隊。"&他們真是個可愛的群體。"t他們基本上是一群穿著護林員制服的幫派——馬凱亞的這個角落是他們的“地盤”。"q通常我們都儘量避開巨人墓穴，但最近發生的事情...讓我們中的一些人感到不安。"V鑽工隊是這麼說的...他們說他們來這兒是為了保護這個地方。"確保監獄的安全。",我覺得那都是肯泰羅的糞便。"A即使不是這樣，我也不信任他們在機器旁邊。"�所以，我的請求是：弄清楚鑽工隊在做什麼。如果我的直覺關於他們的任務是正確的，就阻止他們。"&完成我無法完成的工作。"我會在這裡站崗。">需要複習一下嗎？我知道，這有很多信息。"&鑽工隊入侵了