Good."aThat may be so. Dedicated trainers seem to have some kind of honor to their matches, though."�I would like to ensure you are telling me everything. It seems as if a loss may compel you to reveal what you would otherwise hide."ZThose are my conditions. I will fight you before I have anything more to do with you.")If you would like to leave, you may."7Yes. What honor compels you trainers is beyond me."tI plan to uphold my end of the deal, though. I believe your bizarre code of conduct will force you to, as well."LNow, if you would like time to prepare, or simply to escape, do so now." If not, then we shall duel."Go. I’ll wait."^I understand you are the current Champion. I am more skilled than you may expect, though."!You returned. Are you ready?"SYes, well, I suppose I expected this. The odds of beating a Champion were low."{I did the best I could, and now I will tell you the whole truth. Maybe your response will tell me what I want to know."MI have discovered the locations of at least four of the five Regi tombs."�I am also aware of Yezera’s abduction of the Regis, and that some part of her plan has caused the avatars. My final finding is that... none of it matters."Not for my purposes."�Makya is a large, vibrant ecosystem. The pressures which generate a new regional form are more complicated than one can simply infer."SIn my pride, I thought an outsider’s perspective could unravel this mystery."~The Regis, the avatars, the regional forms – all connected, of course, but not cleanly. The world is not a clean place."cI am glad you agree. If you had a simple solution I had missed, I would be rather embarrassed."uEven a negative result is worth determining for certain. I don’t have answers. I do have experience, and data."jYes. I plan to prove my abilities in more realistic ways than solving an entire region’s mysteries."BI don’t. I’ve determined my problem. Now I’m fixing it."HBut I am also not finished, as I have only told you half the truth.">My challenge and this location were for a higher purpose."�I noted Makya’s vast diversity of species and set my sights on a particular trio. Prior to this moment, they have only been found in an extremely specific locale."KBut, drawn by the sound of brutal conflict, in a place such as this..."Pulp and Fantasy"kConflict against a hero such as you, in a location similar to their home such as this, draws them out."II have been untrue, however. I have fought you before. I was masked."�I have determined I have made a mistake there, too. Primordial truth would elude us even if the world is reverted. There is no point."�The world is complicated, and always has been. My inability to solve such a relatively-trivial mystery suggests my plan was foolish."cPlease excuse my repeated deceptions. I did, in fact, determine quite a bit of this on my own."sThe nature of the regional forms is still a pursuit of mine. I plan to continue it, so Yezera must be stopped."�If you wish, I would suggest you take these birds of the battlefield with you. I planned to use them against you. Now I suggest the reverse."qI will leave you to your preparations. I have many years of study left in Makya, and plan to not waste them."NI rest easy knowing you will not let my efforts be in vain. Goodbye, \PN.")There they are. Bringers of carnage."zOnly a battle against a Champion in an environ similar to their home might draw them out, if they lurked here at all."7I have confirmed my hypothesis, and can rest easy."iIf you wish to catch them, or merely fight them, you may do so. I will leave you to your amusements."[Goodbye, \PN. Thank you. I have many more years of study left in Makya, thanks to you."
Fine."I'd tell you anyways."No."Seems unenforceable."Give me a minute."I'm ready now."That's true."So it was pointless?"Pride is right."Don't beat yourself up.[I"沼澤與包容"寒冷與疏遠"溼地與瘋狂"鳴蟲與微光"岩層與厚重"枝葉與茂盛"門被牢牢鎖住了。">在門縫中，你能看到一點點光線洩漏出來..."你好，\PN。">很抱歉，我用一個假借口把你騙來這邊了。"P在研究過程中，我注意到了一個跟你有過幾次交集的人。"/後來才發現她是前冠軍葉澤拉。"G我有充足的理由相信她就是化身出現的幕後黑手。"V我知道你可能不願意透露太多，那我們不妨靠決鬥來決定吧！",輸家要向勝者透露全部真相。"很好。"V或許吧，但對訓練師來說，這樣的比試也有關榮譽感不是嗎？"k我想確保能得知我想要的一切，如果你輸了，我可能會問一些更深入的問題。"A這只是我的條件，在我們相互坦白前的戰鬥。";如果你實在不願意，我也沒有什麼辦法。"P的確，我很難以自己的思維，理解你們訓練師的榮譽感。"h我會遵守我們的協議，我同時相信你們奇怪的行為準則也會迫使你這樣做。"P所以，無論你需要時間準備，還是就此逃跑，趁現在吧。")如果不需要，那就開始吧。"&好吧，我會在這裡等你。"G我知道你是現任冠軍，不過，我比你想象中更強。"#你回來了，準備好了？"D是啊，我早就想到了，想打敗冠軍沒那麼容易。"�我已經盡力了，願賭服輸，現在我會告訴你全部真相，也許你的迴應也能告訴我我想知道的答案。"5我已經找到四個巨人墓穴的位置了。"�我也知道葉澤拉帶走了它們，她的計劃導致了化身的出現，但我的最終發現是...這一切都沒有意義。",對於我的目的來說沒有意義。"�馬凱亞擁有一個龐大且充滿活力的生態系統，這裡新的地區形態的出現，比人們的想象和推斷更復雜。"b或許是因為我的自負，以為以一個局外人的視角，能解開這裡的謎團。"�巨人、化身、地區形態...我相信它們之間都有所聯繫，但這種聯繫又並不直觀，顯然這個世界並沒有那麼幹淨。"e我很高興你能認可，如果我忽略了什麼明顯的點...光是想想就覺得尷尬。"�即便是不好的結果，也值得大家去研究、確定，我雖然沒能得到答案，但積累了足夠的經驗和數據。"n沒錯，所以我計劃，用比起解決地區的謎題，更為現實的方法證明自己的能力。"k我並不會自責，現在已經確定了擺在面前的問題，只要一點點解決它就好了。"Y但即便如此我也沒有完成目標...我現在也只說了一半真相而已。",我做這一切有著更高的目的。"�為了更加了解馬凱亞的物種多樣性，我把目光投向了它們三個...這三種之前只在一個特定地區出現過的精靈。"T可它們又為什麼被這樣一個 充滿殘酷衝突的地方吸引來呢？"芳草與奇幻"z在這樣一個類似它們家園的地方，與你這樣的英雄的一場對戰，正好能把它們吸引出來。"h而且，我...還隱瞞了一件事，之前我...就和你戰鬥過...我戴著面具的時候。"}但我已經認識到自己的錯誤了，就算世界恢復原初狀態，真理也會離我們而去，毫無意義。"k世界一直都是如此的複雜...我無法解決這樣的謎團，也就此證明了我的愚蠢。"h請原諒我一而再的隱瞞，實際上...至少今天，我已經把該說的都告訴你了。"t我會繼續研究地區形態的問題，這是我一直在做的課題，所以，請一定阻止葉澤拉。"�如果你願意，我建議你帶上它們一起，可笑我曾經還打算用它們對付你，但現在，完全反過來了。"\等你準備好之後，就來收下它們吧，我還會在這裡學習研究幾年。"_將一切交給你我很放心，我知道你不會讓我的努力白費，再見，\PN。"2它們就在這兒，帶來屠殺的使者。"{只有在類似它們家園的環境中，與冠軍級別的英雄戰鬥，才可能將潛伏在附近的它們引出來。"S當然這只是個假設，現在假設已被驗證，我也可以放心了。"\無論你想抓住它們還是僅僅與它們戰鬥，那就是你自己的選擇了。"\再見，\PN。謝謝你，多虧了你，我在馬凱亞的研究得以繼續下去。"好吧"本就沒打算隱瞞"我拒絕"這辦不到"給我一分鐘"準備好了"確實"所以就沒意義？"自信很正常"不要自責;[I"Slick Ick"Cold and Distant"Marsh Madness"Best Pests"Mineral Imports"Pruning and Preening"The door is firmly locked.";Under the door, you see a bit of light spilling out..."Hello, \PN."@I’m sorr