Fine."I'd tell you anyways."No."Seems unenforceable."Give me a minute."I'm ready now."That's true."So it was pointless?"Pride is right."Don't beat yourself up.Iu;␀�@[[�"2Some loose paper displaying the LuxTech logo."LLeaving through -- oh. You -- you’re looking for something down here."2Come back and, uh, I’ll still be... around.")I took some classes in the gym here.":I was a bit scared cause I heard how tough Samorn is."8She's the strongest gym leader in the whole region!"/But she's really nice. I had a great time."The door is locked shut."Samorn's House"-Oh! I knew I’d find you here, my hero."3You’re looking particularly ravishing today."MYour gaze is like a summer night... getting me all hot under the collar."BExcuse my directness. I’m getting carried away. Hello, \PN."KStrange days. Strange days indeed! There’s an excitement in the air."<Oh, don’t flatter me. It’ll go straight to my head."cAww, have I upset you? Please, I don’t mean a word of it, if that’s what you want to hear."P...It’s been a long day. I get... flustered after days like these. Sorry."�A certain trainer you may know grabbed me by the collar. Then she told me in detail what she’d do to me if I ever laid my hands on Yezera."gNow, as much as I might like to do exactly that... I haven’t. And won’t. She’s unattainable.";Sorry, sorry. Let me explain myself. As much as I can."tOh, for sure! She’s so appealing because of her reclusiveness. Oh, to rehabilitate her with endless kindness."fWho isn’t? So tremulous, so frail, yet so powerful. Don’t you want to hug her back to health?"qOh, now, yes, of course. Don’t be jealous. You’ve got all her verve and aren’t as... high-maintenance."DYou see, I used to be obsessed with her. It’s why I’m here."nI could be the one to track her down, lure her out like a timid beast. I just wanted to take care of her."~And she was beautiful, of course. I’m not so high- minded as to discount her graceful splendor as part of my reasoning."UBut then I arrived here... and I found you. My attention was caught immediately."|I’m so sorry. I just can’t really contain my feelings any longer. I like you. A lot. And I’d like you to be mine."VShh. It’s OK. You’re confused and surprised and scared, but that’s alright."[What’s life without a little fear? Adds a little color to proceedings, doesn’t it?"8But I assure you my intentions are pure and loving."=Don’t turn me away so easily, \PN. I know I’m a lot."[I come on strong. Well, the incandescence inside my heart leaches out through my body.";I want you, and I want to be yours. I can’t hide it."4Oh, love, how I’ve longed to hear you say it."lYou’re beautiful when you smile, you know that? More gorgeous than an open sky. Deific in your grace."RBut I don’t want you to rush into this. Take your time. We can move slowly."]\PN, I don’t want to be your friend. I don’t know that I even want to be your lover."~I want to be with you. I want you to be mine, forever. I want you to be my crescent moon to illuminate my starless skies."5Here. Take this as a token of my boundless love."pTo show you I’m honest, and that I only want the best for you. This is the true color of my love for you."uLet this gift saturate your soul. Let it dye you with my affections. Let it be the start of our eternal romance."�You’re amazing. Everything I saw in Yezera, in the avatars, even in the myths and legends, are all in you. You’re radiant. I want to bask in that radiance."Think about it."�I’d love you more than anyone else ever could. Go and take care of your material affairs. Your badges and your tournament – all those trivial things."-And then find me. Somewhere... romantic."The top of a snowy mountain, overlooking the entire world. Beautiful. Stern and rugged and powerful. With an ancient soul."-Just like you. Goodbye, \PN. I love you."Forever."AHello. My Druddigon and I handle trips down to Samorn's gym."=Stay away from the ledge and we won't have any problems."Careful!"TIf you've got a scheduled visit, I'm authorized to help you get down the ledge."..."You look like a Trainer."*sigh*"You're here too early."VSamorn only takes the strongest of challengers, and you aren't strong enough yet."KGo get all of the other badges first. Then you might be strong enough.":My Druddigon and I handle trips down to Samorn's gym.",That service is for civilians, however."/Trainers like you should know their place."fDon't even think about challenging the Dreadnaught until you've aquired every other Makyan badge."2Oh, hello. I see you have some climbing gear."II suppose that means you could go down to the gym on your own power."CI wouldn't recommend it. You still have a lot of growth to do."LYes! You are the proper level of strength to challenge the Dreadnaught."0I'm sure she will be pleased to battle you."0You've bested the Dreadnaught! Well fought."0My congratulations to you and your Pokemon."lYou'd think that Samorn, the gym leader down there, would have issues getting around in her wheelchair."/Especially in difficult terrain like this."bAt first I thought she'd use her dragons to help her down, but apparently that's too awkward."�Instead she just has her Runerigus do the heavy lifting. It isn't part of her team, so it gets to relax at home the rest of the day, too."'"Attention: All Team Chasm Grunts""N"Team Chasm is no longer in operation, and activities here are to cease.""Y"Until further notice, this base is now part owned by the scholars of Novo College.""1"Your admins thank you for your dedication.""9The 8th gym already. I can't believe how time flies."II've been enjoying this. I really and truly hope that you have, too."PNothing like the search for perfection to motivate you to try crazy things."@Using species that are supposed to be extinct, for example."BI'm eager to try out this Arcanine, so hit me up post- haste!"mWe could add to the history of this place by engaging in a struggle of training supremacy. You inclined?"Understood."+I'll be here until you wish to battle."9When I win, I'm gonna shout something very quotable."Rock doggy.... no...."IHeh, now I know how the grunts felt when Yezera whipped their butts."2Leave me to the task of reviving my battlers." Vanya breathes out heavily."VSo, this is it. The very last badge. After this comes the championship, you know.">Even more than usual, I can't afford to mess this one up."SThank you for your help. Now it's just up to me to do what I've trained to do."Team Chasm HQ Gym"Leader: Samorn"History and motion."qHey, kiddo. Knew you’d show up sooner or later. You took to training like a Wooper to water, didn’t you?"eHad to work myself to the bone to get here before you and, guess what? Gym leader’s out again."5You waiting for me to throw a Poké Ball at you?"RI’m not gonna. Not about to bruise my team just before challenging the gym."zYes, \PN. I snuck down here and put a sign on the door saying it’s closed after beating the gym, just to trick you."$It’s a flawless plan, really."$Not if you schedule in advance."]Or that’s what I’d like to say – professionalism isn’t in this region’s blood."HDon’t even get me STARTED on that man in the bayou. Insufferable."!In any case, Samorn’s out."]Sign on the door says she’s dealing with some ruckus over at the dig site. You coming?")That’s what I thought. Let’s go."COh, you want to be contrary, do you? Fine. Stay here and wait." The dig site. West of town."pI swear, sometimes you’re more thick-skulled than a Rampardos. Let’s go perform some heroics, shall we?"gThe railway here used to be pretty nice, but it got destroyed when that girl took Team Chasm down."cNo one's ever really gotten to repairing the whole thing, too much hassle for too little gain."LMost of the dirt and heavy equipment are already where they need to be."KClosed while Samorn participates in the Makya Championship Tournament."XHey, trying to get Samorn's badge as well? I've tried, but I've had no luck so far."UI was prepped for countering a Sandstorm strategy, based on the legends I heard."tBut she apparently hasn't used that strategy in forever, despite how well suited to it some of her Pokemon are."NMaybe it's a "hiding your true power level" thing? I just don't get it..."DYou got the 8th badge? Damn, that means I gotta get myself one.">I want to at least make it to the Championship this year."Um, hi?"You're acting different."Same to you."You're a creep."Wait, what?"Good for her."You're into Yezera?"Eyes only for me?"Um."Hell no."I feel the same way."Can we be friends?"Maybe later."Sure, let's go."You kidding me?"Happens a lot."Of course."	Nah."Where?[�")一些印有光華標誌的紙張。";離開這裡...哦！你...你是在這裡找東西？">等你回來的時候...呃...我還會在這...附近。",我在這個道館裡補過幾節課。"J一開始我有些膽戰心驚的，大家都知道賽蒙有多強。"/她是這個地區最強的道館館主！">但她平日很是和善，懸著的心終於放下了。"門被鎖住了。"賽蒙 家"8我就知道會在這裡遇到你，我的英雄。"#你今天看起來真迷人。"A你的目光就像夏夜一樣...讓我感到又悶又熱。"P抱歉，請原諒我的直白，我有點失控了...咳...你好，\PN。"G今天是個奇怪的日子！我能聞到空氣中的興奮感。",哦，別太誇我，我會驕傲的。"V啊，我讓你感到難受了嗎？那抱歉，剛才的話都當是謊話吧。"J...今天是漫長的一天，像這樣的日子讓我有點慌亂。"z或許你也認識某個訓練師，她會抓住我的衣領警告我，如果我敢碰葉澤拉就怎樣怎樣的。"h儘管我很想這樣做...但我並沒有出手，也不會出手，她是可望而不可及的。";抱歉，抱歉，讓我來儘可能地解釋一下。"q沒錯，當然是這樣！尤其是最後的選擇，真吸引人，用無盡的善意讓她慢慢恢復。"k誰不是呢？如此嬌羞脆弱，卻又如此強大...你不想擁抱她，讓她恢復健康嗎？"_誒呀，不要嫉妒嘛、你擁有著她所有的活力，而且...沒那麼難相處。"P所以，這就是我曾經迷戀她，但現在出現在這裡的原因。"t我只是想照顧她，也願意成為那個追蹤她，像一隻膽怯的野獸一樣引誘她出來的人。"z當然，她也很美，我也不會高估自己的能力，不會將她優美的風度排除在我的行動之外。"S但是當我來到這裡...發現了你，我的注意力立刻被吸引了。"t我很抱歉，但我無法再控制我的感情了，我喜歡你，非常喜歡，我想讓你成為我的。"P你是覺得困惑、驚訝還是害怕？噓...沒事的，沒關係的。"\沒有一點恐懼的人生算什麼？它為生活增添了一點色彩，不是嗎？"G我可以向你保證，我的意圖是純潔和充滿愛意的。";不要這麼輕易地拒絕我，\PN，我知道我..."J表現得過於強勢了，將我心中的光輝透露出了太多。"J我想要你，我想成為你的人，我無法隱藏這份願望。"A我多麼渴望聽到你這麼說，這或許就是愛吧。"h你微笑時很美，你知道嗎？比開闊的天空更美麗，你的優雅神聖不可侵犯。"M但我不希望你過於匆忙，慢慢來，我們可以慢慢前進。"V\PN，我不想成為你的朋友，我不確定我是否想成為你的情人。"�我想和你在一起，我希望你永遠屬於我，我希望你能成為我的明月，照亮我這片沒有星星的天空。"5拿著這個，作為我無盡愛意的象徵。"n為了向你表明我忠誠的心，以及我對你的予取予求。這就是我對你的愛的顏色。"t讓這份禮物浸潤你的靈魂，讓它染上我對你的感情，讓它成為我們永恆浪漫的開始。"�你太棒了，我在葉澤拉、化身、甚至神話傳說中看到的一切，都在你身上浮現，如此光輝璀璨，讓我忍不住想沐浴在其中。"好好感受吧。"t我會比任何人都更愛你，去處理你那些世俗的事務吧，把徽章、比賽什麼的都弄好。"5然後來找我，在某個...浪漫的地方。"w在一座雪山的頂端，俯瞰整個世界，美麗、嚴肅、粗獷而強大，還擁有著古老的靈魂。"A那一切就像你一樣美好。再見，\PN，我愛你。"永遠不變。"P你好，我和我的赤面龍，負責在這裡幫助需要下去的人。"2這點高低差對我來說就是小問題。"小心點！"A如果你想前往道館，我可以帶你從這裡下去。"...")你看起來是個訓練師對吧？"*嗤笑*"但你來的太早了。"D賽蒙只接待最強大的挑戰者，顯然你還不夠格。"A先把其他徽章都拿到手，然後才有這個資格。"J我和我的赤面龍，負責在這裡幫助想挑戰道館的人。"/不過這項服務是提供給平民的。">向你這樣的訓練師應該有自己的辦法才對。"J在獲得馬凱亞其他徽章前，就不要妄圖挑戰這裡了。"8嘿，你好，我看到你有一些攀巖設備。"2也就是說你可以自行前往道館了。"J但我不建議你現在挑戰，你還有很多其他事可以做。",哈哈，你的實力已經足夠了。"/我相信她會很高興與你交手的。",你打敗了無畏的賽蒙，很好！"#恭喜你和你的精靈們。"b你覺得賽蒙，也就是下面那個道館的館主，坐著輪椅會不會行動不便？"/尤其是在需要爬坡下坡的地形。"\起初我以為她會用自己的龍屬性精靈來幫她，但那也顯得太笨了。"q其實她一直用一隻迭失板來做各種重活，而這隻精靈並不在她的常規出戰列表裡。"""注意：所有裂隙隊員""@"裂隙隊已正式解散，這裡的活動也將停止。""I"在另行通知之前，這個基地由望新學院暫時管理。""%"感謝您的付出與奉獻。""J已經是第八個道館了，真不敢相信時間過得那麼快。";我一直在享受這個過程，希望你也如此。"M沒有什麼比追求完美，更能激勵你去做瘋狂的舉動了。",例如，使用本已滅絕的物種。"D我很想試試風速狗的實力，所以儘快來找我吧！"e我們要進行一場訓練至上的對戰嗎？為這裡的歷史添上濃墨重彩的一比！"明白了。"&你準備好了再來找我吧。";如果我贏了，我一定得喊幾句名言警句。"誒呀啊啊...不..."S呵呵，現在我好像明白葉澤拉在面對那些士兵時的感受了。"&讓我先復活我的戰士吧。"#凡雅重重地出了口氣。"G就是它了，最後一枚徽章，之後就是競技大會了。",比起往常，這次更不能出錯。"D感謝你一直以來的幫助，現在輪到我去挑戰了。"裂隙隊總部道館"館主：賽蒙"歷史與行動。"\呵，小鬼，我就知道你會來，你應該跟烏波一樣適應環境了對吧？"k為了在你之前趕到這裡，我不得不拼命往這邊趕，你猜怎麼著？館主又不在。")你在等我往你身上扔球嗎？"b我才不會做這種蠢事，在挑戰道館之前，我可不想減小隊伍的戰鬥力。"q你猜對了，\PN，我悄悄溜到這裡，在道館門上放了個關門的牌子，就是為了騙你。")這真是個蠢到掉渣的計劃。"除非你提前預約。"D或者我這麼說吧...這個地區的人都不怎麼敬業。"5總之，別再談這個地區的討厭鬼了。")現在的情況就是賽蒙不在。"V門上的牌子說她正在處理挖掘現場的騷亂，你要一起去看看？",這就是我希望的答案，走吧。"G哦，你不想去是嗎？好吧，那你就留在這等著吧。"&挖掘現場就在這裡西邊。"e雖說有時候你比戰錘龍還拗，但去做些英勇的事也沒什麼不好的，對吧？"h以前這裡的鐵路相當漂亮，但從那個女孩擊敗了裂隙隊後，它就被摧毀了。"J然後就沒人願意修復它了，因為太麻煩，收益又小。"A明明大部分的泥土和重型設備已經準備好了。")馬凱亞競技大會期間閉館。"M你也想獲得賽蒙的徽章？我之前試過，但一直沒成功。"S我明明已經根據收集到的情報，做好了應對沙暴隊的準備。"V但是她還有其他的戰鬥策略，即便她的精靈很適合沙暴天氣。">或許這也是一種“隱藏真實實力”的方法？"P你得到了第八個徽章了？看來我也得找時間去拿一個了。",今年起碼去競技大會露個臉。"呃...你好？"你咋了？"我覺得你也是"你好奇怪..."你在說什麼？"她很棒"你喜歡葉澤拉？"跟我有關係？"......"不可能"我覺得可以"成為朋友？"等會兒"來吧"你在開玩笑？"這種事經常發生"當然"不要"在哪裡？;[�"2Some loose paper displaying the LuxTech logo."LLeaving through -- oh. You -- you’re looking for something down here."2Come back and, uh, I’ll still be... around.")I took some classes in the gym here.":I was a bit scared cause I heard how tough Samorn is."8She's the strongest gym leader in the whole region!"/But she's really nice. I had a great time."The door is locked shut."Samorn's House"-Oh! I knew I’d find you here, my hero."3You’re looking particularly ravishing today."MYour gaze is like a summer night... getting me all hot under the collar."BExcuse my directness. I’m getting carried away. Hello, \PN."KStrange days. Strange days indeed! There’s an excitement in the air."<Oh, don’t flatter me. It’ll go straight to my head."cAww, have I upset you? Please, I don’t mean a word of it, if that’s what you want to hear."P...It’s been a long day. I get... flustered after days like these. Sorry."�A certain trainer you may know grabbed me by the collar. Then she told me in detail what she’d do to me if I ever laid my hands on Yezera."gNow, as much as I might like to do exactly that... I haven’t. And won’t. She’s unattainable.";Sorry, sorry. Let me explain myself. As much as I can."tOh, for sure! She’s so appealing because of her reclusiveness. Oh, to rehabilitate her with endless kindness."fWho isn’t? So tremulous, so frail, yet so powerful. Don’t you want to hug her back to health?"qOh, now, yes, of course. Don’t be jealous. You’ve got all her verve and aren’t as... high-maintenance."DYou see, I used to be obsessed with her. It’s why I’m here."nI could be the one to track her down, lure her out like a timid beast. I just wanted to take care of her."~And she was beautiful, of course. I’m not so high- minded as to discount her graceful splendor as part of my reasoning."UBut then I arrived here... and I found you. My attention was caught immediately."|I’m so sorry. I just can’t really contain my feelings any longer. I like you. A lot. And I’d like you to be mine."VShh. It’s OK. You’re confused and surprised and scared, but that’s alright."[What’s life without a little fear? Adds a little color to proceedings, doesn’t it?"8But I assure you my intentions are pure and loving."=Don’t turn me away so easily, \PN. I know I’m a lot."[I come on strong. Well, the incandescence inside my heart leaches out through my body.";I want you, and I want to be yours. I can’t hide it."4Oh, love, how I’ve longed to hear you say it."lYou’re beautiful when you smile, you know that? More gorgeous than an open sky. Deific in your grace."RBut I don’t want you to rush into this. Take your time. We can move slowly."]\PN, I don’t want to be your friend. I don’t know that I even want to be your lover."~I want to be with you. I want you to be mine, forever. I want you to be my crescent moon to illuminate my starless skies."5Here. Take this as a token of my boundless love."pTo show you I’m honest, and that I only want the best for you. This is the true color of my love for you."uLet this gift saturate your soul. Let it dye you with my affections. Let it be the start of our eternal romance."�You’re amazing. Everything I saw in Yezera, in the avatars, even in the myths and legends, are all in you. You’re radiant. I want to bask in that radiance."Think about it."�I’d love you more than anyone else ever could. Go and take care of your material affairs. Your badges and your tournament – all those trivial things."-And then find me. Somewhere... romantic."The top of a snowy mountain, overlooking the entire world. Beautiful. Stern and rugged and powerful. With an ancient soul."-Just like you. Goodbye, \PN. I love you."Forever."AHello. My Druddigon and I handle trips down to Samorn's gym."=Stay away from the ledge and we won't have any problems."Careful!"TIf you've got a scheduled visit, I'm authorized to help you get down the ledge."..."You look like a Trainer."*sigh*"You're here too early."VSamorn only takes the strongest of challengers, and you aren't strong enough yet."KGo get all of the other badges first. Then you might be strong enough.":My Druddigon and I handle trips down to Samorn's gym.",That service is for civilians, however."/Trainers like you should know their place."fDon't even think about challenging the Dreadnaught until you've aquired every other Makyan badge."2Oh, hello. I see you have some climbing gear."II suppose that means you could go down to the gym on your own power."CI