 myself to the bone to get here before you and, guess what? Gym leader’s out again."5You waiting for me to throw a Poké Ball at you?"RI’m not gonna. Not about to bruise my team just before challenging the gym."zYes, \PN. I snuck down here and put a sign on the door saying it’s closed after beating the gym, just to trick you."$It’s a flawless plan, really."$Not if you schedule in advance."]Or that’s what I’d like to say – professionalism isn’t in this region’s blood."HDon’t even get me STARTED on that man in the bayou. Insufferable."!In any case, Samorn’s out."]Sign on the door says she’s dealing with some ruckus over at the dig site. You coming?")That’s what I thought. Let’s go."COh, you want to be contrary, do you? Fine. Stay here and wait." The dig site. West of town."pI swear, sometimes you’re more thick-skulled than a Rampardos. Let’s go perform some heroics, shall we?"gThe railway here used to be pretty nice, but it got destroyed when that girl took Team Chasm down."cNo one's ever really gotten to repairing the whole thing, too much hassle for too little gain."LMost of the dirt and heavy equipment are already where they need to be."KClosed while Samorn participates in the Makya Championship Tournament."XHey, trying to get Samorn's badge as well? I've tried, but I've had no luck so far."UI was prepped for countering a Sandstorm strategy, based on the legends I heard."tBut she apparently hasn't used that strategy in forever, despite how well suited to it some of her Pokemon are."NMaybe it's a "hiding your true power level" thing? I just don't get it..."DYou got the 8th badge? Damn, that means I gotta get myself one.">I want to at least make it to the Championship this year."Um, hi?"You're acting different."Same to you."You're a creep."Wait, what?"Good for her."You're into Yezera?"Eyes only for me?"Um."Hell no."I feel the same way."Can we be friends?"Maybe later."Sure, let's go."You kidding me?"Happens a lot."Of course."	Nah."Where?0Iu;␀�'[[^"*Phione! \PN! What just happened here?"LWhat? They can do that? Like, Phione BECAME an avatar? That’s insane!"5I’ve been trying to find Phione for hours now!"LAnd then when I finally do it’s you fighting it as a fricking avatar?"UYeah! What’d you do? I mean – I’m not blaming you, but what happened here?"0OK, sorry, I get it. You’re confused too.">Phione was acting strange – standoffish, kinda hostile."LThen it lashed out at me and bolted. I’ve been hunting it since then."BIt looks OK now… you couldn’t’ve KO’d it any gentler?"kAh, it’s alright. No major scrapes or bruises – it’ll be fine. Just need to do some first aid…"I get that, but c’mon."XIt’s obviously – I don’t know, possessed or something. Messed up in the head.">It’s not too bruised. Just need to do some first aid…"*Well… yeah. Sure. It’s an avatar."XDon’t pull your punches. Well, no harm no foul. Just need to do some first aid…"VInsane. Complete insanity. It attacked me, turned into an avatar, attacked you…"8What would’ve happened if you hadn’t beaten it?"qAh, no use thinking about it. I just… I feel terrible. I feel just awful, because honestly I’m relieved."WBecause if it wasn’t an avatar, then it just left. It just left me. It hated me."MYeah. Because at least it didn’t really hate me. It didn’t leave me."nIt’s hard. I was so afraid that it’d just left me that anything else is, like, a breath of fresh air."ZWell… we’ll see. Hopefully it’ll wake up and this’ll all be a distant memory."(Something we can laugh about, yeah?"0And… damn, I keep bringing you into this?"6You gotta bail me outta everything. Well, thanks."gHere. I’ve had these for a while, but I don’t really need them now. For one reason or another."/Doesn’t really make us even, but thanks."UI need to get Phione somewhere safer, but I’ll see you. Thanks for everything."BHave you seen my new avatar defense technique? Pokésand, go!"0Hmm, back to the drawing board on this one."ZThe technique is for avatars, not Trainers. I can't expect it to work perfectly here."$Huh? Weather wars? What's that?"North: Cave of Hatching"East: Frostflow Farms"=Hey! It's uh... the guy you saw near the Regice Chamber."CI think I got a decent understanding of what's happened to me."XWhatever I was, it kept me separated from the world for a while. A lot has changed."BTeam Chasm is done. People have moved on, though not totally."�Rangers got me set up good. I have a lot of old friends that thought I was dead. They were more than happy to help me when I showed up."�In a way, Hoopa really did help me. Got to skip out on some of the rough parts of Team Chasm breaking up, and I'm taken care of."nI'm... ok. In a weird way. But that's life for ya, huh? It's all weird, and then it isn't. And you're ok."'That's life. Weird, but you're ok."%That's a nice feeling, you know?"�How are you... here? This isn't even the right map... I don't actually exist. Sort of, at least... Please... don't cheat when we fight..."FSheeeeeeesh, let's get a looksie at this this little Trainer now!"YWell butter my butt and call me a biscuit, this here Trainer's got us slapped silly!"eWhat a howdown from our Trainer friend here. Bet they got one o' those fancy candy thingamajigs."Stop that"CA Pokemon world, and within every battle, a world of struggle."CHow much can I fit, into a haiku format? I'm running out of..."JA loud crashing lake, Chatot chirp in the distance, they sing united."FI write, erase, rewrite. Erase again, and then, my Ditto changes."QYou can barely make out the outline of a cave entrance behind the waterfall."BMy Pokemon love the trees and grass. They also love battling!"8What's that, my Pokemon? You want to go to the pub?"6I have no choice, I must listen to them. Bye bye!"_Good battling! You should fight my brother, too. He's all the way at the end of the river."Heya, Trainer!"LI heard that a Champion was going to be here, but I coulnd't find them."nI even brought a Krabby to throw at them and everything! I stole it from a Ranger when he wasn't looking."RIf I can't throw it at someone important, I'll sell it to get some ice cream!"0$5000! That'll get me ice cream for a week!"AYou're lucky you're a nobody, otherwise I'd throw it at you."Done deal Trainer!"&\PN hands over $5000 in exchange."&Maybe I'll get chocolate today...",Haha, you're poor! That's really funny!"TWell golly me we got a cheater! Looks like they did a little bit of hackerooni."mWell I ain't never seen a scrap like that since before my pa started herding Tauros with his bare hands."3Real shame what happened to his favorite knee."<Welp, I'll have to abandon my Cave of Hatching visit..."LThe entrance is blocked, and I stupidly didn't bring any climbing gear."5If I did, I could have climbed around, but alas."1All I wanted was to experience the legend..."4Take this item, I'm clearly not worthy of it..."..."You're cheating, right?"EI'm just here to play my guitar. No idea who the other guy is..."It was an avatar."You're here?"You're asking me?"Sorry."It was attacking me."Could've. Didn't."	Why?"That it was possessed?"Don't beat yourself up."No thanks."I'll take it.[^",霏歐納！\PN！這是怎麼回事？"A什麼...他們竟然能...把霏歐納變成一個化身？">我和它幾小時前...分開了，我一直在找它！"M但是...終於找到的時候，你正在跟變成化身的它戰鬥？"V這...為什麼？我...我不是怪你，但是...這到底都發生了什麼？")抱歉...我知道你也很困惑..."Y前不久，霏歐納突然變得好奇怪...它冷漠，還帶著濃濃的敵意。"_然後它對我發動了攻擊，然後就逃走了，我從那時起就一直在找它。"G現在...應該沒事吧...你不能...輕輕地...打倒它嗎？"\啊，沒事的...沒有很嚴重的傷勢...它會沒事的，只需要治療一下..."我知道，但是..."Z我..我不知道..它應該是被什麼佔據了...導致...頭腦混亂什麼的。"J沒有很嚴重的傷勢...它會沒事的，只需要治療一下..."8啊...也對，畢竟...現在它是一個化身。"q你沒有理由手下留情...還好，沒有很嚴重的傷勢...它會沒事的，只需要治療一下..."_這到底是怎麼了？為什麼，它會攻擊我？然後還變成化身，攻擊你..."2如果你沒有打敗它又會發生什麼..."\啊...想那些也沒用...我只是...一時...我感到很糟糕，但這樣也好。"D如果它沒有變成化身，就選擇攻擊我，離開我..."M也就是說，它並沒有恨我，並沒有因為討厭我才離開。" 我好怕它會離開我...";還好...它會醒來的，這一切都會過去的。"/將來或許還會成為笑談，對吧？",而且...我總是把你牽扯進來..."&謝謝你做的一切，謝謝。"M這個給你了，出於某種原因...我已經不再需要它們了。"P當然這不足以報答你的恩情，權當我微不足道的謝意吧。"P現在我得帶著霏歐納去安全的地方了，我們還會再見的。"M要見識一下我抵禦化身的新招數嗎？精靈之沙，出擊！")嗯，看來還需要重新設計。"q這個技巧是針對化身的，不是針對訓練師的。我不指望它在對戰中也能完美髮揮。")啥？天氣戰爭？那是什麼？"北：啟明之窟"東：風霜農場";哦，你是...我在雷吉祕室看到的那個人。"G我或許多多少少對自己身上發生的事情有些瞭解。"k無論我到底是誰，它都讓我暫時與世界隔絕了，這讓很多事情都發生了變化。"_裂隙隊已經走到了終點，人們應當向前看了，儘管很多人不這麼想。"z護林員們把我安置得很好，很多老朋友都以為我死了，但我出現時，大家都願意幫助我。"~不得不說，胡帕在某些方面幫了我，我躲過了裂隙隊解散時的一些麻煩，還得到了不錯的照顧。"e我的生活方式很奇怪？但這就是生活，儘管奇怪，只要過得好就可以了。"/這就是生活，奇怪，但又合適。")你不覺得這種感覺很好嗎？"�你怎麼......在這裡？這甚至不是正確的地圖......我並不真正存在。至少某種程度上......請......別在對戰時作弊......",哦哦哦，快看這個小訓練師！"J好吧，你可以隨便給我取外號，竟然被這樣打敗了！"M我們的訓練師朋友真會說話，想必一定吃了不少糖吧。"別這樣。">奮鬥與競爭，在精靈的一生，多少敗與成。">俳句的格式的確很嚴格，能塞的東西有限..."A湖畔水聲漾，與聒噪鳥的清嗓，一曲共頌唱。"A一字一音替，不知不覺日偏西，百變怪作筆。">勉強可以透過瀑布，看到後面洞口的輪廓。"A我的精靈們喜歡樹木和草叢，也很喜歡戰鬥！")我的精靈這是...想去酒吧？")我只能聽它們的了，再見！"\打得不錯，或許你有興趣跟我哥也來一場，他就在這條河的盡頭。"嗨，訓練師">我聽說有個冠軍要來這裡，但我找不到人。"J我甚至還趁護林員不注意，偷了只大鉗蟹想扔向他！"J如果見不到冠軍的話，那就把它賣了去買冰淇淋吧！"<5000金錢！我就可以連續吃一週冰淇淋了！"S你應該慶幸自己沒什麼名氣，不然我就要用大鉗蟹扔你了。"交易完成，訓練師"$\PN將5000金錢交給對方。"&要不還是去買巧克力吧..." 哈哈，窮鬼，嘿嘿！"G我們遇到作弊高手了！他絕對用了什麼黑客技術。"b除了我那個徒手跟肯泰羅較勁的老爸，我已經很久沒見過這種廢物了。"真是恥辱啊！">看來我不得不放棄前往啟明之窟的旅程了...";入口被堵住了，我也沒帶什麼登山裝備。")不然我就能直接爬過去了。",我只是想去體驗下傳說中的..."&把這個拿走吧，我不配..."..."你在作弊！";我只是來彈吉他的，根本不認識那個人..."這是個化身。"你也在啊？"你問我我問誰？"抱歉。"它也會攻擊我。"#可以但我不這麼打算。"為什麼？" 你覺得它被附身了？"不要自責。"不用了，謝謝。"我會收下它。;[^"*Phione! \PN! What just happened here?"LWhat? They can do that? Like, Phione BECAME an avatar? That’s insane!"5I’ve been trying to find Phione for hours now!"LAnd then when I finally do it’s you fighting it as a fricking avatar?"UYeah! What’d you do? I mean – I’m not blaming you, but what happened here?"0OK, sorry, I get it. You’re confused too.">Phione was acting strange – standoffish, kinda hostile."LThen it lashed out at me and bolted. I’ve been hunting it since then."BIt looks OK now… you couldn’t’ve KO’d it any gentler?"kAh, it’s alright. No major scrapes or bruises – it’ll be fine. Just need to do some first aid…"I get that, but c’mon."XIt’s obviously – I don’t know, possessed or something. Messed up in the head.">It’s not too bruised. Just need to do some first aid…"*Well… yeah. Sure. It’s an avatar."XDon’t pull your punches. Well, no harm no foul. Just need to do some first aid…"VInsane. Complete insanity. It attacked me, turned into an avatar, atta