f a conveyor belt. It'd be impossible to climb up."xFor most of Sweetrock's history, we've relied on Clefable teleportation to get cargo from the factory to the docks."eWe got these conveyor belts installed a few years back, so the cliffside isn't an issue anymore."TWe still have to rely on teleportation to get in and out of the harbor, though."PLooks like the Trainer ahead is moving to block you from going any further."?Do you want to approach them? It looks like a tough fight."1I knew you would arrive, should I only wait."\Excuse the charade – I would prefer my identity remain enshrouded in mystery for now."{All that you are required to understand is who I serve – Yezera. Under her profound guidance, we have achieved our goals."rThe titans have served their purpose. I come then with a simple inquiry: will you not listen to my reasoning?"PThank you. Our goal is naught less than a complete reordering of the world."<My comrades have their own motives, but mine is simple."�The world at present is mercurial and deceptive. Human culture and technology serves as naught but a veil disguising ultimate truth."cOnly the realm of ancient myth, tended by gods, untouched by humans, might let us perceive it."Do you not agree?"/How disappointing, to dismiss it outright."IIf you have no eye for truth, then we have nothing else to speak of."_Forgive me this act of passion, but I expect a titan’s wrath may settle my raging heart."Regirock, heed my command."RTo the contrary: it has adamant support, if only one ruminates on the matter."`Such wavering faith is nigh-useless for my purposes, alas. We require unflinching devotion."_*sigh* I would be forsaking my duty if I did not stall you at the least. Prepare yourself."lI should encourage you to do so. Judge the weight of the world that is against the world that could be."bAlas, I know you will not ruminate idly upon it. You are a threat. That is intolerable to us."UThis shall be no decisive victory of mine, but I cannot let you pass unhindered."/…I should very much like to believe you."`If you speak truth, then I bid you repeat your convictions to Yezera herself next you meet."oShe can see the machinations of your heart more clearly than I. Until then, you remain a trainer, as do I."<My enemy I smite, my ally I train. To either, en garde."LIf you will not listen to my entreaties, then you are beyond salvation."VAlas. Perhaps a titan’s fury will enlighten you to the clarity of the ancients."]G’afternoon. Took your sweet time showing your face ‘round these parts, didn’t ya?"eListen, I ain’t ‘bout to preach to ya. Just want to make some things clear ‘fore we fight.">‘Cause we’re gonna fight. Ain’t no other way to it."SThank you kindly. I ain’t real interested in this cloak- and-dagger charade."I’m with Yezera, always."EListen, I’m only gonna say this once: you oughta hear her out.";Don’t care if you agree with her. Just hear her out."RAnd if you hurt her, I’ll make you wish Mavis stopped after Zain. We clear?"(Cocky li’l brat, ain’t ya? Tsk."wWhat’s so damn infuriating ‘bout you is I ain’t just able to whip your sorry hide into submission. Too good."NHow ‘bout I try anyhow? Titan’s gotta be good for somethin’, right?".Good. I ain’t ‘bout ta repeat myself."BNow, I came here with a job to do, and I’m a reliable sort."iSorry, kid. You’re a mite too fast. Gotta slow you down. Regirock, lead us off, will ya darlin’?"VHah. Take it from someone who knows, kid: you ain’t even scratched the surface."AI can make you plenty more miserable if I set my mind to it."|But, cheer up, kid. I’m ‘bout to give ya what you always want: a good fight. Facing a Regi oughta cheer ya up. Heh."RNah, I ain’t about to trust that. Ya don’t know jack about me and Yezera."8Bickering old married couple, that’s what we are."9Want to show me you’re with us? Tell it to Yezera."rFor now, I ain’t too keen on letting you off easy. Sorry. Beating folks into the dirt is my job, after all."CAh, well. Guess no matter how hard I try, old habits die hard."BSpeaking of dying hard – lay down and quit moving, will ya?"PHah. They ain’t never been happy with my way of goin’ about covert ops."BToo rough ‘nd tumble. I ain’t built for cloak-and-dagger."iSo, let me tell you straight: you listen to Yezera. You hear her out. And don’t you dare hurt her."KAll I ask. And, uh, I wasn’t just sent here to chit-chat. You ready?"1Hey. Fancy meeting you in a place like this."aOh, don’t look so angry – Regirock and I are here to fight you, but we’ll get to that."RI know you’re more than a pretty face. You’re smart. Care to hear me out?"0Aww. I knew I had a good feeling about you."[How do I explain it… well, I hate to use the word, but modern society is degenerate."_We’re distant from the perfect moment of creation. We’ve kind of taken over the world."UNo respect for our elders – the primordial Pokémon that created the universe."zYezera’s going to reset this world back to its origins. And then humanity will be in the bosom of Arceus once more."kDon’t call me insane. Although I’m sure this arrogant, faithless civilization would use that term."QI’m merely devout, and devotion means making sacrifices. For example: you."EI really do like you, but… we all have to sacrifice sometimes."MGodlike Pokémon are now treated as not much more than beasts of burden."MAvatars are destroyed at will because they’re “threats to humans.”"\The world has lost all respect, the divine essence from creation diluted and destroyed."NAnd since you seem to be no different, I can take some joy in this fight."�Arceus created the world. It is pure, and perfect, and resetting the world back to its original form will let us be pure and perfect too."BI’d like to see myself blessed by the grace of our creator.")I’d like to see you that way, too."In time."CFor now, I’ve been ordered to slow you down. Shall we dance?")Good. I knew I saw something in you."BSome spark of faith. I’m a… very good judge of character."�I’d love to just talk with you for a while, but I was explicitly instructed to stop you. So we’ll fight. Don’t take it personally."Oh. Was I too forward?"HMy emotions tend to get the better of me. I’m almost heartbroken."%Well, I suppose I am a stranger."uFortunately, I’ve been sent to slow you down, so I have a convenient vent for all these feelings of rejection."Hello, friend."FBusiness before pleasure: I have been sent to slow your progress.".To that end, I am accompanied by a titan."XBefore we attend to that, however, may I interest you in a short, frank discussion?"RI would rather like to try to convince you of the legitimacy of our position."Thank you for your time."_Yezera’s goal is to recreate the conditions of the world shortly following its creation."oModern science has attained almost complete understanding and mastery over the world – the modern world."�It cannot, however, understand the past. By reverting existence, we may study the universe from its conception and obtain universal knowledge."#This is the only way to do so."vWithout the reversion, humanity will never attain complete understanding of the universe. It is worth all prices."RNow our time for conversation is up, however. Regirock, please do the honors."AAll persons who attempt to advance civilization should care."HUniversal knowledge is a prerequisite for an all- powerful society."\That is my goal. That is the goal of all science: to know, and to apply that knowledge."\Your ignorance implies discussion will get us nowhere. Let us dispense with such, then."<Knowledge will be retained into the new primordial era."8We can rebuild at least small enclaves of humanity."\From there our analysis and conquest will begin: a new society with absolute knowledge."@And, stemming from this absolute knowledge, absolute power."YConsider it. In the mean time, there is the business I mentioned earlier. Excuse me."|I am glad you have the wisdom to agree. If you should wish to support us in our endeavors, I will be happy to have you."xWe will fight for a more enlightened era. For now, however, I must slow you. Business is business. Let us commence."II find this highly unfortunate. You will be left behind by progress."NIf you would prefer to retain your ignorance, however, I cannot help you.".Prepare yourself. Regirock, if you would."Oh. Hey."IYeah, so, I knew you’d be here. Gym challenger, and, uh, all that."…Welp. This is awkward.";How do I say this… you interested in hearing us out?"bWe’ve kinda got the upper hand, but, y’know, don’t really wanna fight you. Whaddya say?"=Oh. That’s good. Great. Honestly didn’t expect that."HWell, I just figure we’ve done a lot of ordering Pokémon around.">Maybe it’s time to even up the footing a bit, y’know?"8We can all kinda make up for whatever we did wrong."mThe others have their reasons, but, uh, this is mine. Make a world where we can be forgiven. You get it?"(Well – fine. You know what? Fine."dI don’t need your permission, and we certainly don’t need your help. Regirock. Do ‘em in."Z…You so sure? Takes a lot of pushing to train a team that strong in so little time."4But, yeah, no, I get it. Why would you help us?"?Rich brat. Maybe we can beat some responsibility into you."NUh. Don’t really know how to break it to you. You… don’t have time."EFor one, we’ve already just about won. For two – think fast!"*Regirock, sweep ‘em off their feet!"*Oh. Didn’t, uh, really expect that.":Figured you were kind of a stuck-up brat. No offense."=Well, good. Maybe we’ll be side by side one day, yeah?"5But, uh, for now… I’m supposed to fight you."HSo, uh, sorry – ah, what am I saying, we live for this. Ready up."Yeah, I guess that tracks."#Fine. That’s… it’s fine."5I came here to beat the crap out of you anyways."kOdds are Regirock isn’t gonna stick around much longer, so let’s make it count. Try your best, eh?"…Hey."xTsk tsk tsk. I’m not gonna lie to you: I’ve been trying to plan this conversation in my head for the past hour."RBut, um, you kinda interrupted me. So can I just say what I want to tell you?"BWelp. Listen, uh, Makya’s kinda in a weird place right now."]Team Chasm ran roughshod over this whole region and then kinda just… got away with it?"So, uh, yeah, if you ever wanted proof that humans can’t get even the most black-and-white justice right, there you are."KWould’ve been simple to fix that little screw-up. But they didn’t."[So we’re taking the power away from humans, and putting it in the hands of Pokémon."Is it? Is it!"AAm I insane for wanting some damn PUNISHMENT in this world?!"DWell, guess what. If people won’t give me it, I’ll MAKE it.""And I’ve got just the tool!"%It is simple, you – you idiot!"aI can track down every ex-Chasm criminal and haul them up to the courts myself if I have to!"UThey just won’t do anything if I did! So I have to do things personally, yeah?" Sorry. Nothing… personal."	Yes!"MThey’re noble and pure and – and – and they’d never let me down!"/Unlike you! And everyone else around here!"JYou want to see? C’mon. See what kind of justice Pokémon can give!"Oh. Ah-hah."LKinda got myself a bit worked up there… welp, no harm, no foul, yeah?"…Nah, that’s stupid."^I’m not gonna waste this chance. I’ve got a Regi. You’re a prodigy. Let’s RUMBLE!"Urgh, you make me so mad!")Nobody will frickin’ listen to me!"
Fine."Y’know, fine, whatever."?You get what everyone else I fight gets. What you deserve."?Regirock – your watch is over. If you would go, then go."YSo it returns to its resting place… no matter. It has done all I desired and more."%As for you, we shall meet again."YFarewell, and do not pursue me. Fate and fate alone will dictate when we next speak."eRegirock’s damn well spent. Flighty li'l things never like to be outside their tombs too long."*Ah, well. Got what I came for anyhow."�Let me tell you one last word of advice. You hurt Yez, I’ll find you. And it won’t just be for some play fight with animals."jG’evening, kid. I’ll see ya around. Make sure I don’t hafta hurt you too bad when I do, ‘kay?";Au revoir, Regirock. Enjoy your entombment, I suppose."PAnd as for you, that was an exciting fight. You’ve got my heart pounding."yIf you want to join us, come find Yezera. And if not, well, we’ll meet again. I’m looking forward to it already."So long."4I surmise Regirock will now return to its tomb."gThe titans are temperamental and ill-suited to existence outside their crypts. It is of no matter."AWe have all but succeeded in our plans. This was a courtesy."7I will take my leave now. Thank you for your time."/There it goes. Back to where it came from."_Well, didn’t really expect to win anyways. Just wanted to slow you down, and, uh, I did.":So… bye. We’ll do this again sometime. I’m out."P*sigh* Buh-bye, Regirock. We don’t really, uh, need you anymore, I guess."?It was fun while it lasted… welp. Nothing lasts forever."ISpeaking of! Hopefully next time we talk it’ll be in a fair world!"KIf it isn’t, then, uh, I’ll give you a run for your money, ‘kay?"\Toodles. And don’t you dare follow – I’m playing hard to get, so respect it. Hah!"uMore than a million years ago, a meteor struck this area of Makya, plowing through a large mountain to the west."XThat large mountain became two smaller mountains, which we now know as Split Peaks."NThe impact site itself would fill with water and become Sweetrock Harbor."0The ocean to the east brings calming winds."KBut why? We might explain it with ocean currents, or weather patterns."FBut what makes the winds here calming? Of that, I am not so sure."<I really want to know who that was in the weird outfit.";Well, regardless, thanks for kicking them out of town."=I'm a firefighter, so I'm used to dealing with issues..."DBut "Cultist with a Regirock" is outside of my job description."Artisan Orbs" Sweetrock Elementary School"/"In loving memory of Mrs. and Mr. Diakos.""HI've been biking across the entire region over the past few months.":Crossing the Split Peaks was by far the hardest part."nThe view from these cliffs, and the feeling that I've finally accomplished my goal, made it all worth it."West: Split Peaks"South: Sandstone Estuary";"Sweetrock Harbor, satisfying the world's sweettooth!""!"A sister city of Canalave!"":I work at Sweetrock Candy factory, like many in town."IThat said, I rarely get to see Victoire, the manager and gym leader.":I gotta rely on rumors to know what her team is like.",Some of them are a bit hard to believe."CI heard some people saying that she uses a Rainstorm strategy."AWith Fairy and Steel-type Pokemon? How does she manage that?"$Huh, you really beat her, then?"4You gotta tell me what she's like as a trainer.""My curiosity's grown too big!"_Sweetrock Candy is sent all over the world, but more than 30% ends up in the Galar Region."#Those people love their candy."+Shh... don't give away my hiding spot!")Is it... is it safe to come out now?")How goes your journey, young master?"YI've purchased a Clefable teleportation license, and reserved this pier for our use.":We can travel to and from any of our usual locations."Where will we be heading?"+Have you slid down the conveyer belts?";Preeeety sure we're not allowed to, but its crazy fun."PMaybe not as fun as beating the 7th gym will be with my snazzy new Pokemon!";Which ones? You'll just have to battle me to find out!"XI cannot convey to you just how much I want to battle. Heh. So, you up to doing so?"Understood."+I'll be here until you wish to battle."Rock 'Em, Torterra!"9Damn, even these 'mons couldn't leave a dent in you."EThink anyone in the lighthouse was watching our battle just now?"INo way around it, I'll need some healing before we square off again.",Got a good look at Victoire, I take it?"bShe as quirky as they say? I don't know why I bother asking. I'll be finding out soon myself."0The 7th badge... oh so sweet will it taste!"Sweetrock Harbor Gym"Leader: Victoire"The Candy Queen!"Sweetrock Candy Outlet"kWhat was once a printed notice has been covered entirely by a poster advertising the EXP-EZ Dispenser."Sweetrock Lighthouse"#Today's a good day for gaming."Berry Greenhouse"HI love to slide down the conveyor belt. But, my dad doesn't let me."UI have to stay by the school until he gets off work so I don't get into trouble."I'm gaming over here!"No."	Yes."I’ll listen."Don't need it."No, I don't."That's tenuous."I'll think about it."
I do."Fine, talk."Not interested in talking."I know who you are."Don't threaten me."Clear."Wish that already."I'm with you."Alright, fine."Go away."That's insane."Degenerate?"Arceus's bosom?"That's fair."Sure, talk."Don't really care."It isn't worth it."Who cares?"Society will crumble."Good point."I'll listen."Don't care."You're wrong."I'm not guilty."
Sure."Not that simple."Pokémon would do better?"Fair enough."Maybe later."Sure, let's go.Iu;␀�#[[O"=A cap of rock is holding back a geyser of boiling water."PI was once considered a beauty, but the way of the water needed a disciple."I should dry off."_Legends say if I stay here for fourty day and nights, my inner qi will strengthen tenfold."4The way of the water is full of solice. Splash."W\PN! You made it. Took some effort to find this place but... man. It was worth it."7What? My all-grown-up companion here? Yeah. It is."\Sorry. Well, not sorry. You didn’t have to come. But you did. And I’m glad you did."dI think it’s soothing. I dunno, maybe I’m just a little more goth than I’d like to admit."|The waters here are special. Not just ice-cold and way too deep for me to be comfortable, but they’re saltwater, too."cOcean water, trapped down here. And for some reason... it makes Phione transform into Manaphy."CI don’t know why, or how. I’m not that smart. But it does."�I don’t even know if it’s really evolution. It’s – I don’t care. I don’t care how it works, or what it is scientifically."6It’s a Manaphy now. And I’m damn proud of it."(Yeah! I mean, I think so, at least."YI can’t believe it. A Pokémon of actual literal myth and legends, here beside me."Oh. Uh, yeah, thanks."�Um. I didn’t really have a lot to do with it. Phione came down here, danced around in the water here, and then it just kinda... transformed."KUnbelievable. A Manaphy. I raised a Pokémon like this, all by myself."oIt’s a Pokémon from myth. Supposedly they live at the ocean floor and can befriend anything and anyone."iThey’re not half-bad in a scrap, either. Truly just... amazing. An absolutely incredible Pokémon."vAnd it’s my best friend. It doesn’t hate me, or resent me, or fear me. It chose to be with me, of all people."mIt could’ve chosen anyone. It could’ve chosen you – you’re certainly a better trainer than I am."lAnd, yeah, thank you, sincerely, for everything. You’re great. And you’ve really helped me. Thanks.";Hmm. Yeah, not good enough. Gonna need one last favor."qI hope so! Not too many people have even seen one of these magical things. And fewer people have fought one."@Oh, we’re on the same wavelength. You know what it means."CThat’s right. One last showdown. You and me. My new Manaphy."QI’m gonna lose, I know. But I’m not going down easy, alright? You ready?"4Alright. Get ready. I want it to be a good one."<I’ve never been happier to throw down against anyone."oManaphy’s debut. I don’t care if it’s good or bad. I just want to see it in action. Let’s do this."(You good? I’m ready when you are."*Ah, wouldn’t have it any other way."IYou know, \PN, you’re a good friend. You don’t pull any punches."GI never could beat you, and I’m never going to, but that’s OK."WYou’ve made me better. Helped me out. I hope I’ve helped you too. I really do.")And, uh, yeah, I’m glad I met you."rGood. I’m – yeah, that’s all I’ve ever really wanted. Manaphy’s happy, you’re happy, I’m happy."FSorry, that’s just who I am. Big ol’ bleeding-heart, I guess."Oh!";Uh, well... I don’t know. I’ll think about it, OK?"NWe’ll see each other around. I, uh... I dunno if I see you in that way."?You know. If you’re saying what I think you’re saying."D...\PN, I really do care about you, though. You’re my friend."1And if you need me, I’ll be there, always."^Well, maybe not always. I’ve got my Pokémon to take care of. But you know what I mean."/I’ve done some stuff I’m not proud of."ZI’m gonna come clean: I’ve been working with Yezera on her plans for a while now."�Never felt like I was good enough. Didn’t feel like anyone was good enough for the love we got from our Pokémon. But maybe that was just me projecting."�Maybe I’m the asshole, y’know? And I’ve known that forever – I’m not that stupid – but it takes a wake-up call to realize it. And this was it."�So, yeah, if they want to ruin the world, they can do it without me. And you can stop them with a Phione at your side. Or a Manaphy now, I guess."II’ll be thinking about you. Wishing you the best, now and forever."IThanks for all of it. If you need me, ever, all you gotta do is ask.",Neither of us is finished, I know that."JI’m gonna try again at becoming Champion next year, I think. Maybe."GFuture’s uncertain. And you... you’ve got stuff to do, I know."DI wish you the best. I’m gonna be thinking about you, I know."cAnd if you need me, you damn well better ask me, OK? You’ve taken a weight off my shoulders."See you around, \PN."Is that...?"Tell me about it."Creepy, isn't it?"That's great."I'm proud of you."What's a Manaphy?"You're welcome."It was worth it."You know what this means."Not yet."Let's rock."Same here."Don't get sappy."Coffee sometime?[O")一塊巨石堵住了沸騰的水。"P儘管我擁有著俊朗的相貌，但從水之道也需要虔誠的心。"現在得擦乾了。"P只要在這裡住上七七四十九天，我的內功就能增強十倍。"5水之道，無常形，滋萬物，潤無聲。"Y\PN，你來了！雖說費了不少功夫才來到這裡，但...一切都值得。">什麼？你說它？沒錯，只不過成年了而已。"\抱歉...其實也沒必要。你其實不用來這裡的，但我很高興你來了。"M我倒是覺得這裡很舒服，或許我比想象中更喜歡黑暗？"A這裡的水很特別，又冷又深，而且還是鹹水。"b或許就是因為這些被困在這裡面的海水，才讓霏歐納變成瑪納霏了吧。"_我不知道是怎麼回事，我本來就沒那麼聰明，只知道事實就是如此。"\我也不知道這該不該算進化，反正我不在乎在科學上該怎麼解釋。">重要的是它沒事了，而且現在是瑪納霏了。"#對，我就是這樣想的。"P我簡直不敢相信，自己能得到一隻真正的傳說中的精靈。"嗯，謝謝。"q其實我並沒有參與太多，霏歐納來到這裡後，就開始在水中跳舞，然後就這樣了。"J我真的很難想象，自己竟然撫養了一隻這樣的精靈。"e那時一種傳說中的精靈，據說生活在海底，並且可以和任何事物交朋友。"S而且它們也很擅長戰鬥，真是神奇到令人難以置信的精靈。"\最重要的是，它是我最好的朋友，它不討厭我，不恨我，不怕我。"t它明明可以選擇任何人，比如說你，你肯定比我更好...但它最終還是願意跟我一起。"J最後...真的...非常感謝你，這一路上你幫了我太多。"/嗯...不過...我現在還有個請求。"b我希望如此！另外...見過傳說中精靈的人很少，跟它們戰鬥過的更是。",哦，我想我們想到一處去了。"G沒錯，最後一次決鬥，你和我，還有我的瑪納霏。"J我知道我會輸，但我不會輕易放棄，你準備好了嗎？"J好的，準備好再來找我吧，我不希望留下任何遺憾。"A我從來沒有像現在這樣期待與某個人決鬥過。"z瑪納霏的首秀...我不在乎它能不能表現好，我只想看到它戰鬥時的身姿，讓我們開始吧。"/你準備好了嗎？我隨時都可以。"&啊，看來就到此為止了。"J\PN，我一直將你當成朋友，你從不掩飾自己的想法。"M我從來沒有打敗過你，或許永遠也做不到，但沒關係。"V因為你讓我變得更好了，你幫了我很多，我也希望能幫到你。"/能夠與你相識真是件幸運的事。"e這就是我一直想得到的，你，我，還有瑪納霏，我們都很慶幸這段旅程。"M抱歉，我一直都是這樣，情感一直是我的第一驅動力。"哦"5呃...這...我不知道，我得考慮一下。"_我們還會再見的，我...嗯...我不知道再見時是否還可以像今天這樣。")我想你應該知道我的意思..."2...\PN，我真的很在乎你這個朋友。"2如果你需要我，我會一直在這裡。"b好吧，也許不是一直，我還要照顧我的精靈，但大概就是這個意思吧。"5我曾經做過一些讓我覺得丟臉的事。"P我必須坦白：我和葉澤拉計劃這些...已經有一段時間了。"�我不覺得自己是個好人，我不覺得有人能配得上精靈對我們的愛，但...這只是我自己的一種偏執。"}換句話說，我就是個混蛋！我其實知道...自己沒那麼蠢...但我需要有誰來提醒我該做什麼。"�所以，如果他們要毀掉這個世界，根本沒必要來找我。並且，你可以和霏歐納...或者瑪納霏一起去阻止他們。"5我會以我的信念，祝願你能夠成功。"V感謝你做的一切，如果你需要我的幫助，隨時都可以來找我。"&我們還沒有結束這一切。";或許，明年我會試著，成為這裡的冠軍？"M畢竟未來誰也說不準，你也有一定要去做的事不是嗎？"5我會以我的信念，祝願你能夠成功。"V感謝你做的一切，如果你需要我的幫助，隨時都可以來找我。"再見，\PN。"那是..."跟我說明一下"這裡有些恐怖"這樣就夠了"太好了"瑪納霏是？"不用謝"這是值得的" 你知道這意味著什麼"還沒有"開始吧"我也是"別那麼感性"來杯咖啡？;[O"=A cap of rock is holding back a geyser of boiling water."PI was once considered a beauty, but the way of the water needed a disciple."I should dry off."_Legends say if I stay here for fourty day and nights, my inner qi will strengthen tenfold."4The way of the water is full of solice. Splash."W\PN! You made it. Took some effort to find this place but... man. It was worth it."7What? My all-grown-up companion here? Yeah. It is."\Sorry. Well, not sorry. You didn’t have to come. But you did. And I’m glad you did."dI think it’s soothing. I dunno, maybe I’m just a little more goth than I’d like to admit."|The waters here are special. Not just ice-cold and way too deep for me to be comfortable, but they’re saltwater, too."cOcean water, trapped down here. And for some reason... it makes Phione transform into Manaphy."CI don’t know why, or how. I’m not that smart. But it does."�I don’t even know if it’s really evolution. It’s – I don’t care. I don’t care how it works, or what it is scientifically."6It’s a Manaphy now. And I’m damn proud of it."(Yeah! I mean, I think so, at least."YI can’t believe it. A Pokémon of actual literal myth and legends, here beside me."Oh. Uh, yeah, thanks."�Um. I didn’t really have a lot to do with it. Phione came down here, danced around in the water here, and then it just kinda... transformed."KUnbelievable. A Manaphy. I raised a Pokémon like this, all by myself."oIt’s a Pokémon from myth. Supposedly they live at the ocean floor and can befriend anything and anyone."iThey’re not half-bad in a scrap, either. Truly just... amazing. An absolutely incredible Pokémon."vAnd it’s my best friend. It doesn’t hate me, or resent me, or fear me. It chose to be with me, of all people."mIt could’ve chosen anyone. It could’ve chosen you – you’re certainly a better trainer than I am."lAnd, yeah, thank you, sincerely, for everything. You’re great. And you’ve really helped me. Thanks.";Hmm. Yeah, not good enough. Gonna need one last favor."qI hope so! Not too many people have even seen one of these magical things. And fewer people have fought one."@Oh, we’re on the same wavelength. You know what it means."CThat’s right. One last showdown. You and me. My new Manaphy."QI’m gonna lose, I know. But I’m not going down easy, alright? You ready?"4Alright. Get ready. I want it to be a good one."<I’ve never been happier to throw down against anyone."oManaphy’s debut. I don’t care if it’s good or bad. I just want to see it in action. Let’s do this."(You good? I’m ready when you are."*Ah, wouldn’t have it any other way."IYou know, \PN, you’re a good friend. You don’t pull any punches."GI never could beat you, and I’m never going to, but that’s OK."WYou’ve made me better. Helped me out. I hope I’ve helped you too. I really do.")And, uh, yeah, I’m glad I met you."rGood. I’m – yeah, that’s all I’ve ever really wanted. Manaphy’s happy, you’re happy, I’m happy."FSorry, that’s just who I am. Big ol’ bleeding-heart, I guess."Oh!";Uh, well... I don’t know. I’ll think about it, OK?"NWe’ll see each other around. I, uh... I dunno if I see you in that way."?You know. If you’re saying what I think you’re saying."D...\PN, I really do care about you, though. You’re my friend."1And if you need me, I’ll be there, always."^Well, maybe not always. I’ve got my Pokémon to take care of. But you know what I mean."/I’ve done some stuff I’m not proud of."ZI’m gonna come clean: I’ve been working with Yezera on her plans for a while now."�Never felt like I was good enough. Didn’t feel like anyone was good enough for the love we got from our Pokémon. But maybe that was just me projecting."�Maybe I’m the asshole, y’know? And I’ve known that forever – I’m not that stupid – but it takes a wake-up call to realize it. And this was it."�So, yeah, if they want to ruin the world, they can do it without me. And you can stop them with a Phione at your side. Or a Manaphy now, I guess."II’ll be thinking about you. Wishing you the best, now and forever."IThanks for all of it. If you need me, ever, all you gotta do is ask.",Neither of us is finished, I know that."JI’m gonna try again at becoming Champion next year, I think. Maybe."GFuture’s uncertain. And you... you’ve got stuff to do, I know."DI wish you the best. I’m gonna be thinking about you, I know."cAnd if you need me, you damn well better ask me, OK? You’ve taken a weight off my shoulders."See you around, \PN."Is that...?"Tell me about it."Creepy, isn't it?"That's great."I'm proud of you."What's a Manaphy?"You're welcome."It was worth it."You know what this means."Not yet."Let's rock."Same here."Don't get sappy."Coffee sometime?Iu;␀~[[	":A loose piece of paper from a cave explorer's manual."KIt shows a technique for pulling smooth boulders with your bare hands."A strong seedling."3It'll bloom into a tree, if given enough time.[	"#洞穴探險手冊的散頁。">上面寫的是一種徒手推開光滑巨石的技巧。"一棵健壯的幼苗。"A只要給它足夠時間，它必然能為你提供廕庇。;[	":A loose piece of paper from a cave explorer's manual."KIt shows a technique for pulling smooth boulders with your bare hands."A strong seedling."3It'll bloom into a tree, if given enough time.Iu;␀�[[""North-West: Exit to Catacombs"South: Sewer Junction"8The final direction entry has been expertly erased."8You can really feel the essence of Makya down here."!Ancient Pokemon: EMPOWER ME!">The aura here has calmed. As such, I shall take my leave."HI shall continue communing with Makya as it used to be...elsewhere."UIf one listens close enough, they can commune with the ancient energy down here.":Have you stumbled upon any...strange shops down here?"NI heard a rumor that someone is selling gleam powder at the black market."SThat would be perfect for my next project, so I'm gonna keep searching for it."?I'm looking for something to spice up my next art project."1Something with a sense of sparkling panache."'Pesha on site for Carnivine Times!"XWe've heard reports of a trainer defeating an Avatar of Goodra, have you seen them?""Maybe Steven was mistaken...?">I'll touch base with him...find out what's going on here."No leads huh? That's fine!")I'll find one somewhere around here.[" 西北：地下墓穴出口"南：下水道連接處"/最後一條被奇怪的手法抹去了。"8在這裡，你可以感受到馬凱亞的精髓。"/古老的精靈啊，賜予我力量吧！"A這裡的氣氛已經平靜下來了，那我也該走了。">我將會繼續與馬凱亞交流，就像以前一樣..."A如果仔細聆聽，我就能與最古老的力量交流。"8你在這裡遇到過...什麼奇怪的商店嗎？"J我聽說黑市上有人在賣能讓精靈變閃光的閃亮粉末。">這簡直太適合我了，我必須找到這個地方。";我正在為我的下一個藝術項目尋找靈感。")就是那種閃閃發光的感覺。"5我是《食肉動物時代》的記者派希！"V我聽說有訓練師，打敗了黏美龍的化身，你知道他在哪兒嗎？" 難道史蒂文搞錯了？";看來得聯繫一下...看看到底是怎麼回事。"&沒線索？好吧，沒關係！"&我會繼續在附近找找的。;[""North-West: Exit to Catacombs"South: Sewer Junction"8The final direction entry has been expertly erased."8You can really feel the essence of Makya down here."!Ancient Pokemon: EMPOWER ME!">The aura here has calmed. As such, I shall take my leave."HI shall continue communing with Makya as it used to be...elsewhere."UIf one listens close enough, they can commune with the ancient energy down here.":Have you stumbled upon any...strange shops down here?"NI heard a rumor that someone is selling gleam powder at the black market."SThat would be perfect for my next project, so I'm gonna keep searching for it."?I'm looking for something to spice up my next art project."1Something with a sense of sparkling panache."'Pesha on site for Carnivine Times!"XWe've heard reports of a trainer defeating an Avatar of Goodra, have you seen them?""Maybe Steven was mistaken...?">I'll touch base with him...find out what's going on here."No leads huh? That's fine!")I'll find one somewhere around here.0Iu;␀H[[*"8The Pokemon looks forward with steadfast attention."North: Ancient Sewers"#West: Battle Plaza Underground"South: LuxTech Sewers"#The Poochyena is raring to go!"-The Poochyena looks ready to attack you!"(Oh? Looks like it changed its mind."-Ah, hello. It’s good to see you again."?Do not fear: I have no new forms that need combat testing."HI am studying the biodiversity of Prizca’s underground. It’s..."XThat’s not inaccurate. The ecological pressures here are novel, to say the least."2I am a biologist. We are accustomed to filth."SIf one has an aversion to creatures adapting to life in a sepulcher, then yes."�Perhaps to a trainer. After all, you can catch your preferred selection here just as easily as in the open wilderness, can you not?".In any case, it is an understudied biome."�I had rather hoped to find it in pristine condition – as much as a sewer can be pristine – but the avatars have made that difficult."UThis entire region is undergoing dramatic ecological shifts. I have my concerns."~Yes. While avatars do not seem to eat or drink, and they do not prey upon other Pokémon, wild Pokémon still avoid them."6They are, after all, quite large and threatening."`I noticed a lack of avatars when I went anywhere you’d been before. I thank you for that."xI fear a potential climate collapse. That is predicated on very unlikely outcomes, but it is still a sobering idea."TI plan to return to <imp>Novo College</imp> and seek the advice of the experts."DI plan to... well, I plan to ask them about their observations."�And I would also like to determine if they’ve been performing their due diligence. I have my suspicions about their overall effectiveness."9To say more at this point would be baseless slander."�If you should happen to want to assist me, meet me there. In fact... I could use someone with a position of perceived competence with regards to battling.">Could you seek me out after finishing your gym challenge?"hBetween your eight badges and my eight-year degree, I believe our conclusions would demand respect."]But, no, do not answer me. I have already imposed on you enough, so I’ll leave you be."