ned the rangers yesterday."So excited!".I just hope they don't send me to Velenz."6Working with the Makyan Rangers has been a blast!"OOnce I took down an avatar, they even gave me one of their snazzy outfits!"*Makes travelling from Kanto worth it!"@Decided to spend part of my gap year here fighting avatars."2I'm pretty homesick, but I won't give up yet."<I know that this'll be something I look back fondly on."Yo! Greetings from Unova."Want some Dream Balls?"NThey're a Unovan invention that got improved by some scientists in Galar."QI brought a ton of them with me since I figured I'd catch some Pokemon here."aI've caught all the Pokemon I need though, so I'm giving them out to Trainers who need them."*Anything to combat the avatar threat."ODunno if you can find Dream Balls in Makya, haven't seen any in the shops."3Maybe a specialty shop, but not one in Prizca.["J任何願意幫忙應對化身危機的人都可以加入護林員。"A現在的要求非常低，只要報名就有食宿津貼。"k但是由於住房需求太大，大部分人都得待在宿舍裡，直到有新的住處被建好。"&我昨天剛剛加入護林員。"太興奮了！",只希望不要把我派到夜幽市。">跟馬凱亞的護林員們一起工作真是太棒啦！"\那次我打敗了一隻化身，然後他們獎勵給我一套特別好看的衣服！"&沒白從關都來這邊一趟！"G我決定在這裡渡過我人生中的一頁，與化身作戰！"&我很想家，但不會放棄。"/這將是未來的我最寶貴的回憶。"#嗨！來自合眾的問候！"#你想要一些夢境球嗎？"V這是一種經過伽勒爾科學家改進，由我們合眾發明的精靈球。"5我帶了很多過來，想多抓一些精靈。"S現在我抓的數量已經夠多了，剩下的球就給其他訓練師吧。">為了對抗化身的威脅，我願意做任何事情。"M不知道馬凱亞的商店賣不賣夢境球，起碼我沒有看到。">或許哪裡有專門的商店，起碼宏禮市沒有。;["JAnyone who wants to help with the avatar threat can join the Rangers."WThey're pretty accomodating--anyone who signs up gets stipends for food and board."{That being said, the new demand for housing means some of us have to stay in the bunks until a new place becomes available.")I just joined the rangers yesterday."So excited!".I just hope they don't send me to Velenz."6Working with the Makyan Rangers has been a blast!"OOnce I took down an avatar, they even gave me one of their snazzy outfits!"*Makes travelling from Kanto worth it!"@Decided to spend part of my gap year here fighting avatars."2I'm pretty homesick, but I won't give up yet."<I know that this'll be something I look back fondly on."Yo! Greetings from Unova."Want some Dream Balls?"NThey're a Unovan invention that got improved by some scientists in Galar."QI brought a ton of them with me since I figured I'd catch some Pokemon here."aI've caught all the Pokemon I need though, so I'm giving them out to Trainers who need them."*Anything to combat the avatar threat."ODunno if you can find Dream Balls in Makya, haven't seen any in the shops."3Maybe a specialty shop, but not one in Prizca.Iu;␀?[["LHello there. Perhaps you have come looking to purchase exclusive items?"5Unfortunately, I don't deal to just any Trainer."]Some of these items are rather powerful, and I can't let them fall into the wrong hands."'We don't sell to everyone, dearie."eWe don't want to enable Trainers with poor intentions, so we only sell to Trainers we can trust."3That said, only 8 people have ever managed it!"7My husband and I used to be quite the adventurers."�We've racked up quite the collection of artifacts, though now that we're older in our years we're trying to find these items new homes."-They're not coming wherever we're going."qThose fools over at Aegis Insurance called and tried to convince us to register for "adventuring insurance"."^A good idea on the surface, but the fine print restricted us from entering ancient tombs!"RTo think, that they would try and pull the wool over our eyes with that scam."7Clearly they have no respect for treasure hunters!["/你好，是來購買特殊藏品的嗎？",抱歉，我們不對訓練師出售。"Y這裡的一些東西太過強大，我們必須要確保它們不被惡人利用。"5抱歉，我們並不對所有人出售藏品。"b我們不想被那些有著不良企圖的人鑽了空子，之出售給我們信任的人。",現在只有八個人有這個資格！"/我們夫妻二人都很有冒險精神。"~年輕時積累了相當多的文物，雖然現在我們年紀大了，但依然在努力為這些物品尋找新的歸宿。"2它們不會跟著我們離開這個世界。"e宙斯盾保險公司的那些蠢貨們打電話過來，要我們買什麼“冒險保險”。"h表面上看是在保障安全，但裡面的條條框框，無一不是在限制我們的活動！"D他們也太小瞧人了，還想用這種騙局來騙我們！"2尋寶者打交道最多的就是騙子了！;["LHello there. Perhaps you have come looking to purchase exclusive items?"5Unfortunately, I don't deal to just any Trainer."]Some of these items are rather powerful, and I can't let them fall into the wrong hands."'We don't sell to everyone, dearie."eWe do