aeologists."VI'll let you in on a little secret as well -- they're mostly all the same people!"An expensive kitchen set."RThe dishes and silverware are all coordinated to the Team Chasm color scheme."3It's weird working back at the ol' Chasm base."VI never thought I'd see this place again once Helena set me up with a Ranger job."_In the end, I guess she did care about her grunts, even if she didn't ever really show it."3A chalkboard lists a short menu of food items."MKantoan, Unovan, and Galarian culture are all represented, among others."DHey, Trainer. You look like the type that might want a starter."rDigging is my passion, but I do a little bit of scalping on the side to get a little extra dough every month."ZYou interested in purchasing a Starter Token? There aren't many just floating around."LI'll give you one for the low, low price of $4000. How does that sound?";Nah, nah I get it. Not everyone wants the easy street."HTake some time to think about where your hard earned cash goes, no?":Looking good, looking good. That's the cash I needed."#What were you looking to grab?"\PN hands over $4000."LFair enough. I wasn't planning on taking your cash and running anyways."%One Fire Token, coming right up."Use it well, friend."&One Water Token, coming right up."&One Grass Token, coming right up."IUhh, this isn't a charity. I don't scalp 'cause I enjoy the feeling."2You figured out which Starter Token you want?">Sure, take all the time you need. I'm not going anywhere."0You nab one of those fancy starter Pokemon?"(Gonna flex to your friends with it?"VOr are you one of those Trainers that care about, like, teambuilding or whatever?"No"Yes"No."	Yes."Let me think."Fire Token."Water Token."Grass Token."Let me think some more.[="2嘿，你有那些白色圖騰的信息嗎？"A當我在西宏禮市工作時，我對它們視而不見。">哪個書呆子會花時間關心這些古老的陶器？"_但我在巡邏時有機會碰了幾個，它們讓我的手有一種奇怪的刺痛感。"它們絕對有問題。"#我經常在洞穴裡迷路。"D這對在這裡工作的人來說，簡直就是一場噩夢。"Y我聽說蝙蝠精靈很擅長這個，它們能利用回聲探明洞穴的佈局。"k如果你有這樣的精靈，我可以拿我的滴蛛跟你交換（可在箱子裡選擇精靈）。"A希望護林員同意我在他們的營地裡借住一晚..."&這樣就不用走那麼遠了..."A應該不會很難找吧？畢竟我們現在就在洞裡。"D我可以自己去找，但是這...對我來說有些麻煩...")太好了，我要的就是這個！")終於，不用再原地打轉了。"\有了你的精靈，我可以在不到一個小時的時間內來回於家和這裡！"P以前我得需要六個小時以上，所以這是一個巨大的進步。"/我已經在這個餐廳做九年飯了。"�以前是給裂隙隊的士兵以及研究人員做飯，現在是給馬凱亞護林員還有望新大學的考古專家做飯。"M但是，告訴你一個小祕密 - 他們大多數都是同一批人！"#一套昂貴的廚房用具。"J無論是餐具還是廚具，配色都與裂隙隊的設計一致。">在以前的裂隙隊基底工作，感覺真是彆扭。"k自從那天海倫娜給了我這份屬於護林員的工作之後，沒想到還會再看到這裡。"J她是真心實意地關心手下，即便從來沒有表露出來。"5黑板上列出了一份簡短的菜品清單。";關都、合眾以及伽勒爾風格的菜品都有。"A嘿，訓練師，我感覺你應該想要個初始精靈？"M挖礦尋寶是我的興趣，但同時也需要靠倒賣維持生活。"M有興趣買一個初始商店的代幣嗎？這東西可少見得很。"B我不會出很高的價格，4000金錢，你覺得怎樣？"8嗯，明白了，不是每個人都想走捷徑。"G有時間就好好想想，辛苦賺來的錢要花在哪兒吧。")很好很好，我們各取所需。"你想要買哪種？"$\PN將4000金錢交給對方。")沒問題，我也沒打算騙錢。"&一個猛火代幣，你的了。" 好好利用它，夥計。"&一個激流代幣，你的了。"&一個茂盛代幣，你的了。"q呃，這不是慈善事業，金錢不夠那就找找自己的問題，這麼多年有沒有努力工作。"&你想好要哪種代幣了嗎？"D沒問題，你有的是時間，反正我基本都在這裡。"&你得到那些初始精靈了？"&你會向你的朋友炫耀嗎？"D還是說你只在意它們，在戰鬥中是否能表現好？"不換"換"不要"買了"讓我想想"猛火代幣"激流代幣"茂盛代幣"讓我再想想;[="4Hey, you got any info about those white totems?"@When I still worked in Prizca West I took them for granted."<What sort of geek has time to worry about old ceramics?"pBut I got the chance to touch a few while out on patrol, and they made my hand tingle in the strangest way."-Something is definitely fishy with them."$I get lost in caves a good bit."ZWorking here has been a nightmare for me, I can never find the right way out of here."vYa know, I heard that bat Pokemon are pretty good at remembering cave layouts. Something to do with echolocation."dIf you got one of those Pokemon, I can trade you a Pokemon of mine. A Dewpider, to be specific."=Maybe the Rangers might let me crash in their Station..."4Least that way I don't have to make the trip..."FThey can't be too hard to find right? We are in a cave after all."CI'd go find one myself, but, well, it's a catch 22 of sorts..."'Yes! A bat! Exactly what I wanted!"2Finally, the routes might start making sense."MWith your Pokemon, I can head back and forth from home in under an hour!"FIt used to take me upwards of six, so this is a huge improvement."BI've been cooking for this mess hall for nine straight years."wI used to cook for C