earch lead was enough for me to land a cushy job as the Ranger Captain here."TAnd research money is research money, doesn't really matter where it came from."*I wouldn't touch that, if I were you."A metal trash can."4Someone's thrown away a copy of the Novo Times."LThe headline reads: "Brutal Beartic: Man hospitalized by Avatar attack""/Budgetary plans are sketched out in chalk."6$7,000 has been assigned for "Zubat Maintenance.""0Archeology books are strewn over the table."cThe largest is from 10 years ago, a detailed report on the ruins in Three-Point Pass in Galar."NNovo Academy hired me from Galar to work on advanced fossil resurrection."?I specialize in reviving the Galarian combination fossils."gWould you like me to try my hand at that? It's free-- don't have anything else to do with my time."FMaybe I'll go digging through the ruins for the 3rd time today..."HMaybe I'll go digging through the ruins for the third time today..."TThe microscope is prepared with a slide containing some sort of rocky material."It's labeled "SP-883.""1The ruins here date back thousands of years."9Much of it predates even the oldest areas of Prizca."UConnecting the link between this society and Makya's has proven quite difficult."�The region was decimated by internal and external conflicts during the end of monarchy, so much of the era's historical record has been lost."SThe microscope is prepared with a slide with a blindingly bright white powder."No"Yes["V當我聽說裂隙隊要合法化時，我非常擔心研究經費會不會斷。"z結果所有事情都有人處理完了，我作為研究主管，只要同時兼任護林員隊長的工作就行。";我只想要研究資金，哪兒來的我無所謂。")如果我是你，就不會亂動。"一個金屬垃圾桶。")某人扔掉的一份望新時報。"Y報道標題是：“殘忍的凍原熊：一男子被化身襲擊導致住院。”"#粉筆寫出的預算計劃。"4將7,000金錢撥給“超音蝠維護組”。"&考古書籍散落在桌子上。"P其中最顯眼的，是十年前，一份關於伽勒爾遺址的報告。"P我是望新大學從伽勒爾聘來，從事高級化石復活工作的。"2專門研究復活伽勒爾的組合化石。"G要試試嗎？免費的。而且我也沒有其他事情可做。"G也許我該再去挖掘下廢墟？今天已經是第三次了..."G也許我該再去挖掘下廢墟？今天已經是第三次了...">顯微鏡的載玻片上有一種奇特的礦石物質。"&上面的編號是“SP-883”。"2這裡的遺蹟可以追溯到幾千年前。";其中很多比宏禮市最古老的地方還要早。"M想把這些跟馬凱亞的社會聯繫起來不是一件容易的事。"t在君王統治的末期，這個地區同時受到了內外的摧殘，很多歷史記錄都已經丟失了。"G顯微鏡的載玻片上，有一種亮得刺眼的白色粉末。"算了"試試;["QI w