y can..."aBestie, it's time to invest in our stocks while they're low. We're accepting bestie buyouts!"JTime to cash in on the best bonds... get my bestie estate in order..."7Maybe it's time to invest in you stocks instead..."$Bestie, are you cheating? No..."gGood work bestie, we'll be rolling in bestie bucks if we invest in your bestie business right now."	Hey!"Hey hey hey hey!"NOK, so, like, I know what you’re thinking: "Wow, Candy, you’re, like,"�super-cool for hanging out in such a super-cool place full of dangerous trainers." And, uh, yeah, thank you for noticing, I totally am.":But I’ve got a reason, and it’s not even illegal!"�So, apparently Tamarind shows up in Whitebloom Town every few months to like check in or whatever, and I just did a li'l recon and..."0OK, maybe it was actually a little illegal."wNo, shh, I can feel you, like, being judgy right now, and I totally don’t need that energy in my life right now."HBecause she’s the second-in-command of all Team Chasm! Like, duh!"�She’s probably at the top of my hit list – I kinda forgot where I put it and now I can’t find it anymore but it’s almost 100 percent got her name in"big letters at the top!"bUgh, I can’t believe how on the same wavelength we are. You are like my buddy cop soulmate."1Oh, uh, yeah, sorry, hi, love you too. Cool?"4Cool. Let’s talk about the interesting stuff!"�So, I broke into the abandoned lab and rooted around in there – which, it’s like mega-abandoned and super unsafe but, um, who cares – and found these."�Um, which is the part where I’d show you the stuff I’d found but I kinda shoved it in my backpack and that place is a total mess."@So, uh, instead of digging it out, just take my word on it!"~It’s this like dossier on a whole bunch of old Team Chasm operations that Tamarind must’ve left in there and forgot about!";Oh, all kinds of stuff with these, like, killer names."�Like “Operation Vagabond Plumage” or “Operation Cardinal Sin” or “Project Theodicy.” It gives me happy c