"=Me and sister are much better battlers than our parents."'Our Pokemon couldn't beat your's?!"/That was fun, we should battle again soon."&Our Pokemon couldn't beat yours?!"Our Pokemon couldn't win?!Iu;␀0I[[�"FYezera is whistling something mournful while the world is reborn."*Are you prepared for the fight ahead?"...I will."I’m sorry."For everything. All of it."I’m not stopping."I can’t – I can’t!"=I couldn’t make myself live another day in this world.""Not one more day as a pariah.""Is that all you have? Please?"JWhere was that appreciation a year ago? Two years ago? Five? Why now?"I deserve to be happy!"@I’m going to be happy! Finally! How can you deny me that?"No. No one ever did."ZGossiping about me, prying, questioning – I hated it. No one ever cared how I felt."SHah... deep breaths, Yez. Deep breaths... you met those wraiths, didn’t you?"?Vestiges of a future that could’ve been. People we know."]I guess they were drawn to us, somehow. It’s – I can’t think about that right now."1Alessa will be fine. I’ll make sure of it."<Yes! I’m only good at one thing, but I AM good at it."GVery, very good. A world ruled by Pokémon is a world ruled by me."#That – that wasn’t Alessa."AYou don’t know her. What would you know? You’re a child."=How long have you been in Makya? ...What would you know?"For you? Maybe."$For all of them? People? Maybe."WBut I’m making things better for me, and for Pokémon, and that’s fair! Right?"Isn’t it fair? Finally?"(...You can try. You can always try."%To be honest, \PN, I’m scared."OI’m scared it’s going to be ripped away from me when I’m this close."eI should never have let you come here. I should’ve lied to you – hurt you – done anything."4But now that you’re here, I have to stop you."KThe world’s blossoming. It’s almost ready. And I’m ready for it."fSo... just a little longer, \PN. I’m sorry for doing this to you, but they couldn’t stop you."rZain, Tamarind, Alessa. Sang. The gym leaders. Every single trainer, every avatar – they don’t scare you."wWhat scares you? All of history flows freely here! Every eon at once, mixing and merging, returning to the source!"/What are you most afraid of, in all of it?"...Oh."JMavis. Come. Ring in the end of this world with me. Fight by my side."0Once more, \PN. Once more, and never again."8Your mother... a version of her, stands before you."1Not... exactly. I have my own \PN back home."BI wish you were mine, though. You’re obviously much better."0\PN. It’s surreal seeing your face again."EMy own \PN... well, they’re gone now. Soon to be gone forever."*Mavis. Not your Mavis, unfortunately."yIf I had all the power in this place, and you as my child – why, I’d be the best of all Mavises. C’est la vie."ANo. No one commands me to do anything, and you least of all."nYou should know you can’t escape me. I created you: mind, body, and soul. You owe your existence to me."V...You really are \PN, aren’t you? Fiercer. More resilient. Even less obedient."ZOh, I wish I could take you back with me! You’re the child every mother could want."NAfter you’ve been broken in a little, that is. I’d make you… third."Third-to-last."<Where and when I’m from, things are looking... bleak."YEverything ends. I want to ensure the most valuable things are kept for the longest."You’d be third-to-last."^Oh, if I could only wrap my arms around you and take you with me. All the way to the end."�That’s where I’m from, of course – end of the line. You deserve better than that... but so do I, and I’d like to have one good child to keep me company."YOh, don’t take it personally. Kids need to learn to grow up fast where I’m from."?I’ve made sure society is very... regimented. Practical."eWhen everything’s coming to a halt, you can’t really afford the luxury of teenage rebellion."dI’m a specter, \PN. My timeline is crumbling to ash. I don’t know if it even really exists."�I’ll either return there shortly, or cease to be. Give me this small mercy of being able to see my child again – the 