rve to be happy!"@I’m going to be happy! Finally! How can you deny me that?"No. No one ever did."ZGossiping about me, prying, questioning – I hated it. No one ever cared how I felt."SHah... deep breaths, Yez. Deep breaths... you met those wraiths, didn’t you?"?Vestiges of a future that could’ve been. People we know."]I guess they were drawn to us, somehow. It’s – I can’t think about that right now."1Alessa will be fine. I’ll make sure of it."<Yes! I’m only good at one thing, but I AM good at it."GVery, very good. A world ruled by Pokémon is a world ruled by me."#That – that wasn’t Alessa."AYou don’t know her. What would you know? You’re a child."=How long have you been in Makya? ...What would you know?"For you? Maybe."$For all of them? People? Maybe."WBut I’m making things better for me, and for Pokémon, and that’s fair! Right?"Isn’t it fair? Finally?"(...You can try. You can always try."%To be honest, \PN, I’m scared."OI’m scared it’s going to be ripped away from me when I’m this close."eI should never have let you come here. I should’ve lied to you – hurt you – done anything."4But now that you’re here, I have to stop you."KThe world’s blossoming. It’s almost ready. And I’m ready for it."fSo... just a little longer, \PN. I’m sorry for doing this to you, but they couldn’t stop you."rZain, Tamarind, Alessa. Sang. The gym leaders. Every single trainer, every avatar – they don’t scare you."wWhat scares you? All of history flows freely here! Every eon at once, mixing and merging, returning to the source!"/What are you most afraid of, in all of it?"...Oh."JMavis. Come. Ring in the end of this world with me. Fight by my side."0Once more, \PN. Once more, and never again."8Your mother... a version of her, stands before you."1Not... exactly. I have my own \PN back home."BI wish you were mine, though. You’re obviously much better."0\PN. It’s surreal seeing your face again."EMy own \PN... well, they’re gone now. Soon to be gone forever."*Mavis. Not your Mavis, unfortunately."yIf I had all the power in this place, and you as my child – why, I’d be the best of all Mavises. C’est la vie."ANo. No one commands me to do anything, and you least of all."nYou should know you can’t escape me. I created you: mind, body, and soul. You owe your existence to me."V...You really are \PN, aren’t you? Fiercer. More resilient. Even less obedient."ZOh, I wish I could take you back with me! You’re the child every mother could want."NAfter you’ve been broken in a little, that is. I’d make you… third."Third-to-last."<Where and when I’m from, things are looking... bleak."YEverything ends. I want to ensure the most valuable things are kept for the longest."You’d be third-to-last."^Oh, if I could only wrap my arms around you and take you with me. All the way to the end."�That’s where I’m from, of course – end of the line. You deserve better than that... but so do I, and I’d like to have one good child to keep me company."YOh, don’t take it personally. Kids need to learn to grow up fast where I’m from."?I’ve made sure society is very... regimented. Practical."eWhen everything’s coming to a halt, you can’t really afford the luxury of teenage rebellion."dI’m a specter, \PN. My timeline is crumbling to ash. I don’t know if it even really exists."�I’ll either return there shortly, or cease to be. Give me this small mercy of being able to see my child again – the child I wish I’d had."D...Our time is just about up. A word of advice: ditch the girl."5She’s a liability, and she’ll drag you down."�She doesn’t deserve half the kindness she’s gotten, and the other half should’ve been revoked to shape her into something better."}...What? Do you think I don’t have my own Yezera? I said you’d be third for a reason. I’m very proud of my second."�This one’s beyond repair, though. You deserve better than a girl that’d destroy the world over her social anxiety. She’s quite literally insane."}Get rid of her and go back home to your Mavis. She’ll love you even more now that you’ve proven yourself so cleanly."She’ll give you a role in life to fulfill, and protect you forever. Even to the end of the world, you’ll have a place."A place... second-to-last."9Say hi to her for me. Love you, \PN. You deserve it."I’m sorry!"�I’m so sorry. I’m sorry, I’m sorry, I’m sorry. I didn’t mean to. I shouldn’t have. I shouldn’t have done that to you!"AI’m sorry. Please forgive me. I’m so sorry. I’m sorry."DNo! I – I – I can’t believe I would do that. I’m sorry.":I’m sorry... I just. I had to stop you. I had to..."!I’m sorry – I’m sorry!"mPlease, please. I can’t – don’t look at me like that! I’m sorry. I didn’t want to. I had to..."2I’m sorry. You hate me. You should hate me."XI never should’ve done that. I did the worst thing I could think of. I’m sorry."1I’m sorry. I didn’t want to. I had to..."I had to. Right?"4I’m sorry. I couldn’t. I need... I need it."7Give me my world! Give me my happiness! I need it!"UI just – I want to be loved. I want them to love me. After everything I did...";...\PN. I know. I’m sorry, I’m sorry, I’m sorry.">But I know. I want everyone to love me. I want to belong."2I want to be with everyone else! I need more!".They – I don’t know! They’re happy!"eThey’ve gotten enough. Haven’t they? Isn’t it... I’m sorry. I’m so sorry. I can’t..."=I don’t care! I want to be feared, then! Or respected!"eJust to have a place to belong, and power, and be at the center of everything. I want to matter!"0Please, don’t do that to me. I’m sorry!"OI’m sorry, and I know I deserve it. You should be doing way worse to me."`I’m sorry. I just... I had to. I need to matter. I need to be treated like a human being."DI need people to appreciate me, because I’m – I deserve it!"�I want – I need – I wanna be like... like Mavis. At the center of everything... with power... feared and loved... and I’d deserve it."hI – I think I’m gonna be sick. Is that what I want? \PN? Is that what I’ve been trying to be?"<I don’t wanna be that. I don’t want... what I want."...OK. Shhh. Deep breaths."J...Yeah. It is. I don’t have to... be like that. Don’t have to..."=...It hurts. Everything hurts. I feel sick. But... yeah."..."3I’m sorry. I shouldn’t have gone that far."PI... it's different, hurting someone you know like that. I don’t like it."jSo much easier to just sweep away what you’re doing when it’s all clean white stone. I’m sorry."p...I guess nothing’s really changed. I’m not fixed. I’m not happy. I feel the worst I’ve ever felt."qBut... I can’t go through with it. Th-thank you for that. I wouldn’t have been able to live with myself."&Hah. You’re a good friend, \PN."-Or, I guess we’re not friends. Rivals?"=I know. Are you a selfless hero, or do you just hate me?"It’s OK if you hate me."7I – I’m not going to examine that too closely."_Thank you, \PN. I love you too. D-don’t examine that too closely, either. I just do, OK?"aSilence? I guess that’s all I deserve. ...Although, with you sometimes, it’s all I need."I’m not staying."\I need to figure some things out... and I don’t know that I’m welcome here anymore."KHistory’s still enmeshed here. I think I’ll just... take a stroll."cI do. I’ve been alone for a long time, but now I really need to be... alone. Properly alone."KHah. Thanks, I think. I understand if you want me gone. Everyone does."_That’s why I left. And after all of this... yeah. I should go, for their sakes and mine."NI’m sorry. I have to. Sometimes you just need to do things by yourself.">Have your... little revelations, I guess. I do, at least."...Mmhmm."I’ll be back."I promise I’ll be back."~Even if no one wanted me to come back, I still would – this is my home. I don’t know when, or where, but I promise I will."VYou should get out of here. This isn’t really a healthy place, I don’t think."NI’ll just wait here for a little bit, and then I’ll... I’ll be off."WGive me a little while to catch my breath, wipe these tears away... all the usual."<Thank you, \PN. For everything. Even if you do hate me."TI’ll see you again, OK? For a rematch. This time, though, it’ll just be us."Until then... thank you."No."	Yes."You can."Please, Yezera."This is wrong."Don't care."Are you so sure?"Alessa doesn't want this."You're making it worse."I'm stopping this."	Mom."Mavis."What are you?"Disappear."Third?"Take me back?"Broken in?"Leave me be."It's OK."My mom? Really?"You are loved."And everyone else?"That isn't love."Shhh. It's OK."It's your choice."You see now?"You're welcome."Didn't do it for you."I love you."You don't have to."
