 angrier!"...I’m so stupid."No, you aren’t!"HIf you were sorry, you’d do something about it! But you didn’t!"1Yeah, I’m sure you do! And I have my mine!"%I can’t believe I trusted you!"KI’m... oh, \PN. I’m, like, I’m not sorry for being, like, wrong."?I’m sorry for what I’m about to do to you. Hah! Hahah!"Hahahah! Alright!"HLike, fine, Tamarind gets away! But I’ve got someone even better!"Do I look OK, you idiot?"qI’m, like, pretty far down at this point! But I’ve got a shovel and I’m about to dig you down with me!"KYeah. You knew this would happen, you traitor. I hope it’s worth it!"OOh, it is way past time! I can’t believe I let my guard down around you!"#Are you ready? I don’t care."0Jeanne, you were right. Butcher this creep."You beat me. Fine! Fine!"YI don’t care! What does it matter? Of course you’re better than me! Everyone is!"^...You don’t know how, like, completely tempting it is to kick you while you’re down."FYou’d deserve it. But I should let you get up. I know I should."m...So what now? You want to go skitter off and eat treats out of Tamarind’s hand? Fine! See if I care!"3You can burn for all I care. I – I hate you!"3I. Don’t. Care! You’re not better than me!"mEveryone’s always trying to show they’re better than me because they’ve got the law on their side!"|Or they’re older, or bigger, or a better trainer! Well you’re all idiots! You’re all corrupt! You should all just die!"'No you’re not! Shut up! Shut up!"JYou don’t care what you did! You don’t care that you betrayed me!"]Good! I’m glad you hate me! At least that means you have a good reason for hurting me."(I hate you too. I hate you so much."PGo die! I hate you! Ugh – you make my skin crawl, you manipulative creep!",I should’ve trusted Jeanne about you."(...It’s over. Everything is over."-Funny. It’s, like, honestly hilarious.":I was gonna help Yezera end everything! Reset it all!"�And now I don’t even want to! Screw that. You don’t deserve justice. None of you do! Why would I want to make