Mine."?...There is nothing much to say to a dead woman, is there?"1Don’t be. It’s better to know the truth."...Imogene is dead."XI do not know if I ever did. Countless possibilities plagued me in sleepless hours."8Was this one too elegant to consider? Or too cruel?"RImogene has been dead for years. She died well before my memory on the train."KShe was a hermit and a recluse, a mystic and a witch, and now... gone."_I can feel... memories... bubbling up. They’re seeping in like blood through thin gauze."(I can’t let them in. I mustn’t!"MIf I remember who I am... I won’t be me anymore. I won’t be Imogene."...It is agonizing."{The silence, filled with the beat of my raging heart and the echoes of things I had thought left to blissful oblivion."No! You would kill me?"HIf I remember I will be – I will be undone! Unmade in an instant!"So I believed."pHah! How innocent I was, truly, never having witnessed something so horrible as to make one wish to forget."1I’m trying. I am trying with all my might!":I do not want this identity! I do not want this past!"XIf I witness this revelation it will shatter me! I know this with utmost certainty."And... so did she."�I do not know if she has already given in, but she bestowed upon me a gift before she left my presence for what I fear is the last time."Her Pokémon."?She would not entrust them to me if she planned to return."+...I am prepared. I can run no longer."eWilling or no, the truth descends upon me. I will greet it with all the fury I might yet muster.")Make your preparations, if you must."LAre you ready? I cannot do this alone. I require a mirror to gaze into."PI must dance, must ritualize this, must make into something comprehensible."bI need your support, and I know your adamant core resides within your abilities as a trainer."mMore than that, I know it is how you judge people. I would have you witness my soul, and know the truth."SDo what you must. I may wait a few moments longer... may keep the past at bay."FFor the last time, I take up this identity I have absconded with."I am Imogene."I am an oracle."I am a seeker of truth."@Bare your soul to me, wanderer! Let this be my last battle!"...So be it."I remember."oI remember the house, the old hardwood, the ticking of the grandfather clock, the smell of the river loam!"{The crushing of the drying autumn leaves, the warmth of a soft embrace, the bruising, the bleeding, the burning, the fight!"LThe love of the fight! The yearning to learn, to become something more!"_I remember her. I remember Imogene teaching us, teaching all of us... teaching us to be..."Go on ahead."9Find what has happened to my sister in this torment."RI... I will release our Pokémon, and then I will cease this long masquerade."!I will be trapped no longer."?The name on this gravestone is faded beyond recognition..."$Leave me. I must do this alone."There’s a note."�“I’ve released them. Our Pokémon go readily. I think they know. As for me... I remember. She loved Dittos. She kept dozens."SShe trained them not only in battle, but to imitate humans. To imitate... her."YI found it so curious, to see Pokémon pretending to be people. How lovely. How fun!"sShe took me in as if I was just another pink blob, and she taught me more than I can express, let alone repay."{I am not her, nor is my companion. We are but two mirrors set facing each other, endlessly reflecting a woman that is gone."hWe strayed further and further in our imitations every day. It could not last. Do not mourn for us."aThis is the truth, and it provides suffering and succor in equal measure, as it always does.">We are released from our bonds. We are Imogene no longer."<Now we are Imogene, sisters of a name, and that is all."Thank you."Goodbye."�P.S.: I have done things I should not have, in pursuit of this truth. I have endeavored to cause harm to you, to others, to the world entire."qI do not know if this was my own selfish need to know what in my heart of hearts I already saw yet denied --"Aor if, perhaps, Imogene was not the saint I remember her as."EIn either case, I will take responsibility for what I have done."�I cannot stand against you, and will gladly aid you in your coming trials. Not to aid the flow of fate, but because you are my friend."HBecause it is the right thing to do, and because it is what I want."bI cannot ask for more than a chance to make amends side by side with one such as yourself.”"@P.S.: I will gladly lend my aid to you, no matter who I am."TAsk for my assistance, and I will be there. I have plenty strength yet to give."jI do this not for you, who is of import to the flow of destiny, but for you, my friend and confidant."KBring me with you if you desire my company, or have need of my powers."?It is the least I can do... and the best I can imagine.”"...A Mew."@The infinitely-mutable Pokémon of myth, here in the flesh."3It chitters happily, swimming through the air."�Yet, somehow, there’s a macabre tinge to its movements, a slight touch of gallows humor to the way it darts around gravestones."HThere is a flash of sympathy in its eyes when it stares into yours."MIt knows what it is, and it knows what you are, and you know what it is."SIt stops and coils, floating for a moment to regard you with its vibrant eyes.")You see the conflict in its eyes –"�the desire to explore free and wide, the remembered thrill of the fight, the eagerness to repay its debt, the desire to accompany you."!It leaves the choice to you."%It winks at you as you catch it."lSometimes it will go missing, wandering on flights of fancy through landscapes and thoughtscapes alike."CSometimes in the witching hour objects will move on their own."cSometimes you find notes written in handwriting you can’t read, signed with a question mark."9You know it can leave any time it likes. It won’t."9It flips upside down, then rights itself in mid-air."\Perhaps mockery, perhaps a nod, perhaps just an idle motion of a recently-freed animal."Then, it’s gone."RA mirage that disappears with a strong breeze, dispelled like a waking dream."}If you come back, perhaps it will be here, waiting for you. They’ll say this place is haunted, but you know the truth."`It’s always liked graveyards, and it can afford to wait to make sure you won’t need it.""Now, it has nothing but time."0I BRING A WHOLE NEW MEANING TO DEATH METAL!"TNow that I think about it, what I'm doing down here is immensely disrespectful."&TAKE THE G OFF OF GRAVEYARD BABY!""BWAHHHHH BWAAAAHHHHH BWWOOOW!"Are you alright?"Which one are you?"What did you see?"Where's the other one?"..."I'm so sorry."	How?"Yeah, I'd guessed..."You have to remember."Better to know."Then don't remember."I'll prepare."Very well."Catch Imogene."Release Imogene forever.[}"...\PN。",我在這裡...並且你也在這裡。"不..."&這有關係嗎？有區別嗎？"#我不應該擁有的東西。"#沒有人該看到的東西。"G她在更裡面，在為這裡會發現的真相而苦苦掙扎。"V你明白了？你能從我的眼中看到嗎...我所見證的一切的倒影？"q起初，我並不知道為什麼來到這裡，或者我希望能找到什麼，只是知道我必須來。"S然後...它像陰森的食腐鳥一樣，突然襲來，落在了我身上。"k你不明白嗎？我走過這些墳墓，心跳越來越快，尋找那個我害怕找到的名字..."伊莫珍。"M...對於一個已死去的女人，沒有什麼可說的了，對吧？"8別難過，知道真相總比糊里糊塗的好。" ...伊莫珍已經死了。"w我不確定自己是否曾經想過這種可能性，在我失眠的時候，有太多想法一直困擾著我。"b還是說覺得這個結局...太過優雅，或者太過殘忍，所以不願意去考慮？"P伊莫珍已經去世好多年了，在我擁有火車上的記憶之前。"M她是一個隱士，一個神祕的女巫，現在...已悄然離開。"e我能感覺到...記憶...正一點點地冒出來，像血液一樣從輕紗中滲透進來。")我不能讓它們進來，不能！"S如果我記起我是誰...我就不再是我了，就不再是伊莫珍了。"...這太痛苦了。"w我的心跳，和曾經以為已經遺忘的一切，就在沉默中以回聲的形式，充斥在我的耳畔。" 不！你會殺了我嗎？">如果我記起來，我會被毀滅！瞬間被毀滅！"#我曾經是這樣認為的。"\哈！多麼天真...從未見過如此可怕的事情，以至於讓人寧願忘記。"2我正在努力這樣...儘自己的一切！";我不想要這個身份！我不想要這個過去！">如果我目睹這個真相，它肯定...會撕碎我！"&而且...她也是這樣想的。"�我不知道她是否已經屈服，但在她離開我之前，她送給我一份禮物，這可能是我最後一次見到她了。"她的精靈。">如果她打算回來，她不會把它們託付給我。"8...我已經準備好了，我不能再逃避了。"e無論是否願意，真相都將降臨在我身上，我將用我所有的憤怒來迎接它。"#如果你也...做好準備。"\你準備好了嗎？我自己是做不到的，我需要一面鏡子來看看自己。"G我必須以儀式舞蹈完成它，必須使其變得可理解。"n我需要你的支持，我知道你堅定的心深深紮根在你作為一名訓練師的能力之中。"n更重要的是，我知道這是你評判人的方式，我想讓你見證我的靈魂，獲知真相。"_隨你自己的意願去做吧，我可以再等一會兒...可以讓過去晚一些來。"A這是我最後一次使用這個我曾經偷走的身份。"我是伊莫珍。"我是一名先知。"&我是一名尋求真相的人。"M向我展示你的靈魂，旅行者！讓這成為我的最後一戰！"...就這樣吧。"我想起來了。"w我想起了那棟房子，那些古老的硬木地板，那座老爺鐘的滴答聲，那河邊泥土的氣味！"_那些被踩碎的秋葉，柔軟擁抱的溫暖，那些傷、血、燃燒還有爭鬥！"Y那種熱愛戰鬥的感覺！那種渴望學習、成為更好的自己的感覺！"b我想起她了，我記得伊莫珍教導我