e's your ID?"IHaha, just bustin' your chops. You don't need an ID to be down here."@In fact, I stole this whole outfit. I don't even work here!"=Alright, you can pass through. But I got my eyes on you.".Make sure you report your activity to HR."Prizca Black Market"0A photoshoot in the sewers, so avant-garde!"IStrange photoshoots will get me fame. The smell on the other hand..."!How did I get even get here?"3If you see my camera man, tell him where I am."rI got a tip off about a first edition "The Adventures of Mighty Morpeko" being sold here in the Black Market."[When it turns out to be a forgery, I'm so going to expose them to my internet friends."
