Wushu"Rogue Monkey"Wild Horse"Swift Horse"	King"	Test"Test 2"High King"MellowIu;␀��[[B"gWhile it is young, it uses the nutrients that are stored in the seed on its back in order to grow."�To support its weight, Ivysaur's legs and trunk grow thick and strong. If it spends more time lying in the sunlight, it's a sign that the bud will bloom soon."_Its plant blooms when it is absorbing solar energy. It stays on the move to seek sunlight."tFrom the time it is born, a flame burns at the tip of its tail. Its life would end if the flame were to go out."_In the rocky mountains where Charmeleon live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars."fIf Charizard becomes furious, the flame at the tip of its tail flares up in a whitish-blue color."�Its shell is not just for protection. Its rounded shape and the grooves on its surface minimize resistance in water, enabling Squirtle to swim at high speeds."�Its large tail is covered with rich, thick fur that deepens in color with age. The scratches on its shell are evidence of this Pokémon's toughness in battle."dThe jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel."�Its voracious appetite compels it to devour leaves bigger than itself without hesitation. It releases a terribly strong odor from its antennae."hA steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution."dWater-repellent powder on its wings enables it to collect honey, even in the heaviest of rains."}Evolutionary power has supercharged its wings and their toxic scales, which turn to pure energy at the slightest provocation."fPredators not warned off by its brightly-colored body are jabbed with the toxic barb on its head."�It remains virtually immobile while it clings to a tree. However, on the inside, it busily prepares for evolution. This is evident from how hot its shell becomes."rIt prefers hit-and-run attacks using its powerful poison stingers, trying to evade blows to its fragile body."�Its final evolution has sent its killer instinct into overdrive. It obeys its trainer unfailingly, but will grow impatient without a good fight."�It has an extremely sharp sense of direction. It can unerringly return home to its nest, however far it may be removed from its familiar surroundings."�This Pokémon flies around, patrolling its large territory. If its living space is violated, it shows no mercy in thoroughly punishing the foe with its sharp claws."dIt spreads its gorgeous wings wide to intimidate enemies. It races through the skies at Mach 2."YCautious in the extreme, its hardy vitality lets it live in any kind of environment."iWith its long fangs, this surprisingly violent Pokémon can gnaw away even thick concrete with ease."{It shows no interest in anything that isn't fresh. If you take it shopping with you, it will help you pick out ingredients."qIt makes its Rattata underlings gather food for it, dining solely on the most nutritious and delicious fare."vFarmers whose fields are troubled by bug Pokémon appreciate Spearow for its vigorous appetite and look after it."�Its long neck and elongated beak are ideal for catching prey in soil or water. It deftly moves this extended and skinny beak to pluck prey."�Ekans curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. Assuming this position allows it to quickly respond to a threat from any direction with a glare."jTransfixing prey with the face-like pattern on its belly, it binds and poisons the frightened victim."`It is not yet skilled at storing electricity. It may send out a jolt if amused or startled."fThis intelligent Pokémon roasts hard berries with electricity to make them tender enough to eat."�If it stores too much electricity, its behavior turns aggressive. To avoid this, it occasionally discharges excess energy and calms itself down."�Rarely, a Pikachu grows to incredible size instead of evolving into Raichu. It can power settlements so long as it's fed properly."dIt can loose 100,000-volt bursts of electricity, instantly downing foes several times its size."�It loves to bathe in the grit of dry, sandy areas. By sand bathing, this Pokémon rids itself of dirt and moisture clinging to its body."xIts claws and horns often break off. The broken claws and horns can be used to carve plows for tilling farm fields."nLife on mountains covered with deep snow has granted this Pokémon a body of ice that's as hard as steel."�It lives in snowy mountains on southern islands. When a blizzard rolls in, this Pokémon hunkers down in the snow to avoid getting blown away."�Its highly toxic barbs are thought to have developed as protection for this small-bodied Pokémon. When enraged, it releases a horrible toxin from its horn."�When Nidorina are with friends or family, they keep their barbs tucked away to prevent hurting each other. It becomes nervous if separated from the others."�It pacifies offspring by placing them in the gaps between the spines on its back. The spines will never secrete poison while young are present."wIts large ears are flapped like wings when it is listening to distant sounds. It extends toxic barbs when angered."�It's nervous and quick to act aggressively. The potency of its poison increases along with the level of adrenaline present in its body."�When it goes on a rampage, it's impossible to control. But in the presence of a Nidoqueen it's lived with for a long time, Nidoking calms down."bMany appear when the night skies are filled with shooting stars. They disappear with sunrise."�On every night of a full moon they come out to play. When dawn arrives, they return to their quiet mountain retreats and sleep nestled up against each other."�A Clefable uses its wings to skip lightly as if it were flying. Its bouncy step lets it even walk on water. On quiet, moonlit nights, it strolls on lakes."�From its mouth spew flames that seem to resemble the spirits of the deceased. Some people mistakenly think this fire is a ghost."^Legend has it that this mystical Pokémon was formed when nine saints coalesced into one."qIn hot weather, this Pokémon makes ice shards with its six tails and sprays them around to cool itself off."|It lives on mountains perpetually covered in snow and is revered as a deity incarnate. It appears draped in a blizzard."|It constantly demands treats and gifts from its Trainer. An expensive and fashionable hoard is necessary for evolution."�The gifts it received have become a tail of golden light. It weaponizes pure avaricious energy in battle, gaining in power as it is pampered."fIt has a very soft body. If it starts to roll, it will bounce all over and be impossible to stop."{By freely changing the wavelength of its voice, Jigglypuff sings a mysterious melody sure to make any listener sleepy."�The surfaces of its saucerlike eyes are always covered with a thin layer of tears. If any dust gets in this Pokémon's eyes, it is quickly washed away."�Their skin is so thin that they'll be burned if sunlight hits them. When it gets cold out, they gather together to warm one another's bodies."}Its thick fangs are hollow like straws, making them unexpectedly fragile. These fangs are specialized for sucking blood."�Both of its legs have turned into wings. Without a sound, Crobat flies swiftly toward its prey and sinks its fangs into the nape of its target's neck."eIf exposed to moonlight, it starts to move. It roams far and wide at night to scatter its seeds."�A horribly noxious honey drools from its mouth. One whiff of the honey can result in memory loss. Some fans are said to enjoy this overwhelming stink, however."cThe bud bursts into bloom with a bang. It then starts scattering allergenic, poisonous pollen."`When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open."pNo matter how much it eats, the mushrooms growing on its back steal away most of the nutrients it consumes."_The large mushroom on its back controls it. It often fights over territory with Shiinotic."[Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light."vThe powdery scales on its wings are hard to remove from skin. They also contain poison that leaks out on contact."~Around their crops, farmers plant trees that Diglett like to eat as a way of getting Diglett to plow the fields for them."nDugtrio's heads are sleek and smooth and incredibly hard. It can dig through any soil with its headbutts."�Its head sports an altered form of whiskers made of metal. When in communication with its comrades, its whiskers wobble to and fro."~Its shining gold hair provides it with protection. It's reputed that keeping any of its fallen hairs will bring bad luck."�It loves coins, so if you give it one, you can make friends with Meowth easily. But it's fickle, so you can't count on that friendship lasting."kBehind its lithe, elegant appearance lies a barbaric side. It will tear apart its prey on a mere whim."�Scientists are divided as to whether its incredible length inspired internet memes, or whether seeing memes caused a Meowth to undergo unprecedented evolution."yIt's impulsive, selfish, and fickle. It's very popular with some Trainers who like giving it the attention it needs."qIts round face is a symbol of wealth. Persian that have bigger, plumper faces are considered more beautiful."�These daring Pokémon have coins on their foreheads. Darker coins are harder, and harder coins garner more respect among Meowth."eAfter many battles, it evolved dangerous claws that come together to form daggers when extended."iIf its chronic headache peaks, it may exhibit odd powers. It seems unable to recall such an episode."gIt appears by waterways at dusk. It may use telekinetic powers if its forehead glows mysteriously."�It can spontaneously become enraged. Everyone near it clears out as it rampages and the resulting loneliness makes it angrier still."nIt has been known to become so angry that it dies as a result. Its face looks peaceful in death, however."~When its anger rose beyond a critical point, this Pokémon gained power that is unfettered by the limits of its physical body."`It has a brave and trustworthy nature. It fearlessly stands up to bigger and stronger foes."�Legends tell of it fighting alongside a general and conquering a whole country. Those hearing its bark feel compelled to grovel before it."hIts magnificent bark conveys a sense of majesty. Anyone hearing it can't help but grovel before it."|In rivers with fast-flowing water, this Pokémon will cling to a rock by using its thick lips, which act like a suction cup."uThis Pokémon's sweat is a slimy mucus. When captured, Poliwhirl can slither from its enemies' grasp and escape."�Its percentage of body fat is nearly zero. Its body is entirely muscle, which makes it heavy and forces its swimming prowess to develop."`If Poliwag and Poliwhirl hear its echoing cry, they respond by gathering from far and wide."It can read others' minds and will teleport away when danger approaches. You must clear your mind if you want to catch it."yIt stares at a silver spoon to amplify its psychic powers before it lets loose. Apparently, gold spoons are no good."�Alakazam's brain continually grows, making its head far too heavy to support with its neck. This Pokémon holds its head up using its psychokinetic power instead."�Machop exercises by hefting around a Graveler as if it were a barbell. There are some Machop that travel the world in a quest to master all kinds of martial arts."�Machoke works out every day even as it helps with tough labor. On its days off, this Pokémon heads to the fields and mountains to exercise and train."�It can lift heavy loads with the greatest of ease. It can even heft dump trucks. But its clumsy fingers prevent it from doing any precision work."�Bellsprout's thin and flexible body lets it bend and sway to avoid any attack. From its mouth, this Pokémon spits a corrosive fluid that melts even iron."mIf its prey is bigger than its mouth, it slices up the victim with sharp leaves, then eats every morsel."�It attracts prey with aromatic honey, then melts them in its mouth. Acid that has dissolved many prey becomes sweeter, making it even more alluring."zTentacool is not a particularly strong swimmer. It drifts across the surface of shallow seas as it searches for prey."�It communicates with others of its kind by lighting up the red orbs on its head. When the orbs are blinking, it's a warning sign."�The longer it lives, the more its edges are chipped and worn away. However, this Pokémon's heart will remain hard, craggy, and rough always."�This Pokémon will climb a mountain from the base to the summit, crunchingly feasting on rocks all the while. Upon reaching the peak, it rolls back down to the bottom."When Golem grow old, they stop shedding their shells. Those that have lived a long, long time have shells green with moss."�Geodude compete against each other with headbutts. The iron sand on their heads will stick to whichever one has stronger magnetism."�They eat rocks and often get into a scrap over them. The shock of Graveler smashing together causes a flash of light and a booming noise."�It fires rocks charged with electricity. Even if the rock isn't fired that accurately, just grazing an opponent will cause numbness and fainting."eAbout an hour after birth, its fiery mane and tail grow out, giving it an impressive appearance."cVery competitive, this Pokémon will chase anything that moves fast in the hopes of racing it."{This Pokémon will look into your eyes and read the contents of your heart. If it finds evil there, it promptly hides away."�Brave and prideful, this Pokémon dashes airily through the forest, its steps aided by the psychic power stored in the fur on its fetlocks."�Slowpoke uses its tail to catch prey by dipping it in rivers. However, it often forgets what it's doing and spends entire days just loafing at water's edge."�A metamorphosed Shellder has latched onto Slowbro's tail. The tail can't be used for fishing anymore, forcing Slowbro to grudgingly swim and catch prey instead."bWhen its head was bitten, toxins entered Slowpoke's head and unlocked an extraordinary power."|Because Galarian Slowpoke eat the seeds of a plant that grows only in Galar, their tails have developed a spicy flavor."�If this Pokémon squeezes the tongue of the Shellder biting it, the Shellder will launch a toxic liquid from the tip of its shell."cSlowking can solve any problem present to it, but no one can understand a thing Slowking says."{It's frequently the cause of power outages, which is why some power plants send out electrical signals that it can't stand."`When rain clouds form, many Magneton gather in high places to wait for lightning to strike."ZIt evolved from exposure to a special magnetic field. Three units generate magnetism."�The stalk this Pokémon carries in its wings serves as a sword to cut down opponents. In a dire situation, the stalk can also serve as food."~The stalks of leeks are thicker and longer in the Galar region. Farfetch'd that adapted to these stalks took on a unique form."�After deflecting attacks with its hard leaf shield, it strikes back with its sharp leek stalk. The leek stalk is both weapon and food."kBy alternately raising and lowering its two heads, it balances itself to be more stable while running."uIt collects data and plans three times as wisely, but it may think too much and fall into a state of immobility."�Seel hunts in the frigid sea underneath sheets of ice. When it needs to breathe, it breaks through the ice with the sharply protruding section of its head."aIt sunbathes on the beach after meals. The rise in its body temperature helps its digestion."�Its main source of food is the slimy industrial waste of factories. This Pokémon's numbers have been decreasing in recent years."�Their food sources have decreased, and their numbers have declined sharply. Sludge ponds are being built to prevent their extinction."mA Grimer, which had been brought in to solve a problem with garbage, developed over time into this form."xThe garbage it eats causes continuous chemical changes in its body, which produce its exceedingly vivid coloration."�This Pokémon's tongue is always hanging out. It uses its tongue with great dexterity to dig up sand from the seabed in its search for food."Cloyster swims by swallowing water, then jetting it out toward the rear. It shoots spikes from its shell using the same system."�When exposed to a strong wind, a Gastly's gaseous body quickly dwindles away. They cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind."jOn moonless nights, Haunter searches for someone to curse, so it's best not to go out walking around."Should you feel yourself attacked by a sudden chill, it is evidence of an approaching Gengar. There is no escaping it. Give up."~Onix has a magnet in its brain. It acts as a compass so that this Pokémon does not lose direction while it is tunneling."jIt chews its way through boulders with its sturdy jaws. Its eyes can see in the darkness underground."�Its crystalline parts resist all attempts to identify them. Titanix's gravitational abilities make some scientists speculate the crystals are neutron matter."wA Pokémon that nourishes itself by eating dreams, it is thought to share common ancestry with Munna and Musharna."uWhile it is an extremely dangerous Pokémon, people who are in need of a good, sound sleep call it their savior."jIf it senses danger approaching, it cloaks itself with bubbles from its mouth so it will look bigger."�Kingler has an enormous, oversized claw, which it waves in the air to communicate with others. However, because the claw is so heavy, it quickly tires."Its claw has become so large that if it finds itself unable to clamp its opponent, it will just smack them with the blunt side."jIt rolls to move. If the ground is uneven, a sudden jolt from hitting a bump can cause it to explode."�They appear in great numbers at electric power plants. Because they feed on electricity, they cause massive and chaotic blackouts in nearby cities."zWhen excited, it discharges the electric current it has stored in its belly, then lets out a great, uproarious laugh."^The tissue on the surface of its body is curiously similar in composition to an Apricorn."gDiscovered by Attea the Silly at around the 80s, these groovy Voltorbs help bring guests to clubs."~It wears sunglasses to protect its own eyes from its many lights, recently several have been imported to the Orre region."�These Pokémon get nervous when they're not in a group of six. The minute even one member of the group goes missing, Exeggcute become cowardly."}Each of its three heads has its own thoughts. When they want to go in different directions, Exeggutor becomes unable to move."�As it grew taller and taller, it outgrew its reliance on psychic powers, while within it awakened the power of the sleeping dragon."�This Pokémon wears the skull of its deceased mother. Sometimes Cubone's dreams make it cry, but each tear Cubone sheds makes it stronger."}This Pokémon overcame its sorrow to evolve a sturdy new body. Marowak faces its opponents bravely, using a bone as a weapon."vIts custom is to mourn its lost companions. Mounds of dirt by the side of the road mark the graves of the Marowak"kTo brush up on its fighting skills, it will challenge anyone. It has a very strong competitive spirit."WIts legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach."mIts punches slice the air. They are launched at such high speed, even a slight graze could cause a burn."tIf you are enchanted by its smooth, dance-like kicks, you may get a closer experience with one than you'd like."�It licks filth clean with its tongue. Whatever it licks always stinks afterward, so whether it's really clean is... questionable."Their saliva contains lots of components that can dissolve anything. The numbness caused by their lick does not dissipate."�Getting up close to a Koffing will give you a chance to observe, through its thin skin, the toxic gasses swirling inside. It blows up at the slightest stimulation."fTop-grade perfume is made using its internal poison gasses by diluting them to the highest level."Long ago, during a time when droves of factories fouled the air with pollution, Weezing changed into this form for some reason."�It is so dense, while on a run it forgets why it started running in the first place. It apparently remembers sometimes if it demolishes something."�Rhydon has a horn that serves as a drill. This Pokémon occasionally rams into streams of magma, but the armor-like hide prevents it from feeling the heat."lIt puts rocks in holes in its palms and uses its muscles to shoot them. Geodude are shot at rare times."rIt carefully carries a round, white rock that it thinks is an egg. It's bothered by how curly its hair looks."hIt walks carefully to prevent its egg from breaking. However, it is extremely fast at running away."]This kindhearted Pokémon nurses sick Pokémon to health. It senses feelings of sadness."�Its vines snap off easily and painlessly if they are grabbed, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by new growth the very next day."WIts vines grow so profusely that, in the warm season, you can't even see its eyes."�Though it looks like a plant, its green color comes from its jade scales. Looking into its eyes is said to bring three years of bad luck."�While the snakes covering it are hard as granite, its skin is soft. Predators attacking its unprotected limbs have to contend with its powerful digging claws."�Although it's carrying its baby in a pouch on its belly, Kangaskhan is swift on its feet. It intimidates its opponents with quick jabs."|Mother and daughter fight alongside each other, delivering blows in quick succession. Their battle bond is unbreakable."�They swim with dance-like motions and cause whirlpools to form. Horsea compete to see which of them can generate the biggest whirlpool."�It's the males that raise the offspring. While Seadra are raising young, the spines on their backs secrete thicker and stronger poison."`It stores energy by sleeping at underwater depths at which no other life-forms can survive."�Although known for their splendid tail fins, Goldeen apparently compete among themselves to see whose horn is thickest and sharpest."Trainers who are crazy for Seaking are divided into horn enthusiasts and fin enthusiasts. The two groups do not get along well."kThey obsessively count the pebbles in their rivers, becoming irate if the result is an unlucky number."�Fearsome Pokémon lining a river in a grand procession is a sign of a Makyan Seaking. They offer endless blessings in exchange for servitude."�This Pokémon gets nibbled on by Lumineon and others. Thanks to its red core, it regenerates fast, so it's unconcerned by their snack attacks."�This Pokémon has an organ known as its core. The organ glows in seven colors when Starmie is unleashing its potent psychic powers."^It habitually mimics foes. Once mimicked, the foe cannot take its eyes off this Pokémon."hEmanations from its fingertips solidify the air into invisible walls that repel even harsh attacks."uIt can radiate chilliness from the bottoms of its feet. It'll spend the whole day tap-dancing on a frozen floor."mIts amusing movements make it very popular. It releases its psychic power from the pattern on its belly."�While young, they live together deep in the mountains, training themselves in how to fight with their scythes and move at high speeds."ZIt has a steel-hard body. It intimidates foes by upraising its eye-patterned pincers."�Only exceptionally aggressive or well-trained Pokémon will willingly engage one in combat. Its ripping pincers threaten to turn foes to shrapnel."iA violent creature that fells towering trees with its crude axes and shields itself with hard stone."�If its face gets even slightly dirty, Smoochum will bathe immediately. But if its body gets dirty, Smoochum doesn't really seem to care."cIts cries sound like human speech. However, it is impossible to tell what it is trying to say."�It's not good at storing electricity yet. This Pokémon sneaks into people's homes, looking for electrical outlets to eat electricity from."�While it's often blamed for power outages, the truth is the cause of outages is more often an error on the part of the electric company."�In terms of electrical-energy output, Electivire is one of the best among all Electric Pokémon. It discharges high-voltage currents from its tails."�This Pokémon makes its home near volcanoes. At the end of the day, Magby soaks in magma, resting and recovering from the day's fatigue."_When it breathes deeply, heat mirages form around its body, making it hard to see clearly."�When Magmortar inhales deeply, the fire burning in its belly intensifies, rising in temperature to over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit."nAlthough it's tough, it can't handle cold well. When night falls, it buries itself in leafage and sleeps."�When the buzz of its wings becomes a roar, it's about to bolt at full speed. It isn't uncommon for its charges to send opponents through buildings."fWith its Herculean powers, it can easily throw around an object that is 100 times its own weight."They can be seen watching the sky, trying to find a place to stand for when they inevitably attempt to deadlift the world."}When Tauros begins whipping itself with its tails, it's a warning that the Pokémon is about to charge with astounding speed."�Miltank's milk has been sought after due to its taste and nutrition. The local treat of Castelia City, Casteliacones, is made from fresh Moomoo Milk."�Its swimming muscles are weak, so it is easily washed away by currents. In places where water pools, you can see many Magikarp deposited there by the flow."gBrutally vicious and enormously destructive. Known for totally destroying cities in ancient times."oOnce endangered, they are now overabundant. Their mournful songs have died out as the population rebounds."�The musical staff around its body is made of ice particles. The symbols are indecipherable, but some say they've heard Saurenaid speak its own language."sWith its astonishing capacity for metamorphosis, it can get along with anything - except for its fellow Ditto."iEevee has an unstable genetic makeup that suddenly mutates due to the environment in which it lives."`When Vaporeon's fins begin to vibrate, it is a sign that rain will come within a few hours."zIts lungs contain an organ that creates electricity. The crackling sound of electricity can be heard when it exhales."_A dedicated omnivore, Flareon will eat anything - as long as it's been slow-roasted first."tIts fur is so sensitive, it can feel minute shifts in the air and predict the weather...and its foes' thoughts."qWhen exposed to the moon's aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it's filled with a mysterious power."aJust like a plant, it uses photosynthesis. As a result, it is always enveloped in clear air."_It lowers its body heat to freeze its fur. The hairs then become like needles it can fire."�Sylveon's ribbon-like feelers emit an aura that erases any sense of hostility, enabling it to stop fights. It wraps its feelers to its Trainer in order to read their feelings."|Its fluffiness, friendliness, and massive size make it beloved by nearly everyone. Attackers don't know where to begin."~This Pokémon was created using the cutting-edge science of 20 years ago, so many parts of it have since become obsolete."ZWith planetary development software installed, it became capable of working in space."zIts programming was modified to enable it to travel through alien dimensions. Seems there might have been an error..."�Rely on LuxTech's literal firewall! Featuring a unique* typing and cutting-edge network threat purgation protocols, this innovative new form has your back."�Because some Omanyte manage to escape after being restored or are released into the wild by people, this species is becoming a problem."|Its heavy shell is thought to be the reason this ancient Pokémon died out. It's apparently a distant ancestor of Octillery."rThis species is almost entirely extinct. Kabuto molt every three days, making their shells harder and harder."vKabutops slices its prey apart and sucks out the fluids. The discarded body parts become food for other Pokémon."�It flew through the open skies over the ancient continent as if they were its own. When it touched ground, its walk was weak and slow."tIn ancient times, this Pokémon was an apex predator. It has the strength to fly with a Tyrantrum in its claws."vIt conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing."Its stomach is said to be incomparably strong. Even Muk's poison is nothing more than a hint of spice on Snorlax's tongue."�Dratini continually molts and sloughs off its old skin. It does so because the life energy within its body steadily builds to reach uncontrollable levels."�Dragonair stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter weather conditions in its vicinity via crystals on its neck and tail."^It is said to make its home somewhere in the sea. It guides crews of shipwrecks to shore."eA legendary bird Pokémon that is said to appear to doomed people who are lost in icy mountains."cThis legendary bird Pokémon is said to appear only when a thundercloud parts into two halves."gOne of the legendary bird Pokémon. It is said that its appearance indicates the coming of spring."zIts feather-like blades are composed of psychic energy and can shear through thick iron sheets as if they were paper."�One kick from its powerful legs will pulverize a dump truck. Supposedly, this Pokémon runs through the mountains at over 180 mph."�This Pokémon's sinister, flame-like aura will consume the spirit of any creature it hits. Victims become burned-out shadows of themselves."tCreated from the DNA of Mew, this Pokémon is a dangerous combination of overwhelming power and a savage heart."�It's very intelligent and can use an incredible variety of moves. Many believe that all other Pokémon are descendants of this one."bIt uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe."MThe buds that ring its neck give off a spicy aroma that perks people up."eMeganium's breath has the power to revive dead grass and plants. It can make them healthy again."[It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously."kBe careful if it turns its back during battle. It means that it will attack with the fire on its back."bIt has a secret, devastating move. It rubs its blazing fur together to cause huge explosions."�Said to purify lost, forsaken souls with its flames and guide them to the afterlife. Its form had been influenced by the energy of Mt. Coronet."jIts powerful, well-developed jaws are capable of crushing anything. Even its Trainer must be careful."eOnce it bites down, it won't let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place."kWhen it bites with its massive and powerful jaws, it shakes its head and savagely tears its victim up."�This Pokémon is very cautious. It stands on its tail in order to see enemies from far away. If it does then it alert its pack by thumping its tail on the ground."rIt makes a nest to suit its long and skinny body. It uses tunnels in order to make a quick getaway from foes."tThe eye on its stomach enables its psychic powers and never blinks. Dirt and dust are telekinetically repelled."|It burrows at night, leaving only the eye on its stomach exposed. The eye will stare into space while the rest of it sleeps."\It always stands on one foot. It changes feet so fast, the movement can rarely be seen."_When it needs to think, it rotates its head 180 degrees to sharpen its intellectual power."}Its down insulates it against any cold. In winter it will lay dormant beneath snow banks, only to pop out during spring."iWhen its shadow passes over someone, they feel a horrible chill. Some Trainers find it invigorating."jIt is timid and clusters together with others. The fluid secreted by its feet indicates its location."lThe spot patterns on its back grow larger or smaller depending on the number of stars in the night sky."kIt lies still in the same pose for days in its web, waiting for its unsuspecting prey to wander close."jIt attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends."kIt shoots positive and negative electricity between the tips of its two antennae and zaps its enemies."{It blinds prey with an intense burst of light. With the prey incapacitated, the Pokémon swallows it in a single gulp."}Togepi shares its joy with the people who take care of it. It can act maliciously, causing havoc and bad luck to its enemies."cThey say that it will appear before kindhearted, caring people and shower them with happiness."eIt shares many blessings with people who respect one another's rights and avoid needless strife."oIt usually forages for food on the ground but may, on rare occasions, hop onto branches to peck at shoots."kThey say that it stays still and quiet because it is seeing both the past and future at the same time."bIt stores lots of air in its soft fur, allowing it to stay cool in summer and warm in winter."oIf its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact."gThe tail's tip shines brightly and can be seen from far away. It acts as a beacon for lost people."\It swings its large, nutrient-filled tail around to fight opponents bigger than itself."^The tip of its tail is filled with oil that is lighter than water, so it acts as a float."^The bubble-like pattern on its stomach helps it camouflage itself when it's in the water."kIt prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level."nIt disguises itself as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining."jIt drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way."bIt spreads its petals to absorb sunlight. It also floats in the air to get closer to the sun."lEven in the fiercest wind, it can control its fluff to make its way to any place in the world it wants."dIts tail is so powerful that it can use it to grab a tree branch and hold itself up in the air."STo eat, it deftly shucks nuts with its two tails. It rarely uses its arms now."nIt lives by drinking only dewdrops from under the leaves of plants. It is said that it eats nothing else."]It gets energy from warm sunlight and is known for its habit of moving in pursuit of it."jIf it flaps its wings really fast, it can generate shock waves that will shatter windows in the area."{This six-legged Pokémon is easily capable of transporting an adult in flight. The wings on its tail help it stay balanced."dWhen the temperature cools in the evening, they emerge from water to seek food along the shore."eThis carefree Pokémon has an easygoing nature. While swimming, it always bumps into boat hulls."eFeared and loathed by many, it is believed to bring misfortune to all those who see it at night."QBecoming active at night, it is known to swarm with numerous Murkrow in tow."cIt likes playing mischievous tricks, such as screaming and wailing to startle people at night."`Its cries sound like incantations to torment the foe. It appears where you least expect it."\Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or Unown came first."XIt grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit."hTo keep its pitch-black tail hidden, it lives quietly in the darkness. It is never first to attack."kIts tail has a small brain of its own. Beware! If you get close, it may react to your scent by biting."�Now that the brain waves from the head and tail are synced up, the psychic power of this Pokémon is 10 times stronger than Girafarig's."eIt looks just like a pinecone. Its shell protects it from bird Pokémon that peck it by mistake."mIt remains immovably rooted to its tree. It scatters pieces of its hard shell to drive its enemies away."�Scientists believe that it used to fly with its wings during ancient times. Nowadays it burrows under the ground, sharing tunnels with other Pokémon."�This Pokémon uses its hard tail to make its nest by boring holes into bedrock deep underground. The nest can reach lengths of over six miles."wThe gentle Dududunsparce will put Pokémon that wander into its nest onto its back and carry them to the entrance."fIt flies straight at its target's face, then clamps down on the startled victim to inject poison."uIts flight is soundless. It uses its lengthy tail to carry off its prey... Then its elongated fangs do the rest."]Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute."eIt can make most any Pokémon run away simply by opening its mouth wide to reveal its big fangs."hThe small spikes covering its body developed from scales. They inject a toxin that causes fainting."nFishers detest this troublesome Pokémon because it sprays poison from its spines, getting it everywhere."{Its lancelike spikes and savage temperament have earned it the nickname "sea fiend." It slurps up poison to nourish itself."oIt stores berries inside its shell. To avoid attacks, it hides beneath rocks and remains completely still."eIts paws conceal sharp claws. If attacked, it suddenly extends the claws and startles its enemy."kThey live in cold regions, forming groups of four or five that hunt prey with impressive coordination."�Its sturdy, curved claws are ideal for traversing precipitous cliffs. From the tips of these claws drips a nerve-destroying venom."�Because of Sneasler's virulent poison and daunting physical prowess, no other species could hope to best it on frozen highlands."cBefore food becomes scarce in wintertime, its habit is to hoard food in many hidden locations."mAlthough it has a large body, it is quite skilled at climbing trees. It eats and sleeps in the treetops."�It is believed that the swampy terrain of its ancient home region gave Ursaluna its burly physique and capacity to manipulate peat at will."YIts body is made of magma. If it doesn't keep moving, its body will cool and harden."gIts body is as hot as lava and is always billowing. Flames will occasionally burst from its shell."]If it smells something enticing, it dashes off headlong to find the source of the aroma."cBecause the long hair all over its body obscures its sight, it just keeps charging repeatedly."hIts impressive tusks are made of ice. The population thinned when it turned warm after the ice age."pThey prefer unpolluted southern seas. Their coral branches lose their color and deteriorate in dirty water."|Sudden climate change wiped out this ancient kind of Corsola. This Pokémon absorbs others' life-force through its branches."lBe cautious of the ectoplasmic body surrounding its soul. You'll become stiff as stone if you touch it."iUsing its dorsal fin as a suction pad, it clings to a Mantine's underside to scavenge for leftovers."eIt traps foes with the suction cups on its tentacles, then smashes them with its rock-hard head."vWhen it swims close to the surface of the ocean, people aboard ships are able to observe the pattern on its back."iWhile elegantly swimming in the sea, it ignores Remoraid that cling to its fins seeking food scraps."�Food rots and milk curdles in their presence. Because of this, they're commonly seen fleeing from angered Pokémon such as Miltank or Alcremie."�It pelts houses with hail that sounds like knocking, trying to get those inside to open a door or window. People used to import Skarmory to defend against them."^It carries food all day long. When someone is lost in the mountains, it shares that food."UDespite being clad entirely in iron-hard armor, it flies at speeds over 180 mph."`To corner prey, they check each other's location using barks that only they can understand."bThe flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever."~They are the steeds of the Elite Four of the Apocalypse, and their howls will ring in the end of days... or so the stories go."�Phanpy uses its snout to shower itself with water. However its snout is so strong that when it bumps into you, it may send you flying."cThe longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take long to grow."kThe curved antlers subtly change the flow of air to create a strange space where reality is distorted."�The black orbs shine with an uncanny light when the Pokémon is erecting invisible barriers. The fur shed from its beard retains heat well."bOnce it becomes an adult, it has a tendency to let its comrades plant footprints on its back."uBorn deep underground, it comes aboveground and becomes a pupa once it has finished eating the surrounding soil."iIts shell is as hard as sheet rock, and it is also very strong. Its thrashing can topple a mountain."`If it rampages, it knocks down mountains and buries rivers. Maps must be redrawn afterward."{Mechanitar was discovered by Valrex. It is highly intelligent and non-confrontational, tending to avoid battle if possible."�Raikou embodies the speed of lightning. The roars of this Pokémon send shock waves shuddering through the air and shake the ground as if lightning bolts had come crashing down."�Entei embodies the passion of magma. This Pokémon is thought to have been born in the eruption of a volcano. It sends up massive bursts of fire that utterly consume all that they touch."�Suicune embodies the compassion of a pure spring of water. It runs across the land with gracefulness. This Pokémon has the power to purify dirty water."hIt is said to be the guardian of the seas. It is rumored to have been seen on the night of a storm."jA legend says that its body glows in seven colors. A rainbow is said to form behind it when it flies."�This Pokémon traveled through time to come from the future. It bolsters grass and trees with its own strength, and it can heal wounds, too."�Treecko has small hooks on the bottom of its feet that enable it to scale vertical walls. This Pokémon attacks by slamming foes with its thick tail."�The leaves growing out of Grovyle's body are convenient for camouflaging it from enemies in the forest. This Pokémon is a master at climbing trees in jungles."�The leaves growing on Sceptile's body are very sharp edged. This Pokémon is very agile - it leaps all over the branches of trees and jumps on its foe from above or behind."�Torchic has a place inside its body where it keeps its flame. Give it a hug - it will be glowing with warmth. This Pokémon is covered all over by a fluffy coat of down."uCombusken battles with the intensely hot flames it spews from its beak and with outstandingly destructive kicks."�Blaziken has incredibly strong legs - it can easily clear a 30-story building in one leap. This Pokémon's blazing punches leave its foes scorched and blackened."�In water, Mudkip breathes using the gills on its cheeks. If it is faced with a tight situation in battle, this Pokémon will unleash its amazing power."�The surface of Marshtomp's body is enveloped by a thin, sticky film that enables it to live on land. This Pokémon plays in mud on beaches."_It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms."tIt has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track."gIt chases down prey in a pack of around ten. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork."bA Pokémon with abundant curiosity. It shows an interest in everything, so it always zigzags."fIt charges prey at speeds over 60 mph. However, because it can only run straight, it often fails."lThought to be the oldest form of Zigzagoon, it moves in zigzags and wreaks havoc upon its surroundings."\This very aggressive Pokémon will recklessly challenge opponents stronger than itself."�It evolved after experiencing numerous fights. While crossing its arms, it lets out a shout that would make any opponent flinch."jIt lives among the tall grass and in forests. It repels attacks by raising up the spikes on its rear."eIt drinks dew that collects on its silk and waits for evolution. Its hard cocoon repels attacks."gIt has an aggressive nature. It stabs prey with its long, narrow mouth to drain the prey's fluids."cIt never forgets any attack it endured while in the cocoon. After evolution, it seeks payback."iIt violently flutters its wings to scatter toxic dust when attacked. It becomes active after sunset."�Its horns efficiently regulate its body temperature. It seeks out Fire- and Ice-type predators to charge itself with energy for evolution."�Its silk makes it blend in with snowy rocks. If attacked, its only recourse is to make itself unappetizing by chilling its own body."�It is less hostile than the Hoennian form, but vicious towards former predators. Its mouthparts inject a fluid similar to liquid nitrogen."}Its flame is kept burning by an organ similar to a Bunsen burner. Curious Pokémon often try to put it out, to no avail."�Its abdomen is actually a sophisticated torch drive. Their migrations can be tracked by following broken trees left by supersonic flybys."lIt searches about for clean water. If it does not drink water for too long, the leaf on its head wilts."fIt has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere."]The rhythm of bright, festive music activates Ludicolo's cells, making it more powerful."gWhen it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon."mIt lives deep in forests. With the leaf on its head, it makes a flute whose song makes listeners uneasy."bBy flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 feet per second that can level houses."�This Pokémon is very gutsy and will fight powerful opponents without backing down. On the other hand, when it is hungry it will weaken and cry loudly."bIt dives at a steep angle as soon as it spots its prey. It catches its prey with sharp claws."WIt makes its nest on steep sea cliffs. Riding updrafts, it soars to great heights."\It is a messenger of the skies, carrying small Pokémon and eggs to safety in its bill."bIt is highly attuned to the emotions of people and Pokémon. It hides if it senses hostility."cIt has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future."_It has the power to predict the future. Its power peaks when it is protecting its Trainer."\A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows."�Its legs can generate oils, helping it glide through the water. The antenna on its head can secrete a thick, sugary syrup that is used to attract prey."_It flaps its four wings to hover and fly freely in any direction--to and fro and sideways."cIt spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled."jIt scatters poisonous spores and throws powerful punches while its foe is hampered by inhaled spores."kIf it eats just three leaves in a day, it is satisfied. Other than that, it sleeps for 20 hours a day."dIts stress level rises if it cannot keep moving constantly. Too much stress makes it feel sick."~It is the world's most slothful Pokémon. However, it can exert horrifying power by releasing pent-up energy all at once."lIt can sometimes live underground for more than 10 years. It absorbs nutrients from the roots of trees."aBecause it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap."ZA most peculiar Pokémon that somehow appears in a Poké Ball when a Nincada evolves."`If it senses danger, it scares the foe by crying out with the volume of a jet-plane engine."XThe shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up."ZIts roar in battle shakes the ground like a tremor--or like an earthquake has struck."hIt grows stronger by enduring harsh training. It is a gutsy Pokémon that can withstand any attack."hIt loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts."`Its magnetic nose consistently faces north. Travelers check Nosepass to get their bearings."QIt freely controls three small units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force."HIt shows its cute side by chasing its own tail until it gets dizzy."]It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest."bIt dwells in the darkness of caves. It uses its sharp claws to dig up gems to nourish itself."�Attackers find their weaknesses and regrets reflected in the jewel Rubarior carries. If it feels unloved, it will make its Trainer cry."`Attached to its head is a huge set of jaws formed by horns. It can chew through iron beams."�Fans argue whether it's the cutest terrifying Pokémon or the creepiest cute Pokémon. It will act cute or scary depending on its trainer's whims."�When Aron evolves, its steel armor peels off. In ancient times, people would collect Aron's shed armor and make good use of it in their daily lives."�During territorial disputes, Lairon fight by slamming into each other. Close inspection of their steel armor reveals scratches and dents."�Long ago, there was a king who wore a helmet meant to resemble the head of an Aggron. He was trying to channel the Pokémon's strength."_It eats just one berry a day. By enduring hunger, its spirit is tempered and made sharper."WThrough yoga training, it gained the psychic power to predict its foe's next move."�This Pokémon can go up to four years without eating a single meal. Through intense training, it is able to fight in a manner indistinguishable from a dance."hIt stores static electricity in its fur for discharging. It gives off sparks if a storm approaches."iIt discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts."XIf not calmed during storms, it will cause havoc by trying to race lightning bolts."dIt absorbs electricity from telephone poles. It shorts out its body to create crackling noises."]It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks."oIt lives around clean ponds. At night, its rear lights up. It converses with others by flashing its light."WWith its sweet aroma, it guides Volbeat to draw signs with light in the night sky."kOver the winter, it closes its bud and endures the cold. In spring, the bud opens and releases pollen."jRoselia that drink nutritionally rich springwater are said to reveal rare coloration when they bloom."eWith the movements of a dancer, it strikes with whips that are densely lined with poison thorns."mThere is nothing its stomach can't digest. While it is digesting, vile, overpowering gases are expelled."YIt gulps anything that fits in its mouth. Its special enzymes can dissolve anything."eIt lives in massive rivers that course through jungles. It swarms prey that enter its territory."gIt can swim at speeds of 75 mph by jetting seawater through its body. It is the bandit of the sea."�Its propulsion system is the basis for many ramjet engine designs. It eats four times its body weight in food before a battle and will still be hungry by the end."pIt eats one ton of food every day. It plays by shooting stored seawater out its blowholes with great force."bThe biggest of all Pokémon. It can dive to a depth of almost 10,000 feet on only one breath."pThe magma in its body reaches 2,200 degrees Fahrenheit. Its hump gets smaller when it uses Fire-type moves."nIf angered, the humps on its back erupt in a shower of molten lava. It lives in the craters of volcanoes."�Magma builds up in its body over time. If this Pokémon does not regularly erupt, it might accidentally destroy the area around it."\It burns coal inside its shell for energy. It blows out black soot if it is endangered."kIt bounces around on its tail to keep its heart pumping. It carries a pearl from Clamperl on its head."gIt uses black pearls to amplify its psychic power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes."_The chances of two Spinda having identical spot patterns is less than one in four billion."gIt makes an inescapable conical pit and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down."}It generates ultrasonic waves by violently flapping its wings. After making its prey faint, it melts the prey with acid."hKnown as "The Desert Spirit," this Pokémon hides in the sandstorms it causes by beating its wings."kIt prefers harsh environments such as deserts. It can survive for 30 days on water stored in its body."^Packs of them follow travelers through the desert until the travelers can no longer move."iSwablu is very friendly towards humans, so a Swablu may land on your head and act like a fluffy hat."�Altarias often glide through the clouds while singing or humming. While normally kind, Altaria will attack foes without mercy if provoked."�This Pokémon's singing can bring even the most stoic Trainers to tears. Those who fall asleep on it are said to experience beautiful dreams."eIts fur would all stand on end if it smelled a Seviper nearby. Its sharp claws tear up its foes."kConstant polishing makes the edge of the blade on its tail extremely sharp. It's Zangoose's archrival."�Even being bisected by a Seviper's tail couldn't quell its rage. It attacks enemies on a physical and spiritual level simultaneously."~Its iron body is impenetrable to nearly all attacks. When coiled, it can fire metal projectiles using magnetic induction."iIt was discovered at the site of a meteor strike 40 years ago. Its stare can lull its foes to sleep."jIt absorbs solar energy during the day. Always expressionless, it can sense what its foe is thinking."cIts whiskers make a superb radar. They are used to locate prey, even in the murkiest of water."kIt makes its nest at the bottom of swamps. It will eat anything--if it is alive, Whiscash will eat it."dIts hardy vitality enables it to adapt to any environment. Its pincers will never release prey."xLoving to battle, this Pokémon pinches all Pokémon that enter its territory with its pincers and throws them out."bIt moves by spinning on its foot. It is a rare Pokémon that was discovered in ancient ruins."SIt is said that it originates from clay dolls made by an ancient civilization."This Pokémon was restored from a fossil. Lileep once lived in warm seas that existed approximately 100,000,000 years ago."�It has short legs and can't walk very fast, but its neck and tentacles can extend to over three times their usual length to nab distant prey."�Anorith can swim swiftly by pulling its eight wings through the water like oars on a boat. This Pokémon is an ancestor of modern bug Pokémon."~After evolution, this Pokémon emerged onto land. Its lower body has become stronger, and blows from its tail are devastating."`It is the shabbiest Pokémon of all. It forms in schools and lives at the bottom of rivers."^It is the world's most beautiful Pokémon. There are many works of art featuring Milotic."mIt has the ability to change its form into the sun, the rain, or a snow cloud, depending on the weather."uIt changes its shading to match its surroundings so it can sneak up on prey. Only its belly patterns stay fixed."gIt loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live."qStrong feelings of hatred turned a puppet into a Pokémon. If it opens its mouth, its cursed energy escapes."�Its pink claws and feet appear to be made of flesh, but are actually raw negative energy. When it is finally fully unzipped, it moves on to its next life."kIf it finds bad children who won't listen to their parents, it will spirit them away--or so it's said."_Its body is hollow. It is said that those who look into its body are sucked into the void."`It comes to those whose lives have come to an end and escorts their souls to the afterlife."sThe bunch of fruit around its neck ripens twice a year and is delicious. It's a highly favored tropical snack."hThere is an orb inside its mouth. When it hops, the orb bounces all over and makes a ringing sound."MEmitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances."�Swift as the wind, Absol races through fields and mountains. Its curved, bow-like horn is acutely sensitive to the warning signs of natural disasters."�It's loved for its elegantly intimidating looks. It may herald a coming cataclysm, but nothing gets between a trainer and a fashionable Pokémon."TIn Sinnoh, certain folklore says a house will prosper if a Snorunt lives there."_It can instantly freeze moisture in the atmosphere. It uses this power to freeze its foes."�It only closes its mouth to bite its foes, forcing its trainers to learn to interpret its emotions via its changes in eye shape, ear direction, and body temperature."fLegends in snowy regions say that a woman who was lost on an icy mountain was reborn as Froslass."iIt's more efficient for Spheal to roll than to walk. When this Pokémon is happy, it claps its fins."tThis Pokémon has a habit of spinning round things on its nose, whether those things are Poké Balls or Spheal."�Walrein's tusks keep growing throughout its life. Tusks broken in battle will grow back to their usual impressive size in a year."YIt is protected by a sturdy shell. Once in a lifetime, it makes a magnificent pearl."cIt lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey."qIts swimming form is exquisitely elegant. With its thin mouth, it feeds on seaweed that grows between rocks."�This Pokémon was discovered during deep-sea exploration. Its appearance hasn't changed in 100,000,000 years, so it's called a living fossil."fDuring the spawning season, countless Luvdisc congregate at coral reefs, turning the waters pink."dIt gently holds injured and weak Pokémon in its fins. Its special membrane heals their wounds."�Bagon is a solitary Pokémon that doesn't form groups with others of its kind. It also has a head hard enough to cleave a boulder in one strike."�Shelgon ignores its hunger entirely, never eating any food. Apparently, Shelgon will evolve once all its energy stores are used up."�While basking in the joy of flight generally keeps this Pokémon in high spirits, Salamence turns into an uncontrollable menace if something angers it."}From its rear, Beldum emits a magnetic force that rapidly pulls opponents in. They get skewered on Beldum's sharp claws."�Using magnetic forces to stay aloft, this Pokémon flies at high speeds, weaving through harsh mountain terrain in pursuit of prey."�Metagross is the result of the fusion of two Metang. This Pokémon defeats its opponents through use of its supercomputer-level brain."sThe third of the titans, built to commemorate an era of stonecraft. It is as resilient as an ancient monolith."qThe second of the titans, built to commemorate an era of ice. It is as implacable as an encroaching glacier."~The fourth of the titans, built to commemorate an era of metalworking. It is as unfailing as a master swordsmith's blade."The fifth of the titans, built to commemorate an era of electricity. It is as inscrutable as a cutting-edge supercomputer."vThe first of the titans, built to commemorate an era when dragons ruled. It is as terrifying as an apex predator."pThe creator of the titans, who shaped the primal clay in the golden age. Its creative powers are boundless."�Latias is highly sensitive to the emotions of people. If it senses any hostility, this Pokémon ruffles the feathers all over its body and cries shrilly to intimidate them."�Latios has the ability to make others see an image of what it has seen or imagines in its head. This Pokémon is intelligent and understands human speech."�Kyogre is said to be the personification of the sea itself. Legends tell of its many clashes against Groudon, as each sought to gain the power of nature."�Groudon is said to be the personification of the land itself. Legends tell of its many clashes against Kyogre, as each sought to gain the power of nature."�Rayquaza is said to have lived for hundreds of millions of years. Legends remain of how it put to rest the clash between Kyogre and Groudon."]It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years."]DNA from a space virus mutated and became a Pokémon. It appears where auroras are seen."�It relies heavily on water to keep its plant healthy, and thus it spends most of its time near lakes. When thirsty, the plant on its head wilts."VIt knows where pure water wells up. It carries fellow Pokémon there on its back."[Small Pokémon occasionally gather on its unmoving back to begin building their nests."aThe gas made in its belly burns from its rear end. The fire burns weakly when it feels sick."[It uses ceilings and walls to launch aerial attacks. Its fiery tail is but one weapon."gIt tosses its enemies around with agility. It uses all its limbs to fight in its own unique style."gBecause it is very proud, it hates accepting food from people. Its thick down guards it from cold."gIt lives a solitary life. Its wings deliver wicked blows that can snap even the thickest of trees."eThe three horns that extend from its beak attest to its power. The leader has the biggest horns."mThey flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying."XIt lives in forests and fields. Squabbles over territory occur when flocks collide."eWhen Staravia evolve into Staraptor, they leave the flock to live alone. They have sturdy wings."eIt constantly gnaws on logs and rocks to whittle down its front teeth. It nests alongside water."bIt makes its nest by damming streams with bark and mud. It is known as an industrious worker."OWhen its antennae hit each other, it sounds like the music of a xylophone."_It signals its emotions with its melodies. Scientists are studying these melodic patterns."_All of its fur dazzles if danger is sensed. It flees while the foe is momentarily blinded."mStrong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes."ZLuxray's ability to see through objects comes in handy when it's scouting for danger."jA lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with headbutts."bIts skull is as hard as iron. It is a brute that tears down jungle trees while catching prey."vIt was generated from a fossil dug out of a layer of clay that was older than anyone knows. It has a sturdy face."]Any frontal attack is repulsed. It is a docile Pokémon that feeds on grass and berries."ZIf its cloak is broken in battle, it quickly remakes the cloak with materials nearby."bWhen Burmy evolved, its cloak became a part of this Pokémon's body. The cloak is never shed."GIt flutters around at night and steals honey from the Combee hive."�It collects honey for its colony. At night, they cluster to form a beehive and sleep. If a colony loses their Vespiquen, a new Combee will take its place."\Its abdomen is a honeycomb for grubs. It raises its grubs on honey collected by Combee."fA pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity."oIt inflates the flotation sac around its neck and pokes its head out of the water to see what is going on."fIts flotation sac developed as a result of pursuing aquatic prey. It can double as a rubber raft."`It evolves by sucking the energy out of the small ball where it had been storing nutrients."kIf it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun's rays with its whole body."�The colors of this Pokémon change depending on its environment. When it senses danger, this Pokémon excretes a sticky purple liquid."eIt apparently had a huge shell for protection in ancient times. It lives in shallow tidal pools."lThese Pokémon are called the "Signpost for Wandering Spirits." Children holding them sometimes vanish."dIt's drowsy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go."nWhen it senses danger, it perks up its ears. On cold nights, it sleeps with its head tucked into its fur."bThe ears appear to be delicate. If they are touched roughly, it kicks with its graceful legs."�It patterns its fur and attacks after human fighters it looks up to. Only the most over-the-top action movies can inspire it to reach its true potential."bWhen it's happy, Glameow demonstrates beautiful movements of its tail, like a dancing ribbon."bTo make itself appear intimidatingly beefy, it tightly cinches its waist with its twin tails."cIt protects itself by spraying a noxious fluid from its rear. The stench lingers for 24 hours."gIt sprays a stinky fluid from its tail. The fluid smells worse the longer it is allowed to fester."cImplements shaped like it were discovered in ancient tombs. It is unknown if they are related."_Ancient people believed that petitioning Bronzong for rain was the way to make crops grow."XIt can learn and speak human words. If they gather, they all learn the same saying."All Spiritomb's mischief and misdeeds compelled a traveler to use a mysterious spell to bind Spiritomb to an odd keystone."�Gible attacks anything that moves, and it drags whatever it catches into the crevice that is its lair. Despite the big mouth, Gible's stomach is small."�Jewels are buried in the caves these Pokémon nest in, but you'll be torn apart by claws and fangs the moment you enter one of these caves."�Garchomp makes its home in volcanic mountains. It flies through the sky as fast as a jet airplane, hunting down as much prey as it can."]The aura that emanates from its body intensifies to alert others if it is afraid or sad."gBy reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away."�It fights in a state of complete clarity without mercy, fear, or stress. When it has achieved all its goals, it will simply cease to be."_It enshrouds itself with sand to protect itself from germs. It does not enjoy getting wet."eIt blasts internally stored sand from ports on its body to create a towering twister for attack."pIt burrows under the sand to lie in wait for prey. Its tail claws can inject its prey with a savage poison."fIt has the power in its clawed arms to make scrap of a car. The tips of its claws release poison."sInflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab."UIts knuckle claws secrete a toxin so vile that even a scratch could prove fatal."mIt binds itself to trees in marshes. It attracts prey with its sweet-smelling drool and gulps them down."�It hunts other nocturnal predators, trapping them with its sticky tendrils. Its maniacal laugh is a common sound on autumn nights."hAfter long exposure to sunlight, the patterns on its tail fins shine vividly when darkness arrives."cTo avoid detection by predators, it crawls along the seafloor using the two fins on its chest."XIn the spring, it grows berries with the texture of frozen treats around its belly."wIt lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually covered in snow. It hides itself by whipping up blizzards."{Blizzards follow it wherever it goes. It's often used as shelter by unsuspecting mountaineers, though it doesn't mind."bIts body is composed of plasma. It is known to infiltrate electronic devices and wreak havoc."mKnown as "The Being of Knowledge." It is said that it can wipe out the memory of those who see its eyes."]Known as "The Being of Emotion." It taught humans the nobility of sorrow, pain, and joy."gKnown as "The Being of Willpower." It sleeps at the bottom of a lake to keep the world in balance."\A Pokémon spoken of in legend. It is said that time began moving when Dialga was born."dIt is said to live in a gap in the spatial dimension parallel to ours. It appears in mythology."gIt dwells in volcanic caves. It digs in with its cross-shaped feet to crawl on ceilings and walls."{This Pokémon is said to live in a world on the reverse side of ours, where common knowledge is distorted and strange."yThose who sleep holding Cresselia's feather are assured of joyful dreams. It is said to represent the crescent moon."kIt drifts in warm seas. It always returns to where it was born, no matter how far it may have drifted."`It starts its life with a wondrous power that permits it to bond with any kind of Pokémon."aIt can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon."}The blooming of Gracidea flowers confers the power of flight upon it. Feelings of gratitude are the message it delivers."ZIt is told in mythology that this Pokémon was born before the universe even existed."pThey photosynthesize by bathing their tails in sunlight. When they are not feeling well, their tails droop."eWhen it gets dirty, its leaves can't be used in photosynthesis, so it always keeps itself clean."oIt can stop its opponents' movements with just a glare. It takes in solar energy and boosts it internally."bIt loves to eat roasted berries, but sometimes it gets too excited and burns them to a crisp."nWhen its internal fire flares up, its movements grow sharper and faster. When in trouble, it emits smoke."PIt has mastered fast and powerful fighting moves. It grows a beard of fire."rIt fights using the scalchop on its stomach. In response to an attack, it retaliates immediately by slashing."`As a result of strict training, each Dewott learns different forms for using the scalchops."}One swing of the sword incorporated in its armor can fell an opponent. A simple glare from one of them quiets everybody."hHard of heart and deft of blade, its turbulent blows crash into foes like ceaseless pounding waves."qExtremely cautious, one of them will always be on the lookout, but it won't notice a foe coming from behind."vWhen they see an enemy, their tails stand high, and they spit the seeds of berries stored in their cheek pouches."mThough it is a very brave Pokémon, it's also smart enough to check its foe's strength and avoid battle."bIt has black, cape-like fur that is very hard and decreases the amount of damage it receives."uBeing wrapped in its long fur is so comfortable that a person would be fine even overnight on a wintry mountain."zThey steal from people for fun, but their victims can't help but forgive them. Their deceptively cute act is perfect."jStealthily, it sneaks up on its target, striking from behind before its victim has a chance to react."nIt's good at finding berries and gathers them from all over. It's kind enough to share them with friends."tIll tempered, it fights by swinging its barbed tail around wildly. The leaf growing on its head is very bitter."vThis Pokémon lives in caves in volcanoes. The fire within the tuft on its head can reach 600 degrees Fahrenheit."pWhen it gets excited, embers rise from its head and tail and it gets hot. For some reason, it loves sweets."qThe water stored inside the tuft on its head is full of nutrients. Plants that receive its water grow large."wIt prefers places with clean water. When its tuft runs low, it replenishes it by siphoning up water with its tail."kIt eats the dreams of people and Pokémon. When it eats a pleasant dream, it expels pink-colored mist."vThe dream mist coming from its forehead changes into many different colors depending on the dream that was eaten."�When a Munna egg is placed in the care of a brooding dragon, it hatches into this form. It will repeatedly headbutt Togepi if placed near one."�Excess psychic energy is vented as smoke from the hole where its gem once was. Its heart functions as a second brain that lets it communicate telepathically."kThese Pokémon live in cities. They are accustomed to people. Flocks often gather in parks and plazas."sNo matter where in the world it goes, it knows where its nest is, so it never gets separated from its Trainer."vMales have plumage on their heads. They will never let themselves feel close to anyone other than their Trainers."wIts mane shines when it discharges electricity. They use the frequency and rhythm of these flashes to communicate."mThey have lightning-like movements. When Zebstrika run at full speed, the sound of thunder reverberates."qWhen it overflows with power, the orange crystal on its body glows. It looks for underground water in caves."�The blasts of energy it makes from sunbeams have terrifying power. However, it's not able to fire its blasts at night or on rainy days."�In Makyan myth, they were born from meteors that fell when the moon was split by an angry god. Their unfathomably dense armor deflects most anything."mIt was first unearthed in forbidden lands. Its body doesn't abide by the physical laws of this universe."It is more comfortable in alien dimensions than on Earth. The rocky parts of its body can't be analyzed by modern science."�They can't be understood or predicted, making them dangerous opponents. At the end of their lifespan they return to their home universe, reporting to a higher will."oThe heart-shaped mark left on a body after a Woobat has been attached to it is said to bring good fortune."zAnyone who comes into contact with the ultrasonic waves emitted by a courting male experiences a positive mood shift."WBy spinning its body, it can dig straight through the ground at a speed of 30 mph."zMore than 300 feet below the surface, they build mazelike nests. Their activity can be destructive to subway tunnels."uAudino's sense of hearing is superb. Not even a pebble rolling along over a mile away will escape Audino's ears."�They are brought into hospitals when conventional medicine fails. They can hear the number of heartbeats a person has left, but will never tell."iAlways carrying squared logs, they help out with construction. As they grow, they carry bigger logs."tThis Pokémon is so muscular and strongly built that even a group of wrestlers could not make it budge an inch."jRather than rely on force, they master moves that utilize the centrifugal force of spinning concrete."wBy vibrating its cheeks, it emits sound waves imperceptible to humans. It uses the rhythm of these sounds to talk."dIt lives in the water and on land. It uses its long, sticky tongue to immobilize its opponents."dThey shoot paralyzing liquid from their head bumps. They use vibration to hurt their opponents."mWhen it encounters a foe bigger than itself, it wants to throw it. It changes belts as it gets stronger."xTying their belts gets them pumped and makes their punches more destructive. Disturbing their training angers them."kSince this Pokémon makes its own clothes out of leaves, it is a popular mascot for fashion designers."oIt protects itself from the cold by wrapping up in leaves. It stays on the move, eating leaves in forests."vIt keeps its eggs warm with heat from fermenting leaves. It also uses leaves to make warm wrappings for Sewaddle."eIts bite injects a potent poison, enough to paralyze large bird Pokémon that try to prey on it."nIt is usually motionless, but when attacked, it rotates at high speed and then crashes into its opponent."lWith quick movements, it chases down its foes, attacking relentlessly with its horns until it prevails."yPerhaps because they feel more at ease in a group, they stick to others they find. They end up looking like a cloud."lLike the wind, it can slip through any gap, no matter how small. It leaves balls of white fluff behind."wSince they prefer moist, nutrient-rich soil, the areas where Petilil live are known to be good for growing plants."{Even veteran Trainers face a challenge in getting its beautiful flower to bloom. This Pokémon is popular with celebrities."�Its well-developed legs were the result of a life spent on mountains covered in deep snow. The scent it exudes from its flower crown heartens those in proximity."�It seems to pride itself on living in inhospitable conditions. If others take up residence nearby, it will move to even colder climes."�It utters royal proclamations and tyrannical edicts on a whim, becoming petulant when its disobedient subjects can't understand it."xRed and blue Basculin usually do not get along, but sometimes members of one school mingle with the other's school."nClads itself in the souls of comrades that perished before fulfilling their goals of journeying upstream."tThey live buried in the sands of the desert. The sun-warmed sands prevent their body temperature from dropping."{The special membrane covering its eyes can sense the heat of objects, so it can see its surroundings even in darkness."kThey never allow prey to escape. Their jaws are so powerful, they can crush the body of an automobile."rWhen it sleeps, it pulls its limbs into its body and its internal fire goes down to 1,100 degrees Fahrenheit."~Its internal fire burns at 2,500 degrees Fahrenheit, making enough power that it can destroy a dump truck with one punch."�The colder they get, the more energetic they are. They freeze their breath to make snowballs, using them as ammo for playful snowball fights."�Though it has a gentle disposition, it's also very strong. It will quickly freeze the snowball on its head before going for a headbutt."_Arid regions are their habitat. They move rhythmically, making a sound similar to maracas."sWhen it finds a stone of a suitable size, it secretes a liquid from its mouth to open up a hole to crawl into."rCompeting for territory, Crustle fight viciously. The one whose boulder is broken is the loser of the battle."hProud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts everything, but its weight makes it unstable, too."oIt can smash concrete blocks with its kicking attacks. The one with the biggest crest is the group leader."gThe guardians of an ancient city, they always fly the same route while keeping watch for invaders."oEach of them carries a mask that used to be its face when it was human. Sometimes they look at it and cry."jGrave robbers who mistake them for real coffins and get too close end up trapped inside their bodies."hIt's said that this Pokémon was formed when an ancient clay tablet was drawn to a vengeful spirit."qNever touch its shadowlike body, or you'll be shown the horrific memories behind the picture carved into it."uThis Pokémon inhabited ancient seas. Although it can only crawl, it still comes up onto land in search of prey."�Carracosta completely devours its prey - bones, shells, and all. Because of this, Carracosta's own shell grows thick and sturdy."�This Pokémon was successfully restored from a fossil. As research suggested, Archen is unable to fly. But it's very good at jumping."�It needs a running start to take off. If Archeops wants to fly, it first needs to run nearly 25 mph, building speed over a course of about 2.5 miles."_Inhaling the gas they belch will make you sleep for a week. They prefer unsanitary places."WConsuming garbage makes new kinds of poison gases and liquids inside their bodies."�It's unclear what the objects embedded in its body are or where they came from. More must be added over time, though, as anything it absorbs is quickly dissolved."qTo protect themselves from danger, they hide their true identities by transforming into people and Pokémon."pBonds between these Pokémon are very strong. It protects the safety of its pack by tricking its opponents."�A once-departed soul, returned to life. Derives power from resentment, which rises as energy atop its head and takes on the forms of foes."qIt likes to settle grudges and fulfill final wishes. It does so to ensure peaceful passage to the afterlife."mThese Pokémon prefer a tidy habitat. They are always sweeping and dusting, using their tails as brooms."_Cinccino's body is coated in a special oil that helps it deflect attacks, such as punches."{They intently observe both Trainers and Pokémon. Apparently, they are looking at something that only Gothita can see."rAccording to many old tales, it creates friends for itself by controlling sleeping children on starry nights."qThey can predict the future from the placement and movement of the stars. They can see Trainers' life spans."gThey drive away attackers by unleashing psychic power. They can use telepathy to talk with others."]When their two divided brains think the same thoughts, their psychic power is maximized."fWhen Reuniclus shake hands, a network forms between their brains, increasing their psychic power."{They are better at swimming than flying, and they happily eat their favorite food, peat moss, as they dive underwater."]Swanna start to dance at dusk. The one dancing in the middle is the leader of the flock."gThis Pokémon formed from icicles bathed in energy from the morning sun. It sleeps buried in snow."jSnowy mountains are this Pokémon's habitat. During an ancient ice age, they moved to southern areas."{Swallowing large amounts of water, they make snow clouds inside their bodies and, when angry, cause violent blizzards."vThe turning of the seasons changes the color and scent of this Pokémon's fur. People use it to mark the seasons."bThey migrate according to the seasons, so some people call Sawsbuck the harbingers of spring."tThe energy made in its cheeks' electric pouches is stored inside its membrane and released while it is gliding."fFor some reason they evolve when they receive electrical energy while they are attacking Shelmet."qThese Pokémon evolve by wearing the shell covering of a Shelmet. The steel armor protects their whole body."gIt lures Pokémon with its pattern that looks just like a Poké Ball, then releases poison spores."mIt lures prey close by dancing and waving its arm caps, which resemble Poké Balls, in a swaying motion."rIf its veil-like arms stun and wrap a foe, that foe will be dragged miles below the surface, never to return."mThe fate of the ships and crew that wander into Jellicent's habitat: all sunken, all lost, all vanished."~They are drawn to mysterious machinery and internet influencers. Because of this, they are common in online horror media."�They led explorers to an ancient sunken city in the abyss. Its people had uploaded their minds into machines that slowly failed over the ages."zThey attach themselves to large-bodied Pokémon and absorb static electricity, which they store in an electric pouch."�Galvantula attacks its foes with the electricity stored in the fur in its abdomen. To protect itself from threats, it uses electrically charged webs."mIt absorbs the iron it finds in the rock while clinging to the ceiling. It shoots spikes when in danger."bThey attach themselves to cave ceilings, firing steel spikes at targets passing beneath them."tThe two minigears that mesh together are predetermined. Each will rebound from other minigears without meshing."qA minigear and big gear comprise its body. If the minigear it launches at a foe doesn't return, it will die."kIts red core functions as an energy tank. It fires the charged energy through its spikes into an area."wOne alone can emit only a trickle of electricity, so a group of them gathers to unleash a powerful electric shock."tThese Pokémon have a big appetite. When they spot their prey, they attack it and paralyze it with electricity."yThey crawl out of the ocean using their arms. They will attack prey on shore and immediately drag it into the ocean."TRumors of its origin are linked to a UFO crash site in the desert 50 years ago."WIt uses psychic power to control an opponent's brain and tamper with its memories."vLitwick shines a light that absorbs the life energy of people and Pokémon, which becomes the fuel that it burns."IIt arrives near the moment of death and steals spirit from the body."]The spirits burned up in its ominous flame lose their way and wander this world forever."yThey mark their territory by leaving gashes in trees with their tusks. If a tusk breaks, a new one grows in quickly."tA broken tusk will not grow back, so it diligently sharpens its tusks on river rocks after the end of a battle."rTheir sturdy tusks will stay sharp even if used to cut steel beams. These Pokémon are covered in hard armor."xTheir snot is a barometer of health. When healthy, their snot is sticky and the power of their ice moves increases."oIt freezes its breath to create fangs and claws of ice to fight with. Cold northern areas are its habitat."tWhen the weather gets hot, these Pokémon turn into water vapor. Cryogonal are almost never seen during summer."jIt evolves when bathed in an electric-like energy along with Karrablast. The reason is still unknown."vWhen its body dries out, it weakens. So, to prevent dehydration, it wraps itself in many layers of thin membrane."yIt conceals itself in the mud of the seashore. Then it waits. When prey touch it, it delivers a jolt of electricity."�Its conspicuous lips lure prey in as it lies in wait in the mud. When prey gets close, Stunfisk clamps its jagged steel fins down on them."wIn fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies."sUsing the long fur on its arms like whips, it launches into combo attacks that, once started, no one can stop."tIt warms its body by absorbing sunlight with its wings. When its body temperature falls, it can no longer move."`Ancient science fashioned this Pokémon from clay. It's been active for thousands of years."xIt flies across the sky at Mach speeds. Removing the seal on its chest makes its internal energy go out of control."jIgnoring their injuries, groups attack by sinking the blades that cover their bodies into their prey."jBisharp pursues prey in the company of a large group of Pawniard. Then Bisharp finishes off the prey."\Only a Bisharp that stands above all others in its vast army can evolve into Kingambit."VTheir fluffy fur absorbs damage, even if they strike foes with a fierce headbutt."xThey will challenge anything, even strong opponents, without fear. Their frequent fights help them become stronger."sThey fight for their friends without any thought about danger to themselves. One can carry a car while flying."fScreaming a bloodcurdling battle cry, this huge and ferocious bird Pokémon went out on the hunt."{Their wings are too tiny to allow them to fly. They guard their posteriors with bones that were gathered by Mandibuzz."vWatching from the sky, they swoop to strike weakened Pokémon on the ground. They decorate themselves with bones."�It stomps on smaller opponents with its powerful legs, sometimes toppling in the process. If its house is broken, terrible wailing emits until it is repaired."�It steeps the remains of prey within the jar it protects, stirring the concoction with its claws. Folklore says its soul is kept within the diseased mass."yIt draws in air through its tail, transforms it into fire, and uses it like a tongue. It melts Durant and eats them."bThey attack in groups, covering themselves in steel armor to protect themselves from Heatmor."kLacking sight, it's unaware of its surroundings, so it bumps into things and eats anything that moves."sAfter it has eaten up all the food in its territory, it moves to another area. Its two heads do not get along."lIt responds to movement by attacking. This scary, three-headed Pokémon devours everything in its path!"|The base of volcanoes is where they make their homes. They shoot fire from their five horns to repel attacking enemies."tWhen volcanic ash darkened the atmosphere, it is said that Volcarona's fire provided a replacement for the sun."jIt has a body and heart of steel. It worked with its allies to punish people when they hurt Pokémon."xSpoken of in legend, this Pokémon used its phenomenal power to destroy a castle in its effort to protect Pokémon."MLegends say this Pokémon confounded opponents with its swift movements."rWhen it is resolute, its body fills with power and it becomes swifter. Its jumps are then too fast to follow."xTornadus expels massive energy from its tail, causing severe storms. Its power is great enough to blow houses away."~The spikes on its tail discharge immense bolts of lightning. It flies around the Unova region firing off lightning bolts."rLands visited by Landorus grant such bountiful crops that it has been hailed as "The Guardian of the Fields.""cAccording to legend, this Pokémon's love gave rise to the budding of fresh life across Hisui."gWhen Reshiram's tail flares, the heat energy moves the atmosphere and changes the world's weather."uConcealing itself in lightning clouds, it flies throughout the Unova region. It creates electricity in its tail."sIt generates a powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out."qIts melodies are sung with a special vocalization method that can control the feelings of those who hear it."kThis Pokémon existed 300 million years ago. Team Plasma altered it and attached a cannon to its back."yThis Pokémon brings victory. It is said that Trainers with Victini always win, regardless of the type of encounter."nSuch a thick shell of wood covers its head and back that even a direct hit from a truck wouldn't faze it."oThey strengthen their lower bodies by running into one another. They are very kind and won't start fights."iWhen it takes a defensive posture with its fists guarding its face, it could withstand a bomb blast."xAs it walks, it munches on a twig in place of a snack. It intimidates opponents by puffing hot air out of its ears."|When the twig is plucked from its tail, friction sets the twig alight. The flame is used to send signals to its allies."Using psychic power, it generates a fiery vortex of 5,400 degrees Fahrenheit, incinerating foes swept into this whirl of flame."�It protects its skin by covering its body in delicate bubbles. Beneath its happy-go-lucky air, it keeps a watchful eye on its surroundings."dIts swiftness is unparalleled. It can scale a tower of more than 2,000 feet in a minute's time."�It appears and vanishes with a ninja's grace. It toys with its enemies using swift movements, while slicing them with throwing stars of sharpest water."wIt has ears like shovels. Digging holes strengthens its ears so much that they can sever thick roots effortlessly."}As powerful as an excavator, its ears can reduce dense bedrock to rubble. When it's finished digging, it lounges lazily."cDespite the beauty of its lilting voice, it's merciless to intruders that enter its territory."pThe hotter the flame sac on its belly, the faster it can fly, but it takes some time to get the fire going."nWhen attacking prey, it can reach speeds of up to 310 mph. It finishes its prey off with a colossal kick."hThe powder that covers its body regulates its temperature, so it can live in any region or climate."lThe beaks of bird Pokémon can't begin to scratch its stalwart body. To defend itself, it spews powder."|The patterns on this Pokémon's wings depend on the climate and topography of its habitat. It scatters colorful scales."�They set off on their own from their pride and live by themselves to become stronger. These hot-blooded Pokémon are quick to fight."�With fiery breath of more than 10,000 degrees Fahrenheit, they viciously threaten any challenger. The females protect the pride's cubs."�When it finds a flower it likes, it dwells on that flower its whole life long. It floats in the wind's embrace with an untroubled heart."iWhen the flowers of a well-tended flower bed bloom, it appears and celebrates with an elegant dance."|In times long past, governors of castles would invite Florges to create flower gardens to embellish the castle domains."vIf it has sunshine and water, it doesn't need to eat, because it can generate energy from the leaves on its back."gThey inhabit mountainous regions. The leader of the herd is decided by a battle of clashing horns."oIt does its level best to glare and pull a scary face, but it can't help grinning if anyone pats its head."�It charges ahead and bashes its opponents like a berserker, uncaring about any hits it might take. Its arms are mighty enough to snap a telephone pole."aHistorically, in the Kalos region, these Pokémon were the designated guardians of the king."vIt has enough psychic energy to blast everything within 300 feet of itself, but it has no control over its power."�The eyeball patterns on the interior of its ears emit psychic energy. It keeps the patterns tightly covered because that power is too immense."�If anyone dares to grab its hilt, it wraps a blue cloth around that person's arm and drains that person's life energy completely."{The complex attack patterns of its two swords are unstoppable, even for an opponent greatly accomplished at swordplay."�Apparently, it can detect the innate qualities of leadership. According to legend, whoever it recognizes is destined to become king."tIn the past, rather than using perfume, royal ladies carried a Spritzee that would waft a fragrance they liked."�Its scent is so overpowering that, unless a Trainer happens to really enjoy the smell, he or she will have a hard time walking alongside it."{It uses both white and black magic. It harvests the flowers that grow on witches who regularly walk between life and death."TBecause it eats nothing but sweets, its fur is as sticky sweet as cotton candy."�Its sense of smell is 100 million times better than a human's, so even the faintest scent tells it about everything in the area."�It flashes the light-emitting spots on its body, which drains its opponent's will to fight. It takes the opportunity to scuttle away and hide."�It lures its prey close with hypnotic motions, then wraps its tentacles around it before finishing it off with digestive fluids."�They stretch and then contract, yanking their rocks along with them in bold hops. They eat seaweed that washes up on the shoreline."�Barbaracle's legs and hands have minds of their own, and they will move independently. But they usually follow the head's orders."aIt looks just like rotten kelp. It hides from foes while storing up power for its evolution."XTales are told of ships that wander into seas where Dragalge live, never to return."eBorn in pristine waters, they escape detection by blending in seamlessly with underwater plants."UThey gallop on the ocean floor, cleaning it by collecting algae on their hooves."~Through controlled explosions of internal gas, it can expel water like a pistol shot. At close distances, it can shatter rock."dBy expelling water from the nozzle in the back of its claw, it can move at a speed of 60 knots."iThe frills on either side of its head have cells that generate electricity when exposed to sunlight."It stimulates its muscles with electricity, boosting the strength in its legs and enabling it to run 100 yards in five seconds."�This is an ancient Pokémon, revived in modern times. It has a violent disposition, and it'll tear apart anything it gets between its hefty jaws."oThis Pokémon is from about 100,000,000 years ago. It has the presence of a king, vicious but magnificent."�This Pokémon was successfully restored from a fossil. In the past, it lived with others of its kind in cold lands where there were fewer predators."rAurorus was restored from a fossil. It's said that when this Pokémon howls, auroras appear in the night sky."�With its wings, it controls its position in the air. It likes to attack from above, a maneuver that is difficult to defend against."�It uses its tail to absorb electricity from power plants or from outlets in houses, and then it fires the electricity from its whiskers."�It's said that somewhere in the world, there's a mineral vein housing a large pack of slumbering Carbink. It's also said that this pack has a queen."bIt can instantly create many diamonds by compressing the carbon in the air between its hands."^It's covered in a slimy membrane that makes any punches or kicks slide off it harmlessly."�It's very friendly toward people. If you grow close to it, Goodra will hug you with its sticky, slime-covered body. Don't get mad."uIt attacks with retractable horns. It throws a punch that's the equivalent of the force of a hundred pro boxers."�A creature given to melancholy. I suspect its metallic shell developed as a result of the mucus on its skin reacting with the iron in Hisui's water."�Able to freely control the hardness of its metallic shell. It loathes solitude and is extremely clingy-it will fume and run riot if those dearest to it ever leave its side."wIt never lets go of a key that it likes, so people give it the keys to vaults and safes as a way to prevent crime."~According to old tales, these Pokémon are stumps possessed by the spirits of children who died while lost in the forest."|Using its roots as a nervous system, it controls the trees in the forest. It's kind to the Pokémon that reside in its body."^It is said to carry wandering spirits to the place where they belong so they can move on."jIt enwraps its prey in its hairlike arms. It sings joyfully as it observes the suffering of its prey."{Using air of -50 degrees Fahrenheit, they freeze opponents solid. They live in herds above the snow line on mountains."wThe way several Bergmite and Dreepy like to huddle on its back makes it look like an aircraft carrier made of ice."nThis Pokémon barrels along steep mountain paths, cleaving through the deep snow with its hard icy armor."uEven a robust wrestler will become dizzy and unable to stand when exposed to its 200,000-hertz ultrasonic waves."|The ultrasonic waves it emits from its ears can reduce a large boulder to pebbles. It swoops out of the dark to attack."aWhen the horns on its head shine in seven colors, it is said to be sharing everlasting life."wWhen its life comes to an end, it absorbs the life energy of every living thing and turns into a cocoon once more."iSome say it can change to an even more powerful form when battling those who threaten the ecosystem."dIt gathers things it likes and passes them through its loop to teleport them to a secret place."iIt expels its internal steam from the arms on its back. It has enough power to blow away a mountain."}It sends its feathers, which are as sharp as blades, flying in attack. Its legs are strong, so its kicks are also formidable."rThis narcissistic Pokémon is a clean freak. If you don't groom it diligently, it will stop listening to you."�It nocks its arrow quills and shoots them at opponents. When it simply can't afford to miss, it tugs the vine on its head to improve its focus."tThe air stored inside the rachises of Decidueye's feathers insulated the Pokémon against Hisui's extreme cold."�If you try too hard to get close to it, it won't open up to you. Even if you do grow close, giving it too much affection is still a no-no."�It can act spoiled if it grows close to its Trainer. A powerful Pokémon, its sharp claws can leave its Trainer's whole body covered in scratches."�Although it's rough mannered and egotistical, it finds beating down unworthy opponents boring. It gets motivated for stronger opponents."^The balloons it inflates with its nose grow larger and larger as it practices day by day."It gets excited when it sees a dance it doesn't know. This hard worker practices diligently until it can learn that dance."fTo Primarina, every battle is a stage. It takes down its prey with beautiful singing and dancing."yIt pecks at trees with its hard beak. You can get some idea of its mood or condition from the rhythm of its pecking."WIt can bend the tip of its beak to produce over a hundred different cries at will."~They smack beaks with others of their kind to communicate. The strength and number of hits tell each other how they feel."�Its stomach takes up most of its long torso. It's a big eater, so the amount Trainers have to spend on its food is no laughing matter."�Although it wasn't originally found in Alola, this Pokémon was brought over a long time ago when there was a huge Rattata outbreak."kIf you find its nest, you shouldn't stick your hand inside. You'll get bitten by an irritated Grubbin."�It buries itself in fallen leaves and barely moves, munching away on humus. If you accidentally step on one, you'll get a shock!"�It has an organ that generates electricity in its abdomen. It concentrates energy in its jaws and fires off jolts of electricity."yIts hard pincers are well suited to both offense and defense. Fights between two Crabrawler are like boxing matches."jIt stores coldness in its pincers and pummels its foes. It can even smash thick walls of ice to bits!"�It wins the hearts of its enemies with its passionate dancing and then uses the opening it creates to burn them up with blazing flames."�Cutiefly is able to detect the aura of living things, which it uses to find flowers. Cutiefly tend to gather around beings feeling strong emotions."�Ribombee hates rain as it turns its hair dirty and its pollen damp. When storms are on the horizon, Ribombee hides in tree hollows waiting for it to pass."�As they develop, their disposition grows more violent and aggressive. Many Trainers find them too much to handle and abandon them."xThe sharp rocks in its mane can cut like knives. Lycanroc wears its prey down by degrees before finishing them off."{They're weak, so they move in schools. However, they can also often be seen all alone, having strayed from the school."|They eat Corsola branches, so Mareanie are hated by craftsmen who work with Corsola branches that have naturally fallen off."To attack, this Pokémon sends toxic spikes flying at its enemies. Ones that come close get mown down by the claws on its feet."�It loves playing in the mud. If it isn't showered with mud on a daily basis, it gets stressed out and stops listening to its Trainer."It remains calm and unmoving no matter the situation. It mixes dirt with the saliva in its mouth to make a special kind of mud."�When two Dewpider meet, they display their water bubbles to each other. Then the one with the smaller bubble gets out of the other's way."|It usually passes its time in the water. When its belly is full, it stores its subdued prey in the water bubble on its head."When the sun rises, Fomantis spreads its four leaves and bathes in the sunlight. The tip of its head has a pleasant aroma."dFor self-protection, it pretends to be a bug Pokémon. Both of its arms bear keen-edged petals."�It scatters its shining spores around itself. Even though they're dangerous, nighttime tours of forests where Morelull live are popular."�It puts its prey to sleep and siphons off their vitality through the tip of its arms. If one of its kind is weakened, it helps by sending it vitality."`The males will do whatever the females tell them. They give the females most of their food."kSalazzle lives deep in caves and forces the Salandit it has attracted with its pheromones to serve it."�It boasts power enough to split large trees in half. The organ on its rear releases an odor that it uses to communicate with others of its kind."}It waves its hands wildly in intimidation and warning. Life is over for anyone who doesn't run away as fast as possible."wBecause of its sweet, delicious aroma, bird Pokémon are always after it, but it's not intelligent enough to care."�It's protected by its hard sepals, so it plays with bird Pokémon without worry. They peck it relentlessly, but it doesn't care."jA master of grand and beautiful kicks, it can knock out even kickboxing champions with a single blow."�It stretches sticky vines out from its head and picks flowers to adorn itself with. When it doesn't have any flowers, it feels uneasy."|It normally spends its time meditating in the treetops. It throws Poké Balls and gives other Pokémon orders as it pleases."�They use their saliva to stick leaves to their shoulders. You can tell what troop they belong to from the position of the leaves."wIt will pick up anything it finds on the ground. Sometimes it finds coins, so Murkrow and Meowth will go after it."gThe shell covering its body is as hard as diamond. This Pokémon will do anything it takes to win."tIt likes the shovel on its head, so Sandygast will get serious and fight any children who come to take it back."�Each of its grains of sand has its own will. Palossand eats small Pokémon and siphons away their vital essence while they're still alive."�The tradition known as Pyukumuku chucking started from the custom of throwing Pyukumuku back into the sea after they wash onshore."~A Pokémon weapon developed for a specific mission, it went berserk during an experiment, so it was cryogenically frozen."rThis is its form once it has awakened and evolved. Freed from its heavy mask, its speed is greatly increased."|It lives in the ozone layer, where it becomes food for stronger Pokémon. When it tries to run away, it falls to the ground."lIt stays asleep from the moment it's born. When it falls into a deep sleep, it stops moving altogether."�It lives in volcanoes and eats sulfur and other minerals. Materials from the food it eats form the basis of its explosive shell."`When it's surprised or agitated, the 14 fur spikes on its back will stand up involuntarily."�Although it's a quiet, lonely Pokémon, if you try to look at what's under its rag, it will become agitated and resist violently."�It burrows beneath the sand, radiating psychic power from the protuberance on its head. It waits for prey as it surveys the area."rIf a child it has made friends with is bullied, Drampa will find the bully's house and burn it to the ground."wIt wraps its prey in green seaweed and sucks away their vitality. It only likes to go after big prey like Wailord."�It smacks the scales on its head against rocks or against the ground to frighten its opponents. It can also contact its friends with these noises."lIt makes noise by clanging its scales together. When the rhythm has reached its peak, Hakamo-o attacks."~When it howls after finishing off its prey, the metallic sounds of its celebrating comrades can be heard from all around."�Although it's called a guardian deity, if a person or Pokémon puts it in a bad mood, it will become a malevolent deity and attack."�It heals the wounds of people and Pokémon by sprinkling them with its sparkling scales. This guardian deity is worshiped on Akala."dAlthough it's called a guardian deity, it's violent enough to crush anyone it sees as an enemy."�This guardian deity of Poni Island manipulates water. Because it lives deep within a thick fog, it came to be both feared and revered."oEven though its helpless, gaseous body can be blown away by the slightest breeze, it doesn't seem to care."yThe king who ruled Alola in times of antiquity called it the "cocoon of the stars" and built an altar to worship it."�Sometimes the result of its opening an Ultra Wormhole is that energy and life-forms from other worlds are called here to this world."yRecords of it exist in writings from long, long ago, where it was known by the name "the beast that calls the moon.""~It looks somehow pained as it rages around in search of light, which serves as its energy. It's apparently from another world."fA life-form from another world, it was dubbed a UB and is thought to produce a strong neurotoxin."|Although it's alien to this world and a danger here, it's apparently a common organism in the world where it normally lives."mA life-form that lives in another world, its body is thin and supple, but it also possesses great power."�One of the mysterious life-forms known as Ultra Beasts. Astonishing electric shocks emanate from its entire body, according to witnesses."fOne of the dangerous UBs, high energy readings can be detected coming from both of its huge arms."SThis Ultra Beast's body, which is as thin as paper, is like a sharpened sword."zA dangerous Ultra Beast, it appears to be eating constantly, but for some reason its droppings have never been found."\This Ultra Beast is well enough liked to be chosen as a first partner in its own world."oIt stores hundreds of liters of poisonous liquid inside its body. It is one of the organisms known as UBs."|It appeared from an Ultra Wormhole. Each one appears to be made up of many life-forms stacked one on top of each other."�It slithers toward people. Then, without warning, it triggers the explosion of its own head. It's apparently one kind of Ultra Beast."�It synchronizes its consciousness with others to understand their feelings. This faculty makes it useful for taking care of people."�It slips into the shadows of others and mimics their powers and movements. As it improves, it becomes stronger than those it's imitating."�It electrifies its claws and tears its opponents apart with them. Even if they dodge its attack, they'll be electrocuted by the flying sparks."{It melts particles of iron and other metals found in the subsoil, so it can absorb them into its body of molten steel."Revered long ago for its capacity to create iron from nothing, for some reason it has come back to life after 3,000 years."nIt attacks with rapid beats of its stick. As it strikes with amazing speed, it gets more and more pumped."�When it's drumming out rapid beats in battle, it gets so caught up in the rhythm that it won't even notice that it's already knocked out its opponent."zBy drumming, it taps into the power of its special tree stump. The roots of the stump follow its direction in battle."�It has special pads on the backs of its feet, and one on its nose. Once it's raring to fight, these pads radiate tremendous heat."sIt kicks berries right off the branches of trees and then juggles them with its feet, practicing its footwork."�It's skilled at both offense and defense, and it gets pumped up when cheered on. But if it starts showboating, it could put itself in a tough spot."mWhen it gets wet, its skin changes color, and this Pokémon becomes invisible as if it were camouflaged."mHighly intelligent but also very lazy, it keeps enemies out of its territory by laying traps everywhere."�Its nictitating membranes let it pick out foes' weak points so it can precisely blast them with water that shoots from its fingertips at Mach 3."�It eats berries nonstop, a habit that has made it more resilient than it looks. It'll show up on farms, searching for yet more berries."zCommon throughout the Galar region, this Pokémon has strong teeth and can chew through the toughest of berry shells."�Jumping nimbly about, this small-bodied Pokémon takes advantage of even the slightest opportunity to disorient larger opponents."eThe lessons of many harsh battles have taught it how to accurately judge an opponent's strength."With their great intellect and flying skills, these Pokémon very successfully act as the Galar region's airborne taxi service."iOften found in gardens, this Pokémon has hairs on its body that it uses to assess its surroundings."xAs it grows inside its shell, it uses its psychic abilities to monitor the outside world and prepare for evolution."{It emits psychic energy to observe and study what's around it, and what's around it can include things over six miles away."�Cunning and cautious, this Pokémon survives by stealing food from others. It erases its tracks with swipes of its tail as it makes off with its plunder."lWith a lithe body and sharp claws, it goes around stealing food and eggs. Boltund is its natural enemy."~It whirls around in the wind while singing a joyous song. This delightful display has charmed many into raising this Pokémon."rThe cotton on the head of this Pokémon can be spun into a glossy, gorgeous yarn, a Galar regional specialty."}If its fleece grows too long, Wooloo won't be able to move. Cloth made with the wool of this Pokémon is surprisingly strong."dIts majestic horns are meant only to impress the opposite gender. They never see use in battle."�It starts off battles by attacking with its rock-hard horn, but as soon as the opponent flinches, this Pokémon bites down and never lets go."xThis Pokémon rapidly extends its retractable neck to sink its sharp fangs into distant enemies and take them down."�It balances itself like a sumo wrestler, making it nearly impossible to topple. Its squishy flesh is even more resilent than its shell."This gluttonous Pokémon only assists people with their work because it wants treats. As it runs, it crackles with electricity."rIt sends electricity through its legs to boost their strength. Running at top speed, it easily breaks 50 mph."`It can race around like a unicycle, even on rough, rocky terrain. Burning coal sustains it."�By rapidly rolling its legs, it can travel at over 18 mph. The temperature of the flames it breathes exceeds 1,800 degrees Fahrenheit."}While it's engaged in battle, its mountain of coal will burn bright red, sending off sparks that scorch the surrounding area."gAs soon as it's born, it burrows into an apple. The apple serves as both a food source and a home."sIt flies on wings of apple skin and spits a powerful acid. It can also change its shape into that of an apple."}A nectarous scent wafts from its body, luring in the bug Pokémon it preys on. The skin on its back is especially yummy."eIt spews sand from its nostrils. While the enemy is blinded, it burrows into the ground to hide."^Its unique style of coiling allows it to blast sand out of its sand sac more efficiently."�Its rough belly scales can pulverize entire quarries for sand to use in battle. Its fights with Flygon in the center of desert storms are the stuff of legend."�This hungry Pokémon swallows Arrokuda whole. Occasionally, it makes a mistake and tries to swallow a Pokémon other than its preferred prey."nAfter it's eaten its fill, its movements become extremely sluggish. That's when Cramorant swallows it up."�It spins its tail fins to propel itself, surging forward at speeds of over 100 knots before ramming prey and spearing into them."�It manipulates the chemical makeup of its poison to produce electricity. The voltage is weak, but it can cause a tingling paralysis."lThis short-tempered and aggressive Pokémon chugs stagnant water to absorb any toxins it might contain."�It subconsciously broadcasts the audio of its battles over radio waves. Tuning in at the right time will let you hear the performance of a lifetime."�It wraps prey up with its heated body, cooking them in its coils. Once they're well-done, it will voraciously nibble them down to the last morsel."~While its burning body is already dangerous on its own, this excessively hostile Pokémon also has large and very sharp fangs."�Even solid titanium will melt in its coils. It uses the massive mirage it creates to confuse Volcarona in their frequent contests."�Its tentacles tear off easily, but it isn't alarmed when that happens, it knows they'll grow back. It's about as smart as a three-year-old."{Searching for an opponent to test its skills against, it emerges onto land. Once the battle is over, it returns to the sea."{The teacup in which this Pokémon makes its home is a famous piece of antique tableware. Many forgeries are in circulation."�Leaving leftover black tea unattended is asking for this Pokémon to come along and pour itself into it, turning the tea into a new Polteageist."pIt spends days relaxing on the beach. Its rest is often interrupted by someone who confuses it for a drink."lDespite its refreshing scent, those who drink of its colorful liquid are swiftly put into a deep sleep."sIf this Pokémon senses a strong emotion, it will run away as fast as it can. It prefers areas without people."�Using the braids on its head, it pummels foes to get them to quiet down. One blow from those braids would knock out a professional boxer."�If you're too loud around it, you risk being torn apart by the claws on its tentacle. This Pokémon is also known as the Forest Witch."tIt sneaks into people's homes, stealing things and feasting on the negative energy of the frustrated occupants."tWith sly cunning, it tries to lure people into the woods. Some believe it to have the power to make crops grow."}Its hairs work like muscle fibers. When its hairs unfurl, they latch on to opponents, ensnaring them as tentacles would."\They say that any patisserie visited by Milcery is guaranteed success and good fortune."_When Alcremie is content, the cream it secretes from its hands becomes sweeter and richer."�So tall it seems to defy the heavens, it lords its elevated position over other Pokémon. It grants its Trainer knowledge of sweet and sour."�The six of them work together as one Pokémon. Teamwork is also their battle strategy, and they constantly change their formation as they fight."�It stores electricity in each spine. Even if one gets broken off, it still continues to emit electricity for at least three hours."|It eats snow that piles up on the ground. The more snow it eats, the bigger and more impressive the spikes on its back grow."�It shows no mercy to any who desecrate fields and mountains. It will fly around on its icy wings, causing a blizzard to chase offenders away."pOnce a year, on a specific date and at a specific time, they gather out of nowhere and form up in a circle."�This Pokémon keeps its heat-sensitive head cool with ice. It fishes for its food, dangling its single hair into the sea to lure in prey."{Through its horns, it can pick up on the emotions of creatures around it. Positive emotions are the source of its strength."�It carries electrically roasted seeds with it as if they're precious treasures. No matter how much it eats, it always gets hungry again in short order."�If a job requires serious strength, this Pokémon will excel at it. Its copper body tarnishes in the rain, turning a vibrant green color."~These Pokémon live in herds. Their trunks have incredible grip strength, strong enough to crush giant rocks into powder."�After evolution, it has taken on the appearance of a great monument. If revered, it will protect nearby villages from all manner of disaster."|The powerful muscles in its tail generate its electricity. Compared to its lower body, its upper half is entirely too small."�This Pokémon lived on prehistoric seashores and was able to preserve food with the ice on its body. It went extinct because it moved so slowly."Its mighty legs are capable of running at speeds exceeding 40 mph, but this Pokémon can't breathe unless it's underwater."sThe skin on its face is impervious to attack, but breathing difficulties made this Pokémon go extinct anyway."�The special metal that composes its body is very light, so this Pokémon has considerable agility. It lives in caves because it dislikes the rain."�Nostalgic for the cavern home it has outgrown, it will weep molten glass. Those without trainers may find company serving as rookeries for bird Pokémon."�If this weak Pokémon is by itself, a mere child could defeat it. But if Dreepy has friends to help it train, it can evolve and become much stronger."�Without a Dreepy to place on its head and care for, it gets so uneasy it'll try to substitute any Pokémon it finds for the missing Dreepy."nApparently the Dreepy inside Dragapult's horns eagerly look forward to being launched out at Mach speeds."{This Pokémon has slumbered for many years. Some say it's Zamazenta's elder sister, others say the two Pokémon are rivals."{This Pokémon slept for aeons while in the form of a statue. It was asleep for so long, people forgot that it ever existed."�It was inside a meteorite that fell 20,000 years ago. There seems to be a connection between this Pokémon and the Dynamax phenomenon."~If Kubfu pulls the long white hair on its head, its fighting spirit heightens and power wells up from the depths of its belly."�Inhabiting the mountains of a distant region, this Pokémon races across sheer cliffs, training its legs and refining its moves."{Once the vines on Zarude's body tear off, they become nutrients in the soil. This helps the plants of the forest grow."xGlastrier has tremendous physical strength, and the mask of ice covering its face is 100 times harder than diamond."|As it dashes through the night, Spectrier absorbs the life-force of sleeping creatures. It craves silence and solitude."�Calyrex is a merciful Pokémon, capable of providing healing and blessings. It has the power to cause hearts to mend and plants to spring forth."@This Pokemon exists just to test the PBS Extensions system."GThis Pokemon exists just to test the PBS Extensions system. Again!"{This is the form Castform takes on the brightest of days. Its skin is unexpectedly hot to the touch, so approach with care."|This is the form Castform takes when soaked with rain. When its body is compressed, water will seep out as if from a sponge."�This is the form Castform takes when covered in snow. Its body becomes an ice-like material, with a temperature near -5 degrees Celsius."uThis is the form Castform takes when sand sweeps up. Its body is made of particles that are constantly spinning."yThis is the form Castform takes when the moon rises. The particles in its body take on mystical fae-like properties."|This is the form Castform takes when an eclipse covers the sky. It moves around using its hands made of pure psychic energy."|This Rotom has possessed a convection microwave oven that uses a special motor. It also has a flair for manipulating flames."yThis form of Rotom enjoys coming up with water-based pranks. Be careful with it if you don't want your room flooded."zRotom assumes this form when it takes over a refrigerator powered by a special motor. It battles by spewing cold air."�In this form, Rotom applies its new power over wind to its love of pranks. It will happily blow away any important documents it can find."�This is Rotom after it's seized control of a lawn mower that has a special motor. As it mows down grass, it scatters the clippings everywhere."Even Basculin, which devours everything it can with its huge jaws, is nothing more than food to organisms stronger than itself."rIt has foreseen that a world of truth will arrive for people and Pokémon. It strives to protect that future."It's said that this Pokémon battles in order to protect the ideal world that will exist in the future for people and Pokémon."xThe power that lay hidden in its body now covers its horn, turning it into a sword that can slice through anything."mSpirits that wander this world are placed into Pumpkaboo's body. They're then moved on to the afterlife."mWhen taking spirits to the afterlife, large Pumpkaboo prefer the spirits of adults to those of children."gMassive Pumpkaboo are said to be the product of areas where a great number of lost souls lingered."�Eerie cries emanate from its body in the dead of night. The sounds are said to be the wails of spirits who are suffering in the afterlife."lLarge Gourgeist put on the guise of adults, taking the hands of children to lead them to the afterlife."^Supersized Gourgeist aren't picky. They will forcefully drag anyone off to the afterlife."�This is Zygarde when about 10% of its pieces have been assembled. It leaps at its opponent's chest and sinks its sharp fangs into them."|This is Zygarde's perfected form. From the orifice on its chest, it radiates high-powered energy that eliminates everything."�It creates an electric charge by rubbing its feathers together. It dances over to its enemies and delivers shocking electrical punches."tThis Oricorio relaxes by swaying gently. This increases its psychic energy, which it then fires at its enemies."tIt summons the dead with its dreamy dancing. From their malice, it draws power with which to curse its enemies."�It goads its enemies into attacking, withstands the hits, and in return, delivers a headbutt, crushing their bones with its rocky mane."�Bathed in the setting sun of evening, Lycanroc has undergone a special kind of evolution. An intense fighting spirit underlies its calmness."�Weak Wishiwashi school together to concentrate their power. Their united force makes them the demon of the sea, feared near and far."�If its core stays exposed, it will soon die off. It's possible that it may survive if it's put into a Poké Ball quickly enough."{Sad that its true identity may be exposed, Mimikyu will mercilessly seek revenge on any opponent that breaks its neck."|This is Necrozma's form while it's absorbing the power of Solgaleo, making it extremely ferocious and impossible to control."yLunala no longer has a will of its own. Now under the control of Necrozma, it continuously expels all of its energy."sThe light pouring out from all over its body affects living things and nature, impacting them in various ways."pThe slightest shock is sometimes enough to get this Pokémon to spit out the Arrokuda lodged in its throat."{The half-swallowed Pikachu is so startled that it isn't struggling yet, but it's still looking for a chance to strike back."�The hair on its head connects to the surface of its brain. When this Pokémon has something on its mind, its hair chills the air around it."�They diligently serve people and Pokémon so they can gather feelings of gratitude. The females are particularly good at babysitting."rHunger hormones affect its temperament. Until its hunger is appeased, it gets up to all manner of evil deeds."�Able to cut down anything with a single strike, it became known as the Fairy King's Sword, and it inspired awe in friend and foe alike."zNow that it's equipped with its shield, it can shrug off impressive blows, including the attacks of Dynamax Pokémon."�This form of Urshifu is a strong believer in defeating foes by raining many blows down on them. Its strikes are nonstop, flowing like a river."~It's said that this Pokémon once moved a large forest—and all the Pokémon living there—to a new location overnight."�Legend says that by using its power to see all events from past to future, this Pokémon saved the creatures of a forest from a meteorite strike."jWhen wounded, it stops moving. It goes as still as stone to meditate, sharpening its mind and spirit."�Darmanitan takes this form when enraged. It won't stop spewing flames until its rage has settled, even if its body starts to melt."Psychic power has augmented its muscles. It has a grip strength of one ton and can sprint a hundred meters in two seconds flat!"�Despite its diminished size, its mental power has grown phenomenally. With a mere thought, it can smash a skyscraper to smithereens."zIt differs from other Basculin in several respects, including demeanor. It is much gentler than other color variants.">This form also exists to test the PBS Extensions feature.[B"{經常可見它在太陽下睡午覺的樣子。在沐浴了充足的陽光之後，它背上的種子就會成長茁壯。"�下盤為了支撐背上的花苞而變得強韌。當待在太陽底下一動也不動的時間變長，就表示大朵的花即將盛開。"w據說充足的營養和陽光會讓花朵的顏色變得更加鮮豔。花朵散發的香氣能夠療愈人心。"q尾巴上的火焰代表它的心情。開心時火焰會搖曳晃動，生氣時火焰則會猛烈燃燒。"z會用銳利的爪子無情地打倒對手。遇到強敵時會興奮起來，尾巴上會燃起藍白色的火焰。"�會在空中四處飛翔尋找強大的對手。在面對比自己弱小的對手時，它不會吐出那可熔化一切的高溫火焰。"�甲殼的作用不僅僅是用來保護自己。它圓潤的外形和表面的溝槽會減小水的阻力，使它能快速地遊動。"{長滿蓬鬆毛髮的大尾巴的顏色，會隨著年齡的增長而越變越深。甲殼上的傷痕是強者的證明。"j甲殼上的噴射口能夠精準地瞄準目標。打出的水彈可以命中50米外的空罐子。"\或許是想要儘快長大，它的食慾非常旺盛，每天能吃掉100片葉子。"h殼裡面是黏糊糊的液體。為了準備迎接進化，正在不斷地更新體內的細胞。"z翅膀上覆蓋著的鱗粉有劇毒。如果發現有鳥精靈要襲擊綠毛蟲，就會撒出鱗粉將它趕跑。"�它那巨大翅膀與劇毒粉塵都受到了進化之力的加持，只要受到輕微的刺激，就會化作最純粹的能量。"k有著非常靈敏的嗅覺。能用大大的紅鼻子聞出自己喜歡吃和不喜歡吃的葉子。"�雖然掛在樹上幾乎一動不動，但體內卻在為進化而忙碌地準備著。那證據就是它的身體會變得很熱。"�大針蜂的領地意識非常強，所以為了安全起見，不要接近它的住處。它一生氣，就會群起而攻之。"�最終形態完全釋放了它的殺戮天性，它會無條件服從訓練師的命令，但如果不能好好打上一場，就會變得不耐煩。"h因為方向感非常好，所以無論離自己的巢穴多遠，都能毫不迷路地飛回來。"�會飛在空中巡視自己廣闊的領地。要是有誰膽敢侵犯它的領地，它就會毫不留情地用利爪狠狠懲治一番。"k有著靚麗羽毛的精靈。有很多訓練師因拜倒在它美麗的頭羽下而來培育比雕。"V門牙會終生生長。但要是長得太長，就會因無法進食而餓死。"\據說會用後腳上小小的蹼泅水渡海，穿越島嶼來躲避敵人的追擊。"e只對新鮮的東西感興趣。如果帶它去買東西，在挑選食材時會很有幫助。"k讓自己手下的小拉達們收集食物，卻只挑裡面營養豐富並且美味的東西來吃。"q生性魯莽，只要是為了保護自己的領地，即便對手是大型精靈，也仍會衝向對手。"h在大嘴雀的領地上拿著食物走動可是相當危險的。食物轉眼間就會被搶走。"t甚至可以通過讓顎脫位來吞食比自己更大的獵物。進食後就會蜷縮起身體進行休息。"t用腹部的花紋讓對手畏縮後，就會快速地用身體勒住對手，並等著對手的心跳停止。"M臉頰上有電力袋。充滿電時就會精神十足地四處玩耍。"_有積存電力的性情。在皮卡超群居的森林裡會落雷不斷，十分危險。"z隨著電力在體內的積聚，它會越發地具有攻擊性。也有說法講到其實電力就是它的壓力。"�偶爾會有皮卡超不會進化成雷超，而是變得異常巨大。只要餵養得當，就能為居住區提供充足的電力。"Y電擊的威力高達十萬伏特。能一擊擊暈比自己大好幾倍的對手。"w棲息在雨量稀少的土地上。遇到危險就會蜷縮起身體，並以此來保護自己柔弱的腹部。"e爪子和角經常會折斷。折斷的爪子和角會被製作成用來耕作土地的用具。"_棲息於被雪包圍著的山嶽地帶，因此獲得了鋼鐵般堅硬的冰雪之軀。"t很久以前曾棲息在沙漠裡。會用利爪牢牢地插入山體，即便是攀爬冰山也不會滑落。"~人們認為它是為了保護自己嬌小的身體才長出了越來越強的毒針。生氣後就會從角尖放出劇毒。"�和夥伴以及家人在一起的時候，為了避免傷及彼此會把刺收起來。離開伙伴後，好像就會變得不安起來。"z擅長利用長滿堅硬鱗片的身體將對手撞得彈飛起來的攻擊。在保護幼崽的時候最為強大。"�牽動耳朵的肌肉十分發達，可以隨意將耳朵轉動至任何方向。是無論多小的聲音也不會聽漏的精靈。"w有著比鑽石還要堅硬的角。感覺到敵人的氣息時，背上的刺就會一起豎起來全力迎敵。"w粗尾巴的揮擊有著能將堅固鐵塔都折斷的驚人破壞力。一旦陷入狂暴就拿它沒辦法了。"�在流星眾多的晚上，它們會聚集起來並圍成一圈跳舞．如果能在那時看到它們，就會遇到一些好事情哦。"�在滿月的夜晚會精力十足地玩耍。破曉時分，玩累了的皮皮們就會返回安靜的深山裡和夥伴們依偎在一起睡覺。"w會用翅膀像飛一樣跳著走。就算要在水面上行走也沒問題。會在寂靜的月夜漫步湖上。"t會操縱火球捕捉獵物。如果從小就開始培育的話，它就會像小狗精靈那樣親近人哦。"t非常聰明的精靈。能從口中吐出搖曳的火焰來使獵物進入催眠狀態，繼而展開襲擊。"]在炎熱的時候，用6根尾巴製作冰礫在周圍揮灑，讓身體冷卻下來。"n居住在被冰雪覆蓋萬年的山上，被信奉為神的化身。會在暴風雪的伴隨下出現。"w它總是不停地向訓練師索要零食和禮物。擁有一套昂貴的時尚物品是其進化所必需的。"�它收到的禮物已化作了一條金色的光尾。在戰鬥中，可以利用純粹的貪婪能量作為武器，並且自身實力會隨著被寵愛的程度而增強。"t為了能動聽地歌唱，它會一直練習唱歌。就算是睡著了，也會在夢中不停地歌唱哦。"V把肚子鼓得大大的，唱出神奇的旋律。聽到後就會馬上瞌睡。"e富有彈性的身體和細膩的毛皮很受人們的喜愛。抱著它睡會感覺很愜意。"k白天在洞穴裡睡覺。因為沒有眼睛，所以用超音波一邊探測周圍，一邊飛行。"z粗粗的牙齒像吸管一樣，中間是空的，因而意想不到的脆弱。是為了吸血而特別進化的。"k牙齒銳利，就算在黑暗中被它咬住吸血也不會感到疼痛，所以無法立刻發覺。"�白天會把身體埋進地裡，並用全身吸收土壤中的營養。據說土壤越肥沃，葉子就會變得越有光澤。"z感到危險的時候，雌蕊放出的臭味會變得更加強烈，但心平氣和的時候就不會放出臭味。"�會用世界上最大的花瓣引誘獵物靠近，然後將毒花粉撒在它的身上。等獵物不能動後，就會將它抓起來吃掉。"~在充分沐浴了陽光後，身上的葉子就會一圈圈地旋轉起來。美麗花的舞蹈是南國有名的風景線。"Y即使不停地吃，獲取的營養也幾乎都會被背上生長的蘑菇奪走。"w底下的蟲子基本上死了，真正的本體是背上的蘑菇。如果蘑菇掉下來，它就不會動了。"z據說為了保護自己，變得全身長滿了堅硬細小的體毛。有著不會放跑任何小獵物的眼睛。"t具有夜行性，會在夜間開始活動。喜歡捕食被路燈燈光吸引而聚集在一起的小蟲子。"e會在地下挖掘隧道移動。由於討厭光線，所以會在太陽落山後來到地上。"q三胞胎的感情一直很好，但在極少數情況下，也會為哪個腦袋先進食而激烈爭吵。"[3根鬍鬚的形狀會因自身的情緒而變化,對夥伴間的溝通很有幫助。"k用金光閃爍的鬍子保護身體。聽說，如果把脫落的鬍鬚帶回家，會招來不幸。"{非常喜歡硬幣。只要給它硬幣就能輕易和它親近，但因為它性情多變，所以不怎麼靠得住哦。"h很受有錢人喜愛的精靈。有時會遭到那些打它額頭寶石主意的獵人們襲擊。"�科學家對於是吉拔喵驚人的長度促成了互聯網的迷因風潮，還是迷因導致喵喵發生了前所未有的進化，仍存在分歧。"w浮躁、任性、耐不住性子。深受那些比起被別人照顧，更喜歡照顧別人的訓練師歡迎。"_圓臉是富貴的象徵。體型豐滿，大盤臉的貓老大會被認為是美麗的。"k額頭上的金錢越黑就越硬，也越能受到夥伴的尊敬。性格勇猛，什麼都不怕。"e有著十分好戰的性格。頭上像鐵頭盔一樣的東西其實是它硬化後的體毛。"\使用念力會頭痛，所以平時會盡量不做任何事，就在發呆中度過。"k即便是遊得很快的魚精靈，它也能用定身法定住其行動，並輕易地進行捕捉。"n該精靈會因一點小事而立刻動怒。由於不會積累壓力，所以能活相當長的時間。"�它不會原諒激怒它的人或精靈，會持續地追擊對方。就算把對方揍得無法行動也依然不會原諒對方。"n會將隱藏在心裡的憤怒之情凝聚在拳頭裡，其威力能深入對手骨髓，使其粉碎。"k熟悉後便會與人親近，但野生的卡蒂狗會和巖狗狗就領地而展開激烈的爭奪。"\把體內熊熊燃燒的火焰作為能量在大地奔馳。留下了大量的傳說。"�將猛烈燃燒的火焰纏繞在牙齒上撲向獵物。雖然體型很大，卻能以靈巧的假動作戲弄敵手，那姿態就像是舞蹈一般。"�雖然危險，卻嚮往登上陸地。因為它還只能晃晃悠悠地走路，所以被敵人發現後會慌忙逃入水中。"b雖然已經能在陸地上生活，但還是棲息在有大量魚精靈可捕食的水中。"_雖然在水精靈中是屬於游泳健將那一類的，但平時卻生活在陸地上。"e明明叫聲有如嚎叫一般，但某位作曲家卻受其影響創作了優美的敘事曲。"�它能夠讀懂他人的想法，當危險臨近時會進行傳送。如果你想抓住它，就必須讓自己的頭腦保持空白。"b雖然有著強大的精神力，但如果沒有拿著銀湯匙，精神力量就會減半。"b手中的湯匙是胡地用超能力生成的。每把湯匙都是這世上獨一無二的。"\非常喜歡鍛鍊。盯著自己每天不斷增大的肌肉，愈加勤奮地鍛鍊。"b如果遇到了真正的強敵，就會解開腰上的力量限制腰帶，並使出全力。"V使出百萬噸級的拳擊，將阻擋的敵人擊飛到地平線的另一端。"~無論多強的攻擊，都可以通過彎曲纖細柔軟的身體來回避。會從嘴裡吐出連鐵都能溶化的液體。"k到了晚上就會用尾鉤掛在樹枝上睡覺。如果睡相不好，早上就會掉到地上哦。"~會讓長在腦袋上的藤蔓像小生物一樣動來動去引誘獵物。等獵物接近時就會張開大嘴一口吞掉。"q在沙灘等地方晒乾後，依然能存活的情況也有很多。泡在水裡的話就會溼潤復活。"d從紅色珠子中發出超音波使獵物變得虛弱後，就會用80根觸手纏住對手。"q活了很久的小拳石在身上的角被磨平後會變得圓滾滾的。性格也非常的冷靜平穩。"_會爬上山崖前往山頂。到達山頂後，會立刻沿著來時的山路滾下去。"e它會讓自己的身體爆炸，然後利用這爆炸的力量，快速登上陡峭的山路。"\會用頭錘和夥伴爭鬥。頭上的鐵礦砂會附著在磁力強的一方那裡。"S受到喜歡吃的石頭影響，它全身都帶著電。性格非常好鬥。"b能發射帶電的巨大岩石。打中後，著彈點附近就會迸發出驚人的電擊。"t雖然出生後立刻站起來十分不易，但在跌倒中追趕雙親能幫助它鍛煉出結實的腰腿。"�雖然平時會很悠閒地在原野上到處亂跑，但一旦認真起來，鬃毛上的火焰便會燃燒，會以240公里的時速開始奔跑。"n能從眼神中讀取對方的內心。如果發現了邪惡的想法，就會在轉眼間消失不見。"n勇猛果敢，自尊心強。會在蹄子上的毛裡儲存精神力量，在森林中輕快地奔跑。"_有傳說講呆呆獸打哈欠就會下雨，所以據說有些地方會供奉呆呆獸。"t為了能從其尾巴上吸到更多更多的甜味，貪吃的大舌貝把外殼變成了螺旋狀的樣子。"b腦海中經常會湧現出一些像是改變世界的想法，但不久後會依次忘記。"\它以只生長於伽勒爾地區的植物的種子為食，因此尾巴是辣味的。"h如果去捏咬著它的大舌貝的舌頭，它就會從螺的尖端噴出含有劇毒的液體。"k會一邊詠唱詭異的咒語，一邊混合吃掉的東西和體內的毒素來製造可疑的藥。"}釋放出電磁波，在空中飄浮。如果在吞食電力的時候觸碰它，就會全身被電得劈里啪啦的。"b會發出神祕的電波，在三合一磁怪棲息的地方，精密機器會發生故障。"e用雷達監視著自己的領地。一旦發現入侵者，就會立即用破壞光線懲治。"q手上拿著的植物莖好像有好有壞，所以大蔥鴨之間有時會為了爭奪莖而彼此戰鬥。"h在不斷活用又粗又長的伽勒爾大蔥的過程中，大蔥鴨演化成了獨特的樣子。"q只有經歷過無數戰鬥的大蔥鴨才能進化成這個樣子。當大蔥枯萎了就會離開戰場。"u2個腦袋從來不會同時睡著。為了防止在睡著時受到敵人襲擊，所以它們會輪流望風。"u3個腦袋朝著不同方向時，就是它在進行警戒的證明。不小心靠近的話就會被鳥嘴啄。"}因為有著厚厚的脂肪，所以在寒冷的海里它也毫不在意，但在溫暖的海里卻有點容易疲勞。"S進食後會在沙灘上晒日光浴。會通過增加體溫來幫助消化。"h誕生於海底的汙泥。在乾淨的地方，它就會因體內的細菌無法增長而死去。"k食物變少數量也會急劇減小。為了防止它滅絕，人們開始了製造人工汙泥池。"e為了解決垃圾問題，人們把它帶到了阿羅拉。它能美美地吃光任何垃圾。"b身體的顏色極度鮮豔，這是因為吃下的垃圾經常在體內引起化學反應。"Y雖然留在殼裡的沙子終會變成珍珠，但會因為礙事而被它吐掉。"_擁有非常堅硬的外殼。外殼上的傷痕會逐漸隆起，長成大大的尖刺。"Y據說是怨念寄宿在了墓地散發出的氣體中，並最終變成了精靈。"\心情悲傷時單獨夜出很危險。因為你會被鬼斯通捉住而無法回家。"h半夜裡路燈下的影子之所以會超過自己，是因為耿鬼化作那影子跑了過去。"w因為腦內有磁鐵，所以即使在地裡挖洞前進也不會弄錯方向。年紀越大身體就越圓潤。"f在地下住得比大巖蛇還深。會朝著地球的中心挖掘，有時洞深可達1公里。"�它那水晶般的部分阻擋了所有儀器的探測，科學家們從泰坦蛇的引力能力中推斷這些晶體是中子物質。"\能在娛樂設施的附近見到其身影。會偷吃那晚孩子們所做的美夢。"S是非常危險的精靈，但祈求良好睡眠的人們稱其為救世主。"{會在沙灘上挖洞並生活在裡面。在食物稀少的沙灘上，能夠看到為搶地盤而爭鬥的大鉗蟹們。"t雖然巨鉗蟹之間會通過揮舞巨大的鉗子來傳遞信號，但由於鉗子太重很快就會疲勞。"e它的鉗子變得異常巨大，如果無法夾住對手，就會直接狠狠地掄打它們。"�最早在製造精靈球的公司被發現，以及它的外觀十分酷似精靈球，這兩點之間的聯繫至今還是個謎。"w會吃空氣中的電能。在有雷落下的日子裡，吃下過多電力的頑皮雷彈會在各處大爆炸。"}形狀頗似精靈球的奇異精靈。當情緒高漲時，積蓄在腹部的電流就會放出，同時發出大笑。"�體表的組織與球果的成分極為接近，不可思議。當它情緒焦躁時所放出的電流，能量足以匹敵20次的落雷。"p由傻氣的阿特亞在80年代左右發現，這些時髦的燈光球有助於將客人帶到俱樂部。"z它戴著太陽鏡以保護自己的眼睛免受眾多燈光的刺激，最近有幾隻被引進到了奧瑞地區。"V用心靈感應與夥伴交流。據說兼有植物與某種別的遺傳基因。"j會用精神力量來迎擊敵人。3個腦袋會分別放出念力，所以威力也會變成3倍。"z悠然愜意地長大之後，它便不再需要原來的精神力量，沉睡於體內的龍之力量已經覺醒。"e頭上戴著母親的骨頭，因此無法知曉其長相和表情，只知道它一直在哭。"a會有節奏地敲響骨頭，並以此和夥伴進行聯絡。節奏有著近50種變化。"\有哀悼夥伴的習性。如果路邊有隆起的土，那是嘎啦嘎啦的墳墓。"�如果每天不去鍛鍊，壓力就會積攢下來，所以訓練師在培育它的時候，需要在日程管理上好好下番功夫。"h會用能自由伸縮的腿施展強力踢把對手踢倒。戰鬥後會去按揉疲勞的雙腿。"~快拳郎有著不屈之心，永遠不會氣餒。據說在它體內寄宿著以世界冠軍為目標的拳擊手的靈魂。"{高速旋轉時施展出的腳踢是兼具攻擊與防禦的出色技能。比起走路，旋轉著前進會來得更快。"q不管是什麼，都會用長舌頭去舔舔看。被舔到的部位如果放著不管就會紅腫發炎。"O會舉行看誰舌頭伸得遠的大賽。目前的最高紀錄是25米。"�刺激它的話，瓦斯的毒素就會變強，並會從身體各處猛烈噴出。脹成一個圓圓的球后會發生大爆炸。"�非常喜歡腐爛的溼垃圾所產生的瓦斯。會定居在不打掃衛生的人家中，並在夜深人靜時去垃圾箱中尋找瓦斯。"q在往昔工廠林立，空氣嚴重汙染的時代，雙彈瓦斯不知道為什麼變成了這個樣子。"�大腦很小，頭腦很差，跑著跑著就會忘記是為什麼而跑。好像破壞了什麼東西后，偶爾也會記起奔跑的目的。"n角能粉碎鑽石原石，尾巴能一擊掃塌大樓。堅硬的皮膚連大炮也無法傷及分毫。"\從手掌的洞裡發射出小拳石。全身的護具連火山噴發都能經受住。"e是非常溫順的精靈，但如果被奪走了腹部的圓石頭，就會哭著大吵大鬧。"q經歷了一段以奪取它腹部的蛋為目標的濫捕歷史後，它的數量已經變得非常稀少。"b心中充滿著愛的精靈。據說只有和訓練師心靈相通的吉利蛋才能進化。"�被敵人抓住後藤蔓會一下斷開。因為完全不疼，所以它會趁那個空當逃走。第二天就能長出新的藤蔓。"b伸出由植物的藤蔓長成的手臂纏住獵物。即便手臂被吃掉也毫不在意。"z雖然看起來像植物，但滿身的翡翠色源自於其鱗片。據說，盯著它的眼睛會倒三年黴運。"�身上的蛇雖然堅硬如石，但是其身軀卻異常柔軟。捕食者若攻擊它毫無保護的四肢，就得對付它強有力的爪子。"b不能接近從袋裡溜出來玩耍的孩子。因為它的母親就在某處守護著它。"e母女倆並肩作戰，接二連三地擊打敵人。它們之間的戰鬥紐帶牢不可破。"w如果感到危險，就會條件反射地從嘴裡吐出漆黑的墨汁逃跑。能靈巧地擺動背鰭遊動。"~會通過旋轉身體制造漩渦。在用強到連漁船都會被捲入的激流讓獵物變弱後，會將其整個吞掉。"k沉睡在沒有生物居住的海底。據說颱風來到時就會醒來，四處徘徊尋找獵物。"b雖然漂亮的尾鰭是其特徵，但角金魚之間好像會比誰的角更粗更尖銳。"z頭上的角會像鑽頭一樣旋轉，即便是堅硬的岩石也能一下子貫穿。雄性有著鮮豔的顏色。"e它們沉迷於數河中的小石子，如果是不吉利的數字，就會變得十分暴躁。"�當一群可怕的精靈排成大陣仗沿河而列時，這便是馬凱亞金魚王出現的徵兆。它們會提供無盡的祝福來換取效忠。"_不管受了多少傷也沒問題。再生能力很高，所以半天左右就會復原。"n發光的核心被稱為海之寶石。有人將它變成昂貴的飾品，在暗地裡偷偷地買賣。"S會拼命地模仿對方的動作和表情。但還說不上模仿得很好。"w有著非凡的默劇表演實力。在你看入迷的時候，不知不覺間就會出現一面真正的牆壁。"e會從腳底釋放出冷氣。一整天都會在自己凍住的地板上努力練習踢踏舞。"V踢踏舞的達人。會揮動手中的冰杖，向觀眾表演輕快的舞步。"l2把銳利的鐮刀並不單單是武器。還能靈活地運用它們來切割獵物，然後食用。"h有著鋼鐵般的身體。比起夾住敵人，它粗重的鉗子更適合用來把敵人砸扁。"}只有極具攻擊性或訓練有素的精靈才會願意與之戰鬥。它銳利的鉗子可以將敵人剪成碎片。"�用堅硬的岩石守護自身，以粗獷的斧頭砍倒大樹。性情暴躁易怒。要是在荒野遇見它，逃跑將是唯一選擇。"n在確認某樣東西時，會先用嘴脣而不是手去觸碰試試。會經常用舌頭舔去汙漬。"h會按獨特的節奏扭動腰部。棲息在阿羅拉的迷脣姐，那動作更是妙不可言。"q當角發出青白色亮光時，就表示充電已經完成了。如果去摸，就會被電得麻麻的。"M全身都帶著電。會一圈圈掄動手臂進行充電後再出拳。"Y握住冒著電火花的尾巴做成帶電的拳頭後，就會用盡全力猛毆。"w在火山地帶經常能見到。如果冒失地給了它食物的話會很高興，激動地噴出600度的火。"e全身都在燃燒，光是呼出的氣息就帶著高溫，打噴嚏時會同時噴出火焰。"n發射出火球，一招制敵。因為會把對方弄得焦黑，所以在捕捉獵物時不會使用。"e雖然身體壯實，但弱點是怕冷。到了晚上，就會將身體埋在樹葉中睡覺。"~當它展翅飛翔的嗡鳴聲變成轟鳴聲時，它就會以全速猛衝。它的衝撞常常足以將對手擊穿建築。"n會在森林中四處尋找甜甜蜜。雖然以擁有一身怪力為傲，但卻不是很擅長飛行。"n它們常常仰望著天空，尋找一個站立之地，以便隨時實現舉起整個世界的壯舉。"n會組成一個群體生活。在群體中，誰的角最粗最長，並傷痕累累，誰就是老大。"y每天能產出20升的牛奶。越是能長出優質牧草的土地，它所產出的牛奶也就越香濃可口。"\生命力頑強，即便在汙水中也毫不在意。生活在世界各地的水邊。"k能不斷地吐出破壞光線，將周圍一帶燃燒殆盡。也有一些地區稱其為破壞神。"}重點保護過頭導致數量增加太多。據說在拉普拉斯過多的海域，魚精靈的數量已經減小了。"�它身上由冰粒子構成的樂譜暗含玄妙，然而音符卻難以辨認；有傳聞稱曾有人聽到紹爾納德用一種獨特的語言傾訴自己的心聲。"{會變身成它看到的東西。但對於不在眼前的東西，它只能靠記憶來變身，所以有時也會失敗。"P至今未弄清為何只有伊布攜帶著非常不穩定的遺傳基因。"n美麗的水邊是其主要的棲息地。如果感覺有外敵來襲，它就會跳入水中躲起來。"q肺中有能產生電力的器官。從它的吐息中，能聽到裡面混雜著劈里啪啦的電流聲。"]大口吸入空氣就是要攻擊的前兆。這意味著1700度的火焰即將來襲。"Y本來沒有任何能力，但據說為了保護自己從而覺醒了預知能力。"\夜行性精靈。大大的瞳孔即便在一片漆黑中也能看清獵物的樣子。"t本身並不好鬥，但如果是為了保護夥伴，就會削尖尾巴上的葉片，變成刀刃來作戰。"a把體毛凍住，變成銳利的針來保護身體。體溫最低可減小到零下60度。"k會用緞帶般的觸角纏住訓練師的手臂。因為只要觸碰後就能知道對方的心情。"k它柔軟、友善、體型巨大，受到幾乎所有人的喜愛。攻擊者不知從何處下手。"[由20年前夢想著宇宙的科學家們創造而成。那夢想至今仍未實現。"a搭載有AI。會自己學習各種各樣的事情，但也會記住一些多餘的東西。"q不穩定的舉動很惹人注目。這問題好像要歸咎於負責升級程序的技術人員的水平。"�光華市的防火牆！這款創新型產品採用獨特的鍵入方式和尖端的網絡威脅清除協議，是您的堅強後盾。"k從古代的化石復原而來。在很久以前還是海洋的地方能發掘出它的貝殼化石。"b用觸手纏住獵物並讓其無法行動後，就會用銳利的牙齒使出致命一擊。"b除某些極少數地方外，該精靈已基本滅絕。會用堅硬的外殼保護身體。"s能以大約29節的速度遊動。快速接近獵物後，會用鐮刀撕裂獵物並給予其致命一擊。"t由琥珀中殘留的遺傳基因復原而來。性情比想像的還要粗暴，甚至還出現了犧牲者。"V在古代，這種精靈是頂級掠食者。它有力量抓著怪顎龍飛行。"e長長的毛髮下面藏著食物，但有時也會忘記藏了東西而發生異臭的問題。"t平時不是吃就是睡，但如果因某些事而認真起來的話，好像就會發揮出驚人的力量。"\以接近每天一次的頻率反覆蛻皮並長大。剛蛻完皮的皮膚很嬌嫩。"e人們相信它能操縱天氣，所以在哈克龍棲息的湖裡，供品總是源源不斷。"{即便是狂風暴雨的海上，它也能波瀾不驚地飛過。目睹過它那身姿的船長稱其為大海的化身。"w操控冰的傳說的鳥精靈。因為拍動翅膀就能冷卻空氣，所以據說急凍鳥飛過就會下雪。"t操控電的傳說的鳥精靈。平時生活在雷雲之中。被雷電擊中，體內就會湧現出力量。"z操控火的傳說的鳥精靈。據說身體受傷後，會進入火山口的熔岩裡，燃燒全身治癒傷口。"_用精神力量製作出的羽毛形刀刃能像裁紙般輕鬆地劈開厚厚的鐵板。"q腳力強勁，僅憑一腳就能把翻斗車踢得粉碎。據說能以300公里的時速在山中奔馳。"q如果有誰接觸到了它那如烈火般邪惡的氣場，便會靈魂枯竭，燒得只剩白色灰燼。"�通過操作遺傳基因而製造出來的精靈。人類的科學力量可以造出它的身體，卻無法造出一顆溫柔的心。"�據說它有著所有精靈的遺傳基因。因為可以隨心所欲地隱形，所以就算接近人類也完全不會被察覺。"�雖然會揮舞葉子威嚇對手，但由於葉子上會飄散出甜甜的香氣，所以雙方都會變得心平氣和下來哦。"l在脖子周圍那些圓圓捲起的葉子中都長有1個小樹芽。那香味會讓人煥發活力。"h花的香味能夠平復情緒。戰鬥的時候，它會散發出香味來削弱對手的戰意。"w會從背上噴出火焰保護自己。雖然生氣時的火焰勢頭猛烈，但疲憊時就會不完全燃燒。"t會用火勢和熱風威嚇對手。在用敏捷的身手躲避對手攻擊的同時會用火焰點燃對手。"h會用灼熱的火焰在周圍製造出熱浪隱藏身影。燃起的爆炸氣浪能燒盡一切。"�據考察，它是受到聳立於洗翠中心的靈山之氣影響，才形成了現在的模樣。據說會用自己的火焰淨化並超渡無處可去的靈魂。"�個子雖小但顎的力量很強。這力量強大到小鋸鱷只是想輕輕咬一下，但卻會讓對方遭受重傷的程度。"t一旦咬住就絕不會鬆口。牙齒尖端像魚鉤那樣向後彎曲，一旦刺進去就拔不出來了。"e會張開大嘴威嚇對手。能用強韌的後腳蹬地，並以驚人的速度猛撞過來。"�這種精靈非常謹慎。它會用尾巴站立，以便從遠處發現敵人。如果發現敵人，它會用尾巴敲擊地面來警告同伴。"t就算受到敵人的襲擊，也能一溜煙地鑽進細小的縫隙裡逃走。手腳雖短卻十分靈活。"t它肚子上的眼睛能增強它的超能力，而且從不眨眼。還可以用念力驅除泥土和灰塵。"z夜晚它會挖掘地洞，只露出肚子上的眼睛。在其餘器官睡覺時，那隻眼睛會凝視著虛空。"\每天必定會按固定的節奏傾斜脖子。過去人們會養它來代替時鐘。"Y頭倒轉過來就表示它非常煩惱。如果這時去驚動它，就會被啄。"~身上的絨毛可以使其免受寒冷的侵擾。在冬季時會藏著雪堆下休眠，直到春天到來時才會出現。"t它們的身影在飛掠過後，會留下陣陣寒意。有些訓練師認為這種感覺非常神清氣爽。"P非常膽小的精靈。會和夥伴一起張開反射壁來保護巢穴。"\據說它背上的花紋和夜空裡的星星有關，但是具體情況至今未明。"a由它吐絲製成的巢穴非常堅固。即便放上10公斤重的岩石也不會破掉。"}每晚都會為了尋求獵物而四處遊走。發現獵物時會吐絲封住對方的行動，然後用牙齒啃食。"`會通過2根觸手發出微光來吸引獵物。是一種在夜釣時很有用的精靈。"b棲息在深邃的海里。會用光混亂獵物，並趁對方畏縮時將其整個吞下。"w能將人和精靈發出的溫情和喜悅這些情感轉化成能量。會將殼裡儲存的幸福分發出去。"z據說是會帶來幸運的精靈。如果發現心靈純潔的人或精靈，就會現身並將幸福分給他們。"_會給那些彼此認同對方且不做無端爭鬥的人們帶去各種各樣的恩惠。"n它的目光彷佛一直在觀察著這裡。只要稍有靠近，它就會一蹦一蹦地跳著逃開。"b據說該精靈雖然有著能預知未來的力量，但卻沒有能改變未來的力量。"�絨毛摩擦產生的電力會被儲存起來。如果覺得可愛而直接用手碰它的話，就會被啪地一下電得又麻又痛。"~能將電力儲存在鬆軟的毛髮中。因為儲存了太多電力，所以身上有些地方已經變得光禿禿的了。"n尾巴上的光能傳至宇宙，所以身在何處一目瞭然。因此它平時不會讓尾巴發光。"\尾巴里貯滿了成長時所需的營養。會坐在充滿彈性的尾巴上玩耍。"_尾巴的末端充滿了比水還輕的油脂，因此即使遊過河川也不會溺水。"�長長的耳朵是瑪力露麗重要的感應器。只要注意聽，即使是在湍急的河流中，也能分辨出那裡獵物的種類。"w會從眼睛裡排出水分。看起來就像是正在哭泣，所以似乎也有讓敵人麻痺大意的效果。"t它之所以會有柔軟又結實的手臂，是因為在長期擺出同樣姿勢的過程中得到了鍛鍊。"�能隨風輕輕飄浮的精靈。如果感到有強風要來的跡象，夥伴之間就會互相綁緊葉子，做好不被強風吹走的準備。"氣溫超過18度就會開花。開花方式會隨溫度的不同而變化，所以有時也會用它來代替溫度計。"t會乘著溫暖的南風飛越大海，一直飛到外國的精靈。遇到冷空氣就會降落到地面上。"h習慣用尾巴做各種事情後，手就變得不怎麼靈活了。會在很高的樹上築巢。"r無論做什麼都會用到尾巴。如果被它的2條尾巴抱緊，那就證明是真的和你很親近。"�為了將體內儲存的營養一直保留到進化那一刻，它幾乎不會動一下。平時它什麼都不吃只飲朝露。"�會從太陽的能量中製造出營養。在氣溫高的白天會頻繁地活動，太陽下山後會突然變得一動不動。"z不轉動眼珠就可以360度環視。擅長急停和轉向，很快便能將它盯上的獵物追得走投無路。"h高速飛行著，在擦肩而過的瞬間咬斷對手的脖子。它熱衷這樣的戰鬥方式。"t平時生活在水中，覓食等時候偶爾會來到地上。在陸地上會用有毒的粘液覆蓋身體。"�會在水裡張開嘴巴，然後就只是靜靜地等著食物自己碰巧跳進來。因為不會動，所以肚子也不怎麼會餓。"e會為老大去尋找閃閃發光的東西。據說它很不吉利，厭惡它的人也很多。"n絕對不能容忍失敗或是背叛的跟班。是為了維持群體的秩序，不得已而為之的。"w嚇唬別人是其活著的意義。如果把耳朵貼近它脖子上的紅珠子，就能從中聽到悲鳴聲。"k因為四處作祟，播撒詛咒而被人們所恐懼。也會隨性地使用幫助人類的咒文。"~身體像是古代文字的精靈。雖然已有人在研究先出現的是文字還是未知圖騰，但至今仍是個謎。"�在月夜和夥伴們進行互推遊戲。緊緊的推擠會使它的忍耐力變強。這項訓練能讓它使出猛烈的雙倍奉還。"�雖然是會一味忍耐的精靈，但只有尾巴受到攻擊這一點無法忍耐。會尋找和對手同歸於盡的機會。"�尾巴上的腦袋裡也有著小小的大腦。會對臭味和聲音產生反應進行攻擊，因此從後面靠近的話會被突然咬住。"j現在，它的頭部和尾巴的腦波已經同步，這種精靈的超能力是麒麟奇的10倍。"{會用唾液將樹皮粘在自己身上，從而讓自己變得又厚又大。上了年紀的榛果球是無比巨大的。"z只要一有東西靠近，它就會射出鋼鐵外殼的碎片進行攻擊。這是一種無意識的條件反射。"J能挖掘地面移動。會友好地和地鼠共用各自的隧道。"[會用堅硬的尾巴來挖穿地下深處的巖盤來築巢。巢穴長達10公里。"b溫順的土龍麻麻會將闖入自己巢穴的精靈背在背上，並將其送到洞口。"�它會像在地上滑行時一樣悄無聲息地滑過天空。能用雙臂上的大爪子和腳上的爪子抓住獵物的臉，然後再刺入毒針。"V用尾巴倒掛在樹枝上觀察獵物。瞅準空當就從上空發動襲擊。"n喜歡親近人，愛撒嬌。它的動作與長相之間的反差好像會讓年輕女性為之著迷。"P顎的力量很強，但不喜歡爭鬥，所以很少有展露的機會。"q吞下水後，會利用水的力量將全身的毒針一起發射出去。是不太擅長遊動的精靈。"�會用針散佈毒素的棘手傢伙，因而受到漁民們的厭惡。棲息在其他地區的千針魚則是呈現著不同的姿態。"~身上如同槍尖般的針以及凶暴的性情使這種精靈得到了海鬼的外號。會吞下毒物作為自身糧食。"z會在岩石下面一邊吃著甲殼裡儲存的樹果一邊隱藏身體。樹果和體液混合後會變成果汁。"n依靠團隊合作從鳥精靈的巢穴裡將蛋偷出來後，卻會為了由誰來吃而爭吵不休。"e變聰明瞭，不會因為食物的分配而打架。如果被它的爪子勾到就會凍傷。"�強健的爪子形狀有助於在斷崖絕壁上行動自如。爪子尖端滴出的毒液會在捉住獵物時侵襲其神經。"�擁有凌駕其他物種之上的身體能力以及劇毒。在寒冷的高地上所向無敵。偏好獨自行動，而不會集結成群。"z一直在舔滲入了蜂蜜的手掌。熊寶寶的蜂蜜是由水果和大針蜂收集的花粉混合後製成的。"~據說森林裡到處都是圈圈熊用來收集食物的大樹和小河。每天都會為了蒐集食物在森林裡走動。"�考察結果顯示，正是遍佈在洗翠大地上的溼地土壤，造就了它堅實的軀體和自在運用泥炭的新能力。"k代替了體內血液的灼熱熔岩正在不斷循環，為身體輸送著必要的營養和氧氣。"x據說體溫約有1萬度，因此被雨點打到後會蒸汽瀰漫，身體周圍會被濃厚的霧氣所籠罩。"h會用鼻子摩擦地面覓食。喜歡吃枯草下長出的蘑菇。偶爾也會挖到溫泉哦。"k身上覆蓋著可以抵抗冰寒的又厚又長的毛皮。會用牙齒挖出埋在冰裡的食物。"]從遙遠的過去就存在的精靈，甚至在1萬年前的冰層中也發現過它。"}珊瑚枝在沐浴陽光時，會發出七彩光芒，非常好看。就算折斷，也能在一夜之間長回原樣。"e它是因急劇環境變化而死去的遠古太陽珊瑚。會用珊瑚枝吸取人的精氣。"Y靈力增強之後從殼裡被解放出來。用靈體保護著內核中的靈魂。"n又被稱做海洋狙擊手。就算是100公尺外的獵物，它發射的水槍也一定能夠命中。"q巖洞是它主要的棲身之所。章魚桶吐出的漆黑墨汁還會被當成製作料理時的食材。"Y不認生，會靠近人類的船隻。背上的花紋根據地域而有所不同。"�可以在晴朗的日子裡看到在海上優雅跳躍的巨翅飛魚群哦。就算被鐵炮魚吸附在身上也不會在意。"�在它們的附近，食物會腐爛，牛奶會凝結。因此，它們常常被憤怒的精靈，如大奶罐或霜奶仙等追逐。"}它會用冰雹敲擊房屋，試圖讓屋內的人打開門或窗戶。人們曾經會引進大鋼蛇來抵禦它們。"_會用尾巴將食物裹起來運送。尾巴最大的信使鳥就是群體裡的老大。"e全身披著鋼甲。雖然看上去很重，但最快能以每小時300公里的速度飛行。"_會在天亮之前反覆發出恐怖的長嚎，並以此來彰顯自己群體的存在。"k恐怖的長嚎是其特徵。過去人們曾認為它是來自地獄的使者而對其心存畏懼。"b據說它們是天啟四騎士的坐騎，它們的嚎叫將在世界末日時響徹天際..."}在河邊挖個豎坑生活。會在住處附近做上鼻子標記，以此來告訴夥伴這裡是自己的領地哦。"w擅長把身體蜷成一團，邊高速滾動邊向對手猛撞的攻擊。一旦開始滾動就很難停下來。"n由於形狀完美的角作為藝術品可以賣出高價錢，因此該精靈曾遭濫捕差點滅絕。"�製造肉眼不可見的障壁時，黑珠會發出妖異的光輝。從它身上脫落的鬍鬚是用來製作溫暖冬衣的實用原料。"\用從尾巴尖尖慢慢滲出的體液繪出獨有的標記，宣告自己的領地。"�誕生於地下，會一邊吃著泥土，一邊朝至親所在的地面前進。因為光線刺眼，所以它不太能適應哦。"k會到處胡鬧，相當危險的蛹。在巖盤一樣的外殼內，新的身體正在逐漸成形。"{會在山中徘徊以尋求戰鬥對手。但如果遇到的是比自己弱小的對手，它就會視若無睹地離開。"k班機拉是由瓦爾雷克斯發現的。它非常聰明且不具攻擊性，儘可能避免戰鬥。"w體內蘊藏著雷電般速度的精靈。它的長嚎會如同天雷落地時一樣震動空氣，搖撼大地。"z體內蘊藏著熔岩般熱情的精靈。被認為是從火山的噴發中誕生，能噴出燃盡一切的火焰。"}體內蘊藏著泉水般溫柔的精靈。會用滑行一樣的動作在大地上奔跑，有著淨化渾水的力量。"n有著只要輕輕揮動翅膀就能吹走房屋的破壞力，因此躲在不為人知的海底生活。"{據說在不同角度光線的照射下，會閃耀七彩光芒的羽毛能帶來幸福。據傳它住在彩虹的腳下。"z從未來穿越時光而來的精靈。一般認為只要時拉比出現，就會有光明的未來在等著我們。"b能夠用腳底的小刺鉤住垂直的牆壁攀爬。會甩動粗粗的尾巴進行摔打。"{靠著體內長出的葉子，可以方便地在森林裡隱藏身形躲避敵人。是生活在密林裡的爬樹高手。"~體內長出的葉子非常銳利。會用敏捷的動作在樹枝間跳來跳去，從敵人的頭上或背後猛撲過去。"r會緊貼著訓練師搖搖晃晃地走路。能從嘴裡噴出攝氏1000度的灼熱火球把對手燒焦。"t會用鳥嘴裡吐出的灼熱火焰和極具破壞力的腿技戰鬥。因為叫聲很大，所以非常吵。"t戰鬥時會從手腕噴出灼熱的火焰，勇敢地迎戰對手。對手越強，火焰就會燒得越旺。"w在水中，水躍魚用臉頰上的鰓呼吸。如果它在戰鬥中陷入困境，會釋放出驚人的力量。"�沼躍魚的身體表面覆蓋著一層薄薄的粘液，使它能夠在陸地上生活。這種精靈喜歡在海灘的泥漿中玩耍。"�巨沼怪能通過用鰭感知波濤聲和海風的細微變化來預測暴風雨。發生暴風雨時，會堆積岩石保護巢穴。"�找到動的東西就會立刻咬上去。雖然在獵物精疲力盡之前會一直追著不放，但受到反擊的話，有時也會被嚇退。"�發出凶猛的吼聲並壓低身體的時候，就是它準備發動攻擊的前兆。會用銳利的尖牙一口咬住對手。"~之所以會一直之字形地到處亂走，是因為它的好奇心太過旺盛，對看到的各種東西都很感興趣。"w會筆直地猛跑，發現障礙物時就會通過直角轉彎來躲避。非常不擅長慢慢轉彎的道路。"_這似乎是蛇紋熊最古老的樣子。會之字形亂走，把周圍弄得一團糟。"_有著十分好戰的性情。即使是比自己強的對手也會魯莽地發起挑戰。"e能夠發出驚人的音量。它在大叫的同時威嚇對手的樣子被稱為“攔堵”。"w會用尾部的刺剝開樹皮，以滲出的樹汁為食。有著吸盤的腳即使在玻璃上也不會打滑。"{等待進化的時候，為了防止掉落，會將絲線纏在樹枝上支撐身體。能從小洞觀察外面的情況。"z非常喜歡甜甜花粉的精靈。如果把開著花的花盆放在窗邊，它就一定會飛過來採集花粉。"�一旦動了就無法進化出強壯的身體，所以無論受到怎樣的痛擊都不會動。不過那時受到的疼痛它永遠都不會忘記。"�扇動翅膀會揚起細小的劇毒粉末。一旦吸入就連職業摔角手也會臥病不起。會用像雷達一樣的觸角尋找食物。"�它的角能夠高效地調節自身體溫。為了進化，它會主動尋找火和冰屬性的捕食者，從它們身上獲取能量."�其絲質使其與雪白的岩石融為一體。如果遭到攻擊，它唯一的手段就是減小體溫使自己變得難以入口。"�與它的豐緣形態相比要更為溫和，但對於它的捕食者卻極為凶猛。它的口器可以注入類似於液氮的液體用於反擊。"}其火焰由類似於本生燈的器官維持燃燒。好奇的精靈總會試著將其熄滅，但往往都會失敗。"�它的腹部實際上是一臺複雜的火炬驅動器。它們的遷徙路線可以通過跟隨其超音速飛行所留的斷木來追蹤。"w據說原本是生活在陸地上的，但因為頭上的葉子變重了，所以變成了浮在水面上生活。"z夜行性，太陽下山後就會開始活動。如果看到垂釣者，就會從水中扯線搗亂並引以為樂。"�它有著聽到歡快的節奏，身上的細胞就會活躍起來的體質。這讓它在戰鬥時也能發揮出強大的力量。"h會把頭頂粘在樹枝上懸掛著吸收水分。水喝得越多，身體就會越滑越光亮。"}住在茂密繁盛的森林裡的精靈。偶爾從森林裡出來嚇唬人。非常討厭有誰抓自己的長鼻子。"l據說是在樹齡超過1000年的大樹頂上居住的謎之精靈。會用葉子團扇掀起強風。"�這種精靈非常勇敢，會毫不退縮地與強大的對手戰鬥。另一方面，當它飢餓時會變得虛弱並大聲哭泣。"w會盤旋在遙遠的高空，發現獵物後就會俯衝而下，用腳爪緊緊抓住獵物令其無法逃脫。"V翅膀又細又長。能乘著增加氣流，像滑翔機一樣在空中翱翔。"w會將小型精靈放入它那鼓得大大的鳥嘴中運送。但是要把它帶到哪兒去就不得而知了。"�能用頭上的角感知人的情緒。雖然幾乎不會出現在人的面前，但感受到積極向上的情緒後就會靠過來。"�據說使用被頭上的角增強過的精神力量時，周圍的空間會出現扭曲，並能看見現實中沒有的景色。"q有著用精神力量扭曲空間，製造出小型黑洞的力量。是會拼命保護訓練師的精靈。"S因為有著能敏銳感知對手想法的能力，所以可以率先攻擊。"�如果遇到危險，就會從突起的地方分泌出甜汁。收集它製成糖漿，然後塗抹在麵包上就會非常可口。"r會用眼珠花紋威嚇敵人。如果這樣不起作用，就會揮動4根翅膀，靈活地四處逃竄。"�棲息在森林深處潮溼的地面上。經常會一動不動地待在落葉下面。會以落葉堆積起來後形成的腐葉土為食。"t會用輕巧的步法接近敵人，然後用能伸縮的手臂出拳。有著能令拳擊手汗顏的技術。"x每天會趴上20小時以上。因為它的身體幾乎一動不動，所以1天只要吃3片葉子就吃飽了。"�一刻也停不下來的精靈。就算想睡覺了，全身血液也還會沸騰，不去森林裡到處奔跑就無法平息下來。"�整天橫躺著生活的精靈。會吃觸手能及的地方長出來的草，如果草吃光了，就會很不情願地換個地方。"q會用銳利的爪子削開樹木的根部，並吸取其中的水分和營養。不適應耀眼的陽光。"{如果沒有好好培育，它就會不聽話，會持續大叫，所以據說它是用來測試訓練師本領的精靈。"�它是一種在土居忍士進化時，不知為何會擅自出現在精靈球裡的精靈。身體完全不動，也不呼吸。"�一旦大叫起來，就會被自己的聲音嚇到，然後以更大的聲音大吼大叫起來。停止大叫後就會累得睡著。"e會一邊跺腳一邊大叫。大叫後的一段時間內無法聽到任何聲音是其弱點。"z能靠大叫產生的震動引發地震。開始用身上的洞猛烈地吸入空氣就是要進行大叫的前兆。"n會朝著樹幹反覆練習巴掌招數。有時會因為朝著椰蛋樹練習巴掌招數而被扔飛。"b雖然喜歡比試力氣，但心地和善且注重禮儀，會慰勞自己的對戰對手。"e它會一動不動地用強力的磁力將獵物吸過來狩獵。但有時也會吸到天敵。"c使用3個小部件獲取食物，或是和敵人戰鬥。本體基本上只負責下命令。"�會追著自己尾巴到處跑的精靈。野生的向尾喵生活在森林中的樹洞裡。有著可愛的臉蛋，作為寵物非常受歡迎。"�過著居無定所生活的精靈。即使有其他精靈接近自己睡覺的地方，也絕不會去爭鬥，而會換個地方睡覺。"\所吃寶石的成分會在身體表面浮現出來。所形成的花紋變化無限。"�它所攜帶的寶石能映射出敵人的弱點與遺憾。如果它感覺不到愛，就會讓它的訓練師沉浸在悲傷中。"w狡黠而又恐怖的精靈。用可愛的舉止讓人麻痺大意，然後出其不意地用大顎一口吞下。"w它們的粉絲常常會因為其外觀而發生爭辯。它會根據訓練師的心情展現出不同的一面。"~令人頭疼的精靈。為了打造一副鋼鐵之軀，會從山上挖鐵礦石吃，但偶爾也會去吃橋樑或鐵軌。"}會通過喝上滿滿一肚子充滿營養的泉水來鍛鍊自己的鋼鐵之軀。會在美味的泉水附近築巢。"�會把一座山當做自己的領地，要是誰敢來胡鬧，它就會毫不留情地將其痛揍一頓。總是在山間巡邏。"t會在深山裡進行瑜伽的修行。但冥想時注意力總會被打斷，所以修行一直無法結束。"�據說通過冥想體內的能量就會增加，第6感也會隨之變得敏銳起來。會和山野融為一體並藉此來消除自己的氣息。"k這隻精靈可長達四年不進食，經過刻苦的修煉，已將舞蹈完全融入於戰鬥中。"k通過空氣與體毛的摩擦產生靜電。落雷獸如果奔跑，會發出劈里啪啦的聲音。"\在不自然的雷雲之下有著雷電獸。聽說會用和雷同等的速度奔馳。"b如果在暴風雨期間不加以安撫，它就會去追逐閃電，從而引起大混亂。"�一直在給夥伴加油的精靈。夥伴加油努力的話，它就會讓身體短路，產生劈里啪啦的火花聲來表達自己的喜悅。"�比起自己來，給夥伴加油更重要。會通過讓體內發出的電流短路，一邊放出華麗的火花，一邊給夥伴加油。"~太陽下山後就會從尾巴發出光，並通過亮度或閃爍來和夥伴交流。會被甜甜螢的甜甜香氣吸引。"�會利用甜甜的香氣引誘電螢蟲。然後誘導大量聚集而來的電螢蟲，讓它們在夜空中描繪幾何圖形。"k如果沐浴到溫暖的陽光，花苞就會打開並飛散出花粉。習慣住在清澈的水邊。"e會射出尖刺去攻擊那些盯上自己手上花朵的對手。花的香味能撫平情緒。"b用甜甜的香氣引誘獵物，並用雙臂的毒刺鞭刺入或勒緊，以了結對方。"{因為整個身體幾乎都是胃，所以能吞下和自己一樣大的東西。會用特殊的胃液消化任何東西。"�發現獵物後會向對方撒出自毛孔中噴出的帶劇毒的體液。等獵物變弱後就會張開大嘴一口吞掉對方。"s非常膽小，1只的話不會去狩獵。如果聚集了5只左右的話，就會一下子變得很粗暴。"z人們相信，如果帶著它脫落的牙齒就不會在海上遭遇事故，因此會將牙齒加工為飾品等。"�它的運動方式是許多火箭發動機設計的基礎。它在戰鬥前會吃下自己體重四倍的食物，但到最後還是感到飢餓。"n會張著嘴游泳，將食物連同海水一起吃下去。不要的水會從鼻子裡噴出來捨棄。"_因為會吃太多的魚精靈，所以數量增加過多的話，會被漁夫們驅趕。"{雖然遲鈍到被人敲打也不會察覺，但是對於飢餓1秒都無法忍耐。體內的熔岩一直在沸騰。"r體內有著火山的精靈。時不時會從背上的駝峰裡噴出體內儲存的1萬攝氏度的熔岩。"w體內的岩漿隨著時間推移而不斷積聚。如果沒有定期噴發，就可能會地殃及周遭地區。"h通過甲殼裡噴出的煙就能瞭解它的身體狀況。勢頭很旺時，說明很有精神。"t會用尾巴蹦來蹦去彈跳的精靈。靠著跳躍的震動來使心臟跳動，所以不能停止彈跳。"~會用黑珍珠增強精神力量的波動，並能隨意操縱對手的精靈。使出力量的時候鼻息會變得粗重。"_晃晃悠悠，步伐不穩健。如果長時間連續行走，就會變得狀態很差。"q製造兼有陷阱功能的巢穴，一心一意埋伏著等待獵物。到了晚上就潛回沙中睡覺。"V振動翅膀，發出超音波。會把暈厥的獵物活埋在沙子裡保存。"_揮動翅膀捲起沙暴，讓流氓鱷潛伏在那裡。捉到的獵物會一起分享。"w棲息在沙漠之類的乾燥地方。會用濃郁的花香引誘獵物，再射出身上的尖刺解決獵物。"w為了不被沙漠的日照奪走水分，白天會一直站著不動。會在氣溫減小的夜間開始活動。"q此精靈有著像棉花雲一樣蓬鬆的翅膀。不怕人，會像棉帽一樣輕輕地站在人頭上。"�會混在棉花雲裡在空中起舞。如果用通透的聲音鳴出旋律，就會讓聽者心醉神迷，彷佛置身夢境。"�這隻精靈的歌聲足以讓最鐵石心腸的訓練師落淚。據說那些在它身上睡著的人會進入美妙的夢鄉。"q與宿敵飯匙蛇戰鬥的記憶已被刻入它體內的細胞中。會用敏捷的身手來躲避攻擊。"{在用如刀刃般的尾巴切開敵人的同時，會將滲出的劇毒撒向對方。一直在和宿敵貓鼬斬戰鬥。"~即使被飯匙蛇的尾巴斬成兩半，也無法平息它內心的憤怒。它能同時在物理和精神上攻擊敵人。"~它的身體由鋼鐵打造，幾乎無法被任何攻擊所穿透。蜷縮時，它可以利用磁感應發射金屬彈丸。"{由於是從隕石墜落的地方發現的，所以也有該精靈來自宇宙一說，不過這種說法尚未被證明。"z據說是從宇宙中落下來的新品種。會飄浮在空中無聲無息地移動。在戰鬥中會放出強光。"V全身滑膩膩的。即使被鳥精靈啄到，也能哧溜一下滑著逃走。"h猛烈地搖晃地面，威嚇對手。會將沼澤底部的獵物連同泥巴一起整個吞下。"e對環境的適應力非常強。呆在渾濁臭水溝裡的大概就是醜醜魚和這傢伙。"{性格暴躁，喜歡打架，但如果鉗子掉落，就會一下子弱下來。在再生之前，都會提心吊膽的。"k如果發現了夥伴，就會吵吵鬧鬧地叫喚著聚集。會大量出現在古代的墓地裡。"k如果淋溼，身體就會溶解掉。所以下雨時會用精神力量包住全身，保護自己。"z曾生活在古代溫暖的海里。偽裝成海草，埋伏著等待獵物，等對方靠近的時候一口吞下。"b平常棲息在海的淺灘底部，退潮的時候就爬到陸地上，四處尋找獵物。"Z古代蟲精靈中的一種。好像會使用8根翅膀游泳，速度意外的快。"q生活在陸地上，曾為了尋找獵物而出發去海里狩獵。銳利的爪子是它最大的武器。"�因為破破爛爛的，誰也不要捉。因為看起來不好吃，也不會被當做獵物。結果就是，數量嗖嗖地增加起來。"n棲息在很大的湖底。聽說，只要看見它那美麗的樣子，心裡的汙穢就會被清除。"Y樣子會根據天氣發生變化。天氣越惡劣，性格也會變得越暴躁。"n能改變身體的顏色，融入周圍景色中。如果長時間不管它，就會鬧彆扭不現身。"n因為會吞食類似於怨恨、嫉妒之類的感情，所以對於有的人來說是可貴的存在。"q因被丟棄的怨念而誕生。聽說，如果滿足它受重視的需求，就會變回原來的玩偶。"�它粉色的爪子和腳看起來像是肉，但其實是由原始的負面能量構成的。當它被完全超度之後，就會投胎到下一世。"w無論多厚的牆壁都能穿過。一旦被盯上，就會一直被追著，直到第二天早上太陽升起。"�身體內部是空洞，什麼都沒有。據說會像黑洞般，無論什麼都吸進去，一旦被吸進去就回不來了。"k據說，會把無處可去的魂魄吸入它那具有彈力的身體中，並帶往另一個世界。"q脖子上的那串水果很美味，很受歡迎。在溫暖的地方，有許多培育熱帶龍的牧場。"P每次跳躍都會發出鈴鈴聲。用高頻率的叫聲讓對手失聰。"t會讓聲音在身體的空洞裡迴響。發怒時的叫聲會變成超音波，擁有吹飛敵人的威力。"}不祥的只是它的外表。實際上它是會幫忙守護田地，或是告知人們異變的難能可貴的存在。"�人們喜愛它那優雅而冷峻的外表。雖然它可能預示著災難的降臨，但在對於追求時尚的訓練師們眼中不算什麼。"t等發覺時，已在阿羅拉增多起來。據說，雪童子棲息過的家庭會子孫滿堂家族繁榮。"_將獵物凍住，整個咬住。但喜歡吃的是迷你冰等原本就凍著的精靈。"�只有在咬住敵人時才會閉上嘴巴，這就迫使訓練師得學會通過它的眼神、耳向和體溫變化來解讀它的情緒。"�據說會在颳著猛烈暴風雪的夜晚下山，前往人類居住的村落。所以即使聽到敲門聲也千萬不能開門。"q翻滾的話會比走路快很多。吃飯的時候會大家一起高興地拍手，所以會相當的吵。"q總是在用鼻子轉著什麼。一邊轉一邊確認氣味和觸感，分辨喜歡的和討厭的東西。"z一邊用巨大的獠牙咬碎冰山，一邊在冰點下的海里游來游去。豐厚的脂肪可以反彈攻擊。"u別看它長這樣，它可是食肉的。用2片外殼牢牢夾住獵物，直到完全不動了才會放開。"b游泳能力不太強。會揮動尾巴來吸引獵物，在很接近的時候一口咬住。"Y吸食獵物的體液。剩下的肉會沉入海底，成為其他精靈的食物。"\曾被認為已經滅絕。古空棘魚的名字是模仿發現者的名字而起的。"b溫暖海域的珊瑚礁是它的棲息地。特別喜歡在太陽珊瑚的枝條間睡覺。"h漁夫在長距離航海時會帶著它。因為有了保姆曼波，醫生和藥都不需要了。"k每當見到飛在天空上的鳥精靈，它就會羨慕到用頭錘把周圍的東西砸得粉碎。"\體內的細胞正處於千變萬化的時期。堅硬的殼與骨頭的成分相同。"z因為不斷強烈地祈求著，結果身體的細胞發生了突然變異。終於得到了心心念唸的翅膀。"}如果把它惹惱，不僅會大鬧一番，還會放出強大的磁力，所以會把機械類的東西都破壞掉。"Q會從2個大腦裡放射出強力的精神能量，封住獵物的行動。"Y以超越超級計算機的判斷力分析對手，冷靜地將對手逼入絕境。"z過去曾被人封印的精靈。聽說，如果身體在戰鬥中損壞，就會自己尋找新的岩石來修復。"t身體是由冰河時期形成的冰構成，即便用火焰也無法融化。能操控零下200度的冷氣。"n過去曾被人封印的精靈。人們認為，構成其身體的金屬是地球上不存在的物質。"\由電能聚集而成。據說在解開身上的圓環後會釋放出隱藏的力量。"\有一種未經證實的學術說法認為它手臂的形狀是古代龍精靈的頭。"P世間流傳著這樣的傳說，據說它拖動了用繩捆綁的大陸。"�拉帝亞斯對人類的情緒極為敏感，如果它感知到任何敵意，它就會全身的羽毛豎起，併發出尖銳的叫聲來威懾對方。"Y擁有將所見所思用影像展現給對方的能力。能理解人類的語言。"q該精靈據說是海洋的化身。傳說，為了尋求自然的能量，它曾不斷與固拉多爭鬥。"\長久以來固拉多在神話中都被描述為創造土地，擴張大路的精靈。"k據說已經生存了數億年。世間流傳著其調解固拉多與蓋歐卡之間爭鬥的傳說。"}傳說，它會在醒來時實現寫在它頭部許願箋上的願望。如果感知到危險，會在睡夢中戰鬥。"{它是宇宙病毒的DNA受到激光照射後，發生突變而生成的精靈。胸部的水晶體好像是它的大腦。"Y沐浴著陽光，用全身進行光合作用。甲殼是泥土變硬後形成的。"e生活在森林中的水邊。白天會去森林的外面，讓甲殼上的樹木晒晒陽光。"\在遙遠的過去，人們曾假想過，在大地的下面存在著巨大土臺龜。"\屁屁的火焰以腹部產生的瓦斯為燃料。即使被雨淋到也不會熄滅。"S能熟練控制尾部火焰的大小，以自己擅長的距離進行戰鬥。"P性格像頭上燃燒的火焰一樣激烈。在速度方面無可匹敵。"Y自尊心很強，討厭從人那裡接受食物。長長的絨毛能抵禦寒冷。"V不結交夥伴，獨自生活。翅膀的強烈一擊能把大樹一劈兩半。"\能以不輸摩托艇的速度游泳。翅膀的邊緣很銳利，能將浮冰切斷。"_會很多隻一起群體行動。雖然身體很小，但拍打翅膀的力量非常強。"Y有組成龐大的團隊來行動的習性。各個團隊之間的爭鬥很激烈。"Y翅膀和腳的肌肉很發達，能夠抓著小型的精靈輕輕鬆鬆地飛行。"k遇到任何事都不慌不忙，神經很大條的傢伙。能做出與外表不符的靈敏動作。"V勤勞地用銳利的門牙啃斷樹枝和樹根，堆積起來在水邊築巢。"\用互相撞擊觸角發出的聲音和夥伴對話。那音色是秋夜的風景詩。"V鳴叫的時候會將刀子般的前臂交叉在胸前。即興創作出旋律。"\每當活動身體時，肌肉就會伸縮產生電。危機時刻，身體會發光。"Y從爪子釋放出一擊就能令人暈厥的電流。由數只組成團隊生活。"J瞳孔閃著金色時，能發現躲藏在牆壁另一側的獵物。"_太古時代的精靈。擁有堅硬而結實的頭蓋骨，但是腦子相當不好使。"Y過去的人們曾在挖出化石後，用比鋼鐵還硬的頭蓋骨做成頭盔。"b食草的溫順精靈。用結實的臉部皮膚挖掘地面，連樹根之類的也會吃。"b臉部的骨頭又大又硬，所以在復原成功前，一直被錯誤地認作了脊椎。"b為了抵禦寒冷的秋風，會用小樹枝和落葉當材料，做成蓑衣裹在身上。"h根據進化地點的不同，樣子會發生變化。身邊的材料會成為身體的一部分。"V非常喜歡吃花蜜。會搶奪三蜜蜂採集到的蜜，然後自己吃掉。"]從出生時起就是3只一起。為了取悅蜂女王，一直都在採集著花蜜。"b軀體是孩子們的巢穴。釋放出各種各樣的費洛蒙，自由地控制孩子們。"e把儲存了靜電啪吱作響的毛球和最喜歡吃的樹果一起藏在樹幹的洞穴裡。"W會像螺旋槳一樣旋轉2條尾巴來游泳。潛水的時候浮囊會癟掉。"M用發達的浮囊浮在水面。是會幫忙拯救溺水者的精靈。"A吸收儲存在小球裡的養分，作為進化的能量。"D花苞沐浴陽光後，會綻開花瓣並活潑地動起來。"{這種精靈的顏色會隨著環境的變化而改變，當它感到危險時，就會排出一種粘稠的紫色液體。"J被天敵襲擊的時候，會從體內釋放出紫色液體逃命。"k圓圓的身體裡塞滿了許多魂魄。每次帶著誰一起走的時候，身體就會鼓起來。"k謠傳說，如果被乘著風在暮色裡飛行的隨風球捉住，就會被運送往那個世界。"e手腳的力量很弱，但如果死命伸長緊緊捲起的耳朵，連大岩石也能粉碎。"k警戒心很強。雖然不喜歡戰鬥，但它能夠用柔韌的雙腳使出強而有力的踢腿。"�它以人類格鬥家為楷模，模仿其造型和技能進行戰鬥。只有最浮誇的動作片才能激發它的真正潛力。"{一不稱心，就會豎起爪子。但偶爾會從喉嚨裡發出聲響來撒嬌，這樣的性格很受部分人喜愛。"h即使是其他精靈的住所，如果感覺很舒服的話，就會賴著當做自己的住所。"u從屁屁噴出的臭液的氣味會擴散到半徑2公里的範圍，周圍的精靈都會逃得無影無蹤。"a從尾巴尖端噴出帶有惡臭的液體進行攻擊。噴射距離能達到50米以上。"e從古墓裡挖掘出了與銅鏡怪一模一樣的物品，但兩者之間的關係還未知。"k從遙遠的過去開始就作為能召喚雨雲的精靈被供奉著。時不時會被埋入地下。"b通過發出與對手相同的叫聲，讓對方深信自己是同伴，從而免受襲擊。"S因為500年前作惡多端，而導致身體被綁縛在楔石的裂縫裡。"k會對動的東西發生反應，飛撲過去咬住。有時候會傷到自己，但也不太在意。"w非常喜歡發光的東西。如果發現正在攻擊小碎鑽的勾魂眼，就會非常生氣地發動襲擊。"h細小又尖銳的鱗片，不但可以減小空氣的阻力，還能使來襲擊的對手受傷。"h能看見被稱為波導的一種波，感知人和精靈的心情。不會靠近危險的對手。"n它集中精神所放出的一種神奇的波，被稱為波導，連巨大的岩石都能擊得粉碎。"�它戰鬥時心無旁騖、毫不留情，沒有一絲恐懼或壓力。而在它解決了所有事情後，就會悄然離去，不再存在於世間。"V在乾燥的土地生活。是身體會分泌出沙粒而不是汗水的精靈。"_嘴巴張得大大的，炫耀自己的強大。向上捲起大量的沙子進行攻擊。"b用尾巴上的鉤爪夾住獵物並注入毒素。很執著，毒不發作就絕不鬆開。"h用引以為傲的力量把對手打得七零八落，而且還要用劇毒給對手致命一擊。"\臉頰上帶有毒囊。會抓住對手的空當，用滲透了劇毒的手指猛戳。"e喉嚨裡帶有毒囊。如果從喉嚨發出聲響，儲存的毒素會被煉製得更強勁。"c先用甜香的唾液引誘獵物，然後用大顎大口地嚼。要花1整天吃掉獵物。"q它獵捕其他夜行掠食者，用粘性的觸手將其捕獲。其瘋狂的笑聲在秋夜時常而現。"q粉紅色的花紋到了夜裡就會發光。很受潛水者歡迎，所以有時會被馴養在度假地。"n像是爬行一樣在深海的海底游泳。鰭上發出的充滿幻想的光就像是夜空的星星。"e在寒冷的季節裡，會遷移到山腳下，一到春天就會返回積雪殘留的山頂。"P會引發暴風雪，讓周圍變得一片雪白。別名叫冰雪怪物。"�無論它走到哪裡，暴風雪總是緊隨其後。不少毫無戒備的登山者常常利用它作為庇護所，但它並不介意。"J作為驅動特殊馬達的動力能源而被長期研究的精靈。"Y被稱為知識之神。據說擁有消除與之目光交會者的記憶的力量。"P教會了人們悲傷的痛苦和快樂的寶貴。被稱為感情之神。"P被稱為意志之神。一直沉睡在湖底，維持著世界的平衡。"_當帝牙盧卡的心臟跳動時，時間就會流逝。神奧地區的傳說的精靈。"h隨著帕路奇亞的每一次呼吸，空間變得更加安定。神奧地區的傳說的精靈。"S像熔岩般沸騰的血液在體內流動著。棲息在火山的洞穴裡。"t據說棲息在位於這個世界背面的毀壞的世界裡。那裡所有的常規都與這個世界不同。"e飛行的時候，會從薄紗一樣的翅膀中發出閃光粒子。被稱為新月的化身。"t如果海水的溫度增加，該精靈就會讓頭部的浮囊膨脹起來，然後集體在海面上漂浮。"V如果使用與生俱來的神奇力量，就可以和任何精靈心意相通。"t用能引誘對方進入深度睡眠的力量，讓人和精靈做惡夢，並將其驅逐出自己的領地。"S擁有分解大氣中的毒素，讓荒蕪大地瞬間變成花圃的力量。"M神奧神話裡說，它從蛋中現身，並創造出了整個世界。"b如果沐浴在陽光下，就能比平時動作迅速。比起手，藤蔓用得更靈活。"_像滑行一樣在地面奔跑。用敏捷的動作迷惑敵人，然後用藤鞭了結。"k君主蛇只會對那些即使被它高貴的眼眸盯著，也毫不畏懼的強大對手動真格。"b可以輕巧地躲避敵人的攻擊，從鼻子裡射出火球來。會用火烤樹果吃。"q吃得越多，可供燃燒的東西就越多，胃裡的火會增強，力量也會源源不斷地溢出。"b用下顎的火焰燃燒拳頭，連續使出火焰拳。是對夥伴非常體貼的精靈。"\腹部長出的扇貝貝不只是戰鬥時使用，還能用來割開堅硬的樹果。"T通過嚴格的修煉，將使用2片扇貝貝的刀法運用得行雲流水。"e能在敵人眨眼的瞬間，用前腳上帶有的雙足刃切斬對手，然後將其收回。"~性情與刀路皆是殘酷無情。連綿不斷的攻擊彷如千層浪濤。此乃只在洗翠進化而成的稀有姿態。"Y會在頰囊裡藏食物，連續放哨好幾天。用尾巴給夥伴發出暗號。"Y用體內的發光物質讓眼珠和身體閃閃發光，使來襲的敵人畏縮。"t是擁有優秀判斷力的精靈。如果判斷出自己無法戰勝對手，就會立即夾著尾巴逃走。"e黑色的體毛會隨著成長而變得堅硬結實，連爪子和牙齒也不能輕易穿透。"`擁有又長又厚實的體毛。過去在寒冷的地方，每家都會養1只長毛狗。"k出於好玩偷盜人的物品。被偷的人也因其逗人喜愛的動作而不自覺地原諒它。"Y隱藏氣息悄悄接近。在對手發覺前，從背後偷偷靠近並了結它。"V會把頭上的葉子分給沒有精神的精靈。具有緩解疲勞的效果。"\用帶有很多尖刺的尾巴摔打對手進行攻擊。是性格很粗暴的精靈。"Y智商很高，有著將樹果烤熟後再吃的習性。很喜愛給人類幫忙。"_燃燒體內的火焰，從頭和尾巴紛紛揚揚地撒出火花，把敵人都燒焦。"\頭上的毛髮叢裡儲藏的水充滿了營養。會用尾巴給草木澆這種水。"S如果從尾巴發射出高壓水，那威力甚至能破壞混凝土牆壁。"P會出現在為惡夢所苦的精靈和人的面前，吃掉那個惡夢。"M從額頭冒出的煙霧裡載滿許許多多的人和精靈做的夢。"�當食夢夢蛋被放在育雛龍的照料下時，它就會孵化成這種形態。如果把它放在波克比附近，它會反覆用頭撞波克比。"�多餘的精神能量會以煙霧的形式從它的寶石所在的洞口排出。它的心臟就像第二個大腦，能讓它進行心靈感應。"_非常健忘的精靈。明明訓練師已經下了命令，卻還在等待著新命令。"Y人們相信，咕咕鴿所居住的森林深處有著沒有戰爭的和平國度。"Y雄性會搖晃頭上的冠羽威嚇對手。雌性的飛行能力在雄性之上。"S天空雷雨雲密佈時就會出現。用鬃毛捕捉雷電，儲存電力。"\性格粗暴的精靈。如果發脾氣，就會從鬃毛裡向著四面八方放電。"n六角形的洞是它的耳朵。耳朵裡面有能量核心，所以如果把手伸進去就會發怒。"\從身體裡溢出的能量變成了橙色的結晶。其硬度連鑽石都能弄碎。"b如果以全力射出能量，那力量能讓它自己的身體驟然產生出無數裂縫。"_最初是由禁地中所挖掘出來的。其身體不遵循這個宇宙的物理定律。"q相較於地球，外星維度更合適其居住生活。其身體的岩石成分現代科學無法解析。"�它們的行為難以理解或者預測，這使其在戰鬥中極為棘手。在生命結束後會返回自己的母宇宙，向更高意志進行報告。"_生活在昏暗的森林和洞穴中。從鼻孔裡發出超音波探查周邊的情形。"V發出連混凝土都能破壞的強力超音波時，尾巴會激烈地振動。"n將雙掌上的爪子併攏，並讓身體高速旋轉的話，就會以迅猛的速度在地裡前進。"\進化成鋼的鑽頭擁有穿透鐵板的破壞力。在隧道工程裡非常活躍。"k用耳朵上的觸角碰到對方的話，就能通過心跳聲瞭解對方的身體狀況和情緒。"�當傳統醫學手段無法解決時，人們會將希望寄託於它。它們能聽到人類剩餘的心跳數，但從不會透露。"M總是抱著方材。是會出現在建築工地幫忙幹活的精靈。"k身體經過鍛鍊充滿了肌肉，即使是職業摔角手一擁而上攻擊，也是紋絲不動。"V熟練學會了不依賴力量，靈活運用離心力揮舞混凝土的技能。"e振動臉頰上的振動膜，發出人類無法聽見的音波向夥伴們傳遞危險警告。"h如果讓頭上的瘤振動，不只是水裡泛起波浪，連地面也會像地震一樣搖晃。"k如果讓拳頭上的瘤振動，拳擊的威力就會倍增。能一拳把巨大岩石擊得粉碎。"h如果遇到比自己大的對手，就忍不住極度想要投摔。變強後就會替換帶子。"h繫緊帶子後會很振奮，拳擊的破壞力得到增加。如果打擾它修行就會發怒。"\因為會用葉子做衣服，所以作為吉祥物而受到時尚設計師的喜愛。"e用葉子包裹著身體抵禦寒冷。一邊吃著手邊的落葉，一邊在森林裡移動。"\如果發現幼小的精靈，就會用嘴裡吐出的粘絲為它縫製葉子衣服。"M用頭和尾巴上的觸角探查周圍的情形。性格非常粗暴。"S被堅硬的殼保護著。像輪胎那樣地旋轉，猛烈地撞擊敵人。"b用頸部的爪子夾住獵物，讓對方無法行動之後，施以劇毒，一擊斃命。"k會噴出棉花保護身體。如果淋到雨，棉花就會受潮變重，身體變得無法行動。"h潛入民居，藏起重要的東西，或是在屋子裡到處撒棉花，是個搗蛋的傢伙。"n很喜歡乾淨的水和土壤。如果棲息地的環境變差，就會群體遷移到新的地方去。"h因為美麗而受其他精靈喜愛。頭上的花如果疏於照料，很快就會腐爛枯萎。"�據考察，雪山深處的棲息環境為其帶來了發達的腳力。會從頭冠般的花中發出鼓舞周圍夥伴的香氣。"{它似乎以居住在惡劣環境中為榮。如果有其他生物在附近定居，它就會遷往更為寒冷的地方。"t它隨心所欲地發佈皇家宣言和暴君詔令，當臣民不聽從它的命令時，便會大發雷霆。"z因為性格粗暴，在野蠻鱸魚群出現的湖裡，就只有龍蝦小兵和鐵螯龍蝦之類的能留下來。"~在溯河而上的旅程中半途喪命的夥伴的靈魂纏繞其身。在流經洗翠地區的河川裡可謂所向無敵。"q因為還不太擅長狩獵，所以主要是吃倒斃在沙漠裡的東西。被稱為沙漠的清掃者。"\非常害怕身體變冷。在氣溫減小的夜晚會潛藏在沙漠的沙子深處。"j如果發現前方50公里處的獵物，就會像游泳一樣在沙漠裡移動，撲過去咬住。"q睡覺的時候，會蜷縮起手腳，體內燃燒著的600度的火焰也會變小，並安靜下來哦。"i通過在體內燃起1400度的火焰，可以製造出足以赤手空拳破壞翻斗車的力量。"h身體越冷就越有活力。會把呼出來的氣凍起來做成雪球和夥伴互相扔著玩。"b性格敦厚的大力士。會一口氣凍住頭上的雪球，然後用頭錘撞擊對手。"n對於那些以花的種子為目標的天敵鳥精靈，會用節奏輕快的舞蹈和音樂來驅趕。"z在合適的石頭上開洞作為住所。如果被破壞，在找到替代的石頭之前會一直心裡不踏實。"e腳力非常的好，身上揹負著很重的岩石，還能在乾燥的土地上移動多日。"n幾隻為一組行動。漫無目的地到處走，會冷不丁地向視線相遇的對手施以頭錘。"b吐出唾沫挑釁對手。有著固定的領地，會在那兒度過一生，永不離開。"S曾是古代都市的守護神。用精神力量攻擊入侵領地的敵人。"\埋葬在墓穴裡的人類靈魂變化而成的精靈。還殘留著死前的記憶。"Y有傳言說，它會吞掉接近它的人類，做成木乃伊。喜歡吃金塊。"Y據說它是古代黏土板被帶有強烈怨念的靈魂吸引後誕生的精靈。"e被注入了強烈詛咒的古代繪畫在吸進哭哭面具的靈魂後就開始動起來了。"b由古代的化石復活而來。曾生活在海里，但也會到陸地上來尋找獵物。"e為了讓堅硬的甲殼更為結實，會把捕捉到的獵物吃到連殼和骨頭都不剩。"S從化石復原而來。有翅膀，但還不會飛。是古代的鳥精靈。"e古代的精靈。因為羽毛很細，所以如果不是熟練的匠人，就會復原失敗。"b像打嗝一樣吐出的瓦斯，一旦被小孩子吸入，就會有性命攸關的危險。"\用左臂鎖住敵人後，會將有毒的液體潑向對方全身，封住其行動。"�溶毒山體內嵌入的物體來源不明，也不知為何物。不過，由於吸收的任何物質都會很快被溶解，所以得不斷添加新物質。"e性格膽小的精靈，不和夥伴呆在一起的時候，通常都會幻化成其他東西。"t據說，棲息地快要暴露在人類面前時，它就會製造出幻象，讓人在森林裡不斷徘徊。"~死後靈魂在洗翠地區復甦。怨恨化為力量，從其頭部冉冉飄升。會化成對手的樣貌去洗刷仇恨。"�瘋狂舞動白髮的姿態如同死神。在足以撕裂自身的深刻仇怨驅使下，抱定同歸於盡之心襲殺仇敵。"q因為有潔癖，所以不能容忍一丁點兒的髒汙。會把尾巴當做拖把徹底地清除髒汙。"\從全身滲出的油非常滑。對於因肌膚乾燥而煩惱的人也很有效果。"_用蝴蝶結一樣的觸角讓精神力量增強。一直都目不轉睛地盯著什麼。"q星光是其力量的來源。到了夜裡就會用精神力量讓石頭浮起，按星星的分佈排列。"{受強大的精神力量的影響，哥德小姐周圍的空間會扭曲，數萬光年之外的星空也能映照出來。"_身體被特殊的液體包裹著，所以無論多麼嚴峻的情況都能平安無事。"V因為有著一分為二的大腦，所以有時會突然採取不同的行動。"V使用發出的精神力量，操縱特殊液體做成的手臂將岩石擊碎。"k如果被敵人襲擊，就會從全身的羽毛裡噴出水花。混在一片水霧中逃之夭夭。"b儘管有著優雅的外表，揮動翅膀時卻很用力，可以連續飛行幾千公里。"^會吐出零下50度的冷氣。如果呆在溫暖的場所，就會一點點地變小。"h從冰河時期生存下來，非常魁梧的精靈。特別是在炎熱的地方，極受歡迎。"{從2張嘴裡噴出暴風雪。無論在哪裡都能製作出雪來，所以很受滑雪和滑雪板愛好者歡迎。"Y到了換季的時候，體毛和氣味會發生變化。是告知季節的精靈。"\會根據季節改變住所。人們會通過萌芽鹿的角來感知季節的變遷。"h蓄著電在空中飛行。有時甚至會在雷鳴的深夜裡，密密麻麻布滿整個天空。"V與小嘴蝸在一起時，如果受到電的刺激就會進化的神奇精靈。"f用從小嘴蝸那裡搶來的殼蓋住自己的身體，一邊防守一邊用2根長矛突刺。"h以酷似精靈球的花紋引誘對手並向其噴出毒孢子。為何那麼像還是一個謎。"Y顯擺著精靈球狀的菌傘引誘獵物靠近，但是被騙到的精靈很少。"V會用薄紗般的手腳纏住正在游泳的獵物，將其拖入深海之中。"P會纏著豪華客輪或是油輪周圍，目的是將獵物拖進海里。"�他們會被神祕的機械和有影響力的網絡人物所吸引。正因為如此，他們在網絡恐怖媒體中很常見。"�他們帶領探險者來到深淵中的一座沉沒古城。那裡的人們將自己的思想上傳到機器中，隨著時間的推移，機器慢慢失靈了。"Y因為自己不能製造電，所以會附在其它大型精靈身上吸取靜電。"Y會用帶電的絲設下陷阱。會慢慢地享用觸電後無法行動的獵物。"S察覺到危險的同時會發射尖刺反擊。然後趁機翻滾著逃跑。"J貼在洞頂上，朝下方經過的獵物射出鐵刺進行襲擊。"H通過2個身體的咬合旋轉，製造出用以生存的能量。"_通過改變旋轉的方向來向夥伴傳遞感情。越是生氣，旋轉得就越快。"M讓帶有紅色核心的齒輪高速旋轉，便能快速填充能量。"c1條的電力雖小，但是許多麻麻小魚聚在一起，其威力可以比得上雷電。"_纏住對手，從圓圓的斑點放出電流通過對方身體，使其麻痺後啃食。"e用吸盤一樣的嘴巴吸住獵物，並從刺入的牙齒中釋放電流，使對方觸電。"w操縱著非常驚人的精神力量。大多數目擊外星人的信息都是錯把小灰怪看成外星人了。"]擁有強大的精神力量。會用發著3色光的手指操縱對手，改寫記憶。"S假裝點亮燭光，指引道路，實際上是在吸取對方的生命力。"\吸取靈魂來點亮燈火。為了等待人類死去，而在醫院裡徬徨遊蕩。"e如果被水晶燈火靈的火焰包圍，魂魄就會被吸取燃燒。只剩下行屍走肉。"_用牙齒粉碎樹果後食用。牙齒會通過多次再生，變得無比強勁銳利。"h擁有能粉碎巨大岩石的牙齒。爭奪領地的斧牙龍們會進行非常激烈的爭鬥。"h性格溫和，但對於入侵領地者絕不會手軟。會用削鐵如泥的牙齒髮起挑戰。"P總是流著鼻涕。吸著鼻涕使出技能。鼻涕是技能的本源。"e喜歡北方冰冷的大海。將嘴裡吐出的氣息凍結，在海上鋪成道路來行走。"J在雪雲之中誕生。用冰的結晶所形成的鎖捕捉獵物。"Y與蓋蓋蟲在一起時，如果受到電的刺激，雙方的身體就會進化。"_因為脫掉了沉重的殼，而變得輕巧。會用簡直是忍者般的身手戰鬥。"b會埋進海邊的泥裡等待獵物。獵物一旦碰到，就會放出電來使其麻痺。"z會藏在泥巴里，用顯眼的嘴脣吸引獵物接近自己，接著用鋸齒般的鋼鰭緊緊將對手夾住。"t在山中閉關，與群體的夥伴們潛心修行。根據群體的不同，踢和劈的技法也不一樣。"e用奇妙的聲音叫喚的話，就危險了。它會展開飛快的踢和劈來連續攻擊。"n紅色臉孔上的皮膚比岩石還要硬。在狹窄的洞窟中，會用臉朝向敵人發動突擊。"e古代人捏製黏土製作它好像是為了讓其當僕人。但它的能量源尚不明確。"e胸口的封印如果解開，就會不管不顧地橫衝直撞，把街道都變成瓦礫堆。"e遵照劈斬司令的命令襲擊敵人。如果劈開了對手，就會擊響雙手的刀刃。"z據說，無論是多麼強大的劈斬司令，一旦頭部的刀刃有損傷，就會從首領的位置上引退。"h在氣勢磅礴的軍團中，只有站上頂點的那隻劈斬司令才能進化成僕刀將軍。"Y一往無前地猛衝，使出頭錘。擁有讓奔跑的列車脫軌的破壞力。"t用強大的腳力和結實的爪子，連大舌貝的堅硬外殼都能弄碎，將裡面的東西啄出來。"_別名天空的勇士。即便受傷也絕不逃跑，是以此為傲的勇猛的精靈。"z勇猛的大鳥。狩獵時會發出氣勢駭人的戰吼，朝湖水發出衝擊波，捕捉浮出水面的獵物。"k正處於食慾旺盛的發育期。為了配合身體的成長，會多次更換所穿的骸骨哦。"k為了禿鷹丫頭而一直尋找著食物。一旦找到體弱的精靈就會擄去自己的巢穴。"�它用有力的雙腿踩踏較小的對手，如果它的房子被撞壞，就會發出可怕的哀嚎，直到房子修好為止。"�它把獵物的殘骸放在自己保護的罐子裡浸泡，用爪子攪拌調製。民間傳說它的靈魂被保存在病變的屍體中。"_把從尾部吸入的空氣變成火焰，像舌頭一樣使用，熔化鐵蟻后吃掉。"\身上裹著鋼鐵的鎧甲。以群體之力防禦並反擊天敵熔蟻獸的攻擊。"\因為眼睛看不見，所以會又撞又咬地來探索周圍。渾身新傷不斷。"Q2個頭之間關係惡劣，都想比對方吃得更多來學會主導權。"T雙臂上的頭是沒有大腦的。用3個頭把一切都吃光並破壞掉。"O從5只角中噴出火焰與對手戰鬥。那溫度最高可達3000度。"e一邊揮撒火焰鱗粉一邊到處飛翔。古代的人們懼怕地稱之為太陽的怒火。"h擁有鋼鐵的心靈和身體。當人類傷害到精靈時，就會和夥伴一起懲戒人類。"e是傳說中所描述的精靈。為了保護精靈，會用引以為豪的力量破壞城堡。"A傳說中，以敏捷的身手戲弄對手，保護精靈。"k透過下定決心來讓全身充滿力量並變得敏捷。當跳躍起來的時候能看到殘影。"e從龍捲雲的尾部噴出的能量會引起猛烈的暴風雨。有著吹飛民宅的力量。"Y一邊在天空飛來飛去，一邊到處打雷引發山火，因此被人嫌棄。"P吸收風和雷後變成能量，會給予土壤營養，令大地豐饒。"�當它越過大海飛來，便代表嚴寒的冬季即將終結。傳說中其慈愛將使新的生命在洗翠大地上萌芽。"n萊希拉姆的尾部燃燒的話，就會產生熱能令大氣運動，讓世界的天氣發生變化。"\用尾巴製造出電。把全身隱藏在雷雲裡，在合眾地區的空中飛行。"\在體內製造出強力的冰凍能量，但身體因為洩漏的冷氣而凍住了。"P用特殊的發聲法唱出的旋律可以自由地操縱聽者的情緒。"T3億年前就存在的精靈。被等離子隊改造，背上安裝了炮臺。"_如果獲得了比克提尼所分享的無限生成的能量，就會全身充滿力量。"\頭和背部用堅硬的木殼覆蓋著，所以即使被卡車撞到也安然無恙。"_夥伴之間互相碰撞身體，鍛鍊腰腿。自己本身是不好鬥的溫柔性格。"k如果將雙拳合攏擋在臉前，擺出防禦的姿勢，連炸彈的直接轟炸也能承受住。"b隨身帶著小樹枝，嘎吱嘎吱地當零食吃。從耳朵裡噴出熱氣威嚇對手。"n將樹枝從尾巴上拔出時，會因為摩擦而起火。揮動樹枝的火焰向夥伴傳遞信號。"]用超能力操縱攝氏3000度的火焰旋渦。用旋渦包住敵人後燒得精光。"q用細膩的泡泡包住身體，保護皮膚。裝得無憂無慮的，實則很精明地窺視著四周。"]靈巧的身體不輸給任何人。只需1分鐘就能登上超過600米高的塔頂。"h像忍者般神出鬼沒。以敏捷的動作玩弄對手，再用水之手裡劍將對方劈開。"k擁有鐵鍬一樣的耳朵。因挖洞而鍛鍊過的耳朵威力大得可以切斷粗粗的樹根。"z耳朵的力量可以媲美剷車，連堅硬的巖盤也能被它粉碎。挖洞結束後，就會悠哉地生活。"\身體一直都很溫暖。聽說寒冷地區的訓練師會和它一起睡在床上。"D剛起飛後的速度，在所有鳥精靈中也是頂級的。"_鳥精靈是它的主要獵物。用迅速接近後的強力踢將對方打落到地面。"b覆蓋身體的粉末能調節體溫，所以無論在什麼地域和氣候下都能生活。"e身體很堅硬，即便是鳥精靈的鳥嘴也傷不了它分毫。揮撒粉末進行防守。"t根據所居住地區的氣候和水土，翅膀花紋各不相同的精靈。會撒出色彩鮮豔的鱗粉。"e血氣方剛且好奇心旺盛。如果生氣或是開始戰鬥，短短的鬃毛就會變熱。"]會吐出攝氏6000度的氣息，但不會用於獵物。因為更喜歡吃生的肉。"G頭上的冠是收集花粉做成的。蘊藏著治癒的效果。"h被精心照料過的花壇裡的花一旦開放，就會現身，以華麗的舞蹈給予祝福。"P擁有幾百年的壽命。據說會終其一生不斷地守護著庭園。"h如果有水和陽光，就能用背上的葉子製造能量，所以即使不吃食物也沒事。"V在山嶽地帶生活。互相撞角比力氣的勝利者就是群體的首領。"h拼命地想讓對手懼怕。如果它用盡全力瞪著你的話，就裝作自己很害怕吧。"t是用拳頭來說話的那一型。一句話也不說就猛毆，會使出連翻斗車都能擊飛的猛撞。"V如果置之不理，體毛會不斷地長長，但只允許信賴的人修剪。"\擁有足以把100米內的東西全都吹飛的精神力量，但卻控制不好它。"k從耳朵內側眼珠花紋的地方釋放出精神力量。但因為太強力而一直堵住耳朵。"M用藍布捲住握劍柄之人的手臂，吸取生命直至其倒下。"]要抵擋住2把劍發出的複雜的連續攻擊，即便是用劍高手也不可能。"k好像能看出哪個人有成為國王的潛質。據說，被它認可的人最終會成為國王。"b聽說過去的貴婦們會帶著能散發自己喜歡的香氣的粉香香來代替香水。"k因為氣味過於強烈，如果不是相當喜愛它的訓練師，要帶著走路都相當困難。"~它同時使用白魔法和黑魔法。它收穫生長在女巫身上的花朵，這些女巫經常在生與死之間遊走。"b因為淨吃些甜甜的東西，體毛也變得像棉花糖一樣又甜又黏糊糊的了。"k它的嗅覺比人類好一億倍，所以即使是微弱的氣味也能讓它瞭解周圍的一切。"S與夥伴交換信息時，會讓身上的發光體以複雜的節奏發光。"_讓身體上的花紋發光，操縱獵物，引誘其靠近。鰭的前端非常銳利。"n利用拉伸身體的反作用力提著岩石走路。在波浪拍打的海灘上吃衝上來的海藻。"_手腳也有大腦，可以隨意活動。但通常會聽從頭部龜足巨鎧的命令。"t因為不擅長游泳，所以會纏住碎藻。在阿羅拉地區，經常能在破破舵輪旁邊發現它。"k混在海藻裡，等待著獵物，會噴出連金屬都能溶解的毒液，給獵物致命一擊。"Y它們出生在純淨的水域中，通過完美融入水下植物來躲避探測。"G它們在海底奔跑，通過蹄子收集藻類來清潔海底。"e從右側的鉗子裡噴出水來移動。因為平衡性很差，所以不擅長直線游泳。"S右臂非常緊實飽滿。掉落下來的鉗子作為食材被銷往海外。"G在頭部兩側的褶邊裡，有沐浴陽光來發電的細胞。"H如果用電刺激肌肉，腳力就會增加至5秒內跑100米。"h愛撒嬌又任性。有時候，即使寶寶暴龍只打算逗著玩，對方也會嚴重受傷。"S是古代的王者。大顎的力量很驚人，連汽車也能輕易咬碎。"\雖然復原成功了，但由於現在的環境過熱，被認為無法長期生存。"S身體表面的溫度是零下150度。平常是非常穩重溫和的精靈。"_會用輕巧的跳躍跳到對手的死角來戰鬥。也很擅長華麗的關節技能。"_上面的鬍子是探索周邊的感應器。下面長出的鬍子是釋放電的器官。"h為了不讓身體上的寶石黯淡，小碎鑽群體間會用蓬鬆的鬍子互相打磨對方。"Y將空氣中的碳元素壓縮在兩手之間，一瞬間製造出許多的鑽石。"e身體幾乎都是水分。如果幹燥就會死亡，所以一直都靜靜地呆在背陰