 fairy wind and strikes the target with it."OThe user unleashes a strong beam. Lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."YThe user absorbs energy and raises all of its stats by three steps on the next turn."bFires a powerful beam of light drawn from the Eternal Flower. The user also takes 50% recoil."_The user attacks by borrowing the power of the moon. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Atk."XThe user hits the target with the force of nature. It cuts the target's HP to half."^The user plays rough with the target and attacks it. It has a 20% chance to lower Attack."XAttacks the target and breaks its spirit. Lowers the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."dThe user attacks foes with love and hate. It has a 30% chance to lower both Attack and Sp. Atk."WThe user kisses the target with a sweet, angelic cuteness that dizzies the target."XAn attack empowered by the might of a lazy king. It skips and destroys protections."RThe user steadies its eyes, mind, and body in order to maximize its Accuracy."jThe user and the target both fall asleep, fully restoring their HP and healing any status conditions."_The user dances and shows off their many lights at the target, dizzying and damaging them."The user engages the target in a head-to-head fight. The damage is based on the target's Attack rather than their Defense."^The user concentrates to stabilize its mood. It raises the user's Sp. Def by three steps."ZThe user attacks with the full force of The Market. Money is earned after the battle."jThe user thrashes while infused with elements. It has a 15% chance each to poison, waterlog or leech."8A tremendous strike that clears any active weather."\The user stimulates its brain by planning. It raises the user's Sp. Atk by three steps."sThe user chooses between the three most recent moves used by the opposing team, and uses that move themselves."dThe user curls up to conceal weak spots and raise both of its Defense and Sp. Def by two steps."]The user dazzles nearby foes with light or sound.