ely, trapping and damaging it for three turns."OThe user improvises a dance, raising its two weakest stats by three steps."kThe user flexes its rocky skin, raising its Attack and Defense by two steps and gaining the Rock type."gThe user and its allies take 50% less attack damage this turn. Always fails if used in succession."dCombining dance and martial art, the user strikes the target and raises its Speed by two steps."gPins the target with building materials. The target can't use off-type moves for three more turns."PThe user fires a small shockwave. This has a 30% chance to numb the target."vEnables random critical hits for the user, quadruples its critical hit chance, and raises its Speed by two steps."uThe user attacks freed from earthly attachments. Doubles in damage if the user has no item when the move starts."LThe user drops onto the target with a kick, dealing 25% recoil to self."lThe user endures attacks with 1 HP. If so, raises its Attack by two steps. Fails if used in succession."[The user raises all of their stats by two steps. Fails unless a foe fainted last turn."HThe user strikes the target with a basic frontal kicking technique."?The user strikes the target's pressure points, numbing it."hA kick that can also eliminate trapping and hazards afflicting your side. Also raises user's Speed."aThe user grabs the target, slamming both of them into the ground. The user takes 20% recoil."AThe user kicks the target with a powerful, arcing technique."\The user attacks with a burst of inner energy. Lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."fThe user holds fast with its teammates, raise its Defense by three steps, and its allies' by one."_The user shoots three arrows made of Aura with extreme precision. Can random critical hit."dThe user manifests a bolt of pure courage. This has a 10% chance of raising the user's Sp. Atk."sThe user relentlessly rampages with its whip-like hands for two turns. Each hit will always be a critical hit."KA reckless charge attack fro