k thoughts. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."YThe user feigns crying to worry the target, lowering its Sp. Def stat by four steps."mThe user fakes the target out and stabs them with its disheveled hair. Can't miss and skips protections."lThe user draws up to the foe disarmingly, then throws a sucker punch. Can't miss and skips protections."rThe user transforms its wrath into a fire-like aura to attack. It has a 50% chance to make the target flinch."dThe user throws its held item at the target. Some items deal more damage or have extra effects."UTurns the foe's power against it, dealing damage using the target's Attack stat."QThe user sharpens its claws to raise its Attack and Accuracy by three steps."VThe user howls loudly to raise its Attack by three steps, and its allies' by one."�Unleashes a barrage of many-armed attacks, skipping and destroying protections. Always hits. Lowers the user's Defense by two steps."dPrevents the user and target from switching out until either of them faints or is switched out."7The user slaps the target to knock off their item."YIf the user's stats were lowered during the turn, the power of this move is doubled."VThe user pins the target with a dark, arresting look. The target becomes trapped."UThe user faints in order to lower the target's Attack and Sp. Atk by five steps."\The user slashes the target the instant an opportunity arises. Can random critical hit."mProtects the user from damage this turn. It also lowers the Defense of physical attackers by four steps."_The user lowers the target's Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps. Then, the user switches out."MIf the user moves after the target, this attack's power will be doubled."NThe user attacks with a pillar of dark light. This ignores their ability.">Inflicts double damage on a target that is switching out."?The user suppresses the target and makes its move go last."dThe user yells as if it is ranting about something, lowering the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."^The user s