ty Pokémon in waiting. Always goes last."eThe user attacks the target with stored power. Has 10 more base power for each raised stat step."bThe user attacks by splaying its body wide. Its power doubles if Curl Up was used previously."rThe user brings down a ruinous power on the target. This has a 20% chance of lowering all the target's stats."tThe user schemes to raise its Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps. During moonglow, also raises Speed by two steps."dThe user strikes while inviting the power of seasons. The user changes form to the next season."OThe user smirks with confidence. The Sp. Def of nearby enemies is reduced."�A barrage of star-shaped rays are shot at the opposing team that multi-hits two to five times. Can't miss and skips protections."fThe user attacks and steals items from all near foes. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."_The user flings the dirty oil on its fur. It transfers any status condition to the target."rThe user causes the air around the target to explode. The move's type is changed based on the active weather."bThe user conjures up the past, transforming the target into their previous evolutionary form."aThe user forms their excitement into a lash with a 10% chance of raising the user's Sp. Atk."{Enables random critical hits for the user, doubles its critical hit chance, and raises its Attack and Defense by two steps."cThe user contorts the target's chi with an energy pulse, damaging it and lowering its Sp. Def."dAura deep within the user's body is spurred to pulse outward. Can't miss and skips protections."cThe target is barred by rules which prevent it from using off-type moves for three more turns."RThe user hugs the target intensely, trapping and damaging it for three turns."OThe user improvises a dance, raising its two weakest stats by three steps."kThe user flexes its rocky skin, raising its Attack and Defense by two steps and gaining the Rock type."gThe user and its allies take 50% less attack damage this turn. Always fails if used in succession."dCombining dance and martial art, the user strikes the target and raises its Speed by two steps."gPins the target with building materials. The target can't use off-type moves for three more turns."PThe user fires a small shockwave. This has a 30% chance to numb the target."vEnables random critical hits for the user, quadruples its critical hit chance, and raises its Speed by two steps."uThe user attacks freed from earthly attachments. Doubles in damage if the user has no item when the move starts."LThe user drops onto the target with a kick, dealing 25% recoil to self."lThe user endures attacks with 1 HP. If so, raises its Attack by two steps. Fails if used in succession."[The user raises all of their stats by two steps. Fails unless a foe fainted last turn."HThe user strikes the target with a basic frontal kicking technique."?The user strikes the target's pressure points, numbing it."hA kick that can also eliminate trapping and hazards afflicting your side. Also raises user's Speed."aThe user grabs the target, slamming both of them into the ground. The user takes 20% recoil."AThe user kicks the target with a powerful, arcing technique."\The user attacks with a burst of inner energy. Lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."fThe user holds fast with its teammates, raise its Defense by three steps, and its allies' by one."_The user shoots three arrows made of Aura with extreme precision. Can random critical hit."dThe user manifests a bolt of pure courage. This has a 10% chance of raising the user's Sp. Atk."sThe user relentlessly rampages with its whip-like hands for two turns. Each hit will always be a critical hit."KA reckless charge attack from the air. The user also takes 25% recoil."bThe user fires a stormy gust at the target. This also raises the user's Sp. Atk by two steps."`The user whips up a cold north wind to attack the target. It has a 20% chance to frostbite."XThe user propels a gale-force wind at the target. It has a 10% chance