 but can't faint from it."jThe user rips into the target's soul, dealing damage through their Sp. Def rather than their Defense."UThe user attacks while wailing. This has a 40% chance to make the target flinch."aThe user slashes with gusto, inspiring its allies to follow up by using Slash on the target."ZThe user uses gunpowder to rocket at its foe. It has a 30% chance to raise its Speed."RThe user becomes a pain train. It has a 10% chance to raise the user's Speed."ZA reckless charge that forces the user to switch out if it misses. Always goes first."vInflicts physical or special damage, whichever deals more. Then, raises Attack or Sp. Atk, whichever wasn't used."WConductive materials ensnare the target, trapping and damaging it for three turns."dThe user lays a hazard of sharp feathers around the foe. It hurts foes that switch into battle."The user dislodges a blast of thin projectiles. This attack always results in a critical hit, but applies Fracture to the user."sThe user uses explosive force to shoot shards of its own body at the target. The user loses 10% of its max HP."_The user curls its metal hair around the target, trapping and damaging it for three turns."dThe user headbutts the target with a metal head. It has a 20% chance to make the target flinch."�A large spike is shot at the target. If this causes the target to faint, a hazard layer of Spikes is set on the ground beneath them."LThe target is pierced with a sharp iron arrow. Can random critical hit."QThe target is pierced with a pointed metal javelin. Can random critical hit."`The user strikes the target while magnetizing it, trapping and damaging it for three turns."^The target is hit by a wave of magnetic energy. It has a 20% chance to lower their Speed."LProtects the user from attacks. Special attackers take 1/8th HP damage."fThe user attacks the target with a sword. If it faints, tons of money is earned after the battle."�The user creates a high quality area for eight turns in which super-effective deals 25% more, and not very effective deals 25% less."tThe user shoots a massive metal object at the target. The user must rest on the next turn to regain its energy."NThe user economizes half of its weight, healing based on the weight lost."WThe user launches a fist with extreme force. This attack is popular with children."jThe user crushes the target in its metallic vises, breaking any screens protecting the target's side."dThe user looses a flash of energy from its polished body. It has a 30% chance to lower Sp. Def."kProtects the user from damage this turn. It also lowers the Sp. Atk of special attackers by two steps."/The user hurls a metal ball at the target."\The user shoots shards of its own body at the target. The user loses 10% of its max HP."hThe user shreds off bits of its own body to launch at the target. The user loses 10% of its max HP."OThe user sprays mining waste at the target. It has a 30% chance to poison."\The user slashes at the target with a steel blade. Super effective versus Dragon-types."aThe user heals itself for half of their max HP, and extends the current weather by one turn."WThe user enters a protective stance, raising its Sp. Atk and Defense by two steps."ZThe user prepares its dual cannons. Until switch out, each special attack hits twice."[The user drags the target into the water with a heavy anchor. They become waterlogged."fWelds heavy steel onto the target, giving it the Steel type and reducing its Speed by four steps."hThe user ponders ancient wisdom, selecting three random status moves. You choose which one it uses."oSummons sunshine for five turns on the first turn, then overwhelms the foe with fiery light on the second."fThe user charges the target at blazing-fast speed. This attack always goes before any other move."RThe foe is engulfed in a firestorm, trapping and damaging it for three turns."\The target is dried out and loses Water-type. Then, it bursts into flame from the heat."]The user emits great amounts of heat, burning the target and adding the Fire-type to it."[The user attacks the target with a pulsing blast of fire. It has a 20% chance to burn."aThe user fires off explosive rounds in a beautiful display that multi-hit two to five times."zThe user lays a hazard layer of burning spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers burns."nThe user targets the opponents soft spots with a fiery strike. Its power doubles if the target is burned."gRaises Sp. Atk by three steps. Until switch out, the user's attacks spread to hit all nearby foes."kThe user dances rapidly, emitting tropical heat. Any frostbitten Pokémon will be healed by this heat."WThe user shoots the target with a small bolt of fire. This move always goes first."9The user sets the target on fire, inflicting a burn."oIf the target has a status condition, this deals double damage and heals every battler's status condition."^The user cloaks itself in a fierce blaze and attacks. It has a 10% chance to raise Speed."JThe user burns the target, then welcomes in sunshine for eight turns."TThe user warms up its body and attacks the target. It has a 10% chance to burn."pThe user launches up high, becoming invulnerable, then explodes down on the second turn, taking 25% recoil."pThe user roars with the force of a volcano, raising the Attack of itself by three steps and allies' by one."fThe user attacks with fire that can be seen in two places, then summons sunshine for eight turns."{A lance of fire pierces the target from above, lowering their Sp. Atk. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."dThe user explodes itself into the target. The target is harmed, but also their Speed is raised."\Protects the user from attacks. Also burns any attacker who specially attacks the user."nThe user attacks with heat, creating an obscuring wall of haze. The user takes 33% less damage this turn."QCloaked in flames, the user dances wildly, raising its Sp. Atk by two steps."hThe user conserves for future 