"How large the game screen is."S"M"L"XL"	Full"Dark Mode"FWhether or not user interface elements use a darker color scheme."Speech Frame")Which frame surrounds message boxes."Menu Frame"6Which frame surrounds other user interface menus."Text Entry"IWhich method you want to use to enter text. (Use Cursor for Chinese)"Cursor"Keyboard"Bag Sorting"7How should items in your bag be sorted? Automatic."Name on Showcase"?Whether or not to put your player name on Party Showcases."Advanced Tutorials"AWhether to show popups explaining changes and new mechanics."Battle Options"Battle Effects"?How to treat move and effect animations. Fast is 2x speed."Standard"Battle Transitions"OWhether to speed up animations like starting battle or switching battlers."Damage Numbers"OWhether to display how much damage an attack did over the Pokémon's head."Effect. Messages"/Whether to state how effective a move was."Weather Messages"6Whether to show messages about weather mechanics."Status Messages"?Whether to show messages about status condition mechanics."Move Messages"GWhether to show messages when moves change base power or category."Avatar Messages"5Whether to show messages about avatar mechanics."Overworld Options"Default Movement"JWhether walking or running should be your player character's default."Walking"Running"Autosave"HWhether the game should save when healing and every 40 steps taken."Pokémon Follow"4Whether your first Pokémon follows behind you."World Weather"8Whether overworld areas experience random weathers."Flashing"BWhether lightning storms display a flashing lightning effect."Force Time"?Force the overworld lighting of a certain hour of the day."6"12"18"24"Advanced Graphics Options"Color Shifts"@Whether Pokémon have unique appearances. Disable if laggy."Particles";Whether to display particle effects. Disable if laggy."Screenshake";Whether to use screen shake effects. Disable if laggy."(Could not create game Options file."Speed Options