Grouz"Carnation Graves"�A pair of identical fortune tellers, each claiming the other is a Ditto. For some reason, they have a vested interest in you. Find out the truth."Kayfabe"Find her in the sewers."#Find her after your 7th badge."Luxtech Sewers"Prizca East"Volcanic Shore"Hollowed Layer"�A confident young woman who trains Pokémon for a price. Dueling her could be good practice – but she looks at you with unnerving familiarity. She knows more than she lets on."Dear Iconoclast"Find him in Velenz."Find him north east."#Find him after your 7th badge."#Find him after the tournament."Velenz"Team Chasm HQ"Kilna Ascent"�A dashing young man trying his best to be charming. His appreciation for avatars borders on spiritual. Who knows what'll happen if you seek him out?"When in Makya"!Find him north of the Eleig."Find him in the sewers."#Find him after your 8th badge."Eleig Stretch"Sewer Junction"Novo College"Velenz Menagerie"�A studious man, foreign to Makya. He studies regional forms for his research. Something strange is afoot in the region – perhaps you can work together to find out what."Second Chances"Find him near the river."Find him up river."Eleig River Crossing"Highland Lake"Tournament Grounds"Abyssal Cavern"�A modest young man with a Phione, a Pokémon of great import. He's a fellow gym challenger – maybe facing off against a living myth could sharpen your skills."do crimes plz <3"Enter the man's house."Find her at the college."Find her in a cave."#Find her after your 8th badge."Barren Crater"Cave of Hatching"�An energetic girl with no respect for the law. Despite her bubbly energy, it's easy to see she's burdened by a vendetta. Help her enact justice or find peace."Lost Puppy"School Kid"Find the Growlithe."Return to the kid."Repora Forest"Novo Apartments"dThe kid in Novo Apartments is asking you to find his Growlithe, which is lost in Repora Forest."Hide and Seek"TM Kid"Find him."Find him again."Casaba Island"BPlay hide and seek with the kid who said they'd give you TMs."	TMs!"An Inconvenienced Ranger"Ranger"Find all the digit slips."Menagerie-Velenz Gatehouse"cThe local ranger is tired of Rafael's gym puzzle. Find the digit slips and return them to him."Breaking Spirits"Mother"$Perfect the fight with the kid."Return to the mother."Grouz, Mine Head's House"NA mother is concerned with her kid's career choices. Utterly destroy him."Don't Open It"Alolan"Find their package."Return the package."Prizca West Travel Agency"These people report they lost a package to a Gyarados attack, and want you to get it. Must be important, for their job...?"Alolan Wreath"Down Memory Lane"Berry Farmer"Bring the Pokémon to her."�This former Team Chasm member has been feeling nostalgic. Bring her a Bergmite, a Klink, a Dreepy, a Makyan Tangela, and an Elekid."Catching Charm"Geodude Frenzy!"Scientist"Defeat the avatar."!Novo Town, Scientist's House"XThe Alolan Geodudes have gone on a frenzy! This Avatar would wreak havoc unchecked."Foreboding"Worker"Defeat the Avatar."Novo Apartments, Attic"OAn Avatar has invaded Novo Apartments. Assist the Absol it's staring down!"Aegis Insurance Fraud"Jogger?"Find the ID Card."Infiltrate the building."Return to the Ranger."Aegis Insurance"zAn undercover Makyan Ranger is investigating Aegis Insurance. Help her infiltrate the building to discover the truth."Sewer Dining"Dragon Tamer" Give them 10 Big Malasadas."bLocals are feeding the Pokémon in the sewers as compensation for the items stolen from them."Don't Forget!"Flower Keeper"Beat your 4th gym."Return to her."
Makya"�A flower keeper at the south entrance of Novo Town says she'll give you a reward to celebrate completing your 4th gym. You won't forget her, right?
Flower"Luxtech Battle Labs"Defeat the gauntlet."Luxtech Main"tYou've been offered a gauntlet of scientists to try to get past. How difficult could these eggheads be anyways?"Peal of Thunder"'Defeat what lurks behind the door."$Report back about your success.""Casaba Villa, Lambert's House"�Lambert was tasked with keeping eyes on an imprisoned avatar until he found someone capable of destroying it. He seems to think that's you. Silence the beast."May I Have this Dance?"Shipping Lane"Novo Gym"�Eko has waited for years to find someone capable of destroying a particularly powerful avatar. They gave you a key to get into its prison, and told you not to ask too many questions. Put an end to the thing's performance."The Thanks I Get"Luxtech Gym"�Helena told you that Makya's gym challenge was partially created to find exceptional trainers. Having found one, she's eager to put you to work. Take her key, find this vicious avatar, and show it a former Chasm boss's gratitude."Quietus"Velenz, Rafael's House"�Rafael claims that the gym leaders' real purpose is to watch over the prisons of devastatingly powerful avatars. All he wants is for you to go in and end his work. Strike down the darkness writhing within its tomb."Neath Rust and Time"$Eleig River Crossing, Worn Shed"�Zoé told you that her mentor abandoned her and Bence, but left behind instructions. If they found a trainer of her caliber, they were to send them to destroy a pair of dire avatars. End the beasts' illustrious stories here and now."Beneficence"Ancient Sewers"Prizca East Gym"�Noel explains that Team Chasm created something by tampering with the Regis. Whether intentional or accidental, the resulting avatar must be eliminated. Cull it and deaden its fell light."L'Enfant du Vide"Sweetrock Harbor Gym"�Victoire has been waiting to find someone capable of eliminating a remnant of Team Chasm's experimentation with Regigigas's power. Provide this abomination a warm welcome."Kiss of Ascalon"Team Chasm HQ Gym"�Samorn told you that she helped Team Chasm create impenetrable crypts to imprison avatars within, utilizing the power of the Regis. Now, it's time to get rid of one of those avatars for good. She's given you the means to get in and cut it down to size."Bounty: Crobat Avatar"Defeat the Crobat Avatar."Report back to the Ranger."Underpeak Tunnels"Peaks-Harbor Gatehouse"�A ranger is asking you to deal with a Crobat Avatar lying in the tunnels under Split Peaks. Says he'll make it worth your while."Bounty: Beartic Avatar"Defeat the Beartic Avatar."Gigalith's Guts"Svait-Park Gatehouse"|A ranger is asking you to deal with a Beartic Avatar lying in the Gigalith's Guts. Says he'll make it worth your while."!Bounty: M. Aromatisse Avatar"%Defeat the M. Aromatisse Avatar."West-Plaza Gatehouse"�A ranger is asking you to deal with a Makyan Aromatisse Avatar lying in the Highland Lake... apparently. Says he'll make it worth your while." Bounty: Monkey Trio Avatars"'Defeat the trio of Monkey Avatars."Shelf-Novo Gatehouse"�A ranger is asking you to deal with a trio of Avatars, a Pansage, Pansear, and Panpour, lying in The Shelf. Says she'll make it worth your while."A Primordial Material"Talk to Dr. Hekata."$Return to the Path of Paradise."Report back to Dr. Hekata."rDr. Hekata gave you a call mysteriously, asking to meet her in her home of Grouz. What could she want of you?"The Age of Stone"Explore the dungeon."Crumbling Canyon"�A strange dungeon lies before you. A crumbling canyon, carved out and inhabitated in an ancient time. That ancient time may not be as far away as it seems, however..."The Age of Ice"Mirror Tundra"�A strange dungeon lies before you. A frozen wasteland, locked in time and place, rigid and reflective obstacles blocking your way. Perhaps a reflection of times long past."The Age of Steel"Alloyed Thicket"�A strange dungeon lies before you. A forest made of metals and alloys. Always malleable, always changing, the line between natural and man-made thin..."The Age of Electricity"Oasis System"�A strange dungeon lies before you. Circuits run throughout the entire cave, in a similar way to the small streams of water. Electrical currents flow like water, opening the way forward to your goal."The Age of Myths"The Catacombs"�A strange dungeon lies before you. Winding age-old catacombs, full of myths and legends. Stories will be the basis of humanity for as long as it will exist."Turn Back the Clock"Celebi"Plant the seeds."�The mythical being named Celebi handed you four latent seeds. Perhaps you need to plant these somewhere? Afterwards, seek out Celebi."Spacial Split"Find all the lost rangers."�You found a strange set of... spectres? Spirits? Whatever they could be, defeating them in a battle appears to give some resolution to this situation... What could've caused this?"A Collapsed Metal"%Find the Meltan scattered about."�A strange metallic creature fell apart into multiple smaller creatures, and scattered about the Alloyed Thicket. What might happen if you reunite them together?"Always In Character"The LARPers"$See if you can find them again."�Quite an eclectic group you've found. You've claimed their hoard, but this surely isn't the last time you'll find yourself encountering them.""The Most Dangerous Experiment""Fight through the scientists."Battle Plaza Underground"�A group of scientists appear to be guarding something important. You never were one for not sticking your nose in everything, what would a bunch of nerds hold up against you?"The Novo Battle Club"Fight Club Louis"Ascend the ranks."iLouis is holding a Battle Club in Novo town. Simply a way to entertain yourselves and your Pokémon."Parting With a Friend"Strange Girl"Trade a Pokémon."Tournament Lobby"�An odd girl in the tournament lobby has an offer. A Pokémon you've bonded with fully, for the individual she possesses... Can you make that trade?"A Clean Library"'Go to Luxtech to find information."!Return to Nora with the USB."$Head over to the Steamy Valley."!Luxtech Campus, Cold Storage""Prizca East, Capitol Building"hFinally a library in this damned region, maybe there is some interesting information you can learn."Tri Island" Explore the strange island."}The TV talked about a newly discovered island off the coast. A lot of trainers will be heading there, try to be the best one."The King and the Corvid"Find the hidden entrance."'Prove yourself to the Corviknight." Explore the hidden chamber."Find the grassy pits.""Return to the hidden chamber."Under the Battle Monument"Spots Around Makya"Crown Chamber"UYou've opened a strange cave under the Battle Monument. What could it be hiding?"Guardian Island"PYou won the map to an abandoned island, what secrets could this place hold?"Sea Monster"Ship Captain"Find the great Pokémon."Aquatopia Menagerie"kA ship captain talks about a great Pokémon in the waves. Maybe you can be the one to find this beast."Carnation Sigil"'Find the other piece of the sigil."(Discover where the sigil takes you."WYou found a half of a sigil of some sort. Completing it might let it do something."Ruined Tower"Collect the key."cYou saw that a wild Pokémon was holding a key. Take it, and bring it to the tower it goes to."Best Friends for Light"Your friend!""Collect the Condensed Lights."Find your friend :)"�At the name Lainie, a viscous mass of pure light formed in your bag. Find out more about the girl who's friends with all of Makya."Eventide Island"'Follow Chara up to the lighthouse."Explore the island."Catch Cresselia."Sweetrock Lighthouse"bAfter beating former champion Chara, she told you about an island she wants you to check out."Spirit Atoll"Explore the atoll."�Vincent told you the location of a mysterious place called the Spirit Atoll. Journey to it through your boat and explore the secrets."Isle of Dragons"Dragon Hatcher"#Bring one of every egg to him."Explore the isle."Samorn's House"pThe mysterious Dragon Hatcher in Samorn's house offers to hatch the dragon eggs you find around the region."Bad Weather"Find the other avatar."Find Rayquaza."zA trio of imposing beasts, hidden in the outer reaches of Makya. Why not add controlling the weather to your arsenal?"Excessive Force"Explore the cave."Defend the legends."Sandstone Estuary"�The suspicious but friendly scientist is asking for help, you've eavesdropped a bit (un)intentionally, but the whole story still alludes you. What is so important about a dumb cave in the desert?"A Troubled Scientist"Bluepoint Beach"Luxtech Campus"uThis scientist keeps crossing your way. He keeps giving you interesting stuff, may as well continue finding him."Former Champions of Makya"'Find and defeat the former champs."	Makya has seen their own fair share of champions over the years. Inevitably, they'll be dethroned by the next tournament, so they add up. You're going to be the best champion of them all though, aren't you? May as well show those rejects why they are only 'former'."Former Champion Ansel"!Defeat another former champ."Battle Plaza"^An older champion, show him the future is now. After proving your worth to him, at least."Former Champion Praveen"&Find and defeat the former champ."Catch Zarude."eYou've been informed you can now speak to the former champion known as Praveen. What's his deal?"Former Champion Scilla"Defeat the dojo."Ironclad Dojo"yScilla runs a dojo in Prizca East, but she isn't one to be paid off to get a black belt from. Crush all those wimps."Former Champion Chara"�It appears Chara is your next target, found in Sweetrock. You're certain this won't be anymore challenging than your previous fight."Former Champion Elise"Defeat the former champ."Prizca Castle"nSo we got a princess here, don't we? Magnificent castles can always be brought down with enough hardwork."Former Champion Vincent"pElise mentioned Vincent likes finding strong trainers to fight. Maybe one day you'll find a strong trainer."Former Champion Casey""Clear out the Diancie Avatar."Return to Casey."Casey's Basement"�What are you, an exterminator? Oh well, avatars will always be fun to face, then you can show him what you think of his request."The Kilna Thieves"Investigate the bandits."Kilna Turf"}A ranger told you about how Kilna is strewn in items from thieves. Maybe they have a valuable stash you could take from."Ice and Leaf Stone"Rowdy Tourists"Tourist Hater"Calm them down."~You're hearing things are getting pretty rowdy with these tourists. Teach them you should always respect the places you visit!"Alolan and Galarian Wreath"Power of the Stone"Release the influence."�Appears these people are being influenced by a strange rock... probably not healthy to leave them like that, could be radioactive."Shiny and Moon Stone"Clearwater Cave"oA powerful avatar of Suicune is being contained in this cave. Perhaps it is guarding something valuable..."Water and Dawn Stone"Six Spire Cave"nA powerful avatar of Raikou is being contained in this cave. Perhaps it is guarding something valuable..."Thunder and Dusk Stone"Volcanic Cave"mA powerful avatar of Entei is being contained in this cave. Perhaps it is guarding something valuable..."Fire and Sun Stone"=The 'quest' argument should be a symbol, e.g. ':Quest1'."\me[{1}]Quest discovered:"Quest failed:"\me[{1}]Quest completed:"2Stage number {1} is too high for quest '{2}'."\se[{1}]Quest updated:",\wm\<ac>\c[2]{1}</c>
