r Ball, a Cherish Ball, and a Royal Ball."dCapture at least one Pokémon in a Potion Ball, a Slice Ball, a Leech Ball, and a Disable Ball."8Visit a PokÉstate plot that has 30 Pokémon in it." Fully upgrade your Aid Kit."BReach Frostflow Farms Center without aquiring the Surf Board."AReach Prizca West without defeating the Avatar of Terrakion."Connect all Avatar Totems."*Defeat all 7 former Makyan champions."hAfter being crowned champion, defeat Pokémon Master Vanya with a full team of genderless Pokémon."DComplete a full attempt of the Battle Monument (5 battles won)."�Complete a full attempt of the Battle Monument (5 battles won) with a Team whose members were all introduced in the same generation (Pokémon introduced in Tectonic count as a generation.)"xComplete a full attempt of the Battle Monument (5 battles won) with a Team whose members share no tribes in common."8Start a battle while having an active Tribal bonus."SAt the end of a turn, have four or more hazards active on the opponent's side."gAt the end of a turn, have a Weather, a Room, and a Screen (on your side) active at the same time."*Deal 1,000 or more damage in one hit."+Deal 10,000 or more damage in one hit."(Hold 500,000 or more money at once."PHave more than 1,000,000 experience stored in the EXP-EZ Dispenser at once."JAchieve the top prize at Aquatopia Menagerie's Ocean Fishing Contest.[-" 成為馬凱亞的冠軍。".遊戲時間10小時以內通關遊戲。"P在隊伍中有閃光向尾喵的情況下，於西宏禮市擊敗贊恩。"/遊戲結束時拒接梅維斯的電話。"G激活護身符的前提下，在地下墓穴中擊敗葉澤拉。"<在等級上限低於對方時，擊敗道館館主 。"I最高15級的情況下，激活塔羅牌護符並完勝蘭伯特。"F最高20級的情況下，激活塔羅牌護符並完勝艾克。"I最高25級的情況下，激活塔羅牌護符並完勝海倫娜。"I最高30級的情況下，激活塔羅牌護符並完勝拉爾夫。"O最高40級的情況下，激活塔羅牌護符並完勝本斯和佐伊。"I最高45級的情況下，激活塔羅牌護符並完勝諾埃爾。"L最高55級的情況下，激活塔羅牌護符並完勝薇克特爾。"F最高60級的情況下，激活塔羅牌護符並完勝賽蒙。"#擊敗任意傳說級化身。" 使用一次原初技能。"/擊敗八個上鎖的密室中的化身。"D擊敗皇冠之廳的蕾冠王、雪暴馬及靈幽馬化身。",擊敗暴風領域的烈空坐化身。"8使用普通的精靈球捕捉傳說中的精靈。"G分別用紀念球、貴重球和皇家球各捕捉一個精靈。"S分別用毒液球、分割球、寄生球和禁制球各捕捉一個精靈。"+參觀一處有30只精靈的莊園。"全面升級急救包。"8在沒有衝浪板的前提下抵達風霜農場。"D在不擊敗代拉基翁化身的前提下抵達西宏禮市。" 點亮所有化身圖騰。"$擊敗7位馬凱亞前冠軍。"J成為冠軍後，使用一支全員無性別的隊伍打敗凡雅。",完成一次完整的對戰紀念碑。"h以同一世代引入的精靈完成一次完整的對戰紀念碑，原創精靈視為新世代。"J在不激活部族的前提下完成一次完整的對戰紀念碑。"5在獲得部族加成的前提下進入戰鬥。"J回合結束時，對手一側有至少四個陷阱或其它威脅。"G回合結束時，同時激活天氣、空間和己方的屏障。"*打出一擊1000點以上的傷害。"+打出一擊10000點以上的傷害。"'身上攜帶超過500,000金錢。">在經驗分配器中儲存超過1,000,000點經驗值。"2在水世界的海釣比賽中拔得頭籌。;[-"-Be officially crowned Champion of Makya."@Reach the credits with 10 or fewer hours on your save file."BDefeat Zain in Prizca West with a shiny Skitty in your party."6Decline Mavis' phone call at the end of the game."NPerfectly defeat Yezera in the Catacombs with the Tarot Amulet activated."NDefeat a gym leader while at a level cap below that of the leader's team."ePerfect Lambert, the first gym leader, at level cap 15 or below with the Tarot Amulet activated."bPerfect Eko, the second gym leader, at level cap 20 or below with the Tarot Amulet activated."dPerfect Helena, the third gym leader, at level cap 25 or below with the Tarot Amulet activated."ePerfect Rafael, the fourth gym leader, at level cap 30 or below with the Tarot Amulet activated."mPerfect Bence and Zoé, the fifth gym leaders, at level cap 40 or below with the Tarot Amulet activated."bPerfect Noel, the sixth gym leader, at level cap 45 or below with the Tarot Amulet activated."hPerfect Victoire, the seventh gym leader, at level cap 55 or below with the Tarot Amulet activated."ePerfect Samorn, the eighth gym leader, at level cap 60 or below with the Tarot Amulet activated.""Destroy any legendary avatar."Use a Primeval Move."HDefeat all 8 Team Chasm-created avatars within the locked chambers."SDestroy the avatars of Spectrier, Glastrier, and Calyrex in the Crown Chamber."9Destroy the avatar of Rayquaza in the Tempest Realm."lCapture a legendary Pokémon in a regular Poké Ball (thrown normally or created by the Ball Launcher.)"WCapture at least one Pokémon in a Premier Ball, a Cherish Ball, and a Royal Ball."dCapture at least one Pokémon in a Potion Ball, a Slice Ball, a Leech Ball, and a Disable Ball."8Visit a PokÉstate plot that has 30 Pokémon in it." Fully upgrade your Aid Kit."BReach Frostfl